window.CULTIVATION_CHAPTERS=(window.CULTIVATION_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1601,"title":"Chapter 1601 A Forgotten Rumor","paragraphs":["\"According to Yuan, he was taken to a place called the Primal Expanse after going through the rift,\" said Meixiu after Xu Jiaqi's impatient inquiry into Yuan's situation. \"Primal Expanse? Where is that? I have never heard of this place before.\" Senior Bai mumbled out loud.","Xu Jiaqi looked at Kelan with a questioning gaze. Seeing this, Kelan shook his head and said, \"No, I haven't heard of this place, either.\"","\"Primal Expanse...?\"","However, Xi Meili's face was ponderous, almost as if she was trying to recall something.","Xu Jiaqi noticed this and quickly asked, \"You have heard of it?\" \"I think I have heard of it, but I don't remember where or when...\" she sighed.","Meixiu then spoke, \"This is what Yuan said—the Primal Expanse appears to be its own world that exists outside the Nine Heavens, and there are no humans here, only Magical Beasts they call Primals and Predators.\"","Upon hearing this, a spark of recognition flickered in Xi Meili's mind, prompting her to exclaim, \"I remember now! I recall reading about it in an ancient scroll owned by my father when I was very young. It claimed that Magical Beasts and Divine Beasts didn't simply come into existence but actually traveled to the Nine Heavens from another world called Primal Expanse!\"","\"When I asked my father about it, he said it was a rumor that was once popular during the Primordial Era but has since faded into obscurity and forgotten by most people.\"","Xu Jiaqi wore a serious look on her face as she digested this information.","She turned to look at Meixiu and asked, \"Did Yuan say anything else about this place?\"","\"No, but he said that he'd give me an update once he explores the world a little longer. Ah, he also said he's safe and to not worry about him and that he will definitely return to the Nine Heavens as soon as possible.\"","\"I'm relieved to hear that he's safe for now, but he still needs to find a way back to the Nine Heavens. Moreover, the existence of this Primal Expanse has serious implications now that we've confirmed its existence,\" Senior Bai said.","\"Even if we know about its existence, what can we do about it?\" Kelan shrugged. \"It exists outside the Nine Heavens, and those who have gone there never returned. It might as well not exist.\"","Xu Jiaqi suddenly glared at him with a dangerous gaze. Kelan trembled when he realized that he'd screwed up by essentially saying that Yuan would never return from the Primal Expanse.","\"I believe in Yuan. He'll definitely return to us.\" Lan Yingying suddenly said.","Sometime later, Senior Bai asked Xu Jiaqi, \"What are you going to do now?\"","\"I'm going to see if I can learn more about the Primal Expanse, so I'll leave now. Make sure to update me whenever Yuan gives an update.\" \"You heard it yourself, Kelan. If I am not available, you can directly notify the Celestial Overlord.\" Senior Bai said to Kelan.","\"Yes...\" Kelan acknowledged. He never thought he would work as a mere messenger, given his position in the faction, but he did not dare to complain and considered this as punishment for his failure to protect Yuan.","Senior Bai and Xu Jiaqi left the scene and returned to the upper heavens shortly later.","\"What now?\" Chu Liuxiang asked.","\"Well... there's nothing we can really do until Yuan updates us, so I guess we can return to training,\" Meixiu said.","Upon hearing this, Kelan said, \"If you need training, how about I train you guys? I don't mean to brag, but nobody trains as hard as me in the faction. I have nothing else to do, and I need to stay by your side to contact Yuan.\"","They looked at him with doubtful gazes.","\"W-what's with those looks?! Do you not believe me?! How about this? If even one of you doesn't see any significant improvements after training with me for a month, I'll give each of you an Empyrean-grade treasure!\"","Kelan suddenly realized something and quickly said, \"Ah, let me introduce myself first. My name's Kelan, and I was assigned to be Yuan's bodyguard. We're from the same faction, and I am his senior by one rank.\"","Meixiu and the others began introducing themselves afterward.","'This bastard is surrounded by so many beautiful women. Are they his lovers?' Kelan wondered inwardly.","Once the introductions were over, Kelan turned to look at those from the Three Grand Sects and said to them, \"Hey, I need a favor.\"","\"O-of course! Whatever you need!\" Du Daomi immediately responded.","\"We're going to borrow the training facilities in your sect for a little. Don't worry, I will compensate you for the troubles.\"","\"Please, you don't need to worry about any compensation. You can use our sects as much as you want for free. We'll even give you your own living quarters.\"","Sometime later, Kelan and the group of ladies followed Du Daomi to the Grand Mystic Sect.","Meanwhile, in the Primal Expanse, after spending several days running because Xiao Hua had to reveal her scent, Yuan finally came to a halt.","Without even looking back, Yuan had a feeling that Yingzi was behind him.","He slowly turned around to look behind him, and sure enough, Yingzi was standing there, wearing Xiao Hua's clothes. However, it was evident that Yingzi had never worn clothes before, given the disheveled way she had managed to put them on.","\"Umm... you're wearing them incorrectly. Let me help you.\" Yuan said to her.","Yingzi silently nodded.","Yuan approached her and had to completely strip her naked before he could even begin fixing her clothes.","After helping her with the clothes, Yuan said, \"Since I don't know anything about this world, do you mind giving me a tour?\"","\"Where would you like to go?\" she asked.","\"Do you have cities in this world?\"","\"I don't know what cities are,\" she said.","\"A city is an area in which a large number of people—or Primals and Predators, in your case— live close together. It's a community of sorts.\" Yuan explained."]},{"number":1602,"title":"Chapter 1602 Sword Head Serpent’s Territory","paragraphs":["\"A place where Primals and Predators live together? We call those 'territories' here. For example, we're currently in the Sword Head Serpent's territory.\" Yingzi said.","Yuan surveyed their surroundings with a raised eyebrow and further clarified, \"There's been a slight misunderstanding. Cities also have buildings for dwelling and marketplaces where you can buy or sell things.\"","\"There's no place like that in the Primal Expanse. While the idea of buying and selling exists, it's rarely practiced. Most Predators engage in trade, but for everyone else, acquisition typically involves taking directly from others.\" Yingzi said.","In the Primal Expanse, the saying 'the strong prey on the weak' was not just a principle but a stark reality. Here, if someone desired something, they simply took it by force. And since trading was the norm, there was no need for currencies in this world.","Yuan pondered for a moment before asking, \"Then, do you know a way to leave this place?\"","\"I don't understand.\"","\"I am trying to return to my own world,\" he clarified.","\"I am not sure that's even possible.\" Yingzi shook her head.","\"There has to be a way. In my world, we have these specific areas where Magical Beasts—Primals spawn endlessly, and I believe they came from this world. The fact that I managed to travel to this world proves that our worlds are connected in some way.\"","\"Even if you say that, I have no clue. However, I may know someone who does.\" \"Can you take me to them?\"","\"In exchange for something.\"","\"What do you want?\"","\"Something from your world.\"","\"Do you have anything specific in mind?\" Yuan asked.","\"No, not really.\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before retrieving several things from his spatial ring.","The first item was a spirit stone. He didn't know if they existed in the Primal Expanse and wanted to find out. He also took out several Divine-grade treasures and some random pills. Lastly, he took out some food—mostly meat skewers that he had saved up for occasions.","\"Is there anything you want?\" Yingzi inspected all of the items with great interest. Her eyes were essentially sparkling with excitement.","\"What is this?\" Yingzi pointed to the spirit stone and asked.","\"It's a spirit stone. We, humans, use it to cultivate by absorbing the spiritual energy contained inside. We also use it as a currency to buy things.\"","\"What about these things? They smell very nice.\" Yingzi pointed to the meat skewers next.","\"They're meat skewers. This one is made from beef. This one is from chicken. This one is made from lamb.\"","Yingzi's gaze danced back and forth between the spirit stone and meat skewers without giving the treasures even a single glance. After a moment of pondering, she pointed to the meat skewers and said, \"I want these.\"","Yuan nodded and handed her twelve sticks, four of each flavor.","Yingzi accepted the skewers with a smile on her face. This was Yuan's first time seeing any real emotion on her face.","However, the unique and rich aroma of the skewers quickly permeated the area, alerting the Primals nearby.","Since skewers were unknown in the Primal Expanse, their enticing aroma was as novel and irresistible as the scent of humans, sending the Primals into a frenzy.","When Yuan noticed this, he immediately said to Yingzi, \"Um... can you quickly finish eating before the others arrive?\"","However, Yingzi shook her head and said, \"No, I will slowly savor this food at my own pace. If anyone dares to steal from me, I will kill them.\" Yingzi's presence was still nonexistent, so the nearby Primals could only smell Yuan and the skewers.","Dragons were at the top of the food chain in the Primal Expanse, so Primals instinctively avoided them. Thus, no one dared to approach Yuan despite his relatively low cultivation level. However, this caution was abandoned once they caught the enticing scent of the meat skewers.","Yuan wanted to run away, but he also wanted to see Yingzi's prowess. In the end, he decided to stay with her.","A few moments later, the first Primal to appear before them resembled a colossal elephant as large as a mountain, its brown skin adorned with red spots across its body.","Just its size alone was menacing enough, but its strength was also at the Divine Sovereign level.","Yet, when its gaze landed on Yingzi, who wasn't even looking at it, the massive creature's body trembled, and a deep sense of fear flickered in its eyes.","After a loud trumpet-like roar, the elephant turned around and stomped away faster than it approached them.","\"What the...?\" Yuan was surprised by the Primal's reaction.","The elephant-like Primal's reaction to Yingzi was puzzling, as she wasn't exuding any presence or aura of danger that could explain why such a formidable creature would flee from her. This hinted at unseen powers within Yingzi that Yuan did not yet comprehend.","The next several Primals that appeared reacted similarly to the first. Each time their gaze landed on Yingzi, they displayed an intense reaction of fear, quickly turning and fleeing as if their lives depended on it. As for Yingzi, she didn't even bother looking at the Primals that showed up and continued to enjoy the skewers in her grasp at her own place.","Many minutes later, when Yingzi reached her last skewer, Yuan suddenly sensed an unfathomable presence appear, and it was quickly approaching them.","'What a powerful presence! This Primal must be at a level that rivals an Immortal!' Yuan cried inwardly.","When he turned to investigate the presence, he saw a massive black snake, even larger than the elephant, with a horn-shaped like a sword protruding from its head.","\"Is that the Sword Head Serpent?\" Yuan asked Yingzi.","\"Looks like it,\" she calmly confirmed.","\"Will you be fine against it?\"","\"...\"","Yingzi didn't respond, as she was busy chewing the meat in her mouth.","The Sword Head Serpent arrived shortly later. However, unlike the other Primals, it did not immediately run away after seeing Yingzi. Although it still showed fear in its gaze, it refused to run away for some reason."]},{"number":1603,"title":"Chapter 1603 Chaotic Essence","paragraphs":["After silently staring at Yingzi for several moments, the Sword Head Serpent spoke, \"If you value your life, leave behind that meat and get out of my territory!\"","Having a territory named after oneself signifies dominion over that area, and entering another's domain without permission typically invites conflict. Should the Sword Head Serpent flee from an unwelcome guest in its own territory, it would risk becoming a laughingstock, vulnerable to attacks from others who might perceive it as weak.","This was why the Sword Head Serpent refused to flee despite its fear of Yingzi. Driven by the need to protect its territory and maintain its pride and honor, it was prepared to face even death rather than show weakness and risk losing the territory that it had ruled for many decades.","In response to the Sword Head Serpent's threat, Yingzi simply glanced at it. Her look alone sent an unfathomable wave of fear coursing through the Sword Head Serpent, paralyzing it with dread.","However, the Sword Head Serpent somehow managed to shake off the fear and moved to strike Yingzi.","Seeing the Sword Head Serpent approach, Yingzi pointed at it with her empty skewer sticks. In the next instant, the serpent froze completely as a massive black spike emerged from the ground—or, more precisely, from its own shadow, impaling its body with lethal precision.","The life in the Sword Head Serpent's eyes vanished instantly, and its lifeless body thudded heavily to the ground, sending a resounding echo through the area.","Yuan was left speechless by how effortlessly Yingzi had disposed of the Sword Head Serpent, which would rival the strength of an Immortal in the Nine Heavens.","'She's much more fearsome than I'd expected...' he swallowed inwardly.","Once she finished all of the skewers, Yingzi said, \"Okay, I'll bring you to that individual now. Follow me.\"","Yingzi suddenly disappeared into thin air.","\"Huh?\"","Yuan's eyes widened with shock. He wasn't even able to follow her movement, much less follow her in person.","Yingzi returned a few moments later and asked him, \"What's wrong? Why aren't you following me?\" \"Umm... you're too fast for me. I couldn't even see your movements, let alone follow you,\" he sighed.","\"Can you slow down a little?\"","\"...\"","\"If we travel at your pace, it'll take centries to reach our destination,\" she said.","\"Centries?! How massive is this place?\" Yuan was dumbfounded to hear this.","\"Very.\"","Yuan sighed, \"Is there no other way? Asking me to travel at your speed is unreasonable and, quite frankly, impossible.\" \"I can help you, but I want that shiny object you call spirit stone,\" Yingzi said.","\"Deal.\" Yuan immediately retrieved the biggest and shiniest spirit stone in his possession before handing it to her.","Yingzi played around with the spirit stone for a few minutes before tossing it in inside her shadow.","'The ability to manipulate shadow, huh?' Yuan thought to himself.","\"Okay, let's go.\"","Yingzi suddenly enveloped Yuan with a mysterious energy before bringing him with her. The method she used was similar to using Qi Manipulation to move something or someone. They were moving so fast that Yuan only saw a blurred background as they traveled.","\"Yingzi, what's this weird energy you're using? It feels like spiritual energy, but it's clearly not.\" Yuan asked. \"You mean Chaotic Essence? It's what we use to cultivate,\" she explained.","\"There are two types of essence in this world. Chaotic Essence and Pure Essence. There isn't much Pure Essence, but that doesn't matter since we can only cultivate Chaotic Essence.\"","Yuan wondered if this was the reason why Yu Ning and Xiao Hua claimed they couldn't cultivate properly.","'Pure Essence must be Spiritual Energy. However, this world lacks Spiritual Energy, and humans cannot absorb Chaotic Essence. It's almost like the Nine Heavens but inverted. In that case, Chaotic Essence might be something like impurity for us.'","It didn't take long for Yuan to understand the power sources of Primal Expanse.","\"By the way, how long will it take to arrive at our destination now?\" he asked a moment later.","\"About half a year,\" she calmly responded.","\"Half a year?!\" Yuan cried out loud.","He had never anticipated that reaching their destination would take so long. At this rate, he might be stuck in the Primal Expanse for much longer than he had desired. Yet, there was nothing he could do. If it weren't for Yingzi, he might actually be stuck in this world forever. \"When the Divine Heaven used to be one world, it would take Immortals hundreds of years to travel around the world without teleports.\" Yu Ning suddenly recalled.","\"At the speed we're currently traveling, I wouldn't be surprised if this little girl already surpasses the fastest flying treasure in existence,\" she continued.","\"Do you know what kind of bloodline she has? She appears to have the ability to manipulate shadows.\" Yuan asked.","\"I know of several bloodlines that can control shadows to a certain extent, and from what I've seen so far, it doesn't rule out any of them. I'll let you know once I lower the candidates.\"","\"Alright. What about Chaotic Essence? Do you know anything similar to that in the Nine Heavens?\"","Yu Ning pondered for a moment before responding, \"There are several areas in the Divine Heaven where cultivators are unable to cultivate due to the chaotic spiritual energy, such as the Primordial Chaos. I have never been to these places myself, so I cannot confirm firsthand, but according to what I've heard from those who have experienced it, it's similar to what I am experiencing in this world.\"","'How come I am able to absorb this Chaotic Essence?' he wondered inwardly.","Yuan tried to absorb the spiritual energy there again, and sure enough, his body absorbed everything without any issue.","As for the quality of the energy, it was incomparably better than the Fourth Heaven. 'Half a year, huh... What should I do in the meantime?' Yuan began pondering how he should spend the next half a year."]},{"number":1604,"title":"Chapter 1604 Training With Kelan","paragraphs":["While Yuan journeyed through the Primal Expanse with Yingzi, Xu Jiaqi was traversing the Nine Heavens, gathering more information about the Primal Expanse. Since this topic was related to magical beasts, she focused on meeting the beast clans, such as the Dragon Clan and the Phoenix Clan.","At one of the most ancient Dragon Clans in the Supreme Heaven, Xu Jiaqi requested to meet with their historian.","\"The Primal Expanse, huh? It's been a very long time since someone has brought this place up.\"","The Dragon Clan's historian, Long Qi, spoke with interest as he combed his white beard.","He retrieved a large, ancient scroll and opened it, revealing all sorts of information on the Primal Expanse.","\"Don't let the amount of information here fool you, Lady Xu. They're all just speculations and rumors. In truth, nobody has been to the Primal Expanse.\"","\"Then where did the rumor even come from? Who started it?\" Xu Jiaqi asked.","\"Do you know how some people claim they have memories of their past life? Well, some beasts vaguely recall a place called the Primal Expanse, where they lived in their past life. According to these individuals, the Primal Expanse is strictly ruled by beasts, so no humans exist there.\"","\"...\"","'It's exactly like how Yuan described that place...' Xu Jiaqi thought to herself.","\"Do you mind if I borrow this scroll?\" she asked Long Qi a moment later.","\"Of course, but why are you suddenly interested in the Primal Expanse—if you don't mind me asking?\" Xu Jiaqi pondered whether she should reveal the fact that the Primal Expanse was not just a rumor but existed somewhere outside the Nine Heavens.","\"I heard someone mention it, and it piqued my interest. That's all.\"","In the end, Xu Jiaqi decided not to reveal this information yet, fearing it might make the world a little chaotic.","'I need more information about the Primal Expanse before I reveal this information... if I even should...' she thought to herself.","After leaving the Dragon Clan, Xu Jiaqi visited the Phoenix Clan and asked for information on the Primal Expanse. She would visit multiple clans over the next several weeks, gathering as much information as she could.","Meanwhile, Meixiu and the others began their training with Kelan after a quick assessment. It only took a single five-minute spar with each of them for Kelan to understand their prowess and how to train them.","\"I will spend a day training each of you, starting from the one I think is the weakest currently.\" Kelan's gaze fell on Meixiu as he spoke.","\"So you'll be first.\"","\"Okay,\" she nodded.","'I already knew I was quite weak compared to the others, but it still hurts.' Meixiu sighed inwardly.","Although she had been rigorously trained in combat by her mother from a young age to serve the Yu Family, she couldn't match Chu Liuxiang, who had the advantage of training with a cultivator since childhood.","Kelan shifted his gaze to Chu Liuxiang next, \"You'll be training with me after her.\"","Then he looked at Lan Yingying and said, \"You're third.\"","\"On the fourth day, you'll be training with me.\" Kelan looked at Xi Meili, who wore a surprised expression on her face.","\"Huh? Me?\" she pointed at herself, seemingly in disbelief.","\"Yes, you,\" Kelan confirmed.","Xi Meili turned to look at Li Jinxi for a moment before looking at Kelan again.","\"You think she's stronger than me? Surely, you are mistaken.\"","Xi Meili couldn't believe that she would be weaker than Li Jinxi, who had a much lower cultivation.","Kelan shook his head and explained, \"While your cultivation is indeed superior, when it comes to experience and execution in combat, she is superior.\"","\"How is that possible?! There's no way she has more experience than me! I have lived for over 10 thousand years!\" Xi Meili refused to believe that someone as young as Li Jinxi would have more combat experience than her.","\"You don't have to believe me. The two of you can spar with each other—without any cultivation.\" Kelan shrugged.","Xi Meili looked at Li Jinxi, who calmly nodded and said, \"I can do it.\"","Xi Meili then said, \"Please don't take this the wrong way. I just have a hard time believing that you have more experience than me.\"","\"Don't worry, I won't.\" Li Jinxi said.","They entered one of the arenas available at the Grand Mystic Sect's training ground sometime later.","\"For this spar, you are not allowed to use your cultivation or techniques, so you'll be limited to just your weapon and the basics. Ah, movement techniques are allowed.\"","\"Good luck.\" Xi Meili said to her.","\"You too.\"","While Xi Meili and Li Jinxi fought each other, Yuan asked Yingzi to stop for a little so he could write a note for Meixiu.","\"Where did you go just now? You never gave me an answer.\" Yingzi questioned him.","\"Uhh... it's a little complicated.\" Yuan wasn't sure how to explain Cultivation Online in a way that she would understand.","He pointed at his body and said, \"You see this body? It's actually not my real body but a part of my soul. My real body is somewhere far, far away, and I have the ability to return to my real body whenever I want. Whenever I return to my real body, this one will disappear until I return. Do you understand?\"","Yingzi took a moment to understand his words. Eventually, she nodded and said, \"I understand. Where is your real body? Is it in the Nine Heavens?\"","\"No, it's actually outside the Nine Heavens, sort of like the Primal Expanse. However, that world is much smaller.\"","\"If this isn't your real body, why do you need to find a way to leave the Primal Expanse? Can't you just create another body?\" Yingzi then asked.","\"Even if this isn't my real body, it's still part of my soul, which is arguably even more valuable than my physical body, so I can't just abandon it,\" Yuan said.","\"Is that so...\"","They resumed their journey shortly after."]},{"number":1605,"title":"Chapter 1605 Meixiu’s Training","paragraphs":["'This is ridiculous!' Xi Meili cried inwardly as she desperately defended herself against Li Jinxi's endless assault.","It'd only been several minutes since they started their spar, yet she was already pushed into a corner. Xi Meili had never anticipated that someone other than Yuan could possess such outrageous talents.","\"Wow... Li Jinxi's growth has been tremendous lately. What kind of training did she undergo in seclusion?\" Chu Liuxiang muttered, her voice filled with awe. Despite having trained for the same amount of time, Li Jinxi's progress had far outstripped her own.","\"Her experience doesn't match her age, but I can say the same thing about Yuan and many other geniuses out there,\" Kelan said. \"In this world, there are three types of talent. Those who are gifted just enough to be above the average, those who stand above the majority as true geniuses, and then we have monsters that defy logic.\"","\"Li Jinxi's talent would enter the monster category. As for Yuan... I believe he is a separate kind of monster—the type that dominates over other monsters.\"","Many minutes later, Li Jinxi barely secured her victory against Xi Meili.","\"You're very strong. Other than two other people, you're the third person ever to push me this far...\" Li Jinxi said afterward, her body soaked in sweat.","\"Besides Yuan, who is the other individual?\" Xi Meili asked as she lay on the arena with a dazed look on her face.","\"She's my—our mentor.\" Li Jinxi said as she turned to look at Meixiu and Chu Liuxiang.","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Xi Meili released a deep sigh and said, \"I admit defeat. You're definitely better than me when it comes to fighting experience. I apologize for looking down on you.\"","Li Jinxi extended her hand and smiled, \"It's okay.\"","Xi Meili accepted the hand and was pulled back to her feet.","\"We will begin our training tomorrow,\" Kelan said to them before dismissing them a moment later.","Everyone returned to their own living quarter, which was provided by the Grand Mystic Sect.","Meixiu logged off Cultivation Online after returning to her room.","The first thing she did was look for Yuan's note, and sure enough, there was one by the bed.","Her eyes widened with surprise after reading it.","\"Half a year just to visit someone who may or may not know how to leave the Primal Expanse?\" Meixiu knew it would take a while, but she hadn't anticipated it would be to this extent.","Once she finished reading, Meixiu began writing her own note. She mentioned their meeting with Senior Bai and Xu Jiaqi and their training sessions with Kelan and suggested scheduling a meeting to discuss their experiences in more detail in a few weeks during the Eternal Lotuses boot camp.","The following day, Meixiu began her training with Kelan.","\"I see, so he won't be back for at least half a year. That will be more than enough time to transform you guys.\"","\"Now... in order to wield a bow properly, you must first build a foundation and strengthen your body, so we'll begin with tempering your body.\"","Kelan retrieved a spatial pouch and handed it to her.","\"You will use these when you're not training with me to temper your body. It will be very painful, but it's the fastest and most effective way to temper your body.\"","\"I also grabbed a few body-tempering techniques for you. You can choose the one you like the most. Since you're not trying to become a Body Refiner like myself, you don't need any crazy body-tempering technique.\"","Meixiu spent the next hour reading the techniques before choosing one.","\"Good. Then, we'll focus on your technique today. We will begin your training next week.\"","Kelan spent the entire day helping Meixiu comprehend the technique. At the end of the day, Meixiu returned to her living quarters and began her body-tempering process.","Inside the spatial pouch provided by Kelan contained all sorts of medicine that could only be found in the upper heavens. While they were not priceless treasures, it wasn't something that could be obtained easily.","This wasn't Meixiu's first time tempering her body since she would occasionally temper her real body. In fact, every member of the Demon Sealing Faction tempered their body to a certain extent. Not only did it strengthen their bodies, but it also helped them with Liya's spartan-like training.","After following Kelan's instructions inside a jade slip, Meixiu tossed a specific medicine into the bathtub.","After waiting for half an hour, she entered the hot water.","The moment the tip of her toes touched the water, intense pain coursed through her entire body. \"Ah!?\" Meixiu exclaimed, immediately jumping back and staring at the bathtub with wide eyes. She had endured many painful moments in the past—from her first body-tempering experience to training with Liya—but none compared to the excruciating pain she had just experienced.","However, she could already feel her body strengthening just from that slight touch.","Meixiu silently stood there, staring at the bathtub with a nervous gaze.","Eventually, she clenched her teeth and entered the bathtub again, sticking an entire foot inside the water.","\"Mmh!?!?\" Meixiu nearly lost consciousness from the pain but managed to endure it.","Many minutes later, once she felt like she could endure more, she submerged her other foot into the water.","An hour later, she submerged the rest of her body in the water, which increased the pain substantially.","Meixiu couldn't handle the pain for long and jumped out of the bath a minute later to catch a breath.","Over the next several hours, Meixiu repeated this process, slowly increasing the time she could remain submerged in the water.","The medicine was so potent that even after an entire day, the water retained its full strength, as effective as when it was first prepared.","As for Meixiu's condition, she felt better than ever before, her body brimming with energy.","Although the experience was incredibly painful, the rewards were significant enough to motivate her to continue."]},{"number":1606,"title":"Chapter 1606 Qi Resistance Ball","paragraphs":["The day after Meixiu's training, Chu Liuxiang met Kelan at the training grounds.","\"As someone who specializes in spiritual attacks, you need to focus on increasing your spiritual energy, spiritual strength, and your control. While increasing your spiritual energy will come naturally through cultivation, in order to increase your spiritual strength and control, you need specific techniques and rigorous training.","Kelan retrieved a black, round metal ball from his spatial ring. At first glance, this metal ball appeared quite ordinary, but it gave out a peculiar aura that made Chu Liuxiang feel anxious.","\"This is a Qi Resistance Ball. As its name suggests, it has very high resistance against spiritual energy, even outright repelling it if it's weak enough. Your training will consist of levitating this Qi Resistance Ball until you can hover it above your head and keep it there for an hour. Give it a try.\"","Chu Liuxiang nodded and proceeded to wrap her spiritual energy around the ball. However, the moment her spiritual energy touched the ball, she immediately lost control, causing it to disperse into the air.","\"What?\"","Chu Liuxiang's eyes widened with surprise, and she quickly tried again, only to find that the results were the same.","\"Not only is your spiritual energy too weak, but your control is also atrocious. The spiritual energy was too flimsy. Watch how I do it.\" Kelan said before wrapping his spiritual energy around the ball, lifting it into the air with seemingly no effort.","\"Can you see the difference?\" he asked her.","\"Yes... While my spiritual energy is spread apart like a cloud of mist, yours are tightly compressed and wrap around the ball like sheets,\" Chu Liuxiang explained, highlighting the difference between the way they manipulated their spiritual energy.","Kelan nodded in approval and took out a technique before handing it to her, \"This will teach you how to properly control your spiritual energy.\"","For the next two hours, Chu Liuxiang studied the technique. Once she had memorized it, she tried to pick up the Qi Resistance Ball again.","However, while her control over her spiritual energy had improved, it was still nowhere near being able to touch the ball, much less pick it up.","Chu Liuxiang returned to studying the technique again and Kelan would give her advice here and there.","By the end of the day, while Chu Liuxiang still failed to pick up the ball, she was able to cover it with her spiritual energy without it dispersing.","\"You can keep the Qi Resistance Ball to practice on your own time. I want significant improvements by our next session,\" said Kelan.","It was Lan Yingying's turn the next day.","\"Before we begin, I must admit that out of the entire group, it's going to be the trickiest to train you, who specializes in Sacred Fire,\" Kelan said to her.","\"I can't use Sacred Fire, and I am unfamiliar with such techniques. However, I know someone who is, and I have already contacted them for assistance. Until they respond, I will have you focus on strengthening your spiritual energy like Chu Liuxiang.\"","When she first started, Lan Yingying was unable to touch the ball, just like Chu Liuxiang. However, after a day of training with the Qi Resistance Ball, Lan Yingying managed to levitate the ball an inch off the ground for three seconds.","The next day, it was Xi Meili's turn to train.","\"Since your lack of experience is your biggest weakness, that's what we'll be focusing on,\" Kelan said to her.","The fastest way to gain experience was through practice, so they immediately began sparring with each other.","However, even after sparring for an entire day without any breaks, Xi Meili was not even close to landing a hit on Kelan. It felt like she was fighting a ghost—one that could anticipate all of her movements and perfectly avoid them.","\"After spending an entire day analyzing your style, I understand why you're lacking in experience despite having ten thousand years of experience. Your fighting style is outdated.\" Kelan said at the end of their training.","\"O-outdated? How is that even possible?\" Xi Meili said.","Typically, in the cultivation world, the older something is, the more valued it tends to be. This is why ancient treasures and techniques are highly sought after.","\"Not everything improves with age. In some areas, modern knowledge surpasses the old—your fighting style being one of them.\"","\"...\"","Xi Meili was left speechless, unable to refute Kelan's point. The style she had learned was indeed ancient, dating back millions of years to when the Xi Family first entered seclusion. And within such isolation, advancements tend to occur at a much slower pace.","\"It's not going to be easy to adjust your fighting style, considering you've spent thousands of years honing it and engraving its movements into your muscle memory. But once you manage to do so, you'll see a significant increase in performance,\" Kelan explained.","\"I will find you a new style that resembles your current style in a few days. We can start your real training next week.\"","Li Jinxi showed up the next day for her training.","\"Frankly, your techniques are impeccable, and I have no criticisms there. However, it's clear that your body is struggling to keep up with your movements,\" Kelan said.","He continued, \"In order to narrow the gap between your abilities and your body's limits, you will focus on tempering your body, much like Meixiu. However, you will need to push even further than her—perhaps two steps further.\"","\"It's going to be painful, but once you've achieved a physique that can handle your abilities, your prowess will skyrocket to unimaginable levels.\" \"Will it be enough to beat Yuan?\" Li Jinxi suddenly asked an unexpected question.","\"That's...\" Kelan was caught off guard by such a question and didn't know how to respond for a moment.","\"I'll be honest with you. The chances of catching up to him are near zero, much less defeating him. However, nothing is impossible in this world. With enough luck and dedication, even a cripple can even surpass a god.\"","\"That's good enough for me.\" Li Jinxi said with an eager smile.","Sometime later, Kelan spent several hours sparring with her before sending her home with a bunch of body-tempering medicine, but they were several times more potent than the ones he gave Meixiu."]},{"number":1607,"title":"Chapter 1607 The Real Boot Camp","paragraphs":["In the blink of an eye, several weeks have passed since Yuan entered the Primal Expanse, and his group started training with Kelan.","\"We'll return in three days.\" Meixiu notified Kelan of their absence due to Eternal Lotuses' boot camp.","\"That's fine. Make sure to pass on my message to Yuan.\" Kelan nodded in acknowledgment.","\"Of course.\"","After logging off together, Meixiu and Chu Liuxiang were greeted by the sound of heavenly music coming from their balcony. When they looked at the balcony, they could see Yuan playing the zither.","They joined him on the balcony and waited for him to finish. Sometime later, they talked about their training with Kelan and conveyed his message.","\"How's your training with Kelan? I haven't known him for long, but he's definitely one of the strongest people I've met.\" Yuan asked.","\"It's only been a few weeks, and my prowess has already increased significantly. While Manager Liya trains us through brute force and teaches us how to fight, Kelan trains us individually and focuses on our weaknesses and foundation.\" Chu Liuxiang said.","Meixiu nodded, agreeing with her, and said, \"I never thought having a proper teacher would have such drastic differences. I wouldn't be surprised if he has many disciples under him.\"","\"I guess I'll have to thank him once I return.\" Yuan smiled.","\"Speaking of your situation, how is it?\" Meixiu asked.","\"The same as usual. We've been traveling at a speed that even I cannot comprehend without any rest, but we're still many months away from our destination. The Primal Expanse is unfathomably massive.\"","\"Kelan has a message for you. He said that Lady Xu is currently researching the Primal Expanse and would you like to learn as much about it as you can.\"","He nodded, \"I was already planning on doing that. Although the Primal Expanse exists outside the Nine Heavens, it is still connected to them in some way.\"","Sometime later, the Demon Sealing Faction made their way to the Eternal Lotuses' residence.","When they arrived, around 90 percent of their members were standing in a formation, waiting for their arrival.","\"There's more people here than I expected.\" Wang Ming commented after he saw this. He'd only expected half of them after what they experienced last time.","The Eternal Lotuses members trembled after seeing Wang Ming and the others smile.","\"Even if the majority of you quit after today, I applaud you for showing up and giving it a chance despite what you experienced during the trial.\" Shi Lang said to them.","\"What you will experience in the next three days will be much harsher than the trial, but you will definitely become much stronger.\" Wang Bingbing said.","The group swallowed nervously at such words, and many of them had regretful expressions on their faces.","After the introductions, they were split into smaller groups again to make training more effective.","However, Yuan did not participate and only watched as a spectator. Though, he would occasionally give advice to the instructor, as well as the participants.","The boot camp was gruesome and spartan-like, with the participants training until they threw up or fainted. Ten percent of the participants gave up within an hour, and fifty percent gave up in just the first half of the day.","By the end of the day, only thirty percent remained.","\"Good job enduring today. Now, you just need to endure the next two.\" Wang Ming said, reminding them that the boot camp was a three-day event.","One of the participants then asked out loud, \"That's physically impossible! We're all completely drained! We won't have enough energy tomorrow, much less for the remaining two days!\"","Yuan stepped forward and said, \"Don't worry. We have something that will not only help you with your recovery but also strengthen your body simultaneously.\"","\"Really? What is it?\"","\"A medicine bath,\" he said. \"There's a public hot spring available on the Dragon Spiral Mountain. I have already reserved the whole place, too.\"","\"A hot spring?\"","The participants were excited upon hearing this.","After giving them some time to recover enough energy to walk, they descended the mountain until they reached the lower area, where the hot spring was located.","An old lady was waiting for them outside when they arrived.","\"Welcome to the Dragon Hot Spring, Young Master Yuan.\" The old lady bowed to him respectfully.","The hot spring was divided into two sections: one for males and another for females, each spacious enough to comfortably accommodate a thousand people. As the exhausted participants submerged themselves in the medicinally enhanced waters, they felt the exhaustion swiftly drain from their bodies.","\"Wow! What kind of magical water is this?! I have never felt anything like this before!\"","\"All of my exhaustion went away like smoke! How is that possible?!\"","The participants couldn't believe the hot spring's potent effect. \"If I had known there was a place like this here, I would've come here every day!\" However, Wang Bingbing said, \"Actually, this is just a normal hot spring, so you wouldn't get to experience this if you come here at another time. This medicine bath was specifically prepared for you by Yuan.\"","Meanwhile, at the male's side, Wang Ming asked, \"What kind of medicine did you put in here, Yuan? I would like to bathe in this once in a while.\"","\"Medicine? I didn't put any medicine in here,\" he calmly said.","\"Huh? Then what did you put in here?\"","\"I fused my spiritual energy with the water, so you're bathing in my spiritual energy,\" he revealed.","\"What...?\"","Everyone there looked at him with wide eyes.","\"You can do such a thing with spiritual energy? I didn't know that.\" Shi Lang muttered.","\"The concept is similar to transferring your spiritual energy to another individual to replenish their energy. However, in this case, since there isn't any method to contain the spiritual energy, you will need to constantly fuse your spiritual energy with the water, or it'll quickly lose effect.\"","\"In other words, only you can do something like this.\" Wu Zao said.","\"Once you increase your cultivation, you can also do it. However, unless someone does it for you, it wouldn't benefit you.\" Yuan explained."]},{"number":1608,"title":"Chapter 1608 The Real Boot Camp(2)","paragraphs":["The members of Eternal Lotuses soaked in the hot spring for two hours. By the time they emerged, not only had all traces of their exhaustion vanished, but they also felt stronger than they had at the start of the day.","When they returned to their residence, those who had quit or didn't participate in the boot camp were absolutely bewildered to see them so energetic.","\"What the hell? Why do you all look so energetic? You spent the entire day training at their boot camp, right? I was only there for four hours, but I am still exhausted!\"","\"Of course, we were exhausted. However, they had us bathe in a medicine bath at the Dragon Hot Spring, relieving us of all exhaustion in just two hours!\"","\"It not only made our exhaustion disappear, it even strengthened our bodies and boosted our cultivation!\" \"Dragon Hot Spring? There's a hot spring here?\"","\"What?! Such a place exists?! I'm going to go bathe there right now!\" Since the members that bathed in Yuan's spiritual energy weren't aware of the hot spring's true nature, they didn't stop the other members from rushing to the Dragon Hot Spring.","When these members arrived at the hot spring and soaked in the water, they were baffled when they were still exhausted and nothing was happening.","\"Were they messing with us because we didn't participate in the boot camp? This is just a normal hot spring!\"","\"Surely, they can't be that petty.\"","\"They called it a medicine bath, right? Perhaps they'd already absorbed all of the medicine.\" Someone there made a sound judgment.","\"I guess the medicine bath is only a privilege for those who endured that hellish training.\"","These members quickly left the hot spring after realizing that it had lost its healing effects, and most of them contemplated on giving the boot camp another chance.","Later that night, the Demon Sealing Faction had dinner together.","\"Have you guys done any Faction Wars since our last one?\" Yuan asked them.","\"Who would dare to send us a challenge after what you did to the Fiery Garden of Hell?\" Wang Ming shook his head.","\"The Faction War scene has exploded in popularity and participation because of the formation, though,\" Meifeng commented.","\"Any movements from the Ten Great Families or the government?\" Yuan then asked.","\"No, they have been awfully silent. However, I was told by Manager Liya that there have been many people watching the Dragon Spiral Mountain.\"","\"She's not doing anything about it?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"She said that as long as they don't enter the Dragon Spiral Mountain or cause trouble, they have no reason to act.\"","\"Sounds fair.\" Yuan nodded.","\"Actually... I have something to say.\" Wang Xiuying suddenly raised her hand. \"What's the matter?\"","\"I don't know if this is related, but there's been many people trying to contact me through my grandfather.\"","\"Doctor Wang?\" Yuan frowned slightly at this news.","\"I wouldn't think too deeply into it. After all, our exposure exploded after Yan Xiaoxiao's interview was released.\" Xu Murong commented.","\"Murong's right. In fact, it would be weird if nobody tried to reach out to you.\" Hong Xiuquan said.","\"I guess you're right...\" Wang Xiuying nodded.","\"It's never bad to be cautious,\" Yuan said.","He continued, \"Speaking of Doctor Wang, how is he doing lately?\"","\"The same as usual, I guess. Ah, he started cultivating recently.\"","\"Oh? Then I will need to send him some support.\" Yuan said.","Although it was a job, Doctor Wang looked out for him since childhood. If it weren't for Doctor Wang, he might've died before Cultivation Online came out.","\"It's okay. I have already sent him some pills and resources to help with his cultivation.\" Wang Xiuying said.","\"Still, I should—\"","\"Trust me, it's fine.\" Wang Xiuying interrupted. \"I bet you're going to give him valuable resources, correct? His cultivation is too low to even use them. You can help him once he increases his cultivation a little more, okay?\"","\"If you say so...\" Yuan nodded.","Later that night, Yuan and Meixiu spent the night together in Meixiu's old room while Chu Liuxiang slept alone.","After spending several hours passionately embracing each other, Yuan commented on her physique at the end, \"I can tell that you've been training really hard. Your body is incomparably sturdier than before.\"","\"Huh?! Is my body that hard?!\" Meixiu began panicking, worried that she'd tempered her body too much.","Yuan chuckled and said, \"I didn't mean literally. Your body is still very soft and pleasing to touch, so there's no need to worry.\"","Meixiu blushed at such words.","The next day, when the Demon Sealing Faction arrived for the second day of boot camp, they were pleasantly surprised to find that many of the participants who had quit the previous day had returned, ready to continue their training.","\"What happened? What made you change your heart?\" Shi Lang asked them.","These returning participants explained that they were motivated to rejoin after seeing the significant improvements their peers had made after just one day of training. \"I'm glad to hear that you'll give it another chance, but actions speak louder than words. With that said, no matter how many times you quit, we won't stop you from returning.\" Wang Ming said.","They started training shortly after, with the second day proving even more intense than the first. Many of those who had quit on the first day found themselves unable to withstand the increased rigor, while those who had endured the initial day's challenges barely managed to hold on through the entire session.","Surprisingly, by the end of the second day, a higher number of participants completed the training compared to the first day. Although the increase was modest, it was still an impressive achievement, given the heightened intensity of the day's challenges.","Soon, they were rewarded by the spiritual hot spring.","\"Wow! This is even better than I anticipated! I'm so glad I held on!\" One of the participants who had quit on the first day exclaimed after experiencing the hot spring.","\"Instructor Wang, only those who have endured the training can enjoy this luxury, correct?\" Another asked.","\"That's right. Those who quit won't be allowed in here.\" Wang Bingbing confirmed."]},{"number":1609,"title":"Chapter 1609 Half a Year Later","paragraphs":["After spending two hours at the Dragon Hot Spring, everyone returned to their living quarters.","Only two days have passed since they started training, but the members of Eternal Lotuses who didn't quit were already experiencing tremendous growth. All had at least two breakthroughs, while some even had four breakthroughs. As for those who had stopped training on the first day but returned on the second day, they had at least one breakthrough. The rest of the Eternal Lotuses were envious of their exponential growth and contemplated returning to training.","Later that night, Yuan spent the rest of the night with Chu Liuxiang.","\"Is the Primal Expanse a dangerous place?\" Chu Liuxiang asked at the end of their passionate session, which lasted for hours.","\"Yes, it's a gruesome place where only the strong survive.\"","\"Doesn't that apply to our world, as well?\"","\"It's much more so over there, where humans don't exist. When humans want something, the normal ones will negotiate for it. However, according to what I was told, they forcefully acquire everything in the Primal Expanse. It's a place where laws don't exist and the strong rules over the weak.\"","\"The law of the jungle, huh? I guess that makes sense since it's a world of beasts. Be safe over there.\"","Yuan smiled and said, \"Unless my Immortal Monarch's Dominion doesn't work on the beasts there, I should be relatively safe no matter what I am up against. I also have an expert guiding me.\"","He had been curious whether the Immortal Monarch's Dominion would affect the beasts in the Primal Expanse, but he hadn't yet had the opportunity to test it.","The following day, even more participants showed up at the boot camp than on the second day. However, as many had expected, the third day of boot camp was even more torturous than the previous two days combined. Every single participant had either puked or lost consciousness at least once.","Fortunately for them, the training ended earlier than anticipated, and they were rewarded with a four-hour spiritual bath.","\"Good work, everyone. We'll come back next month for the next boot camp session!\"","The next day, everyone from the Demon Sealing Faction except Meifeng and Yuan went to the mountain's peak to train with Liya.","\"Where have the three of you been lately? You haven't been showing up to training.\" Liya asked Meixiu, Chu Liuxiang, and Li Jinxi, who had spent most of their time training with Kelan in Cultivation Online.","Meixiu explained the situation to Liya, who said afterward, \"I understand. Let me see how much you've improved through your new trainer. If it's good enough, you won't need to attend my training any longer.\"","The following hour, Meixiu and the other two had a sparring session with Liya, who was quickly surprised by their drastic improvements.","\"Heavens! Who's training them?! They've improved so much that they're almost unrecognizable!\" Wang Ming exclaimed.","In just a month, Meixiu and Chu Liuxiang, who had consistently ranked at the bottom, experienced a dramatic rise, propelling them to the top of their power ranking. Meanwhile, Li Jinxi, who was already at the pinnacle of the rankings, found her lead expanding even further as the gap between her and the others became more pronounced.","\"Who's your teacher?\" Liya asked them afterward.","\"He's Yuan's bodyguard. We're being trained by him while Yuan is away,\" Chu Liuxiang explained.","\"Yuan has a bodyguard?\" Liya raised her eyebrows at this information. She never expected someone as monstrous as him would need protection.","\"It's a little complicated...\"","\"Whatever, I don't really care. Anyway, the three of you no longer need to attend my training since that person is much more capable than me.\" Liya said a moment later.","\"Yes! Thank you for everything so far!\" They bowed to her.","\"Shit... we really need to ascend to the Fourth Heaven and train with them now...\" Wang Ming muttered out loud.","Hearing this, Liya turned to him and said, \"That's actually a great idea. Not only would you improve faster with that person, but I would no longer need to waste my time training you.\"","Although it may seem like Liya was upset, she genuinely wanted the best for them. Meanwhile, Yuan continued his journey with Yingzi.","\"My body is feeling sore.\" Yingzi suddenly said as she slowed down.","Seeing this, Yuan retrieved a meat skewer and handed it to her without uttering a single word.","Yingzi accepted his offering and immediately continued their journey, acting as though the soreness magically disappeared.","This was Yingzi's way of asking for more food, and she would do it once a week, so it wasn't anything new to Yuan.","'Fortunately, I have an immense stock of meat skewers due to Xi Meili's eating habits...' Yuan thought to himself.","A month passed in the blink of an eye, and it was already time for the Eternal Lotuses' second boot camp.","During this month, Yuan spent most of his time doing mental training since it was pointless for him to improve his cultivation normally.","Meixiu and the others had become celebrities within the Grand Mystic Sect, recognized by the disciples as the Five Ethereal Fairies. Whenever they trained with Kelan on the training grounds, a crowd of spectators would gather, cheering them on enthusiastically.","Their beauty and diligence had captivated the hearts of many young disciples, drawing attention from even the top disciples within the sect. However, no matter who approached them, they consistently shut down any advances.","Due to disturbances caused by a few troublemakers and the increasingly rowdy crowd at the training ground, Sect Leader Du Daomi took decisive action. He restricted access to the training ground and forbade any disciple from disturbing the group, threatening expulsion for those who defied the order.","In the blink of an eye, another month had passed, and it was time for the second boot camp.","The Demon Sealing Faction spent three days training the members of Eternal Lotuses and returned to their daily routine.","One month... two months... three months...","Half a year has passed since Yuan entered the Primal Expanse.","\"We're almost there.\" Yingzi notified Yuan as they reached the end of their six-month-long journey."]},{"number":1610,"title":"Chapter 1610 Supreme Ox’s Territory","paragraphs":["After traveling for another two weeks, Yingzi suddenly stopped moving and said, \"We're at the Supreme Ox's territory.\"","\"Finally, after almost seven months.\" Yuan stretched his body. Since he had to attend boot camp three days every month, it'd extended their trip slightly. \"...\"","Yingzi remained still even many moments later, prompting Yuan to ask, \"What's the matter?\"","\"What do you mean?\" she asked.","\"Why aren't you moving?\" he clarified.","\"I do not have a good relationship with the Supreme Ox, so my presence there will only make things difficult. You will have to meet him yourself,\" she explained.","\"How strong is this Supreme Ox?\"","\"His cultivation is at Perfect Chaotic Immortal.\"","\"Sorry, but I am not familiar with your cultivation system.\"","Yuan proceeded to explain Nine Heaven's cultivation system to her.","After taking a few minutes to comprehend Nine Heaven's cultivation system and comparing it to the Primal Expanse's cultivation system, she began explaining it to Yuan.","The Primal Expanse had ten major cultivation realms, each divided into four minor realms: Early, Intermediate, Advanced, and Perfect.","The major realm consisted of Chaotic Establishment, Chaotic Adept, Chaotic Master, Chaotic Commander, Chaotic King, Chaotic Emperor, Chaotic Overlord, Chaotic Immortal, Chaotic Supreme, and Chaotic God.","The strength of a Perfect Chaotic Immortal was akin to a peak-level Golden Immortal, but that was only pure speculation. Unless two fights with such cultivation collided, there was really no method of finding out.","'Equal to a peak-level Golden Immortal, huh? I won't be able to defeat them if we were to fight for whatever reason suddenly, and I don't want to expose my trump card so soon...'","Although Yuan trusted Yingzi to a certain extent, he couldn't completely trust her at this moment, and he was confident that she would be watching him, so he didn't want to use Immortal Monarch's Dominion and reveal it to her just in case he needed it for her.","He turned to look at Yingzi and spoke, \"Yingzi, as you can probably tell, my cultivation is a little lacking. If this Supreme Ox were to attack me for whatever reason, I'd die for sure. If that happens, can I count on you to protect me? Of course, I will compensate you.\"","Yingzi pondered for a moment before sticking out her hand, with three fingers raised.","\"What is that?\" Yuan asked.","\"Three hundred meat skewers. If you can provide me with that, I will guarantee your safety,\" she calmly said.","\"It's a deal,\" he immediately agreed.","He'd be willing to exchange 3 million meat skewers for his life, much less three hundred.","To further improve their relationship, Yuan gave her ten skewers as a downpayment.","\"Why are you giving me them?\" she asked.","\"I'll give you ten now and the rest if you protect me. We call this a downpayment in our world.\"","\"What if I don't need to protect you? Will I have to give them back to you?\" Yingzi asked.","\"You can keep the ten skewers even if nothing happens to me.\"","Yingzi nodded and immediately began eating the meat skewers since she didn't have to return them.","Meanwhile, Yuan ventured into the Supreme Ox's territory. This domain was a vast, rocky plain, offering a stark contrast to the environment of the Sword Head Serpent's territory. Furthermore, the gravity in this region was significantly altered, being ten times heavier than usual, adding an extra layer of challenge to navigating the area.","The Supreme Ox's territory spanned ten thousand miles, a vast expanse that could easily bewilder anyone from Earth. However, Yuan was guided by Yingzi's directions through divine sense, ensuring that he wouldn't lose his way.","As Yuan traveled across the rocky plains of the Supreme Ox's territory, he observed many Primals roaming the area. Most of these creatures were around the level of a Divine Warrior, equivalent to what would be called an Intermediate Chaotic Master in their world.","Two days into his journey, Yuan spotted a massive mountain in the distance. In the Primal Expanse, the sky was positioned much higher than in the Nine Heavens, towering several times higher, yet this colossal mountain nearly grazed these lofty heights. Moreover, the side of this mountain bore an impressive engraving of an axe-shaped symbol.","Once Yuan approached a certain proximity, a domineering voice resonated through the air, carrying an authoritative echo.","\"Halt, intruder.\" Yuan halted immediately, and he could see a silhouette descending towards him from the direction of the mountain.","This individual possessed a bulky physique similar to that of a human, with two arms and two legs, but its head was distinctly that of an ox.","The ox raised an eyebrow after examining Yuan closely.","\"Are you really a dragon? You smell like one, but your cultivation is...\"","\"What does my cultivation have to do with my bloodline? Who are you, anyway?\" Yuan said.","\"I am the Captain of the Supreme Ox's Axe Squad. Why have you entered our territory?\"","\"I'd like to speak with the Supreme Ox.\"","\"...\"","The Captain narrowed his eyes at Yuan, seemingly pondering something.","After a moment of silence, he said, \"I understand. I will bring you to the Supreme Ox now.\"","'That was too easy...' Yuan thought inwardly. The ease with which they permitted him to meet their leader seemed suspiciously straightforward, prompting him to question if there were any ulterior motives behind their accommodating behavior.","'Is it because I am a dragon?'","Regardless of what they were up to, with Yingzi protecting him, Yuan had no need to worry and followed the Captain.","Sometime later, they reached the peak of the mountain, where a large throne made of bones was situated at the center, commanding a view of the surrounding landscape.","However, sitting on the throne was an ugly middle-aged man with unnatural facial features so unsettling they could scare even ghosts.","Yuan's eyebrows twitched upon seeing this middle-aged man, who was easily the most unattractive individual he had ever encountered.","\"Supreme Ox, you have a visitor.\" The Captain kneeled before the Supreme Ox and said.","The middle-aged man, who had been staring at Yuan long before they even arrived at the mountain, spoke with a mysterious smile on his face, \"What brought you to my territory, young dragon?\""]},{"number":1611,"title":"Chapter 1611 Appearances","paragraphs":["The Supreme Ox's gaze felt unsettling to Yuan. It carried a mixture of craving and shock, leaving Yuan puzzled about the reason behind such an intense stare. However, he decided to ignore it for now and answered the Supreme Ox's question.","\"I am looking for a method to leave this world, and I was told you might know the method.\"","\"Huh?\" The Supreme Ox's eyebrows raised in a puzzled manner.","\"Putting your request aside, who told you that I would know such a thing?\"","Knowing that Yingzi and the Supreme Ox weren't on good terms, Yuan refrained from mentioning her before him.","\"Some Predator I met by chance. I never got to learn his identity, unfortunately.\"","Supreme Ox shook his head and said, \"I don't have the slightest clue to what you're talking about. However, I may know someone who might.\"","\"...\"","Yuan was left speechless. After spending half a year traveling to this location, he discovered that the Supreme Ox knew nothing significant, and now, the Supreme Ox was echoing the same information Yingzi had given him.","'Am I being scammed here?' he couldn't help but wonder inwardly.","\"Who might this individual be?\" Yuan eventually asked.","\"Slow down, young dragon. You may carry the bloodline of dragons, but that doesn't mean you can make free requests in my territory. I will provide you with the information you seek if you're willing to do me a favor.\"","\"What is this favor?\"","\"It's quite simple. Allow me to buy—no, let me borrow your appearance for ten thousand years.\"","\"Huh?\" Yuan was bewildered by such an odd favor. \"Since you're a dragon, I'm sure you have no lack of beautiful appearances like the one you're currently wearing, so lend it to me for a bit. Don't be stingy; it's only ten thousand years.\"","Yuan's eyes widened at the Supreme Ox's weird wording.","'No lack of appearances? Like the one I'm wearing? What nonsense is this?' \"Why do you want my appearance?\" Yuan decided to ask.","\"Are you seriously asking me that? Look at me! I'm heinous compared to you!\"","\"...\" Yuan was speechless.","At this moment, Yingzi's voice resounded inside his head, 'In the Primal Expanse, due to a lack of humans and our understanding of them, Primals like trading appearances.'","'How does that even work? Are you asking me to take off my skin like we do with clothes? We can't do that.'","'It's not like that. If you agree to let the Supreme Ox borrow your appearance, he will simply copy your appearance and use it for himself. Also, you won't be allowed to use your appearance for ten thousand years if you agree.'","'Why would they choose to borrow appearances? Can't they simply craft their own, tailored to their liking?' He struggled to grasp the rationale behind adopting another's visage when the possibility of creating a unique one existed.","'That's easier said than done. With a lack of humans, there are only so many authentic appearances to go around. Also, it is an unspoken rule to never copy another's appearance without permission, even if you change some of the features.'","Once Yuan thought about it, Yingzi was right. Even humans would have difficulties if told to create a human appearance without any reference since it cannot resemble another's appearance too much, much less the beasts within Primal Expanse, where humans don't exist.","'How valuable are appearances in this world?' Yuan continued asking.","'It greatly varies depending on the available features. Of course, the good-looking ones will be worth more. I have never seen anyone with your quality of appearance, so it should be worth a fortune.' Yingzi said.","'Thanks for the information.'","\"What's wrong, young dragon? Why aren't you saying anything?\" Supreme Ox asked with a nervous smile on his face.","Seeing this, Yuan smiled coldly and said, \"You want to borrow my appearance in exchange for some information that may not even be reliable? Are you looking down on me, Supreme Ox?\"","The Supreme Ox sucked his teeth after hearing Yuan's words. He was clearly trying to take advantage of Yuan due to his seemingly young age and low cultivation base.","\"Fine! I won't ask to borrow it, but allow me to use your appearance as a reference, at the very least!\"","\"You're still asking for too much.\" Yuan shook his head.","Supreme Ox frowned and muttered in a cold voice, \"Don't try to push your luck too far, young dragon. The other Predators may be afraid of the dragon bloodline, but we don't fear you.\"","The atmosphere suddenly stiffened, and Yuan could sense many powerful entities in the vicinity announcing their presence, almost as if they were threatening him.","Yuan remained calm and said, \"Are you sure you want to threaten me? You might have to spend the rest of your life in that appearance.\"","Before the Supreme Ox could speak, Yuan continued, \"I was going to say that while my appearance isn't for sale or rent, I have plenty of high-quality appearances available, but if you don't want them, that's fine.\"","As someone with countless encounters with humans, he had an unlimited supply of human appearances to bargain with in this Primal Expanse. \"W-wait!\" Supreme Ox quickly said.","He raised his hand and made a gesture. In the following moment, all of the surrounding presences disappeared.","\"I apologize for my subordinates' unruly behavior. They are too easily agitated. Anyway, what other appearances do you have? May I see them?\"","Yuan retrieved an appearance-altering pill and swallowed it, transforming himself into a middle-aged man with somewhat handsome features.","Supreme Ox's face brightened with excitement the moment he saw Yuan's disguise, even standing up from his seat.","\"That one! I want that one!\" he hastily said.","\"Ten thousand—no, seven thousand years! I'll give you the information if you will lend it to me for seven thousand years!\"","Yuan calmly nodded, \"Deal.\"","The Supreme Ox didn't waste any time and immediately copied every little detail of Yuan's new appearance, taking it for himself."]},{"number":1612,"title":"Chapter 1612 Snowy Fox Mountain","paragraphs":["After the transaction, Yuan returned to his original appearance and asked, \"So, who is this individual who might have the information I want?\"","The Supreme Ox, now with a pleasing-to-the-eyes appearance, spoke with a satisfied smile, \"The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy is known to have knowledge that surpasses every Predator in the Primal Expanse. If she doesn't have the information you need, I'm afraid that nobody else in the Primal Expanse does.\"","\"Where can I find this Divine Fox?\"","\"The Mystic Valley, but unless the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy wants to see you, it's almost impossible to find her.\"","\"Sounds a bit troublesome, but I'll figure it out when I get there. Thank you for the information.\"","\"By the way, which dragon tribe are you from?\" The Supreme Ox suddenly asked.","\"That's a secret.\"","\"Is that so? Then keep your secrets.\"","A moment later, a small figure appeared before Yuan like a ghost.","\"W-who the hell are you?!\" The Supreme Ox was startled by Yingzi's sudden appearance, looking like he couldn't believe he didn't notice her presence until she stood right before him.","'No... even with my eyes directly on her, I cannot sense her presence! This ghost-like presence... she must be—'","\"Shadow Dweller! What are you doing in my territory?! And that appearance... where did you acquire such a high-quality appearance?!\"","\"Shadow Dweller?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow at this familiar name.","He turned to look at Yingzi, who turned out to have the same bloodline as one of the Nine Divine Supremes!","\"Are you trying to start another bloodbath in my territory?!\" The Supreme Ox roared, and the presences that appeared to threaten Yuan returned, but there were significantly more this time.","\"Don't mind me. I am only here as that guy's travel guide.\" Yingzi remained calm despite the many threatening presences surrounding them and pointed at Yuan with her gaze.","\"T-travel guide? You?\" The Supreme Ox couldn't believe what he was hearing.","How could an entity like her become a guide for someone else, even if that individual was a dragon?","\"Are you ready to go to the Mystic Valley?\" she asked Yuan the next moment.","\"How far away is the Mystic Valley from this place?\"","Yingzi pondered for a moment before responding, \"Fifty years, give or take.\"","\"...\"","'You can't be serious...'","Yuan was left absolutely gobsmacked by the ridiculous distance. He thought half a year was already bad enough, but fifty years?","\"That's too long!\" he cried out loud.","Seeing an opportunity to earn more appearances, the Supreme Ox said, \"I know of a way to get to the Mystic Valley in six months.\"","\"Oh?\" Yuan turned to look at him with a hopeful gaze.","\"There's a natural space tunnel that will take you to the Snowy Fox Mountain, which is around six months away from the Mystic Valley.\"","\"I can get you there in two months,\" Yingzi then said.","\"As for the location of this space tunnel...\" The Supreme Ox spoke with a suggestive smile.","Yuan immediately realized what the Supreme Ox was thinking, smiled back, and said, \"Not just seven thousand years. I'll let you keep that appearance permanently.\"","\"DEAL! IT'S A DEAL!\" The Supreme Ox excitedly agreed.","The Supreme Ox proceeded to retrieve a medallion made from a piece of bone and tossed it to Yuan.","\"Since the space tunnel is within my territory, you will need to show that to the guards there.\"","He turned to look at one of his minions and said, \"Bring them to the space tunnel.\"","\"As you command, Supreme Ox.\" The minion acknowledged with its head lowered.","Yuan left the mountain to follow the guide shortly later. They arrived at their location three days later. The space tunnel appeared to be an ordinary cave at a glance, but Yuan's divine sense told a different story.","There were two ox guards standing outside this cave, and they glared at Yuan and Yingzi as they approached.","\"The Supreme Ox has given them permission to use the space tunnel.\" The ox minion explained.","Yuan showed the bone medallion to the guards, who took it and examined it.","\"Very well, you may enter.\"","Yuan and Yingzi entered the cave the next moment while the ox minion stayed behind.","\"Just keep walking until you exit the other side.\" The ox guard said.","The cave was dimly illuminated by the mysterious purple rocks sticking out of the walls around them.","There was also a weird energy that filled the cave. This energy felt similar to the energy from teleport formations that Yuan was familiar with, but it was slightly different, and it only got more intense as they walked deeper into the cave.","After walking for several days straight, Yuan could finally see the end of the cave.","His steps hastened as they approached the glowing white light.","When they finally exited the cave, Yuan was greeted by a white mountain range and snow so deep it reached his waist. As for Yingzi, her entire body was submerged in snow, leaving only her head visible.","\"Fifty meat skewers.\" Yingzi suddenly said. \"Traveling in this terrain is a pain, so it will cost you more.\"","\"Sure. Do you want them now or later? The skewers will quickly get cold in this weather.\"","If he didn't protect his body with spiritual energy, the intense cold would easily freeze it within seconds, but even with his body protected, it was still freezing cold.","'I can't recall the last time I felt this cold...'","Cultivators can regulate their body temperature using spiritual energy, ensuring comfort even if they stand naked in a snowstorm. However, this ability can be challenged under extreme conditions that are too severe for their energy to suppress.","Moreover, the snow in this area seemed to possess a unique trait that drained spiritual energy, making it even more challenging for Yuan to maintain a steady body temperature.","\"You can give them to me later,\" she said.","\"Alright.\"","Yingzi picked up Yuan and flew toward the Mystic Valley shortly later."]},{"number":1613,"title":"Chapter 1613 Shadow Dweller","paragraphs":["As they ventured deeper into Snowy Fox Mountain, a fierce blizzard raged around them. The harsh conditions didn't affect Yuan, but he could sense the relentless blizzard gradually chipping away Yingzi's energy that protected them from the blizzard. Fortunately, Yingzi was able to replenish her energy faster than it was being depleted, averting what could have been a perilous situation.","\"Yingzi, if you don't mind me asking, what kind of Predator are Shadow Dwellers?\" Yuan suddenly asked this question that had been on his mind since it was revealed to him that she was one.","\"What do you mean? Can you be more specific?\"","\"You know how the Sword Head Serpent is a snake, and the Supreme Ox is an ox? What about Shadow Dwellers?\"","\"If you're asking about my shape, we don't really have one. We can become any shape or size, just like shadows.\"","'A shapeshifting beast?' Yuan tried to imagine her true form, but the closest image he could conjure was that of the shadow monsters he'd seen on television—an entity devoid of any distinct features, merely a shadowy figure resembling a silhouette.","\"We dwell in the shadow, hunt with shadows, and traverse through shadows. We are the pinnacle of hunters—at least, that's what the others say.\"","\"Sounds like a species that prefers living in isolation,\" Yuan commented.","\"It's true. Shadow Dwellers rarely show themselves. I, however, am an exception. I prefer traversing the world and experiencing new things. That's probably why I am considered an outcast,\" Yingzi casually remarked.","Despite calling herself an outcast, Yingzi didn't sound dispirited or saddened, almost as if she was completely fine with it.","\"Tell me about your world—this Nine Heavens.\" Yingzi suddenly said.","Yuan nodded and recalled some of his experiences in the Nine Heavens with her.","A month passed in the blink of an eye.","Halfway through their journey, in the midst of Yuan's mental meditation, a voice suddenly rippled loudly throughout the Snowy Fox Mountain.","This voice carried a profound power that had the ability to stop the blizzard.","Yingzi stopped moving after hearing this voice, and she warned Yuan, \"The owner of this territory will be here shortly.\"","The moment Yingzi finished her sentence, and before Yuan could even respond, a white-haired woman wearing white robes appeared before them.","\"You may be a dragon, but how dare you trespass into my territory without permission? Are you looking for death?\" The woman spoke in a bold tone.","At a glance, the aura exuded by this woman was slightly stronger than the Supreme Ox. \"Huh? There are two of you?\" The woman's eyes widened with surprise after realizing that she'd failed to sense Yingzi's presence.","\"I apologize for entering your territory, but we don't have any business with you or this place. We're just trying to reach the Mystic Valley.\" Yuan explained the situation to her.","\"I don't care what you're doing or where you're going. It doesn't change the fact that you're trespassing into my territory,\" she sneered.","'Are entering another's territory usually such a big deal?' Yuan asked Yingzi through divine sense.","'It varies from individual to individual, but it's usually considered rude to enter another's territory without permission. This only applies to Predators, though. Primals have no intelligence, so we can't really blame them for trespassing. They're also considered a source of food and power for Predators, so they're more than welcome to trespass.'","After taking a quick moment to ponder a way out of this, Yuan spoke, \"Is there anything we can do to make it up to you? Would a high-quality appearance be good enough?\"","\"Y-you... are you bribing me?\" The woman wore a bewildered expression on her ordinary face.","Killing intent surged from her the following moment. \"I don't care who you are or what you have to offer! Nobody bribes me!\"","Noticing the woman was preparing to strike, Yuan quickly swallowed an appearance-altering pill and transformed himself into a beautiful woman. He also ensured the appearance had white hair, reflecting the woman's current appearance.","\"...\"","The woman, previously trembling with anger, suddenly froze. Her enraged expression shifted to one of bewilderment, as if she had just witnessed a miracle.","\"Y-you're willing to give me that appearance...?\" she asked in a low voice.","Yuan nodded and said, \"If you're willing to overlook our trespass and let us continue our journey without any further issues, I'll let you keep it.\"","The woman lowered her head to hide her face while she pondered whether she should accept his offer.","'If I accept his offer, my pride will... Forget it! I must get my hands on that appearance, no matter the cost!'","It didn't take long for the woman to make up her mind.","\"It's a deal!\"","She swiftly mimicked Yuan's appearance and then flew away immediately afterward, not uttering another word.","They continued their journey shortly later, and the blizzard never returned.","After another month, they finally arrived at their destination.","Before reaching the Mystic Valley, they had to cross an ocean whose surface suddenly began to glow, casting a shimmering light across the expansive waters.","\"So this is the Mystic Valley, huh? It's a beautiful place.\" Yuan commented after seeing the glamorous scenery before him.","The Mystic Valley was draped in blue and purple trees, lending the area an exotic ambiance. Additionally, these trees bore glowing fruits that illuminated the entire valley, casting a light reminiscent of street stalls glowing softly in the night.","Moreover, a long river that flowed into the glowing ocean bisected the valley, contributing to its mystical atmosphere. The water in this river also glowed, further enhancing the otherworldly aura of the place.","\"Do you know where we can find the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy?\" Yuan asked Yingzi after he finished admiring the place.","Yingzi shook her head and replied, \"No, but the Mystic Valley is a relatively small place, and one could fully explore it in just a few months. If we search every nook and cranny, we should eventually find her.\""]},{"number":1614,"title":"Chapter 1614 Mystic Valley","paragraphs":["Shortly after their arrival, Yuan and Yingzi started looking around the Mystic Valley, using their eyes and divine sense to search for the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy.","\"I want five meat skewers now.\" Yingzi extended her hand and said.","Yuan acknowledged her request and retrieved five skewers before giving them to her.","The moment the meat skewers emerged from his spatial ring, releasing their unique aroma into the air, all of the Primals within a hundred-mile radius detected the scent and charged in their direction.","Sensing the incoming danger, Yingzi released a burst of her aura. The instant the Primals detected her powerful presence, they abruptly turned and fled in the opposite direction, not halting their frantic escape even hundreds of miles later.","This was Yuan's first time experiencing Yingzi's 'presence.' It was chaotic and unlike anything he had previously encountered. There was something fundamentally different about the beasts in the Primal Expanse compared to those in the Nine Heavens.","'Is this due to the Chaotic Essence that they absorb?'","Yuan wondered how it would affect his body if he cultivated Chaotic Essence, but he was reluctant to try, as it could harm his body.","Over the following weeks, Yuan and Yingzi methodically traversed the Mystic Valley. Throughout this journey, they encountered numerous species of Primals, none of which Yuan recognized.","Most of the Primals' strength ranged between Spirit King and Divine Ancestor, with a few having the strength of an Immortal. However, regardless of their strength, not many approached them, primarily due to Yuan's dragon scent. The few who dared to approach them were instantly scared away when they saw Yingzi, so their journey was relatively peaceful.","One day, Yuan halted abruptly when a unique glow caught the corner of his eye. Turning his attention to the source, he discovered it was a glowing purple mushroom nestled among the branches of a nearby tree. Intrigued by its luminous appearance, he moved closer for a better look.","\"Do you know what this is?\" Yuan asked Yingzi, who stared at it from a distance, seemingly unwilling to get closer to it for whatever reason.","\"That is a Primal Bane. It contains a tremendous amount of Chaotic Essence, but it's also extremely poisonous. Just its scent alone could kill,\" she explained.","\"Is that why I don't sense any Primals in this area? Are you okay?\" he asked her.","Yingzi replied, \"I am not weak enough to be killed by its scent, but I dislike its smell.\" \"More importantly... how are you fine?\"","Yuan shrugged and said, \"I'm not sure, but I don't think it's poisonous for me. After all, I can feel my cultivation rising just by being near it.\"","He proceeded to pick the mushroom, which was the size of an apple.","\"Are all humans as reckless as you?\" Yingzi asked with raised eyebrows.","Yuan chuckled and said, \"I can't speak for all humans, but I am definitely not as reckless as you think.\"","Yuan examined the Primal Bane in finer detail once it was in his hands.","After staring at it for several minutes, Yuan suddenly opened his mouth and tossed the glowing mushroom inside.","Yingzi was taken aback by Yuan's actions. However, her immediate concern wasn't for his safety but rather the prospect of not receiving any more meat skewers if something were to happen to him.","As Yuan bit into the glowing mushroom, it released a sweet nectar that tingled his taste buds and offered a surprising burst of flavor.","<You have consumed Primal Bane>","<You have gained Supreme Poison Resistance>","<You have absorbed enough Qi for a breakthrough!>","<You have reached Second Level Spirit Emperor>","<You have absorbed enough Qi for a breakthrough!>","<You have reached Third Level Spirit Emperor>","<You have absorbed enough Qi for a breakthrough!>","<You have reached Fourth Level Spirit Emperor>","Not only did Yuan gain poison resistance from the mushroom, but he also experienced three consecutive breakthroughs in his cultivation despite the Celestial Emperor's curse, which was a pleasant surprise.","Yingzi's eyes widened slightly as she witnessed these events, leading her to ponder whether Yuan's human nature made him unique, or if there was something inherently special about him.","\"This Primal Bane is great. Do you see any more around here?\" Yuan turned to Yingzi and asked.","Although she was speechless, Yingzi still used her divine sense to search for more Primal Banes.","A few moments later, she said, \"There's another one about two days away.\"","\"Great! Let me eat that one, too!\"","\"...\"","Two days later, Yuan tossed the second Primal Bane into his mouth.","<You have absorbed enough Qi for a breakthrough!>","<You have reached Fifth Level Spirit Emperor>","He only managed to breakthrough once this time around, but he still felt it was worth it.","As they continued to look for the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy, Yuan also kept an eye out for more Primal Banes or anything that seemed like it would strengthen him.","A week later, Yingzi suddenly descended toward the glowing river. With a swift hand gesture, she raised an azure-colored flower from the water and hovered it before Yuan.","\"This is a Luminous Aquatic Lily. It's poisonous enough to instantaneously kill a Chaotic Overlord. I'll give it to you for one hundred meat skewers,\" she said.","Yuan stared at the beautiful flower that glowed even brighter than the Primal Bane and swallowed nervously.","'Young Master! That's the Sacred Ocean Lily!' Yu Ning's shocked voice suddenly resounded.","'Oh? You recognize this treasure?' he inquired.","'Of course. It's an extremely rare treasure that can only be found in the Azure Dragon Clan's territory, deep within the Azure Ocean. It's said to grant one immunity to poison!' Yu Ning explained.","'Immunity to poison, huh?'","\"Alright, It's a deal,\" Yuan said to Yingzi the next moment.","'This is safe to consume, right?' Yuan asked for confirmation from Yu Ning.","'You're asking that now, after you ate that weird mushroom, even though you knew it was poisonous?' she said in a dumbfounded voice.","'Anyway, yes, it's poisonous and can only be safely consumed if taken with Saint Dew, which neutralizes the poison when consumed together.'"]},{"number":1615,"title":"Chapter 1615 Luminous Aquatic Lily","paragraphs":["With a pondering face, Yuan stared at the Luminous Aquatic Lily, also known as the Sacred Ocean Lily in the Nine Heavens. Despite Yu Ning's confirmation that it was poisonous, he had Supreme Poison Resistance, and he managed to consume the Primal Bane without any resistance.","'I cannot rely on Yingzi forever since I only had a limited amount of skewers left to use on her. Moreover, I don't feel any sense of dread from it...'","He considered whether to consume the Luminous Aquatic Lily immediately or wait until he had obtained the Saint Dew to safely neutralize its poisonous effects.","\"Aren't you going to eat it?\" Yingzi suddenly asked him.","After hearing Yingzi's words, Yuan quickly made up his mind. Without any hesitation, he tossed the entire flower into his mouth the very next second.","\"Young Master?!\" Yu Ning exclaimed in a shocked voice after seeing his actions. She'd just told him that it was poisonous, so why would he do something so foolish?","\"!!!\"","Upon consuming the Luminous Aquatic Lily, Yuan felt an immense burst of energy surge through his body, so powerful that it threatened to cause his body to explode. Recognizing the urgency, he quickly found a place to sit down and focus on cultivating to control the overwhelming energy.","Since the Luminous Aquatic Lily had thrived in an environment rich with Chaotic Essence, consuming it began to alter Yuan's aura. Gradually, his aura grew more chaotic, beginning to resemble that of the residents of the Primal Expanse, marking a significant transformation in his energy.","Although the Primal Bane also contained a lot of Chaotic Essence, it was not enough to affect Yuan. The Luminous Aquatic Lily, however, was at least fifty times more potent than the Primal Bane.","Yuan's cultivation soared in the following moments.","<You have absorbed enough Qi for a breakthrough!>","<You have reached Fifth Level Spirit Emperor>","<You have absorbed enough Qi for a breakthrough!>","<You have reached Sixth Level Spirit Emperor>","<You have absorbed enough Qi for a breakthrough!>","<You have reached Seventh Level Spirit Emperor>","<You have absorbed enough Qi for a breakthrough!>","<You have reached Eighth Level Spirit Emperor>","<You have absorbed enough Qi for a breakthrough!>","<You have reached Ninth Level Spirit Emperor>","In the blink of an eye, Yuan's cultivation base surged to the peak of the Spirit Emperor level, then began to stabilize. Over the following hours, his cultivation slowly advanced, inching closer to the threshold of Spirit Sovereign.","A day after Yuan consumed the Luminous Aquatic Lily, his aura, which had been tranquil for some time, suddenly skyrocketed.","<You have absorbed enough Qi for a breakthrough!>","<You have reached First Level Spirit Sovereign>","<Sacred Ocean Lily has been completely refined>","<Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has strengthened the effects of Sacred Ocean Lily>","<Your skill 'Supreme Poison Resistance' has developed into 'Hundred Poison Immunity'>","<Your skill 'Hundred Poison Immunity' has developed into 'Ten Thousand Poison Immunity'>","<Due to a large consumption of Chaotic Essence, you have begun to develop a Chaotic Heart>","Ding!","<You have received a Quest>","[Quest: Chaotic Heart]","[Difficulty: Hard]","[Quest Description: Consume Chaotic Essence and complete your Chaotic Heart]","[Progress: 10%]","[Reward: Chaotic Heart]","Yuan stared at the quest with wide eyes.","\"Congratulations on your breakthrough, Young Master...\" Yu Ning's dumbfounded voice snapped him out of his daze.","He turned to look at Yingzi and asked, \"What's a Chaotic Heart?\"","\"That's what we have and need to cultivate,\" she calmly responded.","Her eyes suddenly narrowed as she fixed an intense stare at him.","\"I can sense a Chaotic Heart, one that didn't exist before, within you... However, it doesn't seem complete... How is that possible?\" she muttered in a dazed voice.","The residents of the Primal Expanse are naturally born with a Chaotic Heart, so nobody knew it could be created—in a human, much less.","\"What did you do?\" Yingzi asked him a moment later.","\"Besides consuming the Luminous Aquatic Lily, nothing really. I think it's because I consumed a large amount of Chaotic Essence, which I am not used to,\" he said.","\"...\"","Yingzi wore a pondering expression on her face, but she didn't say anything else.","\"Give me a few more hours. I want to try something.\"","Yuan closed his eyes again and began cultivating.","Six hours later, his progress increased by a single percent.","'At this rate, I will need to cultivate for 23 days to complete the Chaotic Heart.'","\"I need 23 days to complete my Chaotic Heart. Can you wait a little for me?\" Yuan asked Yingzi, who calmly nodded.","Once Yuan returned to his cultivation, Yingzi sat beside him and watched him slowly form his Chaotic Heart.","However, Yuan emerged from his cultivation only a week later.","'This won't work. My progress slowed down significantly after reaching 20 percent. I will need to consume treasures if I want any decent progress.'","He should have gained 28 percent in the last week, but he only managed to achieve an increase of 9 percent. He reached 20 percent overall progress on the second day but failed to make any further progress in the subsequent days.","\"What's wrong?\" Yingzi asked when she noticed he'd suddenly stopped cultivating.","\"There were some errors in my calculations. It seems the requirements increase as I get closer to completing the Chaotic Heart,\" Yuan sighed out loud.","\"At this rate, I don't know how long it will take me to finish it. I will need to consume more treasures containing Chaotic Essence if I want to complete my Chaotic Heart anytime soon.\"","\"Treasures, right? I can find them for you, but in exchange...\"","\"You want meat skewers, right?\"","She nodded.","\"Alright.\"","They returned to looking for the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy shortly after.","As they continued to search the Mystic Valley, Yingzi would occasionally bring Yuan treasures rich with Chaotic Essence. While these treasures were not as potent as the Primal Bane, much less the Luminous Aquatic Lily, it was still enough to progress his Chaotic Heart."]},{"number":1616,"title":"Chapter 1616 Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy","paragraphs":["A month has passed since Yuan consumed the Luminous Aquatic Lily. During this time, he'd consumed numerous treasures while searching for the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy.","His progress with the Chaotic Heart had reached fifty percent, but his cultivation hadn't increased even slightly due to the Chaotic Heart absorbing all of the Chaotic Essence.","Most of the treasures were acquired by Yingzi, and in exchange for them, Yuan had to give her several hundred meat skewers.","'Will my supply last until I can create my Chaotic Heart...?' Yuan wondered inwardly as he checked his swiftly declining stock of meat skewers.","He had only about five thousand meat skewers left, which might seem plentiful, but given Yingzi's rapid consumption rate, his supply could be depleted within a year.","\"We've searched the entire Mystic Valley.\" Yingzi suddenly announced.","\"Is it possible the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy isn't in her own territory?\" Yuan asked.","\"There is a chance she isn't home, but we won't know for sure unless we burn down this whole place to draw her out.\"","Yuan looked at Yingzi with wide eyes, clearly surprised by her savage suggestion.","\"It won't take much effort or time,\" Yingzi said, misunderstanding his feelings.","Before Yuan could respond, a new voice echoed through the air, \"I knew my Mystic Valley would be receiving some special visitors, but alas, what a disappointment. How dare you even speak of destroying my beautiful territory?\" The tone was stern, filled with a mixture of anger and disappointment.","A formidable presence suddenly enveloped the area, and Yuan caught a glimpse of a silhouette in the corner of his eye, prompting him to swiftly turn his head toward the source.","Standing atop an enormous boulder in the distance was a majestic azure-colored fox with golden eyes and purple patterns across its body. Its four tails fluttered gracefully behind it, adding to its ethereal presence.","This golden fox possessed a cultivation level that was at least two to three tiers higher than both the Supreme Ox and the woman Yuan had encountered in the Snowy Fox Mountain, and it exuded a fierce holy aura, almost as if it was a divine being from heaven.","\"Are you the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy?\" Yuan asked despite knowing the answer.","\"That's right. Who's asking?\" she responded, her voice tinged with a mix of pride and arrogance.","\"Hello. My name is Yuan, and I came here for your help.\"","\"My help? That's a good joke, considering you were just talking about destroying my territory to lure me out,\" she coldly sneered.","\"What? I'm sure she was just joking out of frustration since we couldn't find you even after searching the whole Mystic Valley.\"","The Divine Fox of Grand Propechy narrowed her eyes and sneered, \"Yes, I saw...how you stole and consumed all of the treasures in my territory!\"","Yuan's eyes widened at her accusation. It had never occurred to him that gathering natural treasures in the wild could be considered stealing.","Unbeknownst to him, in the Primal Expanse, once an individual claimed a territory, everything within it was considered their possession. Thus, taking anything from that territory was viewed as stealing.","\"To tell you the truth, I'm not from around here, so I don't know your rules. I apologize if I offended you, and if there's any way I can compensate you, don't hesitate to let me know.\"","The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy fell silent after hearing his words. Eventually, she said, \"If you wish to compensate me, then give me those meat sticks you have been giving that Shadow Dweller.\"","\"Of course. How many do you want?\"","\"All of it,\" she responded without hesitation.","\"That's...\"","However, before Yuan could even formulate a response, immense killing intent suddenly surged from Yingzi's small frame, enveloping the entire Mystic Valley in an instant.","\"Don't push your luck too far, Divine Fox,\" she growled in a shivering tone.","Despite the intense atmosphere, the Divine Fox neither fled nor showed any signs of fear, standing firm and composed. In stark contrast, the nearby Primals scrambled away in terror, visibly shaken to their core, even pissing themselves while they fled.","\"What? You wanna go at it? I'm not afraid of you.\" The Divine Fox sneered, her posture oozing with confidence for some reason.","\"We didn't come here to fight you. Also, I would give you all of my meat skewers if I could, but as you can see, it will only lead to an even bigger problem, so I will refrain from doing so.\" Yuan sighed.","\"How about five hundred meat skewers?\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, the Divine Fox nodded, \"Fine. I'll forgive you for five hundred of those meat sticks.\"","Yuan immediately retrieved 500 meat skewers and offered them to the Divine Fox, who started eating them the moment it was in her grasp.","\"Oh my! What a unique flavor! I have never tasted anything like this before! What kind of Primal meat is this?!\" exclaimed the Divine Fox, her entire body trembling with joy as she savored the meat skewers, clearly delighted by the unfamiliar and exquisite taste.","\"I can tell you if you answer one of my questions,\" Yuan saw this opportunity and said.","\"There is almost nothing I don't know. What do you want to know?\"","\"A method of leaving this world,\" he said.","\"...\"","The Divine Fox stopped chewing on the meat skewers and stared at him in silence, her thoughts unknown.","Sometime later, she quickly chewed her food and swallowed before speaking in a calm voice, \"As I thought, you're not from this world.\"","\"How can you tell?\" Yuan asked out of curiosity.","\"How can I not after watching you for the last several weeks? Not only do you lack common sense, but you also lack a Chaotic Heart. Are you even a dragon or a human disguised as one? It's been a few million years since we've had a visitor from the other side.\"","Yuan smiled inwardly after observing the Divine Fox's knowledgeable demeanor, hopeful that she might possess the information he needed to return to the Nine Heavens."]},{"number":1617,"title":"Chapter 1617 Primal Monarch","paragraphs":["\"You're right. I am not from this world originally. I came to the Primal Expanse by accident, and I am trying to look for a way back to my own world.\" Yuan said to the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy after she correctly guessed his identity.","\"And you think I know this method? What made you come here, anyway?\" The Divine Fox asked.","\"That's what the Supreme Ox said. Don't tell me you don't...\" Yuan swallowed nervously.","\"I do know how to leave this world.\"","\"Really?!\"","Yuan's expression brightened after hearing this.","\"Yes, but I do not have the power to do so. If you want to leave this world, you will need to find someone else.\"","\"Not this again...\" Yuan muttered in disbelief.","He had already spent a year in the Primal Expanse, with most of that time devoted to searching for someone who could help him escape this realm.","This was now the third time he was being directed to find another individual who 'might' be able to assist him. The repeated dead ends were becoming increasingly frustrating, but there was nothing he could do but continue following these leads.","Seeing Yuan's disappointed face, the Divine Fox elaborated, \"You probably don't know this, but the Primal Expanse has a master—one true ruler that governs every Primal and Predator in existence.\"","\"Not only does he rule over the entire Primal Expanse, but he also has the power to connect this world to the other world. If you want to leave this world, you'll need to find him.\"","\"Who is this individual?\" Yuan asked.","\"Some call him the One True Monarch while others call him the Primal Monarch or Monarch of Primals.\"","\"Primal Monarch...?\" Yuan repeated in a mumbling voice.","Although this should have been his first time hearing of this individual, Yuan couldn't shake a sense of familiarity, as if he somehow already knew or was connected to them in some way.","\"Where can I find him?\" Yuan then asked.","The Divine Fox pointed the skewers in her hand at him and said, \"So, what kind of meat is this?\"","Clearly, she had no intention of answering all of his questions for free.","The Divine Fox pointed the skewers in her hand at him and said, \"So, what kind of meat is this?\"","Clearly, she had no intention of answering all of his questions for free.","\"There are three types of meat used for those meat skewers. They come from animals we call chicken, lamb, and cow.\" \"Are animals in your world what we call Primals here?\" she asked.","\"No. Animals don't have spiritual energy. They're essentially powerless Primals.\"","\"I see... Which meat is this?\" Divine Fox asked as she showed him one of the skewers.","\"That white meat is from chicken. The small, chunky ones are lamb meat. The brown slices are beef—cow meat.\" Yuan explained.","\"And what are these tiny specks of dust on it? I can tell that's where most of the flavors come from.\" The Divine Fox continued to inquire.","\"We call those spices, which are commonly used to give or enhance flavors in our food. Without them, the meat will taste quite bland.\"","\"I see... how intriguing...\" The Divine Fox stared at the meat skewers.","\"I happen to have some spices on me. If you want, I can give you some.\" Yuan suddenly retrieved several bottles of spices, mainly salt, sugar, garlic, and crushed pepper.","\"Oh?!\" The Divine Fox's gaze suddenly brightened.","\"Of course, it's not for free—\"","\"If you want to find the Primal Monarch, it's impossible. He's not an individual you can just seek out. Like me, he will only appear before you if he chooses to do so. If he doesn't want you to find him, you will spend the rest of your life trying.\"","\"What?! Then how am I—\"","The Divine Fox interrupted, \"Of course, I can help you find—give you a better chance of finding him. With my divination, I can locate his proximity. Whether or not you will be able to find him is entirely up to your luck and fate.\"","\"However, for my abilities to work on the Primal Monarch, I will need to use a tremendous amount of Chaotic Essence—more than what I currently have, so you'll need to supply me with the rest. This is also why I can only give you his proximity, as I lack the power to do anything more.\"","Yuan tossed the spices to the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy after receiving her answer.","\"So, what would it cost to have you help me find him?\" Yuan asked the following moment.","\"I'll be severely weakened after using my ability on the Primal Monarch, so it'll cost you more than just some spices or food.\" The Divine Fox said.","\"I have an annoying neighbor who's always been a pain in my butt and consistently trying to scheme against me. I want you to get rid of them for me,\" she said.","\"If this individual is so strong that even you cannot get rid of them, what hope do I have?\" Yuan asked.","\"They're not particularly strong. I would have no issue dealing with someone at their level in ordinary circumstances, but this one has a special background, so I am unable to harm them without putting myself at risk. With that being said, they still have the strength of a Perfect Chaotic King, way above what you can handle at your current level.\"","\"Perfect Chaotic King... so around Divine Sovereign, huh? I think I can manage.\" Yuan said.","\"Huh? You're barely a Perfect Chaotic Adept. There's no way you can defeat someone three major realms stronger than yourself. In the first place, I never expected you to do the work, but your little friend here.\" The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy's gaze stared at Yingzi as she spoke.","Yuan smiled and said, \"I have my ways.\"","\"Whatever. I don't care how you deal with that bastard as long as you get rid of him. Once you do that, I'll divine the Primal Monarch's location for you. Also, don't forget about the extra Chaotic Essence. I need a treasure that will temporarily boost my strength, or it won't work, and coincidentally, that annoying bastard has something like that in his possession.\""]},{"number":1618,"title":"Chapter 1618 Starfire Dragon","paragraphs":["\"So, who is this Primal that you want to get rid of?\" Yuan asked.","\"Not a Primal. He's a Predator.\" The Divine Fox corrected him. \"He has a dragon bloodline—a real one.\"","\"Dragon bloodline, huh? Is that why you cannot attack him?\"","\"He's from the Divine Dragon Sanctuary, one of the top powers in the Primal Expanse. If I attack him and offend them, they could easily destroy me and my territory. However, you're a different story. Even if you kill him, it won't affect you once you leave this place.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow and said, \"But you were expecting Yingzi to kill him, and she is a resident of this world.\"","Divine Fox of Grand Propechy looked at Yingzi and sneered, \"You know nothing about Shadow Dwellers. With their ability to hide their presence completely, she can traverse the Primal Expanse without worry, even with the entire world hunting her.\"","\"Even if she's completely invisible, it doesn't make it okay to use her like that. Also, I don't have to kill your neighbor, only get rid of him, right?\"","The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy became silent to ponder.","A moment later, she spoke, \"I would prefer it if you killed him, but if you can't, just make sure he never returns.\"","\"Sounds good. Then I'll go visit him now.\" Yuan said.","\"What about me?\" Yingzi asked.","\"I don't think I'll need your help this time, but you can come with me just in case.\"","Yingzi nodded and decided to follow him, motivated by the opportunity to possibly acquire more meat skewers.","Yuan began traveling to the dragon's territory after acquiring more information from the Divine Fox.","According to the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy, Yuan's next target was a Starfire Dragon, who resided within the Flaming Peak—a fiery land perpetually engulfed in flames.","The Flaming Peak was roughly ten days away from Mystic Valley, even when traveling at Yingzi's swift pace. As they neared their destination, the temperature soared to extreme levels, reaching intensities that could melt even Spirit Kings if they ventured too close.","'If it weren't for my physique, I would probably be a puddle right now...' Yuan thought to himself as he tried to cool himself.","He looked at Yingzi, who didn't have a single drop of sweat on her, seemingly unaffected by the intense heat.","The heat only worsened as they approached the Flaming Peak. However, despite his situation, Yuan took this opportunity to temper his body.","<You have gained Weak Fire Resistance>","<You have gained Powerful Fire Resistance>","As Yuan bolstered his fire resistance, the oppressive heat began to affect him less. Gradually, he adjusted until the once scorching temperatures felt merely warm, akin to that of lukewarm water.","Upon arriving at Flaming Peak, Yuan was met with a fiery spectacle. The place itself was an island featuring a solitary mountain at its center. The entire island was engulfed in flames, and the mountain was an active volcano, further intensifying the blazing landscape.","Upon arriving at Flaming Peak, Yuan was met with a fiery spectacle. The place itself was an island featuring a solitary mountain at its center. The entire island was engulfed in flames, and the mountain was an active volcano, further intensifying the blazing landscape.","Resting within the volcano, submerged in lava, was a solitary silhouette. Upon closer examination with his divine sense, Yuan discovered it was a handsome young man with short red hair.","When the handsome young man sensed Yuan's divine sense probing, his eyes snapped wide open, revealing their striking golden hue.","\"Who dares to spy on this Young Lord?!\"","The Starfire Dragon roared as he leaped into the air before staring directly at Yuan's direction.","\"Hm? A dragon?\" The Starfire Dragon narrowed his eyes after realizing this.","\"Which clan do you belong to? And what business do you have here in my territory—with a Shadow Dweller, no less?\" The Starfire Dragon immediately began interrogating Yuan.","\"How dare a lowly Starfire Dragon question me?\" Yuan roared in an arrogant voice.","Given that the Primal Expanse was a dog-eat-dog world, Yuan decided that it would be in his best interest to project strength, adopting an overbearing demeanor to show no signs of weakness.","\"L-lowly Starfire Dragon...?!\" The handsome young man trembled in anger and disbelief.","While it was true that the Starfire Dragon's bloodline wasn't top-tier—ranking only in the lower middle in terms of quality and purity—the Starfire Dragon had never before been humiliated or looked down upon in such a manner.","\"HOW DARE YOU!\"","As the Starfire Dragon's anger surged, so did its aura, sending powerful ripples across the entire island, causing the flames to dance violently.","\"I don't care who you are or where the fuck you came from, but you will not be leaving here alive today!\"","The Starfire Dragon soared toward Yuan like a flaming meteor.","Seeing this, Yingzi spoke, \"Do you want me to suppress him for you?\"","\"No, it's fine. I can handle this.\"","Yingzi puffed her cheeks at his refusal, seemingly disappointed that she couldn't earn some meat skewers.","Once the Starfire Dragon was close enough, Yuan suddenly activated Dragon's Gaze.","\"Wha—?!\"","The Starfire Dragon halted upon being struck by Dragon's Gaze.","\"T-this power is—! Dragon's Influence! You're royalty?!\" The Starfire Dragon cried out loud, his anger dissipating instantly after realizing he was baring his fangs against royalty.","Even if he had the Divine Dragon Santuary's backing, they would not hesitate to disown him if they knew he'd offended a dragon of a royal bloodline.","'Why the hell is a royal dragon causing trouble for me, a nobody?!'","Although the Starfire Dragon found it weird that he didn't recognize Yuan even though he memorized every member of the royal family, not to mention Yuan's low cultivation base, he was in no position to think properly.","\"Your Highness! This is an misunderstanding! Please tell me why you are here!\" The Starfire Dragon lowered his head and said.","\"Not only do you dare to question me, but you even dare to give me orders? Who do you think you are, huh?!\" Yuan roared, sending chills down the Starfire Dragon's spine.","'This overbearing demeanor! The strength of his Dragon's Influence! He's definitely royalty—a high-ranking one, at that!' he cried inwardly."]},{"number":1619,"title":"Chapter 1619 Starfire Dragon(2)","paragraphs":["\"M-my apologies, Your Highness! It wasn't my intention! I was wrong!\" Starfire Dragon quickly lowered his head.","\"If you know you're wrong, why are you still hovering above me and looking down on me like you're above me? Get on your knees! Or are you waiting for me to help you with my authority!? A lowly dragon like you?!\" Yuan shouted, increasing the intensity of Dragon's Gaze.","'This fucker is really too overbearing! But there's nothing I can do!' The Starfire Dragon cried inwardly before reluctantly descending to the ground and kneeling before Yuan.","\"...\"","Yingzi stared at Yuan with slightly widened eyes, clearly surprised by his domineering demeanor.","Once the Starfire Dragon was forced to kneel on the ground amidst the flames, Yuan fell silent. He spent the next several moments staring intently at the subdued dragon, his silence serving to further humiliate the proud creature.","Eventually, Yuan spoke, \"So, what are you doing here, on this island that is obviously too small for you?\"","\"T-this place may be small, but the yang energy here is very beneficial for me, so I am training here.\"","The Starfire Dragon didn't dare to reveal the truth—that he was actually there to court the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy, fearing that it might make him look weak and pathetic. Moreover, he was afraid that Yuan might take an interest in the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy and steal her away from him.","However, Yuan suddenly trembled, his face filled with anger.","\"Y-Your Highness...?\" The Starfire Dragon had a bad feeling after seeing this.","\"Do you think I am stupid? That I am easily fooled? How dare you, a lowly dragon, mock me?!\" Yuan roared, his body surging with immense killing intent.","\"?!?!\"","The Starfire Dragon was left in utter shock and fear after sensing Yuan's immense killing intent, which manifested as a red miasma enveloping the entire island.","Even Yingzi, who had encountered countless bloodthirsty Primals and Predators throughout her life, was taken aback by the intensity of Yuan's killing intent. Despite her extensive experience with formidable beings, she had never felt anything as overwhelming as the aura Yuan now emitted.","\"I will give you one last chance to tell me what you are doing on this island!\" Yuan roared.","\"I...I...I am truly sorry, Your Highness! Training here was just an excuse! I am actually here for the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy, whose territory is close by! I have been trying to court her for many years now, and living close to her makes it more convenient!\"","\"If you don't provide me a good reason why you lied to me the first time, I'll ensure you experience a fate worse than death!\" Yuan said.","\"I truly don't know why I lied to you, Your Highness! Please forgive me!\"","\"No, that's not good enough.\" Yuan shook his head with a profound glint in his eyes.","\"But I'll give you a chance to redeem yourself.\"","\"Anything!\"","\"Let's have a spar. If you can defeat me within half an hour, I will pretend you never lied. However, if I win, you will leave this place and never approach the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy.\"","\"?!?!\"","The Starfire Dragon couldn't believe his ears.","'He wants to spar with me? As far as I can tell, he's only at Perfect Chaotic Adept! He won't last a second against me, much less half an hour!'","Yuan narrowed his eyes at the Starfire Dragon and muttered in a cold voice, \"Are you looking down on me right now?\"","\"H-huh? O-of course not! I wouldn't dare!\" The Starfire Dragon vigorously shook his head. 'He's probably hiding his cultivation. There's no way someone with a royal bloodline would have such a low cultivation!' The Starfire Dragon convinced himself.","A few moments later, Yuan descended to the fiery ground. Despite his entire body being engulfed in flames, he did not burn and only felt mildly uncomfortable due to his enhanced resistance.","\"Do you need some time to prepare?\" Yuan asked.","\"No, I can start whenever.\"","He nodded and said, \"Don't hold back just because of my status. I don't want any excuses later.\"","\"As you command...\"","The Starfire Dragon transformed entirely the following moment, becoming a giant, red dragon.","He had expected Yuan to shift into his true form for the battle, as fighting in human form would be a disadvantage. So, when Yuan remained in his human guise, he couldn't help but ask, \"You're going to fight me in that appearance?\"","\"You're not even worth it. In fact, if you can make me fully transform, I'll consider it my defeat,\" Yuan said as he partially transformed.","'This arrogant bastard!' The Starfire Dragon clenched his teeth, cursing inwardly.","\"Then here I come.\"","Without using any weapons, Yuan made the first move and approached the Starfire Dragon. He wanted to see his current limit after so many breakthroughs.","They clashed shortly after, with the Starfire Dragon unleashing devastating flames with every movement.","Using nothing but his fists, Yuan struck the Starfire Dragon's body, each strike as heavy as mountains.","'Fuck! How does he exude so much power with that cultivation?! It doesn't make any sense!'","However, as strong as it seemed, Yuan's punches were only strong enough to inflict superficial damage on the Starfire Dragon.","Not only were the differences in their cultivation too vast, but the Starfire Dragon's body was unfathomably durable.","'Does he really intend to fight me while only partially transformed with that level of cultivation?!' The Starfire Dragon was in disbelief, but he was also filled with anger.","'Royalty or not, I will teach you a lesson for underestimating me!'","The Starfire Dragon opened its mouth and unleashed a massive ball of flames, its size rivaling that of the entire island itself. The air around it shimmered with intense heat as the colossal fireball gathered energy.","'Let's see if you still refuse to fully transform after this!'","\"Starfire Meteor!\"","The Starfire Dragon released the attack shortly after, hurling the massive ball of flames at Yuan."]},{"number":1620,"title":"Chapter 1620 Starfire Dragon(3)","paragraphs":["Long before the Starfire Dragon's fiery attack even reached him, Yuan could feel his skin being scorched by the intense heat radiating from the massive ball of flames.","Despite the dangerous situation, he refused to move away, seeming intent on blocking the attack with his bare body.","\"H-he can't be serious... right?\" The Starfire Dragon muttered in a dazed voice.","After the Starfire Dragon unleashed his attack, he began to fear the possibility of actually killing Yuan. Unsure, he glanced at Yingzi, searching for any sign of concern.","Noting her nonchalant demeanor, he sighed in relief, thinking, 'I doubt she would actually let me kill him. I need to push him to fully transform, no matter the cost!' With this resolution, he continued his fiery assault.","As the Starfire Meteor neared, about to make an impact, Yuan wrapped his arm in Enhanced Sword Aura and flicked it toward the massive ball of flames. The heat was intense enough to incinerate his arm completely, yet he sliced the meteor in half, and his burned arm fully recovered a few seconds later.","\"What is that sharp energy?\" Yingzi's eyes widened with interest after seeing Sword Aura for the first time.","The Starfire Dragon was just as shocked and puzzled as Yingzi, as he'd never heard of anything like that before.","'What is that weird energy? And what is with that ridiculous regenerative ability? My flames have a unique property that greatly reduces healing! Why isn't it working on him?!'","Unbeknownst to the Starfire Dragon, his flames actually reduced Yuan's healing ability. Otherwise, it wouldn't have taken him a few seconds to heal but instantly.","<Your resistance to fire has increased>","\"Not bad.\" Yuan examined his arm, which appeared completely healed on the surface. Despite this, a lingering burning sensation remained.","'What kind of dragon bloodline does he have? I don't know of any bloodlines with such a powerful healing ability, not to mention that weird energy he used to split my fire!'","\"L-let's see if you can cut this!\" The Starfire Dragon soared into the air, spreading his wings wide. As he did so, tens of thousands of small fireballs materialized, raining down upon Yuan like a fiery meteor shower. In response, Yuan cloaked his entire body in Enhanced Sword Aura, transforming himself into a blur as he charged directly toward the Starfire Dragon, undeterred by the onslaught of flames.","As Yuan charged forward, his Enhanced Sword Aura sliced through the barrage of fireballs, annihilating anything it touched. However, the intense heat from the fireballs penetrated his aura, inflicting direct damage on his body. Despite this, Yuan's form, now completely charred, continued to advance resolutely towards the Starfire Dragon.","'What the fuck?!'","The Starfire Dragon was left terrified by Yuan's unrelenting will and persistence. He always thought dragons with royal bloodline were mentally weak and disliked pain, but Yuan appeared to be the complete opposite of the rumors.","In the midst of Starfire Dragon's shock, Yuan arrived before him and swung his arm, unleashing a powerful sword light.","The Starfire Dragon hastily snapped out of his daze to avoid the sword light, but he failed and ended up having one of his wings severed.","He unleashed a thunderous roar, echoing through the air with such ferocity that he seemed to have entered a state of frenzy.","\"I don't care anymore!\"","The Starfire Dragon suddenly curled his body into a tight ball, and a red, ominous light began radiating from him, signaling the buildup of a potentially devastating attack.","\"Need my help? You might die from this.\" Yingzi suddenly said.","Yuan shook his head with a smile, \"I'll be fine.\"","Not wanting to get caught up in the blast, Yingzi distanced herself from the battlefield.","\"STARFIRE...\"","The light suddenly intensified, and a fiery aura enveloped the Starfire Dragon.","\"BURST!\"","The Starfire Dragon erupted in a colossal explosion, his flames rapidly expanding to envelop the entire island in a mere blink of an eye, turning the surroundings into a sea of fire, including the ocean.","The ferocious fire from the Starfire Dragon's explosion obliterated everything it touched, leaving nothing behind. Yuan was completely engulfed by the flames. The explosion maintained its intensity, with a massive ball of fire resembling the sun hanging in the air for several moments before it gradually began to dissipate.","The Starfire Dragon, completely exhausted of Chaotic Essence, fell directly into the ocean afterward.","Yingzi looked around for Yuan, but he was nowhere to be seen, almost as if he'd been erased from existence.","<Your fire resistance has increased significantly>","Suddenly, as if he'd materialized out of thin air, Yuan's body quickly recovered until there was not a single burn left on his body.","\"...\"","Seeing this, Yingzi began doubting whether Yuan was a human or a monster.","\"What kind of dragon are you...?\" Starfire Dragon muttered in a low voice as he stared at Yuan with a defeated look on his face.","\"I have never seen or heard of an indestructible dragon before... Even the Shadow Dragons, rumored to be as indestructible as Shadow Dwellers, would've perished just now...\"","\"That's none of your business. Anyway, it's your defeat, so you'll never show your face before the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy again as punishment. If I find out that you've broken our agreement, I will slaughter your entire bloodline. Do you understand?\"","\"Of course, Your Highness. I swear upon my bloodline that I will never approach the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy again...\"","Yuan nodded and suddenly retrieved a pill before tossing it into the dragon's mouth.","\"W-what did you just feed me?\" The Starfire Dragon was instantly alarmed.","\"Relax. That will recover your injuries.\" Yuan said.","Sure enough, the Starfire Dragon's exhaustion was quickly lifted, and within minutes, he was full of energy, almost as if they had never fought. \"W-what a miracle treasure! Thank you, Your Highness!\" The Starfire Dragon returned to his human appearance and bowed to Yuan.","\"I'm tired of seeing your face. Scram.\" Yuan coldly sneered.","\"Yes!\"","The Starfire Dragon didn't dare to linger and immediately flew away as if his life depended on it."]},{"number":1621,"title":"Chapter 1621 Ranked Territories","paragraphs":["\"It feels like I am forgetting something...\" Yuan muttered to himself shortly after the Starfire Dragon left the scene.","\"Whatever. It's too late to worry about that now.\"","Sometime later, Yingzi brought Yuan with her back to the Mystic Valley.","\"Do all humans have regenerative abilities like that?\" Yingzi asked him as they traveled.","\"No, they don't. I have an ability that allows me to regenerate that quickly.\"","\"Can this ability be taught?\"","\"I don't think so since it requires you to eat something dangerous.\"","While humans are incapable of consuming Demon Cores, Yuan wondered if beasts in the Primal Expanse have such capability since the Chaotic Essence in their world was similar to the energy found within Demon Cores.","Once they returned to the Mystic Valley, the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy appeared before them with a weird expression on her face.","She had watched their interaction with the Starfire Dragon and was left speechless by the results.","\"Are you really human?\" she suddenly asked Yuan with a doubtful face.","\"Of course. What makes you think otherwise?\"","The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy explained, \"Because humans aren't capable of using the power of our world. Moreover, you managed to create an incomplete Chaotic Heart. Are you perhaps half human and half Primal?\"","The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy had always suspected Yuan's identity since the very beginning, but due to so many confusing factors, it was nearly impossible to confirm anything about him.","\"No, I am full human. I am also unsure why I can cultivate Chaotic Essence, but I think it might have something to do with my physique.\"","The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy pondered for a moment before responding, \"If I recall correctly, some humans are born with special bodies and bloodlines, just like Primals, but they're incredibly rare.\"","\"What about your healing abilities? Is that also due to your unique physique?\"","\"No, that's something else entirely.\"","\"Is that so? Well, I won't pry further. Anyway, I believe you may have forgotten about something.\"","\"Oh? I also had the same feeling, but I don't remember what exactly.\"","\"You were supposed to acquire a treasure that will allow me to use more Chaotic Essence than I currently contain, and the Starfire Dragon had something like that, but you let him go without it.\"","\"Ah, right. I remember now. With that said, I was only going to do that if I killed him, which I didn't. Also, he would become suspicious of my identity if I suddenly asked for his treasure. I'm supposed to be royalty, after all.\"","\"Dragon's Influence, huh? I was extremely shocked when you used it. Does your world have dragons, too?\"","\"Of course. In fact, I think the beasts in my world originally came from the Primal Expanse. The only difference is that they cultivate different resources.\"","\"It's possible, but there is only one individual who can confirm that—the Primal Monarch.\" The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy said.","\"Anyway, now that you've dealt with my annoying neighbor, you'll need to find me a treasure that can temporarily boost my Chaotic Essence. The closest place with something like that would be the Phoenixes' territory. They're about three months away from here.\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes at this information.","\"Phoenixes' territory?\"","He wondered if they could help accelerate Feng Yuxiang's recovery. Despite his efforts in constantly feeding her his blood, there were still no signs that she would awaken anytime soon.","\"Yes, but there is a slight problem. The phoenixes in this world aren't kind to dragons. In fact, they detest each other to the point where they will attack each other on sight. I'm afraid you won't get near them, much less acquire their treasure.","\"You call that a slight problem?\" Yuan said with a raised eyebrow.","The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy shrugged and said, \"Then you'll have to visit the Divine Dragon Sanctuary. They're pretty far from here, but there is a space tunnel nearby that will shorten the trip to two years... from two hundred years.\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"No, I'll visit the phoenixes' territory. I have some business with them, regardless of the treasure.\"","\"Are you sure? Even the Shadow Dweller won't be able to protect you there.\" The Divine Fox said as she shifted her gaze to Yingzi.","While Yingzi was undoubtedly powerful, she was not among the most powerful beings in the Primal Expanse. As a matter of fact, she was far from it. Yuan looked at Yingzi and asked her, \"I never asked you, but how strong are you?\"","Due to her unique existence, it was impossible to determine Yingzi's cultivation base unless she disclosed it herself.","\"Early Chaotic Emperor,\" she calmly revealed.","\"Only Early Chaotic Emperor?\" Yuan was a little surprised to hear that she was only slightly stronger than the Starfire Dragon in terms of cultivation, as she had been incredibly confident throughout their journey.","The Starfire Dragon had a cultivation equivalent of Divine Sovereign in the Nine Heavens, so Yingzi would only be as strong as a Divine Ancestor.","\"You shouldn't underestimate a Shadow Dweller because, just like you, they're far more powerful in reality due to their unique abilities to control shadows.\" The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy said.","\"At her level, she can probably defeat even a Chaotic Overlord, much less a Perfect Chaotic Emperor, and the difference between a Chaotic Emperor and a Chaotic Overlord is immense, sort of like the difference between being a mortal and an immortal in your world.\"","\"However, the Phoenix territory you'll be heading to is a rank two territory, with rank one being the strongest and rank three being the weakest. In a rank two territory, there will be multiple Chaotic Immortals and a single one has the capability to erase you from existence with their breath alone.\"","\"What rank is the Mystic Valley?\" Yuan asked out of curiosity.","The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy laughed out loud, \"Hahaha! My territory doesn't even qualify to be ranked! Only large communities with many powerful Predators are qualified. This place is a small house on an island in comparison.\""]},{"number":1622,"title":"Chapter 1622 Feng Yuxiang’s Spatial Ring","paragraphs":["In order for a territory to be ranked, it must first have a community with at least a hundred Predators. Once that requirement was fulfilled, the overall prowess of that territory determined the rank of the territory.","The Phoenix territory that Yuan planned on going to was a rank-two territory, with over ten Chaotic Immortals, each as strong as a Bronze Immortal, at the very least.","Even though the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy warned him of the dangers and the Phoenixes' hatred toward Dragons, Yuan had to go there not just to find the Primal Monarch but also for Feng Yuxiang.","\"If you're resolute on going to the Phoenixes' territory, I won't stop you.\" The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy pointed in a certain direction and continued, \"If you go straight, you'll arrive at your destination in about three months, and I have already taken into consideration the Shadow Dweller's speed.\"","\"Thank you. I'll return once I acquire the treasure.\"","\"Don't forget this time, and it's called the True Ember.\" \"I won't.\" Yuan smiled.","Yuan and Yingzi left the Mystic Valley and began their journey to the Phoenixes' territory shortly after.","\"Yingzi, I don't expect you to protect me inside the Phoenixes' territory. If you sense danger, just run.\"","However, Yingzi said, \"While I won't be able to defeat the Phoenixes, I can ensure you keep your life, at the very least, but it'll cost you.\"","\"Of course.\" He nodded.","While they traveled, Yuan pondered how he should communicate with the Phoenixes once they arrived.","'According to the Divine Fox, they will attack Dragons on sight, so I probably won't be able to have a proper conversation with them. I should try to acquire their attention as soon as possible, but how can I achieve that?'","Yuan pondered whether it would be a good idea to reveal Feng Yuxiang's egg to them.","'No, I can't do that until I am certain they won't attack me. I cannot risk it, especially when Feng Feng is in that condition.'","'Should I just use Immortal Monarch's Dominion on them? That will definitely get their attention, but there's a chance it might not work on them, and there's a good chance it might anger them even further.'","Unable to think of anything, Yuan asked Xiao Hua and Yu Ning for advice.","\"Sorry, but I can't think of anything.\" Yu Ning sighed.","\"Brother Yuan, why don't you look inside that dumb pigeon's spatial ring and see if there's anything useful in there.\" Xiao Hua suddenly suggested.","Feng Yuxiang had left behind her spatial ring when she entered her slumber. Normally, one wouldn't be able to access another person's spatial ring while the owner was still alive, but Feng Yuxiang was Yuan's servant and had previously granted him permission to use it.","However, Yuan never even tried to look inside her spatial ring, as he respected her privacy and refused to invade it.","\"I guess I have no choice. I'll apologize to her later.\"","Yuan retrieved Feng Yuxiang's spatial ring and opened it for the first time.","\"?!?!?\"","Yuan's eyes widened with shock after seeing the treasures inside.","He'd always known that Feng Yuxiang had a large collection of rare treasures because of her store in the Lower Heavens, but he'd vastly underestimated her wealth.","After seeing just how truly wealthy Feng Yuxiang was, Yuan couldn't help but bow to her inside his head.","Not only did Feng Yuxiang's spatial ring have a larger storage space than his own Dragon Spatial Ring, but there were all sorts of treasures that could only be found in the Upper Heavens. What she'd shown in her store at the Lower Heavens barely scratched the surface of her vast collection.","There were mountains of treasures in the spatial ring for Yuan to go through, and luckily for him, he had nothing but time for the next three months.","After spending two and a half months going through all of the items, Yuan found several that might help him in the Phoenixes' territory.","[Burning Phoenix Pill] [Tier 7] [Purity: 94%]","[Effects: Permanently increases fire resistance and grants the power of a Phoenix for nine sunrises]","[Ancient Phoenix Robes]","[Grade: Mythic]","[Quality: Peak]","[Description: An ancient robe, once worn by the most noble of Phoenixes, symbolizing their supreme status and power. Grants fire immunity. It can only be worn by those with a Phoenix bloodline.]","[Warning: Those without a Phoenix bloodline will be punished with Phoenix's Wrath if they try to wear this item!]","[Primordial Phoenix Blood Essence]","[Effects: ???]","[Description: The Blood Essence of a Primordial Phoenix]","When Yuan saw the Primordial Phoenix Blood Essence, it reminded him of the Dragon Ancestor's Blood Essence, and knowing how valuable it was, he didn't dare to use it without Feng Yuxiang's permission. However, it made him wonder how Feng Yuxiang acquired such a precious treasure in the first place.","'Phoenix's Wrath... how bad could it be?'","After taking some time to mentally prepare himself, Yuan asked Yingzi to stop traveling temporarily.","\"Give me a moment to try something out,\" he said to her before gaining some distance from her.","Once he felt there was enough distance between them, Yuan retrieved the Ancient Phoenix Robes and wore it on him.","Ding!","<The Ancient Phoenix Robes burns with rage!>","<You have been afflicted with Phoenix's Wrath!>","[Phoenix's Wrath]","[Effects: Inflicts immense pain upon the targeted.]","Yuan's body suddenly became engulfed in flames that were several times stronger than the Starfire Dragon's most powerful attack, enveloping him in a blazing aura of unprecedented pain. Yet, despite the immense pain and being enveloped in flames far more intense than those of the Starfire Dragon, Yuan's body resisted immediate disintegration, and only his skin was burnt away. The purpose of Phoenix's Wrath was to inflict pain so excruciating that death would seem a preferable alternative.","Yuan attempted to withstand the pain, but even with his exceptional physique and high pain tolerance, he could only bear it for a few seconds. Upon removing the Ancient Phoenix Robes, the flames of Phoenix's Wrath dissipated, yet the agonizing pain lingered in his body for a little longer, enough to nearly make him lose consciousness.","<Your resistance to fire has increased tremendously>","<You have gained Super Fire Resistance>"]},{"number":1623,"title":"Chapter 1623 Phoenix Ascendancy Plateau","paragraphs":["\"Fuck, that was fucking painful!\" Yuan cursed out loud after taking off the Ancient Phoenix Robes.","He'd worn it out of curiosity and expected some pain, but he never anticipated it to be that painful. 'Even though it increased my fire resistance by an entire stage after wearing it for a few seconds, I don't want to experience that level of pain again... It's not worth it...' Yuan quickly put the Ancient Phoenix Robes back into Feng Yuxiang's spatial ring before retrieving another treasure.","'I need to mask my dragon scent first and foremost since I cannot undo my transformation, or everyone will know that I am a human.'","The item he retrieved was a small red pouch.","[Phoenix Powder]","[Description: Made from Phoenix Feathers. It has incredible healing properties and produces the scent of a Phoenix when mixed with water.]","'This is exactly what I am looking for. Since it's only made from feathers, I doubt it's too valuable to use,' Yuan smiled at this find.","Sometime later, Yuan filled a bottle with water and added the Phoenix Powder to it, creating a light red liquid that resembled blood diluted in water. The mixture emitted a unique scent that tingled his nose with each whiff.","\"Yingzi, does this smell like a Phoenix to you?\" Yuan asked her.","Yingzi took a deep breath and pondered for a moment before responding, \"It's similar, but it's a little weak. I don't think it'll be able to mask your dragon scent, either.\"","\"Is that so?\"","Upon hearing Yingzi's criticism, Yuan added more Phoenix Powder to the liquid, intensifying the smell.","\"That should be good enough,\" Yingzi said after taking another deep breath.","\"Okay.\"","Yuan proceeded to rub the liquid all over his body until Yingzi could no longer smell the scent of dragons on him.","Not only did the liquid mask his Dragon scent and make him smell like a Phoenix, but he could also feel his body becoming more energetic.","'I should save the Burning Phoenix Pill for when I really need it since it only lasts for nine days...'","Now that Yuan had found a way to mask his Dragon scent, he needed to make his identity more convincing, a challenging task given that he wasn't originally from their world, and crafting a believable persona required careful attention to the cultural and social nuances of this new environment.","\"Can you tell me what you know about Phoenixes in the Primal Expanse?\" Yuan asked Yingzi as they continued their journey.","\"Hmm...\" Yingzi had to really think about it since she hadn't had much interaction with Phoenixes, given their rarity.","\"I'm not too familiar with them, but from what I've heard, they're all incredibly selfish and unreasonably prideful creatures. They're arrogant, have bad tempers, and are generally unpleasant to be around if you're not a fellow Phoenix.\"","\"...\"","Yingzi's description of Phoenixes left Yuan speechless, but he didn't doubt it.","A week later, Yuan had to reapply the liquid on his body to maintain his Phoenix scent.","As they approached the Phoenixes' territory, Yingzi suddenly warned Yuan, \"A Phoenix is coming.\"","Moments later, a large, fiery Phoenix could be seen soaring in their direction. This Phoenix stopped once it was before Yuan.","'Divine Emperor, huh? A little weaker than I was expecting, but this is good for us.' Yuan quickly gauged the Phoenix's strength.","\"I don't recognize you. Which bloodline do you belong to? And what are you trying to achieve in our Phoenix Ascendancy Plateau? \" The Phoenix asked him.","\"I am from the Ancient Phoenix Bloodline,\" Yuan said, using Feng Yuxiang's bloodline as his own.","\"A-Ancient Phoenix?!\" The Phoenix exclaimed in a shocked voice after hearing this.","\"That's impossible! There are very few Ancient Phoenixes in the Primal Expanse, and I know all of them! How come I don't recognize you?\"","\"Can't you tell by my cultivation that I was only recently born?\" Yuan shook his head in a disappointed manner.","\"Indeed, you do smell a little young... Who are your parents, if you don't mind me asking?\"","Yuan frowned and responded in an irritated tone, \"I do mind. Who the hell are you to question me? I may be young, but I still have the Ancient Phoenix Bloodline. Watch your manners!\"","He deduced that the Ancient Phoenix Bloodline likely held a high standing among the Phoenix clans, so he decided to embrace this identity and play along.","The Phoenix trembled after hearing Yuan and quickly said, \"M-my apologies!\"","\"Forget it. Anyway, let's talk about my reason for being here. I am looking for a treasure called the True Ember, and I was told that I could find it here.\"","\"The True Ember? While it's true that we have it, it's not something we can give away...\"","\"I am willing to trade for it. Is there anything you want for it?\"","\"I apologize, but I do not have the authority to speak on this.\"","\"Then bring me to someone who does.\"","\"I understand. Please, follow me.\"","Sometime later, they reached the heart of the territory, where a community of Phoenixes resided. However, within the Phoenix Ascendancy Plateau, most of the Phoenixes possessed low-grade bloodlines, and the majority of its population consisted not of true Phoenix bloodlines but rather of subspecies related to Phoenixes, such as the Divine Yang Bird or the Vermillion Sky Hawk.","\"Please wait here while I notify our leader of your presence.\" The Phoenix that led Yuan said to him before disappearing somewhere.","Yuan used this opportunity to closely observe the Phoenix Ascendancy Plateau. Despite being referred to as a community, there were no buildings; instead, most of the beings resided within caves and outdoor nests. This setting gave Yuan the impression of being in a zoo, one predominantly populated by birds and Phoenixes, a stark contrast to the urban or structured habitats he might have expected.","The temperature within the Phoenix Ascendancy Plateau was also hot and dry, but it wasn't as bad as the Starfire Dragon's territory.","<Your fire resistance has increased slightly>","Still, it was hot enough to temper his body."]},{"number":1624,"title":"Chapter 1624 Phoenix Ascendancy Plateau(2)","paragraphs":["\"Leader, we have a situation.\" The Phoenix that met with Yuan bowed before a handsome young man.","This young man's hair blazed red with strands of bright orange, mirroring the fiery aura he carried about him. Clad in a robe of red and gold, the colors of flame and royalty, he exuded the powerful presence of a Golden Immortal, attracting attention and awe from those around him.","\"Is this about the guest you brought back?\" The young man asked.","\"Yes. He claims to have the Ancient Phoenix Bloodline. It's a little suspicious, but I dare not verify his identity.\" The Phoenix said.","Even if there was a ninety-nine percent chance that Yuan might be a fake, they couldn't risk offending an Ancient Phoenix. \"He is also traveling with a Shadow Dweller.\"","\"A Phoenix and a Shadow Dweller traveling together? What an odd pair.\"","A young lady with features reminiscent of the young man sat beside him, her expression marked by curiosity.","\"The Ancient Phoenix Bloodline is an Imperial-grade bloodline, and it ranks in the top 3 amongst all Phoenix bloodlines. They're essentially royalty. Meanwhile, my Scarlet Phoenix Bloodline is only ranked 9th. If he turns out to be real, we must assist him to the best of our capabilities. However, if he is a fake... I'll make him suffer a fate worse than death.\" The young man said.","\"What does he want, anyway?\"","\"He wishes to trade for our True Ember.\"","\"The True Ember, huh? While it's not a priceless artifact, it's quite valuable. If he's an Ancient Phoenix, he is likely to have come from the rank one Phoenix territory, Eternal Phoenix Domain, and they have plenty of artifacts that surpass our True Ember, so why would he come all the way here?\"","\"Forget it. There's no point guessing their motives. Bring them to me, and I'll ask them myself.\"","\"Yes!\"","The Phoenix departed the next moment, returning to Yuan and Yingzi.","\"Nobody is dumb or bold enough to imitate an Ancient Phoenix, right?\" The young lady suddenly muttered out loud.","The young man sighed, \"The Primal Expanse is immense beyond comprehension. There are bound to be some fearless individuals out there.\"","Sometime later, the Phoenix returned to Yuan's side.","\"Esteemed guest, our leader would like to meet you. Please, follow me.\"","The Phoenix led Yuan and Yingzi to the summit of the tallest mountain within the territory. Upon reaching the peak, Yuan was greeted by a surprisingly familiar sight—a pagoda stood prominently on the mountaintop.","'So they do have buildings in this world... I guess they're just incredibly rare.' Yuan thought to himself.","However, the pagoda was striking in its simplicity, almost to a fault. It appeared that the builder, while earnest in their efforts, had clearly lacked experience and imagination in its design, resulting in a structure that was functional but unadorned and stark. It was almost as if the builder had to work on it with nothing but a brief explanation of its outer appearance.","Once the Phoenix brought Yuan and Yingzi inside the pagoda, it became even more apparent that the builder had no idea what they were building. Although the pagoda looked like it had four floors from the outside, inside, there was only one floor and room. The other floors were just an empty space.","Inside, at the far end of the modestly decorated room, sat two individuals: a handsome young man and a beautiful young woman.","Their appearance was top quality, surpassing even the appearance Yuan had given the Supreme Ox. However, they would still only be considered slightly above average when compared to those truly beautiful in the Nine Heavens.","The young man narrowed his eyes at Yuan the instant they entered the room, his gaze as sharp as swords.","Before Yuan could even open his mouth, the young man spoke with a cold expression, \"Bastard, what are you trying to pull here?\"","\"What do you mean?\" Yuan frowned.","\"The Ancient Phoenix Bloodline ranks the third purest amongst all Phoenix bloodlines, and all inferior bloodlines would naturally feel submissive toward them. You may smell like a Phoenix, but I don't feel anything from you. I have seen Phoenixes with royal bloodlines before, and your aura is nothing like theirs. You may be able to mimic our smell, but you will never be able to mimic our royal bloodline. You should've disguised as an ordinary Phoenix instead, you bastard.\"","Even though his disguise was instantly exposed, Yuan remained calm and began to think of a way out of his predicament.","\"Are you willing to bet your life—your territory and all its residents on those accusations?\" Yuan asked.","\"Your threat is as weak and empty as your attempt to fool me. I can easily erase someone at your cultivation with a sneeze. As for the Shadow Dweller, even if she has the ability to wipe us out, the Eternal Phoenix Domain will avenge us.\"","\"Kneel before me!\" The young man suddenly roared, and his body exuded a profound aura that instantly filled the room.","\"...\"","A few moments of silence went by without anything happening, leaving Yuan puzzled.","The young man frowned and muttered, \"If my Phoenix's Influence failed to work on you, then you must not be a Phoenix at all... What are you?\"","Yuan swiftly noticed an opportunity to turn the situation around and showed a cold smile on his face.","\"You dare order me to kneel? A lowly Phoenix like you?\"","The young man's face twisted with anger as he stood up.","\"How dare—\"","\"Who permitted you to talk back? Shut up!\"","Upon hearing Yuan's voice, imbued with an unfathomable power, the young man felt his own voice falter, leaving him unable to utter another word.","\"?!?!\" The young lady turned to look at him with wide eyes.","\"F-father?! Please tell me you're only pretending to—\"","Yuan shifted his gaze to her and shouted, \"Shut up!\"","The young lady immediately felt as though someone had suddenly seized her throat, sealing her ability to speak.","\"?!?!\"","\"Kneel!\"","Thud!","Unable to resist his command, the young man and young lady suddenly fell to their knees, their gaze filled with shock and horror as they stared at Yuan."]},{"number":1625,"title":"Chapter 1625 True Ember","paragraphs":["'This power... Phoenix's Influence?! Impossible! He should be a fake! Why does he wield such power?!' The young man exclaimed inwardly as his entire being was forced to obey Yuan's commands.","'He was a genuine Ancient Phoenix?! We're screwed! Our entire territory is screwed!' The young lady cried inwardly.","Due to her lower cultivation, the Immortal Monarch's Dominion was even more potent on her.","As for the young man who was as strong as a Golden Immortal, even he was powerless before the Immortal Monarch's Dominion.","The last time Yuan used Immortal Monarch's Dominion on an immortal-level entity, it could only affect them for a few seconds. However, he was still only a Spirit King back then.","After his breakthrough, Yuan's control and prowess of Immortal Monarch's Dominion reached unprecedented levels. Moreover, he had been strengthening his Soul Strength nonstop for the past year during his travel around the Primal Expanse.","At his current prowess, he could easily command even a Golden Immortal for an entire minute.","'For whatever reason, Immortal Monarch's Dominion feels stronger in the Primal Expanse...' Yuan thought to himself after noticing this phenomenon.","Yuan spoke in the following moment, \"I will ask you again. Are you willing to bet your life and your territory on your claims?\"","Yuan released Immortal Monarch's Dominion on the young man so he could speak.","\"...\"","However, the young man didn't respond.","Seeing this, Yuan turned his focus to the young lady next to the young man and spoke in a commanding tone, \"Who gave you the permission to breathe?\"","\"!?!\"","The young lady instantly lost her ability to breathe and fell to the ground with her hands grasping at her throat.","The young man instantly snapped out of his daze and shouted, \"I-I was wrong, Your Highness! Please forgive me and my daughter for this offense! I will even give you the True Ember as an apology!\"","\"...\"","Yuan had a calm look on his face, but he was inwardly surprised that his small experiment actually worked. It made him wonder if he commanded someone to die, would their heart instantly stop?","\"Your Highness! Please!\" The young man pleaded again when Yuan refused to release the young lady.","\"I'll forgive you this once.\"","The young lady immediately began gasping for air after Yuan deactivated the Immortal Monarch's Dominion.","\"The faster you hand over the True Ember, the faster I will be out of your feathers,\" he added.","\"Get the True Ember for His Highness!\" The young man quickly ordered the young lady, giving her an excuse to leave the room.","\"Right away!\" The young lady hastily left.","Once they were alone, Yuan said, \"Is there anything you want for the True Ember? Although you said it'll be for free, I don't want any rumors of me bullying you to spread.\"","\"I-I don't dare ask for anything.\" The young man said.","Yuan silently pondered for a moment before speaking, \"You seem to have a thing for human appearances. I can upgrade your appearance and your daughters in exchange for the True Ember.\"","The young man looked at him with wide eyes and said, \"Really?\"","He nodded and said, \"Give me a brief description of your ideal appearance. Young, middle-aged, or old? Hair color and length? Body shape?\"","\"Umm... I would prefer something a little older than my current appearance. I like my current hair color and style. As for my body...\"","After receiving the description, Yuan consumed an appearance-altering pill and transformed into the young man's ideal appearance.","The young man's eyes widened with surprise after seeing how high-quality it was.","\"What do you think?\"","\"Can I really have such a high-quality appearance?\"","\"Are you doubting me?\" Yuan narrowed his eyes.","\"N-no!\" \"Then hurry up and take it.\"","The young man quickly changed his appearance, becoming more handsome, a little taller, and a few years older.","\"Thank you, Your Highness, for this appearance!\" The young man stood up and bowed to Yuan. \"If there's anything else you need, please don't hesitate to ask!\"","Yuan smiled and quickly said, \"Then let me ask you something.\"","He retrieved Feng Yuxiang's egg and continued, \"Do you know how I can speed up my friend's recovery progress?\"","\"T-that's—!\" The young man's face became filled with shock after seeing the egg.","\"What's wrong?\" Yuan asked him with a slight frown.","\"W-who is inside that shell?! I have seen this state countless times before, but I have never seen such a complex and powerful shell! Not to mention...\"","Yet, what shocked him most wasn't the shell itself but the overwhelming sensation it evoked within him. Bloodlines of a lower grade instinctively revere those of higher lineage, and he felt a powerful compulsion to kneel and kowtow before the entity within the shell.","'There's only one bloodline that could make my blood react in such a fashion! To think such a powerful entity would be in this sorry state... what happened?' he wondered inwardly.","\"I'm sorry, but there's nothing we can do here to help you or the one inside that shell since our bloodlines are too weak. If you want to revive the Phoenix within that shell, you'll need to visit the Eternal Phoenix Domain. There, you'll be able to find the Primordial Phoenix.\"","'How far away is the Eternal Phoenix Domain?' Yuan asked Yingzi since he would have exposed himself if he had asked the Phoenix before him.","'It's on the other side of the world, so it'll take several hundred years if we travel normally,' she said.","'That's too far... I guess we'll have to put this on hold for now.' Yuan sighed inwardly.","Sometime later, the young lady returned to the room with the True Ember, but she was astonished by her father's new appearance.","\"His Highness said he'd upgrade our appearances for the True Ember,\" he explained.","Once he received the description, Yuan gave the young lady her new appearance.","\"Thank you, Your Highness! Here is the True Ember!\"","The young lady handed Yuan a small black rock that emitted intense heat. \"Thank you.\" Yuan quickly tossed the True Ember inside his spatial ring."]},{"number":1626,"title":"Chapter 1626 Ancient Canyon","paragraphs":["After putting away the True Ember, Yuan quickly made his way toward the exit, unwilling to remain in the Phoenixes' territory any longer.","Neither the young man nor the young lady tried to stop him. In fact, they also wanted him to leave as soon as possible.","Once they left, Yuan and Yingzi began flying back to the Mystic Valley.","\"Fuck, this is why I hate royalty. They do as they please and treat us like dirt.\" The young man sneered in disdain once they were alone.","\"We did call him a fake first...\" The young lady sighed out loud.","\"I don't understand what went wrong. As far as I can tell, he definitely didn't have the bloodline of an Ancient Phoenix. Yet, he was able to use Phoenix's Influence on me despite his lack of cultivation.\"","\"Haa... forget it. It's already in the past.\"","Three months later, Yuan and Yingzi made it back to the Mystic Valley in one piece.","\"Oh? You're back already? That was faster than I anticipated.\" The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy greeted them the moment they entered her territory.","\"I got the True Ember,\" Yuan said.","\"Really? How did you deal with the Phoenixes as a dragon? Didn't they attack you on sight?\"","Yuan shook his head with a smile, \"I have my methods.\" \"Anyway, here is the True Ember.\"","He retrieved the treasure and tossed it to her.","\"Okay, give me a week to prepare.\"","While the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy began her preparation to divine the Primal Monarch's location, Yuan spent that time with Meixiu and the others.","While Yuan was in the Primal Expanse, Meixiu, Chu Liuxiang, and Li Jinxi continued their training with Kelan. Meanwhile, the rest of the Demon Sealing Faction had graduated from their sects and traveled to the Fourth Heaven, joining Kelan's training three months ago.","\"How's your progress? Have you figured out a way to get out of the Primal Expanse yet?\" Wang Ming asked him during dinner.","\"No, but I think I am getting close.\"","\"Take your time so the rest of us can catch up.\" Shi Lang chuckled.","\"The Primal Expanse is so vast that most of my time is spent traveling. I have been pretty lucky so far with the distance I need to travel, but I'm worried that the next place I need to go might take too long,\" Yuan sighed. He could imagine the Primal Monarch being in a location that was several decades or even centuries away. \"Have you tried to kill yourself? Who knows, you might respawn back in the last city you visited.\" Wang Bingbing suddenly said.","\"That's quite a dangerous suggestion. It'd be disastrous if he becomes a cripple because of that.\" Wang Ming said.","Yuan nodded and said, \"I have thought about it, and as Wang Ming said, it's quite risky. That said, if nothing else works, I can only try that as a last resort.\"","\"By the way, the Lord wanted to speak with you as soon as possible.\" Wang Xiuying suddenly said.","\"I'll go meet him after this.\"","After dinner, Yuan went to speak with the Lord.","\"What's up?\" Yuan greeted the Lord casually.","\"We have been contacted by the Qi Family. Do you remember them?\" The Lord said.","\"Of course. Since you're contacting me, it must be related to demons, right?\" Yuan could easily guess the reason behind the Qi Family's contact. The Qi Family was the Earth's version of the Demon Sealing Clan, and Yuan had personally trained them before.","\"You're correct. They have recently stumbled upon another sealed demon. According to them, this demon is unfathomably strong and surpasses the 11 demons you dealt with in the past.\"","\"Where is this demon? I'll deal with it as soon as possible.\"","\"They haven't disclosed the location to us yet. I'll notify them of your arrival if you want to visit them directly.\"","\"You can do that. I'll visit them first thing tomorrow morning.\"","\"I understand.\"","After leaving behind the Starry Abyss so that Ji Ran could heal the Lord, Yuan returned to his residence.","The next morning, Liya was already waiting at Yuan's front door, ready to escort him to the Qi Family, just as she had done previously.","\"Welcome back to the Qi Family, Manager Liya. Yuan.\"","The Qi Family was ready to greet them long before their arrival.","\"It's been a while.\" Yuan smiled.","\"Thank you again for your assistance,\" Qi Man said with his hands clasped.","\"Don't mention it. Anyway, where's the demon?\"","\"It's located at the Ancient Canyon.\"","\"Is it close to breaking out of its seal?\" \"No, and some people are watching over it even as we speak. They would notify us if there were any changes.\"","\"Even if it's not close to breaking out of its seal, I am going to take care of it immediately.\"","Qi Man then said, \"Please don't be too hasty. We are aware of your prowess, but this demon is different. We believe it's at least a Superior Demon with a tiny chance of it being a Demon General.\"","\"A Demon General, huh?\" Yuan muttered with an intrigued face.","Suddenly, someone could be heard shouting, \"Elder Qi! We have just received a message from the expedition team! It's an emergency! Cracks have started appearing on the demon!\" \"What?!\" Qi Man exclaimed.","\"Looks like we can't take things slowly anymore,\" Yuan said. \"Bring me to the demon.\"","\"Y-yes! I will bring you there myself!\" Qi Man quickly responded.","Yuan and Liya followed Qi Man to the Qi Family's private jet and quickly left.","A day later, they arrived at their destination, the Ancient Canyon.","The Ancient Canyon is a 1,000-mile-long plateau composed of horizontal layers of lava and rock, featuring a range of landscapes, including arid deserts and barren stretches. This area is rarely explored due to its harsh climate and extreme heat, which can easily reach up to 170 degrees Fahrenheit, making it nearly impossible to explore without proper equipment. \"We've arrived.\" Qi Man notified them after the jet landed."]},{"number":1627,"title":"Chapter 1627 A Different Person","paragraphs":["After disembarking from the jet, Qi Man led Yuan and Liya to the sealed demon, where a dozen members of the Qi Family were stationed to keep watch over it.","\"Yuan?\" Qi Fang, one of the people stationed there, was a little surprised to see Yuan.","\"Hey, it's been a while.\"","\"You came here alone?\" she asked.","\"Yes, the others are busy with their training.\"","Yuan's attention quickly shifted to the sealed demon in the distance.","\"Just one? How disappointing.\"","\"Actually, we found another sealed demon just a few hours ago,\" Qi Fang suddenly revealed.","\"What?! How powerful is it?!\" Qi Man exclaimed.","\"It's hard to tell, but it shouldn't be any stronger than this one.\" Qi Fang's gaze landed on the sealed demon several meters away.","Yuan approached the demon and examined it with his divine sense.","\"This demon...is a Demon General,\" he muttered a moment later.","\"What?! Are you certain?!\" Qi Fang exclaimed in a shocked voice.","He nodded in confirmation and continued speaking, \"Not only is it a Demon General, but it's as powerful as a Spirit Sovereign.\"","Qi Fang and everyone who heard his evaluation fell to their knees, their faces etched with despair.","\"S-Spirit Sovereign? How the hell are we supposed to kill it?! This demon could destroy the world by itself!\" Qi Man cried out loud as he fell back and collapsed on the ground.","\"E-Elder Qi!\"","\"Grandfather!\"","Qi Fang rushed to his side.","Seeing this, Yuan said, \"Calm down. It's only a Spirit Sovereign. I'll take care of it.\"","Qi Fang frowned at his words and said, \"This isn't the time to be arrogant or get carried away, Yuan. I know you're powerful, but you're only at the peak of Spirit Grandmaster. There's no way you can fight a demon that is as strong as a Spirit Sovereign, much less kill it! The only thing we can do is strengthen the seal until we're capable of dealing with it!\"","\"True, my cultivation is only at the peak of Spirit Grandmaster, but it won't take long for me to increase it.\"","Yuan suddenly retrieved a treasure he'd acquired from the Primal Expanse. After swallowing it, he could immediately feel his cultivation soaring to the next realm. A second later, Yuan had a breakthrough and reached the first level of Spirit Lord.","However, his surge of spiritual energy didn't slow down; it continued relentlessly until he broke through to the second level of Spirit Lord. It then pushed him into the third level before finally settling at the fourth level of Spirit Lord.","If it wasn't for the Celestial Emperor's curse, he could've easily entered the Spirit Sovereign realm with that treasure.","\"Alright, let's get this over with.\"","While everyone was still in a daze after witnessing Yuan breakthrough with the ease of breathing, he swiftly unsealed the demon before any of them could even react.","\"Ah! What have you done?!\" Qi Fang cried out loud.","\"Get away from here if you don't want to get caught up in our battle,\" Yuan said to them.","\"R-run!\" Qi Fang shouted, snapping the others out of their daze.","Once they realized their situation, they immediately scrambled to safety—to Liya's side.","Moments later, the demon was fully released from its seal and calmly began to survey its surroundings and assess the situation.","\"Hahaha! I am finally free!\" It suddenly burst out laughing, its voice loud and powerful enough to create shockwaves.","Yuan didn't interrupt the demon's celebration and patiently waited for it to notice him. Sometime later, the demon turned to look at Yuan and spoke, \"There's even a meal prepared for me? This must be Demon God's work!\"","The demon suddenly lunged at Yuan, its claw-like hands reaching for his neck.","However, just as it was able to reach Yuan, it suddenly felt something grasping onto its neck, holding it back from advancing any further.","The demon was stunned to realize that Yuan had seized its neck before it could grab his.","\"When did you—?!\"","\"Shhh...\" Yuan hushed the demon by tightening his grasp on its neck. If it weren't for the demon's regenerative abilities, it would have already died from having its neck crushed.","\"You just escaped your seal, so I'm sure you haven't fully recovered your strength. Don't worry, I'll give you some time to recover so it isn't too boring.\"","Yuan flicked his arm, flinging the demon away like a ragdoll.","\"Yuan! What the hell are you doing?!\" Qi Fang yelled at him after seeing his actions.","\"Calm down. It's just a mere Demon General. I can deal with trash like this with my eyes closed.\" Yuan laughed out loud.","The demon trembled in anger after being humiliated by Yuan in such a fashion. \"How dare a mere livestock mock me... a great Demon General?!\"","Veins appeared all over the demon's face and body.","\"UNFORGIVABLE!\"","The demon's aura erupted with intense bloodlust.","Feeling the demon's overwhelming bloodlust and the terrifying pressure that accompanied it, Qi Fang and the others trembled uncontrollably. They were so paralyzed with fear that even if given the chance, they wouldn't have been able to run away.","'What the hell are you doing?' Even Liya couldn't help but question Yuan's decision to anger the demon, as it would only make things more difficult for him.","\"DIE, YOU DAMN LIVESTOCK!\"","The demon lunged at Yuan for the second time.","\"Too slow!\"","Yuan lunged forward as well, flying straight toward the demon. Using nothing but his raw strength, he began pummeling the demon. Each of Yuan's punches was powerful enough to blow a hole through the demon's body.","\"Hahaha! What's the matter, you fucking trash?! Is this all your anger amounts to?! You're too weak! No wonder why you were sealed by the Demon Sealing Clan!\" Yuan relentlessly provoked the demon during its beatdown.","Qi Fang and the others were left speechless by Yuan's sudden change in behavior, feeling as though he had become a completely different person.","\"AAAAAH!\" The demon let out a crazed roar, its entire being radiating with unfathomable anger as its body suddenly began to transform."]},{"number":1628,"title":"Chapter 1628 Second Sealed Demon","paragraphs":["\"Damn livestock! You will regret mocking me!\"","The Demon General suddenly grew in size until it was three times its original height, its muscles bulging as if they were on the brink of bursting, and two bat-like wings sprouted from its back.","\"So you grew a little bigger and a lot uglier. I don't see how that will save you.\" Yuan commented on the demon's transformation.","Sure enough, even after its transformation, the Demon General couldn't touch a single hair on Yuan's body, much less defeat him.","'This bastard has grown so much since our last spar, and it's only been a year...' Liya narrowed her eyes at Yuan. She had always been proud of her own talents and strength, but before Yuan, she felt as insignificant as an ant.","'Is this the prowess of the Immortal Monarch? I guess he didn't command the Nine Divine Supremes through sheer luck...'","\"Impossible... How is he overwhelming a Demon General with the strength of a Spirit Sovereign at his cultivation? It doesn't make any sense!\" Qi Fang muttered with a dazed expression.","\"He's not even using any Demon Sealing Aura, either! Are you telling me that he's overwhelming the demon with brute force?! No wonder why he's so confident!\" Qi Man cried out loud.","\"Even if he's confident and everything seems fine for now, why is he messing around? Demons aren't playthings, and things can go wrong in the blink of an eye!\" Qi Fang anxiously clenched her fist.","\"Fuck! Fuck! Fuck! Where did a human like you come from?!\" The Demon General no longer wanted to fight Yuan and began preparing to run away.","\"Even if the entire world knew my name, I guess it's not possible for everyone to recognize my face, huh?\" Yuan muttered in a low voice.","While there was not a single demon who didn't know of the Divine Paragon, not all of them had the misfortune of encountering him, so it wasn't shocking that this Demon General didn't recognize Yuan.","\"I guess it's about time we finish this.\"","Yuan suddenly surged with Demon Sealing Aura. The moment the Demon General sensed this aura, its entire being trembled with fear. Although demons typically don't fear Demon Sealing Aura, even though it is their greatest weakness, Yuan's Demon Sealing Aura was on an entirely different level—one that made the demon feel completely powerless, as if surrounded by the abyss.","\"No matter how many times I see it, his Demon Sealing Aura always humbles me...\" Qi Man muttered, completely in awe.","The Demon General didn't dare to confront Yuan's Demon Sealing Aura and instantly ran away.","\"Where the hell do you think you're going?\"","Yuan caught up with the demon in no time and shoved his hand into the demon's body before pulling out of its Demon Core.","\"T-this technique! You can't be the Divine—\"","The Demon General perished before it could even finish its sentence.","Yuan quickly tossed the Demon Core into his pocket and turned to look at the Qi Family.","\"Bring me to the next demon,\" he said to them.","Once they snapped out of their daze, the Qi Family escorted Yuan to the next sealed demon several hours away.","Yuan frowned as he looked at the sealed demon. Unlike the usual human-shaped statue, this one had no particular shape and resembled a small mountain.","\"We mistook this as an ordinary boulder at first, but we examined it a little closer since it seemed out of place, and sure enough, we could sense a sealed demon inside.\" Qi Fang explained.","\"Yuan...?\" Qi Fang raised an eyebrow upon noticing a surprised expression on Yuan's face. \"This isn't an ordinary demon...\" he spoke slowly.","\"This is a special demon called an Abomination! They're essentially mutants even within the Demon Clan.\"","\"Abomination? We have never heard of them before. How strong are they?\" Qi Man asked.","\"They're not only much harder to kill but also stronger than the average demon, and judging by its energy... it's as strong as a Divine Warrior.\"","\"What?! Divine Warrior?! That an entirely different realm!\" Qi Fang exclaimed in a shocked tone.","\"There's no way we can defeat something like that even if we're given a thousand years!\" Qi Man said.","Yuan shook his head and said, \"I can still deal with it, but I will need some time to prepare.\"","'Yu Ning, can you set up a barrier around this area so I don't completely destroy this place?' Yuan asked.","\"Of course, Young Master.\"","Once Yuan transferred control to Yu Ning, his cultivation temporarily soared to the peak of Spirit Enlightenment.","'I guess the peak of Spirit Enlightenment is my new limit, huh?' Yuan thought to himself.","Sometime later, Yu Ning returned the control to Yuan after setting up the formation.","\"I am finished, Young Master. As long as they're not stronger than a Divine Grandmaster, no attacks will be able to break this formation.\"","\"Thanks.\"","He turned to look at the Qi Family and said, \"You guys should stand further back.\"","\"Are you sure you want to unseal it now? Why don't you come back a few years later—when your cultivation is much higher? The seal is strong enough to keep that demon sealed for another decade, so you have plenty of time.\" Qi Man suggested.","Yuan looked at him and said, \"You should know by now that one's cultivation isn't the most important factor when dealing with demons. It's our Demon Sealing Aura that matters, and it doesn't require spiritual energy to be strengthened.\"","He stopped paying attention to the Qi Family and focused on the sealed Abomination.","Once he was prepared, Yuan broke the seal and waited for the Abomination to emerge.","The earth trembled as the Abomination began breaking free from its seal. Cracks rapidly spread across the boulder before it suddenly exploded a few seconds later, revealing the creature's ugly and menacing form.","\"T-that is an Abomination?!\" Qi Fang and the others wore expressions of fear and disgust upon seeing its grotesque appearance. Even though Yuan had warned them about its hideous appearance, none of them could have anticipated just how horrifying it would be."]},{"number":1629,"title":"Chapter 1629 The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy’s Divination","paragraphs":["The second the Abomination broke out of its seal, Yuan activated Swords of Eternal Torment. Once the Abomination's massive body was covered in swords, immobilizing it, Yuan instantly transformed. His hair and eyes turned a majestic gold, and his aura erupted like a volcano, radiating immense power.","\"T-that's?!\" Liya's eyes widened with shock after seeing Yuan's dragon transformation for the first time.","'Not only does he know Dragon's Gaze, but he can even transform?!' she stared at Yuan's handsome face with a dazed expression.","Meanwhile, after his transformation, Yuan retrieved Number One Under Heaven and prepared to launch Heaven Splitting Sword Strike.","He had to control its power so that it didn't exceed the strength of a Divine Grandmaster and accidentally destroy the world, but he also had to ensure it was powerful enough to completely obliterate the Abomination in one strike.","After taking a moment to adjust and gather spiritual energy, Yuan swung his sword, launching a beam of sword light that enveloped the Abomination's figure.","Fortunately for them, the Abomination wasn't as massive as the one Yuan had faced during the Elite Demon Sealer Examination.","The moment Yuan's Heaven Splitting Sword Strike hit the formation, it triggered a massive earthquake powerful enough to be felt across the entire world.","Cracks spread across the formation, yet it somehow managed to hold together, clinging to a sliver of strength.","When the dust settled and the Qi Family could finally see the situation, they were bewildered to find that Yuan was standing alone and the Abomination had vanished entirely.","\"Heavens! He killed a demon with the strength of a Divine Warrior while only being a Spirit Lord!\" Qi Man cried out loud, his entire being trembling in awe.","\"How on earth is he doing that? Ignoring his Demon Sealing Aura, his strength doesn't match his cultivation! Is he hiding his true cultivation? It doesn't make any sense!\" Qi Fang shook her head.","Once the Abomination was defeated, it left behind its Demon Core.","Yuan's eyes widened with surprise when he saw how different it was from an ordinary Demon Core. It wasn't just the size of a watermelon but also pitch black in color.","\"This is a Demon Core...?\" Yuan mumbled as he picked up the core.","He was also a bit disappointed, realizing it would be impossible for him to consume a Demon Core of this size, as it wouldn't even fit in his mouth.","The Qi Family approached him once they determined it was safe to do so.","\"W-what the heck is that?\" Qi Fang asked as she pointed at the Demon Core.","\"The Abomination's Demon Core. This is also my first time seeing something like this,\" he said.","Qi Man shivered at its sight and said, \"It feels very ominous... What are you going to do with it?\"","\"I don't know if we can even do anything with it.\"","Qi Man then said, \"In that case, would you mind allowing our family to research it? Of course, we're not asking you to give it to us. It'll still be your property.\"","Yuan nodded, \"Sure. Let me know if you learn anything.\"","He handed the Demon Core to Qi Man.","\"S-so heavy!\" Qi Man nearly dropped the Demon Core once it was in his grasp.","The Demon Core was deceptively heavy and weighed several tons.","\"Oh, sorry. It was almost weightless for me, so I forgot to tell you.\" Yuan said with an apologetic smile.","\"It's okay...\" Qi Man quickly moved the Demon Core back to their private jet.","Sometime later, they returned to the Qi Family to celebrate the demon's extermination with a big feast.","\"Yuan, can I bother you to check on our disciples' progress before you leave? It's been some time since their lecture with you, after all.\" Qi Huan asked him.","\"Of course.\"","During the feast, the disciples put on a performance to showcase their Demon Sealing Aura.","\"What do you think, Yuan? Have they improved a little?\"","He nodded, \"Yes, they've improved, but there's still a lot of work to be done. I would give them another lecture, but I have to return to Cultivation Online by the end of the day. Next time, surely.\"","\"We'll be waiting for your return.\" After the feast, Liya escorted Yuan back to the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","During their travel, she questioned him, \"How did you use dragon transformation? Only those with a dragon bloodline could possibly do such a thing.\"","\"I was able to do that after performing the Dragon Cleansing Ceremony.\" \"The Dragon Cleansing Ceremony?!\" Liya was deeply shocked to learn this, finding it unbelievable that dragons, who were famously strict about their traditions and bloodlines, would permit a human to partake in one of their most sacred rituals, especially those of royal bloodlines.","'Which royal bloodline would be foolish enough to do such a thing?' she sighed inwardly.","Once they returned to the Dragon Spiral Mountain, Yuan spoke with the Lord, recounting everything that had transpired.","\"An Abomination, huh... That thing would've spelled the end of this world if you weren't here,\" he sighed.","\"As long as I am here, no demon will cause havoc on Earth ever again. Notify me again if they find any more demons.\"","\"Of course.\"","At the end of the day, Yuan returned to Cultivation Online. \"Welcome back. You're just in time for my divination.\" The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy had just finished her preparation.","\"Now, witness my divination!\"","The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy was suddenly enveloped in a golden aura that expanded outward until it covered the entire Mystic Valley.","\"Grand Prophecy, show me the location of the Primal Monarch!\" she roared.","A complex and majestic magic circle materialized beneath the Divine Fox, radiating an unfathomable aura. The Divine Fox's eyes glowed with a golden light that shone like a flashlight, and intricate symbols began to form within her eyes.","The Divine Fox remained in this state for several moments until she suddenly coughed up a mouthful of blood.","\"T-that is impossible...\" she muttered in disbelief.","\"What happened? Did you fail?\" Yuan asked with a slight frown, wondering if something went wrong with the divination.","\"No... the divination succeeded, and I have the Primal Monarch's location. But the Grand Prophecy revealed that its location is... here! In the Mystic Valley!\" she exclaimed, her voice filled with terror.","\"What?\" Yuan's eyes widened with shock upon hearing this."]},{"number":1630,"title":"Chapter 1630 Primal Monarch","paragraphs":["\"What did you say? The Primal Monarch is located somewhere in the Mystic Valley? Are you sure you divined properly?\" Yuan looked at the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy.","\"Y-you! Are you mocking me?! I have never failed a divination! I am sure of it! The Primal Monarch is in the Mystic Valley!\" The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy said as she frantically looked at her surroundings with a nervous and fearful expression.","The Primal Monarch was an entity that stood at the very pinnacle of the Primal Expanse. If there were Primals and Predators within the Primal Expanse, the Primal Monarch would be the Apex Predator, existing in a league of its own.","Knowing that the Primal Monarch was in her territory, the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy didn't dare to make any significant movements, remaining as still as a statue.","Yuan looked at Yingzi and noticed that she, too, appeared quite nervous. It was the first time he had ever seen such emotions from her.","'This can't be a coincidence...' Yuan thought to himself.","He recalled something the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy said.","\"He will only appear before you if he chooses to do so, huh?\" he mumbled.","Several moments passed in silence, with nothing happening.","After waiting a little longer without any changes, Yuan decided to make the first move.","\"Primal Monarch! You can hear me, right?! In fact, I bet you're looking at me right now!\" he shouted with the support of his spiritual energy, allowing his voice to ripple throughout the entire Mystic Valley.","The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy and Yingzi turned to at him with terrified expressions on their faces.","\"W-what the hell are you doing?! Do you have a death wish?!\" The Divine Fox shouted at him.","Yuan ignored her and continued, \"I doubt you're here by chance! Are you here for me? If so, why don't you show yourself already?\"","\"Yuan...\" Yingzi called out to him in a nervous tone. If the Primal Monarch wanted to kill Yuan, even she was powerless to do anything about it.","\"Don't tell me you want to play hide-and-seek with me?! I don't have the time for that!\"","As Yuan's voice faded and silence returned, a faint rustling noise suddenly broke the stillness.","Yuan and the others immediately turned their heads toward the source of the noise, and a small silhouette slowly emerged from the tall bushes.","\"You are...?\" Yuan's eyes widened with shock when he saw the appearance—the face of this individual.","Once the silhouette fully emerged from the bushes, it became clear that it was a child—a young boy. He had short black hair and innocent eyes that held a sharp and powerful gaze. Like Yingzi, he had an uncanny absence of presence, despite standing right in front of them.","Yuan was in disbelief, not because this individual had the appearance of a child, but because the child's face was identical to his own when he was younger. It was as if he were staring at a mirror image of his past self.","The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy and Yingzi also noticed this obvious detail. If they hadn't known any better, they would've mistaken this child for Yuan's son.","\"You... you are the Primal Monarch?\" Yuan asked.","After a moment of silence, instead of answering his question, the child said, \"Who are you? And why do you have that appearance?\"","The atmosphere in the Mystic Valley shifted abruptly. Sensing this change, both the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy and Yingzi began to sweat profusely.","\"What do you mean? I have always looked like this. In fact, I should be the one asking you that. Why do you look like my childhood self?\" Yuan responded.","The child narrowed his eyes.","\"What is your name? And how are you related to Tian Yi?\"","Yuan's eyes widened with surprise after hearing this familiar name.","'He knows the Immortal Monarch?!'","\"I am Yuan. As for my relationship with Tian Yi, why are you asking? Who is he to you?\"","\"I am the one asking asking questions here, brat.\"","A domineering pressure suddenly surrounded Yuan, forcing him to his knees.","\"!!!\"","The force was so powerful that Yuan couldn't fight it even for a split second.","\"You kneel!\" Yuan immediately activated Immortal Monarch's Dominion on the child.","\"...\"","However, the child remained standing, seemingly unaffected by the Immortal Monarch's Dominion.","Yuan's eyes widened after seeing the results—or the lack of. He was certain that the child before him was a beast, so this made it the first time his Immortal Monarch's Dominion failed on a beast.","\"As I thought, you were the one who used that power earlier.\" The child muttered, clearly unfazed by it.","The pressure on Yuan suddenly disappeared.","\"Are you that brat's descendant? Is Tian Yi still alive?\" The child asked.","\"What...?\" Yuan muttered, utterly confused by the situation.","Despite the strange situation, Yuan couldn't sense any killing intent from the child. Furthermore, the child's tone when speaking of Tian Yi was akin to that of a father speaking to his child.","'I guess it's safe to assume that he's not my enemy.'","\"I'm not Tian Yi's descendant,\" Yuan spoke as he got back to his feet.","\"I am—was Tian Yi in my past life.\"","\"What?\" The child's eyes widened with surprise after hearing this.","\"Bullshit. Then why don't you recognize me?\" He shrugged, \"I reincarnated not long ago and am still recovering my memories. Unfortunately, my memories of Tian Yi's childhood are still missing.\"","\"Anyway, you're the Primal Monarch, right? Since you know Tian Yi, I must have traveled to this place in the past.\"","\"So you really don't remember anything, huh?\"","After sighing, the child spoke, \"Indeed, I am the Primal Monarch.\"","\"You asked about my relationship with Tian Yi—you, right? I am your father—.\"","\"You're my father?!\" Yuan cried out loud at this revelation. \"So I wasn't even human?!\"","\"Let me finish, you brat. I am not your real father. You somehow wandered into our world when you were still a child, and I took you in.\"","\"Is that so...?\" Yuan swallowed nervously."]},{"number":1631,"title":"Chapter 1631 Retrieving Tian Yi’s Memories","paragraphs":["'W-what the hell is going on here? The Primal Monarch is that human's adoptive father?' The Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy was bewildered by this information. She had countless questions, but she didn't dare to ask them.","\"Since you don't remember me, I guess it's safe to assume you don't remember our promise. Did you wander to the Primal Expanse again by accident, too?\" The Primal Monarch looked at Yuan.","He nodded, \"Yes, I came here by accident. I wanted to look for you because I was told you could take me out of this place. How long have you been watching me?\"","The Primal Monarch sighed, \"Since you used my power at the Phoenixes' territory.\"","\"Your power...? You mean Immortal Monarch's Dominion?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"If that's what you call it, sure. However, that power—the ability to command Primals and Predators—was originally mine, to begin with.\" The Primal Monarch revealed.","Yuan wasn't too surprised to learn that the Immortal Monarch had inherited his power from another source, as it seemed unlikely for a human to naturally possess such control over beasts in the first place.","The Primal Monarch suddenly gestured to Yuan and said, \"Let me see the kind of life you've lived after leaving the Primal Expanse.\"","\"Huh? You want to see my memories? But I don't have all of them.\"","\"That doesn't mean anything to me. While you don't remember it now, they're definitely somewhere in there, so all I need to do is take it out from hiding.\"","\"You can do that...?\" Yuan didn't think of this until it was mentioned.","\"Does it have any side effects?\"","He was worried that it might affect his fate.","'No... my appearance in the Primal Expanse isn't a coincidence or an accident. It was fate that brought me here, so the Primal Monarch retrieving my memories should also be considered fate.'","\"If I was an inexperienced brat like yourself, you might lose all of your memories and become a vegetable.\" The Primal Monarch calmly said.","\"But you're not... right?\" Yuan swallowed nervously.","\"You really don't change, huh?\" A subtle smile appeared on the Primal Monarch's face.","The next moment, he pointed two fingers at Yuan's forehead before shooting a warm beam of light directly into his head.","Primal Monarch raised an eyebrow the following moment as he thought inwardly, 'This brat reincarnated more than once...'","Despite his interest and curiosity, the Primal Monarch didn't touch the memories that didn't belong to Tian Yi.","After retrieving Tian Yi's memories, the Primal Monarch observed his entire life after leaving the Primal Expanse.","Sometime later, the Primal Monarch lowered his hand and said, \"I understand the situation. Although I was able to retrieve most of Tian Yi's memories, I was unable to retrieve the final moments of his life due to some interference. How do you feel?\"","\"I remember now...\" Yuan muttered in a somewhat dazed voice.","After the Primal Monarch pulled out Tian Yi's memories, he remembered everything from his childhood.","Tian Yi was born into a wealthy and influential family. However, he lacked the talents necessary to survive there. In fact, he didn't have any cultivation talents, which was a complete surprise to Yuan since the Immortal Monarch was the fourth reincarnation, so he should've been a genius like his previous incarnations.","Due to his lack of talent, Tian Yi was abandoned by his parents and exiled from the family at the age of six, leaving him to wander the streets as a foundling. However, that life didn't last long, as his family didn't want him to stay in the same city, so they forced him out into the wilderness, leaving him to fend for himself.","Shortly after Tian Yi entered the wilderness, he encountered a powerful magical beast that chased him to a nearby Endless Beast Den. At that moment, two cultivators were locked in a fierce battle, causing the destruction of the Endless Beast Den.","The destruction of the Endless Beast Den created a rift, and in his desperation, Tian Yi entered it, not caring where it might lead him.","Once he came out on the other end, Tian Yi found himself in an unfamiliar world that reeked of wild beasts and blood.","\"Where am I...?\" Tian Yi muttered as he frantically looked around.","Suddenly, a rough voice resounded, \"I came here as soon as I noticed the scent of a human, but what is this? A human this small... You won't even be able to fill the gap between my teeth!\"","Tian Yi turned to the source of the voice and was immediately scared shitless when he saw a massive black dragon hovering in the sky.","\"This human is mine!\" Another voice suddenly resounded, followed by the appearance of a Phoenix with fiery purple flames.","\"You dare covet my prey?! I'll tear you to shreds!\" The black Dragon roared.","\"Not before I roast you for dinner!\" The purple Phoenix laughed arrogantly.","Their aura fiercely crashed with each other. Unable to bear the pressure, Tian Yi fainted instantly.","Tian Yi didn't know how long he had been asleep for, but by the time he woke up, neither the Phoenix nor Dragon could be seen, almost as if they'd vanished magically.","\"This is the first time I've seen a human like you.\"","An unfamiliar but calm voice suddenly resounded.","Jumpscared by the voice, Tian Yi jumped to his feet and began running away without looking at the source of the voice.","\"Where do you think you are going?\"","The voice that was far away from Tian Yi a moment ago suddenly sounded like it was right behind him.","Tian Yi swiftly realized that running wasn't an option and surrendered to his fate.","He stopped running and fell to his knees.","\"Go ahead and eat me. I don't care anymore.\"","\"Why would I eat you? Even a thousand of you wouldn't fill half my stomach. Eating you would only arouse more hunger.\" The voice laughed.","At this moment, Tian Yi turned around to face the voice, and to his bewilderment, the voice belonged to a child who didn't look any older than himself.","As a matter of fact, this child didn't simply look to be the same age. He looked exactly like Tian Yi, as if he was a perfect clone."]},{"number":1632,"title":"Chapter 1632 Tempering in Blood","paragraphs":["\"W-who are you?! Why do you look like me?!\" Tian Yi was terrified when he realized that the face before him was actually his own face.","\"I like it, so I decided to use it.\"","\"You decided to use it...? You're not human, are you?\"","\"Humans don't exist in the Primal Expanse. Other than you, who came here from another world, everyone here is what you call beasts.\"","\"Another world?\" Tian Yi couldn't comprehend this information and became dazed.","Seeing his dumbfounded expression, the entity with his face said, \"I am the Primal Monarch, and you are currently in my world, the Primal Expanse.\"","He continued, \"What are you going to do now? Humans cannot survive in this world alone, and you're not even a cultivator. The moment I leave you alone, you'll become someone's food or toy until you die.\"","Tian Yi fell silent.","A moment later, he spoke in a defeated tone, \"My family abandoned me because I was born without talents, and I somehow ended up in this dangerous place. I think this is Heaven's way of telling me to just die. I am just a powerless mortal. Who am I to go against Heaven's will? No matter what happens to me, I will accept it.\"","The Primal Monarch smiled and said, \"You're an interesting human. Despite your young age, you're surprisingly clear-headed and intelligent.\"","\"This Heaven you speak of doesn't exist here. No, to be more precise, I am Heaven here!\" The Primal Monarch boldly declared.","\"I don't care how mighty your Heaven is; it won't influence my territory. So if you want to survive, I can make that a reality.\"","Tian Yi stared at the Primal Monarch with wide eyes and spoke in a dazed manner, \"Even if you say that, how am I supposed to survive in this place?\"","The Primal Monarch showed a wide smile and said, \"Humans have never managed to pique my interest, but I think it'll be fun to have you around for some time.\"","\"You want me to follow you?\" Tian Yi asked.","\"You don't want to?\"","\"I'll do it!\" Tian Yi responded without any hint of fear in his voice. This was the first time he felt accepted and needed, so he had no reason to refuse, even if that individual was not human.","\"Good.\"","After the Primal Monarch accepted Tian Yi as his follower, he escorted Tian Yi back to his home, which existed in a different dimension. There, the Primal Monarch taught Tian Yi everything he needed to know about the Primal Expanse and the entities living there.","'This brat truly has a bright mind. His ability to learn and comprehend things is almost frightening. Even Predators who have lived for tens of thousands of years wouldn't be able to match him.' The Primal Monarch quickly realized that the notion of Tian Yi being talentless was completely false.","'To throw away such talents, humans are such foolish creatures.'","In the blink of an eye, two years had passed since Tian Yi began studying under the Primal Monarch.","\"Listen here, you brat. If you want to live more than a hundred years, you'll need to start cultivating. However, it's impossible for humans to cultivate properly in the Primal Expanse since your bodies cannot adapt to our environment. If they forcefully cultivate our Chaotic Essence, they will turn into mindless beasts.\"","\"In that case, isn't it hopeless for me?\" Tian Yi spoke calmly, almost as if it didn't matter to him whether he could cultivate or not.","\"A hundred years is already a long time—enough to live a fulfilled life.\"","\"That's what someone who's never truly experienced life would say. Anyway, the reason humans are unable to cultivate Chaotic Essence is because they don't have a Chaotic Heart, something all beasts in the Primal Expanse are born with.\"","\"In that case, what will happen if we give them a Chaotic Heart?\" The Primal Monarch spoke with a profound smile as he glared at Tian Yi, who swallowed nervously.","\"Is it even possible for a human to acquire a Chaotic Heart?\" Tian Yi raised an eyebrow.","\"We'll find out soon enough.\"","\"I guess so.\"","Tian Yi understood that he was the subject of an experiment that had never been done before, fully aware that things could go disastrously wrong, yet he remained indifferent.","The Primal Monarch went to the Primal Expanse to prepare for Tian Yi's experiment.","He returned a few hours later and prepared a bath filled to the brim with the blood of various beasts.","\"First and foremost, we need to strengthen your frail body. This will be incredibly painful, unlike anything you've ever experienced before, so brace yourself.\"","However, to the Primal Monarch's surprise, Tian Yi neither screamed nor showed any signs of pain during the tempering from the beginning to the very end, lasting for six hours straight.","\"How do you feel?\" The Primal Monarch asked Tian Yi as he emerged from the bath.","\"Feels like my body is surging with strength,\" he said.","\"Did you not experience any pain during the tempering?\"","\"I did, and it hurt like hell.\" Tian Yi calmly replied.","\"...\"","The Primal Monarch gazed at the blood bath and thought to himself, \"I never could have imagined he'd endure six hours on his first tempering. How interesting!\"","He began to feel that he had made the right choice in taking Tian Yi under his wing. Over the next four years, Tian Yi continued to bathe in the blood that the Primal Monarch provided. The pain he endured grew more intense as the quality and potency of the blood increased.","\"Your body should be strong enough to grow a Chaotic Heart now.\"","The Primal Monarch retrieved a mountain of treasures and continued, \"Although we are born with a Chaotic Heart, it isn't complete at birth and requires tremendous effort to complete it. Once completed, Predators can further grow a second or even third Chaotic Heart by consuming large amounts of treasures. Let's see if you can grow a Chaotic Heart by consuming treasures.\""]},{"number":1633,"title":"Chapter 1633 Primal Monarch’s Bloodline","paragraphs":["After his body tempering period ended, Tian Yi began consuming an enormous amount of treasures provided by the Primal Monarch to cultivate a Chaotic Heart. He was akin to a pig, but instead of eating pig food, he was being fed priceless treasures.","However, despite the vast number of treasures he consumed, there were no signs of his Chaotic Heart forming.","Despite this, Tian Yi's cultivation soared, reaching the level of Divine Ancestor in just four years solely by consuming treasures. He achieved this without needing to cultivate or learn any cultivation techniques, as the Primal Monarch assisted him in absorbing and containing all that energy.","\"Hmmm... your Chaotic Heart isn't forming... We might be missing something.\" The Primal Monarch eventually halted feeding him treasures.","\"Maybe it's because I lack a proper bloodline,\" Tian Yi casually guessed.","\"Bloodline, huh? That might be it...\" The Primal Monarch fell silent for a few moments, a contemplative expression on his face.","\"I have never done or even thought about doing this before, but I can give you some of my Blood Essence, which has a chance of giving you my bloodline.\" The Primal Monarch muttered with a curious face.","Even in the Divine Heaven, humans can acquire bloodlines through the Blood Essence of Magical Beasts or Divine Beasts. However, since the creation of Blood Essence requires tremendous effort and even involves sacrificing one's longevity, they are only created for special occasions and are incredibly rare, even in the world of beasts.","\"Once you accept my Blood Essence, we'll essentially be family. What do you think? Are you willing to accept the bloodline of a beast?\" The Primal Monarch asked Tian Yi.","Tian Yi smiled and said, \"I already see you as a family and a father, so nothing's changed.\"","The Primal Monarch laughed out loud, finding his answer extremely entertaining.","\"Very well! Then, give me some time to form my Blood Essence. Since this is my first time doing something like this, it will take a few years to complete.\"","\"A few years? What should I do in the meantime?\" Tian Yi asked.","\"I'll teach you a few of my techniques, so you can use this time to train them.\"","The Primal Monarch transferred several of his own techniques to Tian Yi directly through his mind, allowing him to understand them instantly. However, he still needed to train to deepen his understanding and strengthen the techniques.","Afterward, the Primal Monarch entered seclusion to form his Blood Essence, leaving Tian Yi alone for the next decade.","In these ten years, Tian Yi focused on training the techniques bestowed by the Primal Monarch, occasionally tempering his body and consuming the leftover treasures. His cultivation reached the peak of Immortal Ascension without any issues.","When the Primal Monarch returned with his Blood Essence, he didn't immediately feed it to Tian Yi, as he feared that Tian Yi was too weak to absorb his Blood Essence.","\"Let's increase your cultivation a bit more to be safe.\"","Thus, he fed Tian Yi even more treasures.","After a few more years, Tian Yi broke through Immortal Ascension and became a true Immortal at the Bronze Immortal realm.","Normally, a cultivator would need to face a Heavenly Tribulation before they can ascend past Immortal Ascension and become an Immortal, but since Tian Yi was located in Primal Expanse, where the 'Heavens' had no influence, he was able to break through that barrier without facing one.","\"So, I just consume this like water?\" Tian Yi inquired with the Primal Monarch's Blood Essence in his grasp.","\"Yes, pour it onto your tongue and let it be absorbed.\"","Tian Yi followed the Primal Monarch's instructions and placed a single drop of Blood Essence onto his tongue.","The Blood Essence melted into his tongue the instant it touched. At first, he felt no change, but after a few moments, his entire body began to burn up, as if his blood were boiling.","The Primal Monarch watched with great focus, paying attention to every little detail and change occurring within Tian Yi's body.","Veins bulged across Tian Yi's body, as if they were on the verge of bursting through his skin. Soon, they began to glow with a golden hue, as if liquid gold were coursing through them.","\"AHHHHH!\"","Tian Yi let out a beastly roar that shook the entire world. Moments later, he began to calm down, and his body quickly started to recover.","\"How do you feel now?\" The Primal Monarch asked him.","Even before Tian Yi's response, the Primal Monarch could tell from Tian Yi's aura that he had successfully absorbed the Blood Essence.","\"I feel... the same?\" Tian Yi muttered in a somewhat puzzled voice.","Although he didn't realize it, his voice carried an unfathomable power capable of commanding all beasts if there were any near him. Of course, it wouldn't work on the Primal Monarch, who gave him the power.","\"You may not feel it now, but you'll realize it sooner or later,\" said the Primal Monarch.","\"As long as you learn to control that power, you'll be invincible within the Primal Expanse, even as a mortal.\"","\"However, great power comes with great responsibilities, and I trust that you won't abuse this power.\" Tian Yi smiled and said, \"I won't betray that trust, but if I ever do, you can kill me.\"","\"Kill you? Hmph! I'll make you suffer a fate worse than death.\" The Primal Monarch sneered.","After acquiring his new powers, Tian Yi spent several more years studying and practicing to master control over them.","During this time, Tian Yi also successfully formed his Chaotic Heart, albeit an incomplete one.","Once the Primal Monarch was confident Tian Yi could survive by himself, he was released into the Primal Expanse for experience.","\"What should I do in the Primal Expanse besides completing my Chaotic Heart?\" Tian Yi asked the Primal Monarch before leaving for the Primal Expanse.","\"How should I know? This is meant to expand your experience, so live however you want for the next hundred years. Also, you will be hunted everywhere you go because you're a human, and your scent will drive everyone mad, so try to stay alive. I don't want all of my efforts to go to waste.\"","\"I will try not to disappoint you.\" Tian Yi left for the Primal Expanse with an excited smile on his face."]},{"number":1634,"title":"Chapter 1634 Tian Yi’s Growth","paragraphs":["After Tian Yi left home to gain experience in the Primal Expanse, the Primal Monarch secretly followed him, having nothing better to do. Of course, since this was Tian Yi's first time exploring alone, he also felt a little worried for him.","However, the Primal Monarch's worries were quickly relieved once he saw how quickly Tian Yi adapted to the Primal Expanse.","While his cultivation as a Bronze Immortal was respectable in the Primal Expanse, it was far from sufficient for him to be reckless and careless. Tian Yi didn't have any big ambitions and wanted to complete his Chaotic Heart as soon as possible, which he set as his primary goal.","He traversed the Primal Expanse in search of treasures, dominating nearly every territory he encountered.","Tian Yi's presence quickly spread throughout the Primal Expanse like wildfire, and within a few years, nearly every powerhouse there had heard of the human causing havoc in their territories.","\"A human who can cultivate and use his powers? Bullshit! There's no way such a human exists!\"","\"What? This human has a Chaotic Heart? Are you sure he's really human and not just a Predator in disguise?\"","Most of the powerhouses refused to believe that a human could create such chaos in their world, especially when every human before him had been unable to adapt to their Chaotic Essence.","However, some had their interest piqued and left their territories to seek out this human they had been hearing so much about.","After another decade, it was all but confirmed that Tian Yi was real, and he was growing at such a tremendous rate that he could pose a threat to even the powerhouses in the Primal Expanse if given a few more decades.","Tian Yi quickly became a presence that could not be ignored, prompting Predators across the Primal Expanse to attempt to either tame or kill him. However, every failed attempt only made Tian Yi stronger. Eventually, Tian Yi became so powerful that it took several powerhouses just to face him on equal footing.","\"Fuck! Where's the Primal Monarch?! Why isn't he doing anything about this human when his world is being flipped upside down?!\"","The natives of the Primal Expanse were puzzled by the Primal Monarch's silence. Normally, whenever a situation threatened the balance of the world or someone caused excessive chaos, the Primal Monarch would intervene.","Yet, he was nowhere to be seen. This made some wonder if something had happened to the Primal Monarch. However, after a hundred years had passed since Tian Yi first appeared in the Primal Expanse, he vanished as suddenly as he had arrived.","Unbeknownst to the natives, Tian Yi had returned to the Primal Monarch's home.","\"How was your experience in the outside world?\" the Primal Monarch asked upon Tian Yi's return, pretending as if he hadn't been watching him the entire time.","\"It was a little scary at first with the amount of beasts trying to kill me, but once I got used to it, it was pretty fun.\" Tian Yi laughed out loud.","\"Is that so? Let's see how many Chaotic Hearts you've managed to form in the last 100 years...\"","After a quick examination, the Primal Monarch was surprised to sense four Chaotic Hearts within Tian Yi's body.","\"Four Chaotic Hearts in a hundred years, huh? Not bad, considering that even the strongest Predators in the Primal Expanse only have six after millions of years.\" Not only did Tian Yi acquire 4 Chaotic Hearts, but his cultivation even reached Golden Immortal in a hundred years.","\"What should I do now? I have done pretty much everything there is to do in this world—not that there is much to do in the first place.\"","\"Well, do you have any interest in owning your own territory?\" The Primal Monarch asked.","\"Not really. I just don't see the appeal of owning a territory.\"","\"Unfortunately, there isn't much for you to do in this world. In the first place, the Primal Expanse wasn't created for humans. As for the rest of us, we live to increase our strength and expand our territories. We thrive off growth and preying on the weak.\"","\"If there's nothing to do, I can simply create my own entertainment. For example, I can bring human entertainment into this world.\" Tian Yi suggested.","However, the Primal Monarch shook his head and said, \"That won't work. What you humans find entertaining is meaningless to us. Just as owning territories holds no appeal for you, we find human culture dull and uninteresting.\"","Tian Yi sighed, \"This is why I didn't mind remaining as a mortal and living only a hundred years.\"","The Primal Monarch fell silent for several moments before asking, \"Have you ever thought about returning to your home—the human world?\"","Tian Yi looked at the sky and responded in an oddly calm tone, \"I have. Many times, in fact. However, even if I were to go back, I wouldn't know what to do. Furthermore...\"","He looked at the Primal Monarch directly in the eyes and continued, \"Although I was born in the human world, I grew up in this world, and my family is also here, so this world is my home.\"","The Primal Monarch laughed out loud and said, \"That's heartwarming and all, but you don't belong here. Now that you're all grown up and have the power to survive without my help, I think you should go back to the human world.\"","\"You seem eager to send me away. Why?\" Tian Yi noticed this and inquired with a deep frown, feeling like he was being abandoned by his family for a second time.","The Primal Monarch shook his head and said, \"This world is more complex than it appears. Also, there's nothing left for me to teach you, and unless you want to die of boredom in this world or spend the rest of your life fighting the natives of this world, it only makes sense for you to return to your original world.\"","\"In the first place, I never expected you to remain in this world by my side forever. I took you in and helped you grow so that you could one day return to your world and become living proof that this 'Heaven' isn't omnipotent and its will could be defied.\"","\"...\"","Tian Yi was speechless, unsure of how to respond."]},{"number":1635,"title":"Chapter 1635 Primal Monarch’s Blood Essence","paragraphs":["\"Do I... do I really have to leave and return to the human world?\" Tian Yi stared at the Primal Monarch with a dispirited expression.","The Primal Monarch smiled and said, \"The Primal Expanse isn't your final stop. You are fated to achieve great things in the human world. I'll give you a few years to prepare, but you must leave within ten years.\"","Tian Yi sighed, \"Fine. If you so desperately want me to leave, I won't argue any further. However, how do I even return to the human world? According to what I've heard, it's impossible to leave the Primal Expanse.\"","\"There is only one way to leave the Primal Expanse, and that is through me.\" The Primal Monarch said.","\"Whenever you're prepared to leave, just let me know.\"","Tian Yi nodded.","In the years that followed, Tian Yi sought to learn all he could from the Primal Monarch, yet he soon realized there was nothing more the Primal Monarch could teach him. Despite this, Tian Yi chose not to waste their remaining time together.","In the blink of an eye, nine years passed.","\"I am ready to leave.\" On a certain day, Tian Yi approached the Primal Monarch to declare his departure.","The Primal Monarch nodded and said, \"Before you leave, promise me one thing.\"","\"What?\"","\"That you will never submit to anyone, especially to Heaven's will, ever again and become a being worthy of the Monarch's bloodline. Also, don't come back to the Primal Expanse unless you have fully awakened my bloodline.\"","\"You never told me how to awaken it even though I have asked many times,\" Tian Yi frowned.","\"Because you didn't need such knowledge back then.\" The Primal Monarch shook his head, and he continued speaking, \"Anyway, to fully awaken the Monarch's bloodline, you will need to absorb the Blood Essence of nine different beasts with a Supreme-grade bloodline.\"","\"Supreme-grade Blood Essence?! And nine of them?! That'll take an eternity!\" Tian Yi exclaimed.","There are barely a dozen Predators in the entire Primal Expanse who possess a Supreme-grade bloodline, and asking even one of them for their Blood Essence was nearly impossible—let alone nine.","Moreover, he had to accomplish this task in the human world, where the likelihood of finding even nine entities with a Supreme-grade bloodline was slim, if not nonexistent.","\"You're asking for too much... You might as well tell me never to return.\" Tian Yi sighed out loud.","\"Are you going to give up without even trying? I didn't know I'd raised such a useless quitter.\" The Primal Monarch sneered in disdain.","Tian Yi clenched his fists and gnashed his jaw, \"Just wait, you old booger! Not only will I awaken my bloodline, but I'll even take your position as the Primal Monarch and force you into retirement the next time I come back, so prepare yourself!\"","\"Hahaha! You'll take my position? It's a promise! I cannot wait, you snotty little brat!\" Shortly after, the Primal Monarch opened a rift to the Divine Heaven, and Tian Yi stepped into it without looking back.","After digesting Tian Yi's memories, Yuan looked at the Primal Monarch with emotional eyes.","\"Sorry, but I don't think I can fulfill my promise to you right now...\" Yuan spoke with a bittersweet smile.","\"Well, this won't be the first time you've disappointed me.\" The Primal Monarch shrugged.","He continued, \"Not only did you fail to awaken your bloodline, but you've managed to weaken it to its weakest state.\"","\"I'll awaken the bloodline this time for sure,\" Yuan said with a resolute expression on his face.","However, the Primal Monarch shook his head and said, \"Even if you consume nine Blood Essence right now, you won't be able to awaken your Monarch bloodline because it is still in its dormant state.\"","\"Huh? What do you mean?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"You've managed to activate your bloodline, but it's only Royal-grade, so you're not receiving any actual benefits from it.\"","\"Even your Immortal Monarch's Dominion is just a technique, not your bloodline's ability.\"","\"How do I awaken my bloodline then?\"","The Primal Monarch suddenly opened a rift and said, \"Follow me.\"","\"Wait a moment.\"","Yuan turned to look at Yingzi, \"Thank you for everything.\"","He retrieved a thousand meat skewers and handed them to Yingzi, who accepted them in a daze.","\"You too.\" Yuan gave some skewers to the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy before entering the rift with the Primal Monarch.","On the other side of the rift lay the Primal Monarch's own dimension, the place where Tian Yi had once lived. The world within this dimension was as vast as the Primal Expanse, but only Tian Yi and the Primal Monarch inhabited it at this moment.","Yuan surveyed his surroundings, feeling a sense of nostalgia.","Sometime later, the Primal Monarch spoke, \"I knew you would return one day, so I prepared this for you, but I never anticipated you would return in such a state.\"","He showed Yuan his palm, where a small bottle rested.","\"This is...\" Yuan swallowed nervously after seeing the drop of blood inside.","\"You made a second Blood Essence?\"","Most beings don't even dare to create Blood Essence, fearing the harm it could cause them. Those brave enough to attempt it would only produce a single drop in their lifetime, as that was their limit. Yet, the Primal Monarch had created two drops.","\"If you consume this Blood Essence, your Monarch's bloodline will awaken its true prowess.\"","Yuan accepted the Primal Monarch's Blood Essence.","\"Thank you...\"","Yuan tossed the bottle into his spatial ring, causing the Primal Monarch to raise an eyebrow.","\"What are you doing? Saving it for later? Why?\"","\"But I am only a Spirit Sovereign now, and I was an Immortal the last time I consumed your Blood Essence.\"","\"That's true, but you also didn't have the Monarch's bloodline back then. You already have the Monarch's bloodline this time, so the requirements won't be as harsh.\"","\"Is that so...? Then I'll consume it now...\"","Yuan retrieved the Blood Essence."]},{"number":1636,"title":"Chapter 1636 Awakening Immortal Monarch’s Bloodline","paragraphs":["Yuan stared at the Blood Essence in his grasp with a nervous gaze. Despite the Primal Monarch's assurance that it was safe to consume at his cultivation level, he couldn't help but feel uneasy.","After all, the Blood Essence belonged to an entity likely far stronger than even the Dragon Ancestor, whose Blood Essence he also possessed and has yet to consume due to his lack of cultivation.","\"Are you really scared of a single drop of blood? When did you become such a coward?\" The Primal Monarch casually mocked.","\"A single drop of blood? Is that how little you view your own Blood Essence?\" Yuan shook his head as he opened the bottle.","After taking a deep breath, Yuan tilted his head backward and poured the Blood Essence onto his tongue.","The Blood Essence immediately melted into his tongue.","<You have consumed '???' Blood Essence>","<Immortal Monarch's Bloodline is reacting to '???' Blood Essence!>","Yuan immediately sat down and began cultivating in silence. He could feel his body burning, almost as if his blood was boiling, but it wasn't as intense as his first experience as Tian Yi.","<Immortal Monarch's Bloodline has improved>","<Immortal Monarch's Bloodline has reached Imperial-grade>","<Immortal Monarch's Bloodline has improved>","<Immortal Monarch's Bloodline has reached Divine-grade>","A few days later, Yuan's bloodline had ascended by two grades. Unlike treasures and techniques, bloodlines had only four known grades, with the vast majority being Royal-grade.","After Royal-grade came Imperial-grade. In the human world, those with Imperial-grade bloodlines were regarded as nobles, hailing from the most elite bloodlines. In the beast world, they were considered royalty.","Above Imperial-grade was Divine-grade. Those with a Divine-grade bloodline were destined to rise above all others, standing as Emperors among their kind. If one searched the entire Nine Heavens, there would be less than a hundred entities with a Divine-grade bloodline.","The highest-known grade of bloodline was the Supreme-grade bloodline. Only the most powerful entities, such as Dragon Goddess Yeyou, the Primordial Phoenix, and the Dragon Ancestor, possessed such bloodlines. They are so rare that one could count all of them with two hands.","\"Only Divine-grade? I was expecting it to reach Supreme-grade.\" Yuan mused afterward.","\"The Monarch's bloodline is, without doubt, Supreme-grade at the very least. However, you've only partially awakened your bloodline. If you want your bloodline to reach Supreme-grade, you'll need to consume Supreme-grade Blood Essences to truly awaken your bloodline's full potential.\" The Primal Monarch said to him.","\"I need to consume nine different Supreme-grade Blood Essence, correct? Can I assume that your Blood Essence doesn't count?\"","The Primal Monarch nodded, \"My Blood Essence won't count, so you still need nine more.\"","'The Dragon Ancestor should have a Supreme-grade bloodline, so that's one down. If I count the Primordial Phoenix's Blood Essence in Feng Feng's possession, that's two...'","\"What are your plans now?\" The Primal Monarch suddenly asked him. \"Will you be returning to the human world now?\"","\"No, there's still something I must do here... unless you can help me.\"","Yuan retrieved Feng Yuxiang's egg and showed it to him.","\"Can you do something about this?\"","\"What do you want me to do, exactly? If you want me to awaken the Phoenix inside forcefully, I can do that, but it'll injure the Phoenix.\"","\"Can you speed up her recovery?\"","The Primal Monarch glared at the egg and said, \"As far as I can tell, the Phoenix inside is already fully recovered.\"","\"Really? Then why isn't she coming out? I was told that she would come out once she fully recovers.\"","\"I'm afraid I don't have an answer to your question. If you want to know, you should visit the Phoenixes' territory.\"","Yuan nodded, \"That was my plan from the start, but it's a little far, and I can't spend too much time in this place. Do you think you can send me there?\"","\"The Eternal Phoenix Domain, right?\"","\"Yes, that's right.\"","\"I can send you there. What about your friend?\"","\"My friend?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"That Shadow Dweller you've been traveling with. She's still at the Mystic Valley.\"","\"I thought she'd left by now...\" Yuan muttered in a low voice.","After taking some time to ponder, Yuan said, \"Let me talk to her for a bit.\"","The Primal Monarch flicked his arm, casually creating a rift that led him directly back to the spot where he had left from.","When Yuan returned to the Mystic Valley, he noticed that Yingzi hadn't moved an inch from her spot. As for the Divine Fox of Grand Prophecy, she had disappeared somewhere, presumably to recover after exhausting herself to divine the Primal Monarch's location.","\"Don't tell me that you've been waiting for me.\" Yuan looked at Yingzi with a raised eyebrow.","She nodded and said, \"Well, I still don't understand what it means to be a human.\"","\"What if I never returned?\" he asked.","\"If you hadn't returned by the time I finished all of the meat skewers, I would've left,\" she calmly said.","Yuan glanced at the number of meat skewers Yingzi had left. He had been gone for five days, yet she had only eaten a little over 100 skewers. It was clear to him that she had purposely slowed down, waiting for his return.","\"Well, I am going to visit the Eternal Phoenix Domain now. Want to come along?\"","\"I won't be able to protect you, though,\" she said.","\"That's fine. I can protect myself now.\"","\"Are you going to be visiting the Phoenixes' territory in that guise? They'll attack you before you can even get close.\" The Primal Monarch suddenly said to him.","\"Hmm... you're right, and pretending to be a Phoenix is too risky. If I cannot be a Dragon or a Phoenix, I might as well go there as a human.\"","Yuan deactivated his transformation for the first time since he came to the Primal Expanse, and his human scent immediately started to fill the air.","The Primals within the Mystic Valley quickly picked up his scent and immediately began rushing toward his location.","Despite the approaching threat, Yuan remained calm. He took a deep breath and spoke in a commanding voice, \"I don't have time to play with you lot. Scram.\"","Though his voice was barely louder than usual, it sent a powerful ripple through the entire Mystic Valley.","The moment the Primals heard his voice, which resounded inside their heads like a thunderclap, they immediately turned and fled in the opposite direction."]},{"number":1637,"title":"Chapter 1637 Forbidden Technique","paragraphs":["\"I'm ready to visit the Eternal Phoenix Domain,\" Yuan said to the Primal Monarch after chasing away the Primals.","The Primal Monarch nodded and said, \"Don't expect me to protect you if you get in trouble there.\"","He smiled, \"I'll be fine. Thanks for worrying.\"","\"Who the hell is worried?\" The Primal Monarch sneered before opening a rift that led directly to the Eternal Phoenix Domain.","\"Can you hold these for me with your treasure?\" Yingzi handed him the meat skewers she didn't eat.","Yuan nodded and stored the skewers in his spatial ring before stepping into the rift, with Yingzi following closely behind. Upon emerging from the rift, Yuan found himself standing before a vast land that resembled the Phoenix Ascendancy Plateau.","His human scent instantly spread and attracted the attention of nearby Primals.","'This is the perfect opportunity for me to test out my new powers while I wait for the Phoenixes to show up...' Yuan thought to himself and patiently waited for the Primals to show up.","A few moments later, a massive purple-feathered bird, its wings large enough to cover an entire mountain, came diving toward Yuan's location.","This bird exuded an aura equal to that of a Divine Emperor cultivator.","Yuan calmly gazed at the incoming bird. Once it was close enough, Yuan muttered in a nonchalant tone, \"Die.\"","In the next moment, the bird's movements suddenly slowed, and then, without warning, it began to fall lifelessly, plummeting straight into the ground.","<You have killed Fleeting Lightning Bird>","\"...\"","Yingzi's eyes widened in shock as she witnessed Yuan kill the Primal with nothing more than a simple voice command.","\"So it actually works...\" Yuan mumbled to himself.","He had never used the Immortal Monarch's Dominion in such a manner in his previous life, so this was something new to him.","More Primals appeared shortly after, but they also dropped like flies as Yuan commanded them to die with nothing more than his voice.","Although this power initially seemed limitless, Yuan began to feel fatigued after killing several more Primals in this manner, and it was mental fatigue that couldn't be healed even with his powerful soul cultivation technique. It was also apparent that the stronger his target, the more it drained his energy and exhausted him.","'Let's try something else now...'","Yuan suddenly made a grasping motion toward the corpses scattered on the ground and muttered, \"Condense!\"","In response, the corpses began to disintegrate into their purest form—spiritual energy—before condensing and forming what is known as a monster core.","In the Primal Expanse, entities do not leave behind a monster core because they cultivate through their Chaotic Heart. Yet, Yuan had managed to transform their corpses—their very Chaotic Hearts—into monster cores through his unique power.","<You have learned Absolute Core Creation>","[Absolute Core Creation]","[Rank: Celestial]","[Mastery Level: Max]","[Description: Allows the user to create perfect monster cores from beast corpses.]","\"What is that?\" Yingzi asked as she stared at the monster cores with a curious gaze. This was her first time seeing a monster core.","\"The Primals and Predators in the human world don't have Chaotic Hearts. Instead, they have a monster core, which you're looking at right now.\" Yuan explained.","\"They don't have Chaotic Hearts...?\" Yingzi muttered in disbelief, unable to fathom such a possibility, as it was impossible for them to survive without a Chaotic Heart.","\"Do you want it? Here you go.\" Yuan tossed the monster cores to her.","Once the monster cores were in her grasp, Yingzi inspected them with great interest. Meanwhile, Yuan shifted his focus to the approaching Primals.","\"Although I can't turn them into monster cores while they are still alive, I can do this instead...\"","When his next target was close enough, Yuan pointed two fingers at it and muttered, \"Extract!\"","The targeted Primal suddenly sensed an overwhelming dread as it felt its longevity rapidly depleting, its life force draining away uncontrollably.","However, its longevity wasn't disappearing into thin air. Instead, it was being used to form a Blood Essence.","Sure enough, just moments later, Yuan successfully extracted the Primal's Blood Essence.","<You have gained Fiery Giant Eagle's Blood Essence>","<You have learned Forbidden Blood Extraction>","[Forbidden Blood Extraction]","[Rank: Celestial]","[Mastery Level: Max]","[Description: Forcefully extracts Blood Essence from your target. This forbidden technique is greatly frowned upon by the Heavens. Using this technique may invoke Heaven's Tribulation!]","Yuan swallowed nervously at the description.","'A technique that could invoke Heaven's Tribulation just by using it? Luckily, I am still in the Primal Expanse, where Heaven has no influence...' Yuan thought to himself.","\"...\"","When she realized what Yuan had just done, Yingzi wasn't merely shocked—she was absolutely terrified. The ability to forcefully extract another's Blood Essence was a terrifying technique, one that could plunge the entire Primal Expanse into chaos and turmoil.","Seeing Yingzi's fearful expression, Yuan smiled apologetically and said, \"I'm sorry if that scared you. I was just testing it out. I won't do that again.\"","Yingzi silently acknowledged his words, but the fear in her heart couldn't be dispelled so quickly.","Meanwhile, several powerhouses had also witnessed Yuan's terrifying powers from afar and were left in shock.","\"That human just used the Primal Monarch's powers!\"","\"Who is that human?! Where did he come from?!\"","\"Did he come to our territory to cause trouble, or is he here for something else?\"","Despite their status as powerhouses, these individuals didn't dare to show themselves before Yuan, fearing that he might forcefully extract their Blood Essences.","\"Let's just stand by and observe him a little longer before deciding what to do with him.\"","\"Yeah, let's do that.\"","Meanwhile, Yuan continued killing the Primals who approached him because of his scent. However, he refrained from using the Monarch's power unless necessary.","'What's taking them so long to show up? They should've been aware of my presence the moment I showed up in their territory...' Yuan wondered inwardly, unaware that they were purposefully avoiding him.","Sometime later, a human-shaped figure approached Yuan, but this person was not one of the powerhouses."]},{"number":1638,"title":"Chapter 1638 One Condition","paragraphs":["\"Hey, you with the weird scent!\"","A voice suddenly called out to Yuan.","Yuan turned toward the source of the voice, spotting a young lady with long crimson hair, amber-colored eyes, and fierce facial features.","\"About time someone shows up,\" Yuan mumbled after seeing this young Phoenix.","\"Who the hell are you? And why are you causing a scene in our territory?\" the young lady questioned, seemingly unaware that Yuan was a human.","It was well known that humans couldn't use their powers in the Primal Expanse, and the fact that no human had appeared in their world for millions of years left the young lady unaware of Yuan's true identity.","When the powerhouses realized who this young lady was, they began panicking.","\"What the hell is she doing over there?!\"","\"We need to intervene before that human steals her Blood Essence!\"","Meanwhile, Yuan faced the young lady and spoke, \"I have some business with the Primordial Phoenix.\"","The young lady frowned and said, \"The Primordial Phoenix isn't someone you can meet just because.\"","\"Then how can I meet them?\"","The young lady narrowed her eyes and said, \"First and foremost, you must identify yourself. What bloodline do you have? I am not familiar with your scent. Also, we need to know your reason for seeking out the Primordial Phoenix.\"","\"I'm Yuan, a human, and I need the Primordial Phoenix's help with something.\"","\"Huh? A human?\" The young lady's eyes widened with surprise after hearing such an unexpected answer.","\"To be messing with me... you obviously don't care about meeting the Primordial Phoenix,\" she sneered in disdain.","\"Why would I be messing with you? Can't you tell by my scent? There's a reason the Primals have been swarming me.\"","\"...\"","The young lady was speechless.","At that moment, two more figures appeared: a middle-aged man and a woman, both exuding an aura equivalent to a cultivator at the God Ascension realm. As soon as they arrived, they positioned themselves in front of the young lady, as if shielding her with their bodies.","\"Seniors? Why are you here?\" The young lady was surprised by the appearance of these two powerhouses.","\"We should be asking you that! Why did you come here when we told everyone to remain in their home?!\"","\"You did? I didn't get the word.\" The young lady shrugged.","\"Anyway, I came here because I noticed a weird scent coming from this guy. He claims to be a human, but I don't believe him.\"","The two powerhouses turned to look at Yuan with deep frowns on their faces.","\"What is your relationship with the Primal Monarch?\" The woman asked in a nervous tone.","\"What? The Primal Monarch?\" The young lady's eyes widened.","\"He's my adoptive father.\" Yuan calmly responded.","\"?!?!\"","\"The Primal Monarch adopted a human?!\" The middle-aged man exclaimed, his face filled with disbelief.","\"Then are you here on behalf of the Primal Monarch?\" The woman continued to ask.","He shook his head, \"No, I came here because I personally have business with the Primordial Phoenix.\"","\"What sort of business?\" Yuan retrieved Feng Yuxiang's egg and said, \"I was told that they would be able to help my friend here.\"","The Phoenixes before him trembled, their faces filled with shock when they saw the egg in Yuan's grasp.","\"T-that is...! Where the hell did you get that?!\" The young lady cried out loud.","\"That shell! It can't be...!\" The middle-aged man swallowed nervously.","\"W-we must notify Her Majesty immediately!\" The woman exclaimed.","Yuan raised an eyebrow at their reaction and asked, \"Does that mean I get to meet the Primordial Phoenix?\"","However, before the Phoenixes could respond, Yuan suddenly felt a strong, overwhelming pressure appear out of nowhere.","Yuan tilted his head upward to see a massive, majestic Phoenix hovering above them.","When the Phoenixes noticed this newcomer, they immediately lowered their heads and greeted it, \"We greet Your Majesty!\"","\"The Primordial Phoenix...?\" Yuan recognized the Primordial Phoenix's appearance since she looked exactly like Feng Yuming in her beast form.","In the next moment, the Primordial Phoenix began to shrink, transforming into the form of a human.","The Primordial Phoenix took the form of a stunning woman, tall and slender, with long, fiery red hair cascading down her back, nearly reaching her feet. Her presence radiated a majestic aura, one that commanded respect, like that of an empress.","'She looks just like Feng Yuming...'","Yuan was startled by how closely this Primordial Phoenix resembled Feng Yuming. Yet, it was clear that she wasn't Feng Yuming, but another distinct Primordial Phoenix.","The Primordial Phoenix descended gracefully, halting just before Yuan, her sharp gaze locking onto the egg in his hands. After a brief, tense silence, she shifted her eyes to Yuan and asked in a calm, yet commanding tone, \"Who are you?\"","\"I'm Yuan, a human from the human world.\"","\"What is your relationship with the one inside this shell?\"","\"We're companions.\"","\"Then you're not much of a companion, letting her end up in such a state,\" the Primordial Phoenix remarked, her tone laced with disdain.","Yuan narrowed his eyes and said, \"You don't even know what happened.\"","\"That's irrelevant.\"","\"Whatever. I'm not here to argue but to see if you can heal her.\"","The Primordial Phoenix looked at the egg and said, \"Of course, I can heal her. However, why should I do that for you? Did you think I would be willing to heal her just because she's a Phoenix?\"","\"I was hopeful, but if you're unwilling to heal her, just let me know so I can stop wasting my time here.\"","\"How dare you speak to Her Majesty in such a tone! Even the Primal Monarch addresses her with respect!\" the middle-aged man shouted, his voice brimming with anger.","The Primordial Phoenix narrowed her eyes at him.","After a brief silence, she spoke, her voice calm yet firm, \"I am willing to heal her... but only under one condition: you must leave her with us in the Eternal Phoenix Domain.\"","Yuan frowned after hearing about her condition. \"Are you serious?\" \"Did it sound like I was joking?\" the Primordial Phoenix replied, her voice cold and unwavering."]},{"number":1639,"title":"Chapter 1639 Primordial Phoenix’s Outburst","paragraphs":["\"If I heal her and let her continue traveling with you, she will undoubtedly be hurt again, perhaps even face death,\" the Primordial Phoenix explained the reason behind her condition, her tone resolute. \"In that case, I would rather she stay here with us, where she will be close to her own bloodline and, more importantly, where she'll be safe.\"","Hearing this, Yuan calmly replied, \"You're right. It is dangerous to be with me, and there's a high chance she'll get hurt again in the future. However, it's her decision whether she wants to continue traveling with me. Neither you nor I have the right to decide her path for her.\"","\"Moreover, she doesn't even belong in this world. It's unreasonable to ask her to stay.\"","\"You speak so confidently despite knowing nothing.\" The Primordial Phoenix sneered.","\"Why don't you enlighten me, then?\"","\"You're not worth it.\"","Yuan shrugged, \"Then I guess we have nothing left to talk about.\"","He put Feng Yuxiang away and prepared to leave.","\"Where do you think you're going? This isn't a place where you can come and go as you please,\" the Primordial Phoenix said sharply, her voice echoing with authority. \"Leave that Phoenix behind, and only then will I allow you to leave.\" With those words, she unleashed a powerful pressure, instantly restricting Yuan's movements.","The Primordial Phoenix was undoubtedly one of the strongest beings Yuan had encountered so far, second only to the Primal Monarch. If compared to a cultivator, her power would rival that of a Cultivation God—an entity that stood at the very peak of the cultivation world.","Sensing the Primordial Phoenix's overwhelming presence, Yuan instantly realized that he was powerless against her—and that not even the Monarch's power could save him.","However, Yuan remained calm, confident that the Primal Monarch was watching everything unfold and wouldn't allow him to die.","\"If you think the Primal Monarch will save you, think again,\" the Primordial Phoenix said, her eyes gleaming with certainty. \"He and I have an agreement—that he won't interfere with anything that happens within my territory, no matter what.\"","She had guessed the obvious reason behind his calm demeanor.","\"If he does show up to save you, I am willing to fight him to death.\"","\"...\"","Yuan was speechless. He couldn't understand why the Primordial Phoenix was so determined to keep Feng Yuxiang in the Eternal Phoenix Domain with them.","Before Yuan could respond, she continued, \"Or perhaps you believe I can't kill you because that isn't your real body? Unfortunately for you, my flames can burn anything—even a body crafted from your soul.\" Her voice carried a cold certainty that sent a chill through the air.","Yuan's eyebrows twitched at her words.","'She can tell that this isn't my real body?!' he cried inwardly.","\"As a curtsy to the Primal Monarch, I will give you one last warning. Leave behind that Phoenix. Otherwise, I completely erase you from existence!\"","Suddenly, flames erupted around them, encircling Yuan and trapping him within a blazing sphere of fire. The intense heat pressed in from all sides, leaving him no escape.","Seeing this, Yuan spoke out loud, \"I know you're seeing this, you old booger! Are you really going to let me die?!\"","\"It's useless. The Primal Monarch won't interfere.\" The Primordial Phoenix sneered at his futile attempt.","However, a voice suddenly resounded, \"You were quite confident that you'd be fine right before I sent you off, so what is this, you little brat?\"","The Primordial Phoenix frowned when she realized it was the Primal Monarch's voice.","\"Primal Monarch, I won't hurt him as long as he leaves behind the Phoenix!\"","The Primal Monarch then spoke, but not to the Primordial Phoenix, \"You heard her, brat. It would save me a lot of headaches if you leave behind that Phoenix.\"","\"Hmph! I'd rather die!\" Yuan sneered.","\"It's just a Phoenix. I'm sure you can easily acquire more when you return to your world.\"","\"Just a Phoenix? She's much more than that to me! If you're not going to help, just leave! You useless old booger!\"","\"...\"","After a brief silence, a deep sigh echoed through the fiery enclosure. Suddenly, a rift tore open beside Yuan, and the Primal Monarch emerged from it.","\"What do you think you are doing, Primal Monarch? We had an agreement! Don't tell me you plan on breaking it!\" The Primordial Phoenix roared in anger.","\"I know we had an agreement,\" the Primal Monarch responded, his voice calm yet firm. \"But I cannot allow my one and only son, since the beginning of time, to die here.\"","He paused, his gaze steady on the Primordial Phoenix. \"Why are you so determined to take his companion from him, anyway? Even if she dies by his side, what does that have to do with you? It's not like she's the only Phoenix out there.\"","The Primordial Phoenix trembled at his words, her composure faltering. After a moment, she responded with a fierce intensity, \"It has everything to do with me! You're not the only one trying to save your child here, Primal Monarch! That Phoenix is my daughter—my oldest!\"","\"What?! Your daughter?!\" Yuan's eyes widened with shock after hearing the Primordial Phoenix's unexpected claim.","'Feng Feng is her daughter?! How is that even possible?!' he cried inwardly.","\"And unlike you, who merely adopted that human, she's my biological daughter!\" the Primordial Phoenix continued, her voice trembling with emotion, revealing the feelings she had been holding back all this time.","Yuan stared at the Primordial Phoenix, his jaw slack in disbelief. He could sense the truth in her words—her emotions were raw and genuine, leaving no room for doubt.","However, Yuan couldn't fathom how Feng Yuxiang could be her child. Had Feng Yuxiang somehow traveled to the Nine Heavens, much like he had accidentally found himself in the Primal Expanse?","\"So she was your child, huh? That explains a lot.\" The Primal Monarch mused.","The Primordial Phoenix pointed at Yuan, her voice rising with fury as she shouted, \"I won't allow my daughter to stay with someone who let her nearly die, even if you are the Primal Monarch's son!\"","Her fierce gaze burned with such intensity that Yuan felt as if his entire body was engulfed in flames. Coupled with her harsh words, he felt a deep sense of guilt, as though he was in the wrong."]},{"number":1640,"title":"Chapter 1640 A Vicious Curse","paragraphs":["\"Since you're her mother, this changes everything. However, that doesn't mean I'm willing to let you take her away from me.\" Yuan said to the Primordial Phoenix after a moment of silence.","He continued, \"How about this? Why don't you help your daughter recover first, then we can discuss her future together? I promise that I won't leave before the two of you have a conversation. I really don't want to fight you.\"","\"Hmph! You don't want to fight me? You aren't even capable of doing so!\" The Primordial Phoenix sneered.","She turned to look at the Primal Monarch and continued, \"Although you haven't done anything yet, I am still going to consider this a breach of our agreement, Primal Monarch!\"","\"Does this mean you have given up on trying to kill my son?\"","\"That will depend on my daughter's testimony. If I find out that he's mistreated her even slightly, I will not hesitate to kill him even if it's the last thing I do,\" she responded in a cold voice.","The Primordial Phoenix removed the flames shortly after and said to Yuan, \"Follow me.\"","She created a rift and entered it.","\"Go ahead. I won't be coming along.\" The Primal Monarch said.","\"Alright.\" Yuan nodded and followed the Primordial Phoenix into the rift.","Yingzi, who had been watching in the background, silently followed him. As for the three Phoenixes...","\"So the Phoenix inside that egg was my eldest sister, huh? No wonder I felt an odd sense of familiarity with her...\" the young lady mused, her voice softening as the realization dawned on her.","\"I can't believe that the First Princess has returned after so long...\" The woman muttered in a dazed voice.","\"Things are going to get chaotic here very soon. I need to notify everyone of the situation as soon as possible.\" The middle-aged man sighed.","Once Yuan stepped through the rift, he found himself in a vast, breathtaking garden that seemed to stretch endlessly in every direction. The air was thick with the fragrance of medicinal plants, all flourishing with vibrant yang energy.","\"Put my daughter on that altar.\" The Primordial Phoenix pointed to the altar covered with complex array symbols in the distance.","Yuan nodded and approached the altar before retrieving Feng Yuxiang's egg and placing it in the center of the altar.","\"Get back,\" said the Primordial Phoenix as she stood before the altar.","Yuan stepped back and waited for her next move.","However, the Primordial Phoenix didn't do anything besides silently staring at the egg with a motherly gaze.","A few moments later, she suddenly frowned and roared, \"Which bastard placed such a vicious curse on her?!\"","\"That happened to her before we met, so I don't know the details.\" Yuan quickly shook his head when she turned to look at him for answers.","\"Just so you know, I've been working to get that curse removed since we met,\" he added.","\"Hmph! The reason why she hasn't emerged from her shell is because of this damned curse.\" The Primordial Phoenix revealed with a cold sneer.","\"Unfortunately, I cannot do anything until we completely remove the curse, or I risk injuring her, even killing her.\"","\"Do you have a way to remove the curse?\" Yuan asked.","\"We can remove the curse with the help of a treasure. However, we don't have that treasure at our territory.\"","\"But you know where it is, right?\"","\"The treasure is called the Sacred Chalice of Purification, and it is in the possession of those annoying dragons at the Divine Dragon Sanctuary,\" she said.","\"The Divine Dragon Sanctuary?\" Yuan didn't expect to hear this name again.","\"It's a rank one territory, one that rivals our Eternal Phoenix Domain, controlled by the dragon race,\" the Primordial Phoenix sighed, her frustration evident. \"I would retrieve the treasure myself, but doing so would undoubtedly spark an all-out war between our territories.\"","\"I can get the treasure.\" Yuan suddenly volunteered.","She looked at him and sneered, \"You? What can you possibly achieve with that level of cultivation? Your Monarch's power is useless against those whose strength far exceeds your own.\" Her tone was sharp, dripping with condescension.","\"Must everything be solved with violence and force?\" Yuan shook his head.","He proceeded to transform, revealing his dragon form to her.","\"You...\" The Primordial Phoenix's frown deepened as she sensed the unmistakable scent of a dragon exuding from his body. This was the first time such a scent had breached her sacred territory—her private sanctuary. Her displeasure was evident, her gaze hardening with irritation.","\"I'll go there as a fellow dragon,\" Yuan said with a calm smile, ignoring her displeased glares. \"Even if you go there as a dragon, it won't do you any good,\" the Primordial Phoenix scoffed. \"The Sacred Chalice of Purification isn't just any treasure—it's one of their most valuable, revered as sacred. It has never left their territory before, and they guard it like their life depends on it.\"","\"That does sound troublesome...\" Yuan mumbled to himself after hearing this.","After a moment of silence, he shrugged, \"Well, I'll figure something out—probably.\"","\"You... why would my daughter follow someone as foolish as you...?\" The Primordial Phoenix sighed.","\"Then do you have a better suggestion?\" Yuan inquired.","The Primordial Phoenix remained silent.","Eventually, she said, \"Even the Primal Monarch might not be able to acquire the treasure from them without a fight, so I really have no idea how you're going to do it. However, it's still better than suddenly going to war with them—not that I am afraid of them or anything like that.\"","\"We've been trying to conquer or eliminate each other since the beginning of time,\" the Primordial Phoenix continued coldly. \"We've gone to war more than once, even for reasons far more insignificant than this. All we need is time to prepare, and that's exactly what we'll be doing while you do your thing. So don't worry. Even if you fail to secure the treasure, we'll strike when the time is right.\"","Yuan swallowed nervously.","The Primordial Phoenix's expression was deadly serious as she spoke of going to war with the dragons, all for the sake of reviving her daughter. Her resolve was unwavering, showing just how far she was willing to go for her child's life."]},{"number":1641,"title":"Chapter 1641 Human From Back Then","paragraphs":["\"I'll do whatever it takes to acquire the treasure. Just don't do anything reckless and foolish before I return.\" Yuan shook his head at the Primordial Phoenix's eagerness to go to war with the dragons.","\"Who the hell are you to tell me what to do?\" The Primordial Phoenix sneered.","She continued, \"Ten years. If you haven't returned with the treasure by then, we will go there and get it ourselves.\"","'Ten years?' Yuan smiled inwardly after hearing this generous number. 'I only plan to stay in this world for another year at most. As if I need ten years!'","\"Alright. Ten years.\" He agreed to her terms.","\"Anyway, I will need some time to prepare before I head to the Divine Dragon Sanctuary. If I go there in my current state—with an incomplete Chaotic Heart, they will definitely suspect my identity.\"","The Primordial Phoenix narrowed her gaze on him, seemingly pondering something.","\"Since you brought my daughter back to us, we will assist you in that regard,\" she suddenly said.","\"Eh? Really?\" Yuan wasn't expecting this at all and was pleasantly surprised.","\"It's only a single Chaotic Heart, and it's your first, so it won't take much effort.\"","\"Then I will take up on your offer,\" Yuan said.","\"...\"","\"By the way, I have been meaning to ask you this, but how did Feng Feng—your daughter end up in the human world?\"","\"Are you seriously asking me that? Do you even know anything about the Primal Expanse? Are you really the Primal Monarch's son?\" The Primordial Phoenix suddenly bombarded him with questions.","\"Now that you mentioned it, I don't really know much about the Primal Expanse...\" Yuan suddenly came to this realization.","Despite spending over a hundred years in the Primal Expanse, Yuan hadn't taken the time to learn much about its intricacies. Instead, he had devoted nearly all his focus to training.","'I never anticipated that I would be leaving the Primal Expanse so soon back then, so I never really paid attention to the world, and that old booger never told me much about the world, either.' Yuan sighed inwardly.","\"Did the Primal Monarch really not tell you anything about our world? How long have you been living in the Primal Expanse?\" The Primordial Phoenix asked.","\"I came to the Primal Expanse by accident a little over a year ago,\" he said.","\"Only a year ago? And you'd become the Primal Monarch's son in that little time? Something isn't adding up here.\" The Primordial Phoenix frowned.","\"It's a little complicated, but this isn't my first time to the Primal Expanse.\"","\"Elaborate.\"","'Since she's Feng Feng's mother, I guess telling her the truth is fine. She'd find out eventually, anyway.'","With that in mind, Yuan explained his situation to her.","\"I lived in the Primal Expanse for a little bit in my previous life,\" he calmly explained.","The Primordial Phoenix's eyes widened after hearing this.","\"Your previous life...? Reincarnation? Wait a minute...\"","The Primordial Phoenix suddenly began approaching him, her movements graceful yet deliberate. When she stood directly in front of him, she leaned in, bringing her face so close to his that their lips were just a breath apart, almost touching.","Her gaze was fierce, searing into his face with such intensity that it felt as though her eyes alone could burn him. The heat of her presence was almost overwhelming, like a fire just beneath the surface.","After a tense moment of silence, she abruptly stepped back, her eyes widening in shock as she cried out, \"Y-you! No wonder you felt so familiar! You're that human from back then! The one who appeared out of nowhere and caused chaos in the Primal Expanse for a hundred years before vanishing just as suddenly!\" Her voice was filled with both recognition and disbelief.","\"Hm? You know me—Tian Yi?\" Yuan asked, his brow furrowing as he tried to recall the Primordial Phoenix from Tian Yi's memories. However, he had fought so many phoenixes during that time that it was impossible to pinpoint her for certain.","\"Who in the Primal Expanse hasn't heard of you back then?\" the Primordial Phoenix sneered. \"Though I never met you personally, I heard all about your so-called 'feats'—how you went from territory to territory, beating up the owners individually.\" Her voice was laced with a mixture of disbelief and frustration as she recalled the stories of his chaotic past.","\"As a matter of fact, you also made a mess in the Eternal Phoenix Domain back then!\" the Primordial Phoenix continued, her voice rising with frustration. \"Unfortunately, I was away when you invaded our territory. By the time I returned, you had already disappeared from the Primal Expanse, so I wasn't able to exact revenge!\" Her eyes burned with fury as she recalled the memory of returning home, only to find her people beaten to a pulp and their treasures plundered. The humiliation and rage she had felt at that moment resurfaced, igniting her anger once more.","\"Oh, that was just my training,\" Yuan said as he reminisced the past.","\"Then why did you take our treasures?!\"","\"It requires a lot of resources to form Chaotic Hearts, you know? Anyway,\" Yuan continued calmly, \"while I did take your treasures, I didn't kill any of the Phoenixes. Besides, you guys were the aggressors. I was simply passing through your territory when your people attacked me first, so you can't really blame me for defending myself.\"","The Primordial Phoenix trembled, but she eventually stopped.","\"That explains why the Primal Monarch never showed up to stop you...\"","\"...\"","\"Whatever,\" the Primordial Phoenix suddenly scoffed, waving her hand dismissively. \"That's all in the past, and I'm not petty enough to hold a grudge over something that happened millions of years ago.\" Her tone softened slightly, though the tension in the air lingered.","\"Thanks. Now, can you tell me about your daughter's situation?\" Yuan returned to the topic.","\"Before that, you should learn more about the Primal Expanse,\" she said.","\"In that case, allow me to explain.\" A third voice suddenly resounded.","\"I knew you hadn't left yet...\" the Primordial Phoenix sneered, her voice dripping with disdain. \"But to snoop around in my private world... I didn't realize you were this shameless, Primal Monarch.\"","Sure enough, a moment later, the Primal Monarch appeared before them, stepping through an entrance he had created himself with a faint smile on his face."]},{"number":1642,"title":"Chapter 1642 The Connection Between Two Worlds","paragraphs":["\"Shameless? I am just trying to ensure my son's safety. That's all. I have no interest in you or your world.\" The Primal Monarch shrugged.","\"Hah! Do you think I am the type to go back on my words? I am nowhere as shameless as you, Primal Monarch!\"","\"Anyway, you had plenty of chances to explain to him before, so why didn't you do so?\" \"Hmm... good question...\"","The Primal Monarch began pondering with a serious face.","A few moments later, he had a look of realization and said, \"I remember now! I forgot to tell him!\" \"Are you serious...?\" The Primordial Phoenix frowned.","He shrugged, \"My mind was occupied with other things back then, and teaching him about our world wasn't a priority, so I never gave it any thought.\" \"Unbelievable...\" Yuan muttered.","\"Anyway, let me make it up by explaining our world to you now.\" The Primal Monarch looked at Yuan and went on to explain the connection between the Primal Expanse and the Nine Heavens.","\"As you already know by now, the 'beasts' of your world are originally from the Primal Expanse. Of course, not all of them came from the Primal Expanse, but a good portion of them are.\"","\"Now the question is, how does that work? How did they enter your world?\"","\"But before I answer that question, I have one for you. What happens when a human dies in your world?\" The Primal Monarch faced Yuan with a profound smile.","\"Well, as long as their soul isn't destroyed, they will eventually be reincarnated. Without the memories of their past lives, obviously.\"","The Primal Monarch nodded and continued asking, \"Then what do you think happens to beasts after their death?\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before responding, \"Unlike humans, beasts don't reincarnate. Unless they have a unique bloodline, they simply return to nature—being part of the world as spiritual energy.\"","\"You're partially correct, and you're missing a few pieces.\" The Primal Monarch spoke.","\"Just like humans, beasts also reincarnate,\" he proceeded to explain. \"However, their process is vastly different. When a beast dies, as long as its Chaotic Heart—or 'core'—isn't destroyed or consumed, it returns to nature as Chaotic Essence in the Primal Expanse and spiritual energy in your world. Over time, that energy will give birth to a new beast, whether by natural birth or through another beast.\"","\"Unlike humans, who rely on their own bodily fluids to breed and procreate, beasts only need spiritual energy to do so. There are two ways they acquire this energy—by receiving it from another being or by absorbing the natural energy around them. Most prefer to use nature's energy, as it is both the most convenient and abundant source. However, those who wish to maintain or strengthen their bloodline's purity and strength typically acquire it from another individual.\"","Yuan absorbed the information with a serious expression, carefully processing every word. When the Primal Monarch mentioned the beasts' method of breeding through spiritual energy, Yuan's thoughts drifted to Lan Yingying and how she had requested his spiritual energy to conceive her future child.","While it wasn't unheard of for beasts to conceive using a human's spiritual energy, it was incredibly rare due to the unpredictability of the results. The fusion of human and beast energy often led to unforeseen complications, making such occurrences highly unusual and risky.","However, there are special races that can conceive with a human's spiritual energy without any complications, and Lan Yingying belongs to that category.","\"Now then, let's finally get to the main topic,\" the Primal Monarch said suddenly. \"In the Primal Expanse, for reasons still unknown, when beings here perish, they don't always return to nature as Chaotic Essence. Instead, they sometimes transform into spiritual energy and drift into your world, where they are reborn.\"","\"Huh?\" Yuan's eyes widened at this information.","He looked at the Primordial Phoenix and muttered, \"Does that mean your daughter died in the Primal Expanse and was reincarnated in the human world?\"","She nodded, \"Yes, but due to our unique bloodline, our reincarnation process is somewhat identical to that of humans. For instance, when a human reincarnates, they will always return as humans. If I were to die right now, I would eventually come back as a Primordial Phoenix. However, if there are no interferences, a dragon could reincarnate as a snake or even a pig in their next life. In simpler terms, we will naturally retain our core identity and bloodline no matter how many times we are reborn, as long as there are no interferences.\"","\"Therefore, no matter how many times she dies, my daughters will always be my daughter.\"","\"I see...\" Yuan muttered.","\"By the way, if you didn't know, the Primal Expanse existed long before the human world even came into the picture.\" The Primal Monarch suddenly said.","\"I have another question. If a beast dies in the human world, is there a chance that they could return to the Primal Expanse?\" Yuan asked.","\"No. Once one leaves the Primal Expanse, they will never return—at least not in that fashion. Of course, they can still return the same way you did.\"","\"How often does that happen?\"","\"As often as humans show up. Also, if a beast without a Chaotic Heart visits the Primal Expanse, it will be as powerless as a human. After all, only those with a Chaotic Heart or the Monarch's bloodline could cultivate and utilize Chaotic Essence.\"","\"That explains why I am able to use my powers even without a Chaotic Heart...\" Yuan mused to himself.","\"That said, a beast born in the human world can still form a Chaotic Heart, so they're not completely hopeless.\" The Primal Monarch added.","Sometime later, Yuan said, \"I understand how the Primal Expanse and the Nine Heavens are connected, but I still don't know why.\"","\"Unfortunately, even I do not know why.\" The Primal Monarch shook his head.","\"Hmm... what about your bloodline? Just what exactly is the Monarch's bloodline?\"","The Primordial Phoenix stared at the Primal Monarch with intrigue. Although the beings in the Primal Expanse understand and have accepted the Primal Monarch's powers, nobody knows how or why such a bloodline exists."]},{"number":1643,"title":"Chapter 1643 Six in Total","paragraphs":["\"What is the Monarch's bloodline, huh?\" The Primal Monarch looked at Yuan with a profound smile on his face.","After a moment of silence, he responded with a casual shrug, \"No clue.\"","\"Huh?\" Yuan's face became dumbfounded.","\"I am the first of my kind, and it has been that way since the beginning of time. I do not know why I was born or my purpose. I merely exist.\"","The Primordial Phoenix stared at the Primal Monarch with a pondering expression. As he had claimed, he had existed since the beginning of time before any other race was born. In fact, there are speculations that he had been created alongside the Primal Expanse itself, an ancient being intertwined with the very fabric of the world.","No one truly knows the full extent of the Primal Monarch's power, as he has never revealed it. Throughout the ages, he has remained detached from worldly affairs, rarely interacting with its residents or intervening in their matters. He was a silent ruler, observing the world from a position so high that others could hardly comprehend it—his presence akin to that of a god.","He also possessed an unrivaled ability that allowed him to command all bloodlines as if they were his servants, even those of the so-called purest and most powerful bloodlines.","Due to his terrifying abilities, few dared to challenge him, allowing him to remain at the peak of the world since the beginning of time.","\"You never questioned it or tried to find an answer?\" Yuan asked, his curiosity piqued.","The Primal Monarch remained silent for a moment before shaking his head.","\"I was curious during my earliest years,\" he admitted, \"but once I realized that knowledge wouldn't change anything, I have since stopped caring about it.\"","'Just what is so special about this human for the Primal Monarch to be so attached to him?' The Primordial Phoenix wondered inwardly.","The Primal Monarch was a godlike existence, one so far beyond the reach of most that even speaking to him seemed unimaginable. Yet, somehow, a mere human had managed to pique his interest enough to not only be adopted as his own but also be granted his immense powers. It was simply incomprehensible even for someone as experienced and knowledgeable as the Primordial Phoenix.","Sometime later, after their conversation ended, the Primordial Phoenix opened a rift, leading Yuan to the Eternal Phoenix Domain's primary residence, where most of the phoenixes dwelled. \"There will be someone to assist you with your Chaotic Heart.\" The Primordial Phoenix said to him after opening the rift.","\"You're not coming?\"","\"I am going to examine her curse a little more.\"","\"I understand.\"","The moment Yuan emerged from the rift, he was immediately greeted by a familiar face—the young lady who was the first to approach him. And before them, multiple islands floated majestically in the sky, each one occupied by a powerful phoenix, their fiery auras radiating through the air.","\"We meet again. I was given instructions by my mother to assist you.\" \"Your mother...? You're also the Primordial Phoenix's daughter?\" Yuan asked.","She nodded, \"I am the youngest. You can call me Feng Yao.\"","\"Nice to meet you. By the way, how many siblings do you have?\" \"I have five siblings, but only three of them still exist in the Primal Expanse. The last two drifted into the other world, one of them being the eldest, whom you brought back.\"","\"So there are six of you in total, huh? Are you all Primordial Phoenixes?\" \"Of course not. The Primordial Phoenix bloodline is the purest and highest-grade Phoenix bloodline. Besides the eldest, we all have a different bloodline. However, while our bloodline isn't as pure as the eldest, we're still at the top of our bloodline.\"","'So Feng Feng is a Primordial Phoenix like her mother? But her character status shows a different bloodline. Is this also due to the curse?'","Yuan recalled that Xiao Hua's character status changed when she released her seal, so Feng Yuxiang might be in a similar situation.","\"Anyways, enough about me. What's your relationship with Eldest Sister?\" Feng Yao stared at him with glowing eyes that were filled with curiosity.","\"We're traveling companions,\" Yuan said with a smile, purposefully avoiding the fact that they were in a master-servant relationship.","'They'd probably skin me alive if they find out about our real relationship...' Yuan could imagine the Primordial Phoenix's fury if she found out, sending shivers throughout his body.","\"How long have you known the eldest?\" Feng Yao continued asking as they walked to their destination.","\"We've only known each other for a few years.\"","\"Huh? That little time? You're practically strangers!\"","Yuan looked at her with raised eyebrows, but he refrained from commenting on her logic.","\"What was she like when she still lived in the Primal Expanse?\" Yuan suddenly asked.","Feng Yao shrugged and said, \"I was born long after she was gone, so I don't have the slightest clue. However, the others might know. You can try asking them later.\"","\"I'll just ask the Primordial Phoenix later,\" he said.","\"...You're really something, you know?\" Feng Yao suddenly sighed.","\"What do you mean?\"","\"Despite being her daughter, I rarely see my mother, let alone speak with her,\" Feng Yao remarked with a hint of bitterness. \"I think you've spent more time with her than I have in my entire life so far.\"","\"Seriously? Even though you all live in the same territory?\"","\"What do you know? Mother spends most of her time inside her own world.\"","\"Doing what? Increase her cultivation, which could already rival even the strongest cultivators in my world?\"","\"No, she spends most of her time conceiving another child. It takes hundreds of millions of years for someone at her level to conceive a single child, after all. This doesn't include the time it takes her to absorb enough Chaotic Essence to begin the process, either.\"","Yuan was left speechless by this revelation.","'Hundreds of millions of years for a single child? I suppose it would disrupt the balance of the world if such a powerful being could conceive too quickly,' Yuan thought to himself.","The stronger the being, the more time is required to conceive, a principle that applies even to humans.","'Compared to the Primordial Phoenix, Yingying's one thousand years is almost laughably short...'","\"Alright, we're here.\" Feng Yao said out loud once they reached their destination."]},{"number":1644,"title":"Chapter 1644 Nine Levels of Hell","paragraphs":["\"Where exactly are we?\" Yuan inquired as they stood at the peak of a massive volcano. He thought they were going to feed him treasures to complete his Chaotic Heart.","\"We're at the Nine Levels of Hell Peak.\"","\"What a terrifying name. Why did you bring me here? The Primordial Phoenix said you'd help me complete my Chaotic Heart.\"","\"Were you expecting us to feed you treasures or something? You'll be forming your Chaotic Heart here.\" Feng Yao pointed at the raging flames inside the volcano.","\"How does that work?\" Yuan asked with raised eyebrows.","\"There are nine floors in the Nine Levels of Hell, each floor engulfed in my mother—the Primordial Phoenix's flames,\" Feng Yao explained. \"If you temper your body within these flames, you'll eventually complete your Chaotic Heart. The deeper you go, the more intense the flames become, but the rewards will also be greater.\"","Of course, they could have simply fed Yuan the necessary treasures to complete his Chaotic Heart. However, since the Primordial Phoenix couldn't kill him, she saw this as an opportunity to inflict some pain on him instead. Thus, this grueling method of tempering his body in the flames was chosen as a way to achieve his goal while ensuring he endured some suffering in the process.","'Not petty enough to hold a grudge, huh?' Yuan recalled the Primordial Phoenix's words and shook his head inwardly.","\"Anyway, you're only a human, and your cultivation is also pathetically low, so even the first level might be unbearable for you.\" Feng Yao continued, \"That's why I'll give you this.\"","She handed him a bottle that contained a single drop of blood inside.","\"Phoenix blood?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"My blood, to be precise. If you consume it, you'll have enhanced fire resistance for a short time, enough to endure the second level at most.\"","It was only ordinary phoenix blood, but Feng Yao had a powerful bloodline, so even a single drop would be priceless in the Nine Heavens.","\"Your blood is only enough for the second level? Just how powerful are these flames?\" Yuan asked.","\"What do you know? My Mother is the most powerful phoenix in existence. Her flames can burn even someone with fire immunity.\"","\"Is that so? Have you heard of Phoenix's Wrath?\" Yuan suddenly asked.","\"Phoenix's Wrath? Of course, I have. Why?\"","\"How does it compare to the flames here?\"","Feng Yao pondered for a moment before responding, \"The Phoenix's Wrath would only be as strong as the flames in the fourth level.\"","'The fourth level only? This place is no joke...' Yuan swallowed nervously.","If the pain he experienced from the Phoenix's Wrath was only as strong as the fourth level, he couldn't imagine how much pain he'd experience in the ninth level.","\"Alright, I'm going in,\" Yuan said a moment later.","\"Don't bite more than you can chew.\" Feng Yao said.","Yuan didn't say anything and jumped inside the entrance, diving straight toward the second floor.","\"Wha—?! I just warned him! And he didn't even consume my blood! Are all humans this reckless?!\" Feng Yao was shocked when Yuan jumped straight to the second level.","As Yuan passed through the first level, a wave of intense heat washed over him, making him feel as though he had stepped into an oven. The air was thick with scorching energy, but to his surprise, it wasn't painful—just overwhelmingly hot, like standing too close to a blazing fire.","The moment Yuan stepped into the second level, the intensity of the heat skyrocketed. It was fierce enough to scorch his skin in an instant, but despite the flames' strength, they couldn't burn him faster than his body could regenerate. His healing abilities kicked in immediately, restoring his skin as quickly as it was damaged, creating a relentless cycle of burning and regeneration.","<Your fire resistance has increased!>","<Your fire resistance has increased!>","<Your fire resistance has increased!>","'This is a great place to temper my body and increase my fire resistance!' Yuan thought, his excitement growing as the flames continued their relentless assault. 'Perhaps I could even achieve fire immunity in this place!'","The burning sensation was excruciating, but it wasn't unbearable. Filled with determination, he sat down and began cultivating on the second level.","\"Wow, he's actually enduring the second level right off the bat. I guess I underestimated him a little.\" Feng Yao mused, her interest piqued.","Not only did the flames temper Yuan's body, but they also contained rich Chaotic Essence that gradually advanced his Chaotic Heart. However, the process was slower than he anticipated.","'It'll take years to finish my Chaotic Heart at this rate. I'll head to the third level once I improve my fire resistance to the next level.'","With that in mind, Yuan continued to temper in the flames.","Sometime later, a figure appeared at the Nine Levels of Hell Peak and landed right beside Feng Yao.","\"Elder Brother Mu.\" Feng Yao greeted this tall and handsome man with a respectful smile.","\"When did you return?\"","\"A few hours ago,\" he responded, his gaze staring intently at Yuan's figure.","Feng Mu was the second youngest in the family, but he was still a billion years older than Feng Yao.","\"I came back immediately after hearing that the eldest has returned. Is that him? The human who brought back the eldest from the human world?\" Feng Mu asked.","\"Yes, he's the one.\"","\"He's less impressive than I anticipated—even disappointing,\" Feng Mu remarked, shaking his head in dissatisfaction. \"I heard he was related to the Primal Monarch, too. Must be a lie.\"","\"No, it's true. The Primal Monarch even showed up to protect him when Mother was about to kill him.\" Feng Yao said.","\"Seriously? How is someone so weak related to the Primal Monarch? I can burn him to ashes with a single breath.\"","Feng Mu quickly lost interest in Yuan and asked about Feng Yuxiang.","\"Have you spoken to the eldest yet? What was she like?\"","\"That's... Haven't you heard? She came back as a 'shell'.\"","\"What?\" Feng Mu immediately became dumbfounded."]},{"number":1645,"title":"Chapter 1645 Fire Immunity","paragraphs":["\"What the hell are you talking about? The eldest came back in such a state?\" Feng Mu almost couldn't believe what he was hearing.","\"Unfortunately. I don't know the situation, but Mother's going to take care of it. In the meantime, I am tasked with helping him complete his Chaotic Heart.\" Feng Yao pointed at Yuan.","Feng Mu shifted his gaze to Yuan again and sneered, \"What a waste of time and effort.\"","\"Is that really the case?\"","\"Huh? Don't tell me you think differently.\"","\"I don't know humans enough to tell if he's talented or not, but he was chosen by the Primal Monarch. I think that says enough.\" Feng Yao shrugged.","At this moment, Yuan suddenly opened his eyes and stood up.","<You have gained Supreme Fire Resistance>","After Yuan's fire resistance reached a new threshold, he wasted no time and immediately descended to the third level. The flames on the third level were no longer the familiar orange hue of the first two levels. Instead, the third level was bathed in intense blue flames, radiating an even more potent and refined heat.","Even with his Supreme Fire Resistance and powerful body, he experienced pain that was several times worse than the second level.","At this point, Yuan's entire figure was completely engulfed by flames, so much so that even his silhouette was no longer visible. The blue flames enveloped him entirely, making it seem as though he had become one with the fire itself. Despite the overwhelming intensity, Yuan remained focused, letting the flames temper his body further and push his limits.","\"Wow, he's actually cultivating in the third level,\" Feng Yao muttered, covering her mouth in surprise, her eyes wide with awe. She had only expected him to reach the second level at most, but in just a few days, he had surpassed her expectations.","Feng Yao turned to look at Yingzi, who had been silently blending in with the background, and spoke to her, \"How long have you been following this human?\"","\"Since the moment he arrived at the Primal Expanse, I guess.\"","\"Why are you following him? I thought Shadow Dwellers are introverts.\" \"I wanted to know what it means to be human.\"","\"Oh? That does sound interesting. What have you learned so far?\" A new voice suddenly interrupted.","Yingzi turned toward the voice and saw a beautiful woman with short red hair and purple eyes hovering gracefully above the Nine Levels of Hell Peak. Her presence was commanding, and the air around her seemed to shimmer with an ethereal glow as she watched the scene below with calm intensity.","\"Elder Sister Liqiu.\" Both Feng Yao and Feng Mu bowed to her in a respectful manner the moment they noticed her presence.","This newcomer was Feng Liqiu, the second eldest in their family.","After snapping out of her daze, Yingzi responded, \"Not much, but from what I've seen, humans are beings that grow exponentially fast.\"","\"From my understanding, human growth varies from person to person.\" Feng Liqui said. \"Although I don't know how he compares with the rest of the humans in his world, he's definitely a lot better than the humans I've encountered in the Primal Expanse.\"","Being the second oldest in the family, Feng Liqui has lived for billions of years in the Primal Expanse, so she has encountered plenty of humans in the past.","\"Have you spoken with Mother yet, Elder Sister Liqui?\" Feng Mu asked.","\"Yes, but it was brief.\"","\"Elder Sister Liqui, you've met the Eldest before, correct? What was she like?\" Feng Yao suddenly asked after recalling Yuan asking her the same question.","\"Elder Sister, huh?\" Feng Liqui closed her eyes and recalled her memories of Feng Yuxiang, which were billions of years old.","\"We never really got along and constantly competed against each other to impress Mother. As for what she was like... I don't remember.\"","\"Anyway, she's probably reincarnated many times by now. I doubt she's the same person I remember.\"","Feng Liqui's gaze returned to looking at Yuan.","\"I'm more interested in this human with the Primal Monarch's bloodline...\" she muttered with a slight smile.","\"What's so interesting about that weakling?\" Feng Mu shook his head, unable to comprehend it.","\"Are you pretending to be stupid, or are you actually stupid?\" Feng Liqiu narrowed her gaze at him.","\"W-what did you say?! Did you just call me stupid?!\" Feng Mu exclaimed, clearly surprised by her sudden mockery.","\"Amongst the thousands of phoenixes in our territory, how many of them are capable of cultivating in the third level? Most of them can't even endure the second level! Yet, this human is able to achieve that with his pitiful cultivation!\" \"T-that's...\" Feng Mu became speechless.","\"A human capable of withstanding Mother's flames... I am very intrigued!\" A profound smile appeared on Feng Liqiu's face as she returned to focusing on Yuan.","\"Hmph. Whatever.\" Feng Mu didn't linger and left the scene shortly after. However, he didn't leave the Eternal Phoenix Domain.","\"Are you going to stay here? Elder Sister?\" Feng Yao asked Feng Liqiu.","\"I don't have anything else to do, so I might as well. I also want to see his limit.\"","\"Huh? You think he'll be able to go higher than the third level? That's impossible! He's already at his limit on the third level!\" Feng Yao refused to believe that he could go any further.","\"Is that what you think? I think he still has some tricks tucked under his sleeves.\"","\"I mean, I did give him a drop of my blood, which he hasn't consumed yet. However, that won't help him in the next level.\"","\"Oh? You gave him your blood? Did Mother tell you to do that?\" Feng Liqiu looked at her with a suspicious smile.","\"No, but don't misunderstand. This is my way of showing gratitude. He brought back the Eldest, after all.\"","Two weeks later, a significant change occurred in the flames surrounding Yuan's body. The once ferocious flames, which had relentlessly burned him, began to shift, their intensity softening as they seemed to merge with his aura. The fire no longer consumed him but appeared to dance in harmony with his energy, as though he had mastered its power and become one with the flames.","<You have acquired Fire Immunity>","<You have acquired the title 'One With the Flames'>"]},{"number":1646,"title":"Chapter 1646 Completed Chaotic Heart","paragraphs":["\"That human! He's achieved fire immunity!\" Feng Yao exclaimed, her expression filled with astonishment. \"I didn't know humans could do that!\"","She had always believed that only beasts with unique bloodlines, like phoenixes, were capable of acquiring such immunity. The fact that a human had done it defied her expectations and understanding.","Even in the Nine Heavens, achieving fire immunity was an exceptionally rare accomplishment. Those who managed it typically relied on special techniques, priceless treasures, and years of dedicated cultivation to reach that level. There were also those born with unique physiques that granted them fire immunity naturally, but that was a different story since they hadn't earned it through effort but were simply born with the gift.","The fact that Yuan had attained this without the aid of a technique made his accomplishment all the more extraordinary.","However...","\"No... this isn't something as simple as fire immunity!\" Feng Liqiu's eyes widened as she came to this realization.","[Fire Immunity]","[Rank: Divine]","[Mastery: Level 1]","[Description: Grants the user immunity to most fire]","<Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has activated>","<Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has begun fusing with Fire Immunity>","<Progress: 1%>","'What? It's fusing with my Fire Immunity?' Yuan raised an eyebrow at this notification. 'Is this similar to how my two physiques fused with each other?'","<Progress: 5%>","<Progress: 9%>","Unlike fusing two physiques together, the progress this time was much quicker.","\"He's absorbing the flames!\" Feng Yao exclaimed when she noticed this. \"Fire Immunity only makes one impervious to most fire, but it doesn't have the ability to absorb flames!\"","Feng Liqiu narrowed her eyes and spoke, her voice calm but filled with passion. \"Fire Immunity may be the end of the journey for most, but for us phoenixes, that is just the beginning.\"","\"Above Fire Immunity lies True Fire Immunity, where one becomes truly immune to all flames,\" Feng Liqiu continued, \"And beyond that is the realm of Fire Harmony. Once one reaches Fire Harmony, not only will they be immune to fire, but they'll also be able to absorb it, transforming flames into their own power—the apex of fire control.\"","\"Are you telling me that a human has managed to achieve Fire Harmony when even I haven't been able to do so?!\" Feng Yao exclaimed, her voice filled with disbelief and frustration. The idea that a mere human could reach a level of mastery that had eluded her was almost inconceivable.","Feng Liqiu shook her head and said, \"No, that can't be possible. He's just achieved Fire Immunity, so it doesn't make sense for him to achieve Fire Harmony so quickly. There must be something else going on inside that weird body of his.\"","Suddenly, Yuan stood up and jumped even deeper into the Nine Levels of Hell, reaching the fourth level.","The fourth level's flames were as powerful as the Phoenix's Wrath, a force Yuan couldn't withstand for more than a few seconds before. However, after achieving Fire Immunity, the once unbearable flames became barely endurable.","<Progress: 51%>","The progress of his physique, which had stalled at 50 percent before Yuan entered the fourth level, began to rise once more.","As for his Chaotic Heart, it was already on the verge of completion.","\"This is something different... It's similar to Fire Harmony, but it's not the same...\" Feng Liqiu mused to herself as she spent more time watching Yuan.","Several hours later, Yuan completed his Chaotic Heart.","<You have completely formed your Chaotic Heart>","Ding!","<Your character status has been updated>","[Yuan]","[Cultivation(Dantian): First Level Spirit Sovereign]","[Cultivation(Chaotic Heart): N/A]","Yuan wasn't surprised to see a second cultivation because Tian Yi also achieved the same thing after returning to the Divine Heavens and cultivating his Dantian.","<Due to having a Chaotic Heart, your Heaven Refining Immortal Physique will no longer refine Chaotic Essence into Qi!>","<You have absorbed Chaotic Essence>","<You have absorbed enough Chaotic Essence for a breakthrough!>","<You have reached Early Chaotic Establishment>","<You have reached Intermediate Chaotic Establishment>","<You have reached Advanced Chaotic Establishment>","<You have reached Perfect Chaotic Establishment>","<You have absorbed enough Chaotic Essence for a breakthrough!>","<You have reached Early Chaotic Adept>","<...>","<You have reached Perfect Chaotic Adept>","<You have reached Early Chaotic Master>","Yuan's second cultivation soared rapidly, experiencing breakthroughs every few minutes. In just a few short hours, Yuan's second cultivation reached Early Chaotic Master, akin to a 9th-level Spirit Enlightenment in human cultivation, surpassing his original cultivation.","\"What am I seeing right now...? I can sense two distinct energies coming from him! Is this what happens when a human forms a Chaotic Heart? I have never seen or heard of anything like this before!\" Feng Yao exclaimed.","Feng Liqiu narrowed her eyes at Yuan and said, \"This isn't my first time seeing a human with a fully formed Chaotic Heart. Do you recall the human who made a mess in our territory several million years ago? However, he didn't have the other energy at that time, so this is also my first time seeing someone with both at once. I wonder how it affects him.\" \"I have heard about him, but that happened before I was born.\" Feng Yao nodded.","\"Now that he's formed his Chaotic Heart, he should be leaving soon.\"","However, Feng Yao would soon realize that Yuan had no intention of leaving so soon. He may have formed his Chaotic Heart, but he still had something else to complete.","'Chaotic Essence is essentially the same as spiritual energy, but it's more chaotic, giving it far greater destructive power,' Yuan thought, recalling Tian Yi's experience. 'Unfortunately, it can't be used with human techniques. However, I can fuse it with my spiritual energy to enhance my techniques and make them more powerful. Or, I can directly enhance my body with it.'","When the fusing progress halted at 70 percent, Yuan looked to the fifth level.","After a moment of stillness, his body suddenly surged with Chaotic Essence. Once he'd strengthened his entire body with Chaotic Essence, Yuan jumped straight to the fifth level, where the flames were bright green and five times more powerful than the fourth level."]},{"number":1647,"title":"Chapter 1647 Fifth Level of Hell","paragraphs":["The instant Yuan entered the fifth level of Nine Levels of Hell, his progress shot up from 70 percent to 80 percent.","However, the pain he was experiencing was excruciating and would break the minds of even the toughest cultivators out there. The Nine Levels of Hell weren't created for humans but for phoenixes, beasts with a natural affinity for fire.","Even a newly born phoenix with the lowest bloodline would have supreme fire resistance, and it wouldn't take long for them to achieve fire immunity.","In fact, even a Golden Immortal would perish inside the fifth level, much less a Spirit Sovereign like Yuan.","\"How much more is this human going to surprise me? Even I, who has almost achieved True Fire Immunity, can barely endure the fifth level's flames!\" Feng Yao exclaimed.","\"...\" Feng Liqiu didn't make any comments and merely watched him in silence.","Yuan remained in the fifth level for a week straight, and his progress reached 89 percent.","Once he realized he wouldn't advance any further, Yuan looked at the sixth level, where purple-colored flames raged.","After a moment of silence, he released a resolute roar before transforming into his dragon form.","\"That's—?!\" Feng Yao and Feng Liqiu were startled by Yuan's transformation.","While they took a moment to comprehend the situation, Yuan dove into the sixth level.","\"This scent... does he have dragon blood flowing through his veins?!\" Feng Yao cried out loud.","\"Does mother know about this?\" Feng Liqiu looked at her with a slight frown.","Dragons were forbidden from entering the Eternal Phoenix Domain. It didn't matter if they were real dragons or only had a single drop of dragon blood in their whole body. Rules were rules, and not a single dragon managed to remain in their territory for more than a day, much less cultivate inside the Nine Levels of Hell Peak, a sacred place for phoenixes.","\"I-I don't know!\" Feng Yao vigorously shook her head. \"I was only told to bring him to this place!\"","Once the nearby phoenixes noticed Yuan's scent, they immediately rushed over to the Nine Levels of Hell Peak, thinking that a dragon had invaded their sanctuary.","\"A dragon?! In the center of the Eternal Phoenix Domain?! Impossible!\"","\"How did a dragon manage to invade so deeply inside our territory without revealing its presence until now?!\"","\"This dragon has a weak presence, but it still doesn't explain how it evaded us until now!\"","\"The scent is coming from the Nine Levels of Hell Peak! Don't tell me they're trying to sabotage our sacred place!\"","Hundreds of phoenixes gathered at the Nine Levels of Hell Peak within minutes, surrounding the place.","Not a single one of them wasn't baffled at the moment of their arrival when they saw the situation.","\"W-what the fuck is going on...? What the fuck am I looking at?!\"","\"Are my eyes deceiving me, or is there a dragon inside the Nine Levels of Hell?! At the sixth level, no less!!!\"","None of the newcomers dared to believe their eyes.","Sometime later, they snapped out of their daze and began shouting at each other.","\"Hey! Someone go fish that dragon bastard out!\"","\"Why don't you do it?!\"","Although nobody there wanted to admit it, none of them could enter the sixth level, much less drag Yuan out.","\"Lady Liqiu! You're the only one here who can endure the flames on the sixth level!\"","Eventually, they all turned to the only individual there who had any hopes of surviving the sixth level.","Feng Liqiu remained silent for a moment before responding to their hopeful gazes, \"Huh? Why should I?\"","Her words instantly shattered their hopes and left them dumbfounded.","\"W-what do you mean, why?! There's a dragon in our territory—inside the Nine Levels of Hell!\"","She shrugged, \"I'm exhausted right now.\"","\"Exhausted? From what?!!\"","\"From rushing back home,\" she explained.","\"...\"","An awkward silence filled the atmosphere.","Suddenly, a loud and authoritative voice resounded, \"What the hell is going on here?!\"","\"Master Mu!\" These phoenixes became hopeful again after seeing Feng Mu's appearance.","These phoenixes pointed to the sixth level of the Nine Levels of Hell without uttering a word.","When Feng Mu followed their gesture and saw Yuan cultivating in the sixth level, his eyes widened with shock and disbelief.","\"The sixth level?! Impossible!\"","He immediately looked at Feng Liqiu and questioned her, \"What did you do to him?\"","He assumed Feng Liqiu was responsible for Yuan's achievements since she was the only one there capable of entering the sixth level.","\"And why the hell does he smell like a dragon? Is Mother aware of this?\"","\"No clue what you're talking about.\" Feng Liqiu casually responded","Feng Mu looked at Yuan and frowned.","\"Whatever. If you're not going to take him out, I will do it myself. I won't allow him to dirty this place with his presence any longer.\"","\"Halt.\"","Right as Feng Mu prepared to dive into the volcano, a calm and clear voice rippled through the air, halting everyone's movement.","The second the phoenixes recognized this voice, they lowered their heads and loudly greeted her.","\"Empress Feng!\"","\"We greet Her Majesty!\"","The Primordial Phoenix emerged from a rift, her figure hovering majestically above the Nine Levels of Hell. Her gaze was fixed intently on Yuan, observing him with a mixture of surprise and curiosity.","\"Nobody is allowed to disturb him. Leave.\"","The phoenixes bowed to her and left the scene without uttering a single word. The only ones who remained were her children.","Once most of the spectators were gone, the Primordial Phoenix created a barrier around the peak that prevented Yuan's scent from spreading.","\"Mother, did you let him enter knowing that he has dragon blood flowing through his veins?\" Feng Mu asked.","\"Yes, I am aware.\"","\"...\"","Once the Primordial Phoenix confirmed this fact, Feng Mu no longer had any say in this matter. He gave Yuan one final glance before disappearing from the scene.","\"I know you're watching this, Primal Monarch.\" The Primordial Phoenix suddenly spoke out loud.","Sure enough, another rift appeared above the volcano, and the Primal Monarch emerged from it.","\"I don't remember the last time I made so many public appearances in such a short time. In fact, this might be a first,\" he spoke as he appeared."]},{"number":1648,"title":"Chapter 1648 Impervious to Fire","paragraphs":["\"Primal Monarch!\" Feng Yao and Feng Liqiu lowered their head after snapping out of their daze.","The Primal Monarch acknowledged them with a slight nod before looking at the Primordial Phoenix and asking, \"So, why did you call for me?\"","The Primordial Phoenix looked at Yuan and spoke, \"You know, I have secretly been to the human world before, and I'd even spent a few thousand years there.\"","\"What? When did you do such a thing? And why?\" Feng Liqiu expressed shock after learning this information for the first time despite being the second eldest.","\"After giving birth to my fourth child, I suddenly had the urge to see how my first child was doing, so I traveled to the human world to satisfy my curiosity. Just going there took several million years of traveling nonstop. I was only able to achieve this because she had the same bloodline as me, and I could sense someone of the same bloodline no matter the distance. If it weren't for that, I wouldn't have been able to find the human world, much less see my child.\"","\"After arriving at the human world and confirming with my eyes that my first child was there, I spent several thousand years exploring the world. During my time there, I studied the humans, learning their customs and whatnot.\"","\"Unfortunately, what stood out the most about humans was their insignificant strength. Even the strongest cultivators back then were laughably weak.\" The Primordial Phoenix recalled her experience in the Divine Heavens long before it was split.","\"No matter how much potential they had, it didn't impress me even in the slightest. That's why I left their world so quickly. It was simply too boring, and I have already reunited with my first child—without her knowledge.\"","\"However, this human cultivating inside my flames right now, he's different, and I want to know if you had anything to do with it, Primal Monarch.\"","The Primal Monarch smiled and said, \"In essence, you want to know if I have anything to do with his abilities, correct?\"","The Primordial Phoenix nodded.","The Primal Monarch looked at Yuan and smiled, \"He may have my bloodline, but what he's displaying right now has nothing to do with it. It's something entirely different.\"","\"I see...\"","\"Why do you even care?\" The Primal Monarch asked.","\"Just curious,\" she responded in a nonchalant manner.","A few days later, Yuan's aura suddenly began to transform.","The Primordial Phoenix and the others watched with anticipation.","<Progress: 99%>","Yuan stared at the progress for several hours straight, hoping it would be completed without needing him to enter the seventh level.","Realizing he needed stronger flames to complete his progress, Yuan turned his gaze toward the seventh level, where black flames roared ominously. These flames exuded a dangerous and oppressive energy, far more intense than anything he had encountered before.","'I will only be able to last a few seconds in the seventh level...'","Even with his godlike physique, fire immunity, and incredible regeneration, Yuan knew he would perish in the seventh level if he stayed longer than a few seconds. The sheer power of the black flames was beyond anything he had faced before, and even this estimate felt like a dangerous gamble. But despite the risk, Yuan was determined to finish the progress.","\"He's looking toward the seventh level... don't tell me he plans on going deeper? Does he have a death wish?\" Feng Yao swallowed nervously.","Feng Liqiu narrowed her eyes, recalling her first time entering the seventh level.","When she first attempted the seventh level, she'd just achieved Fire Harmony, but even that was not enough to withstand the black flames, and she nearly lost her life just entering it.","'If Mother didn't save me at the last second, I would've perished on that day...' Feng Liqiu sighed inwardly.","After preparing himself, Yuan took one last deep breath before jumping into the black flames.","'The flames are much more powerful than I anticipated! I won't last more than a second in this place!' Yuan immediately realized that he'd underestimated the prowess of the black flames, but it was already too late to go back.","More than half of his body was burned away the instant he entered the seventh level. However, at the same time, his progress also advanced.","<Progress: 100%>","<Congratulation, your Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has successfully merged with Fire Immunity>","<Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has evolved to Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique(Incomplete)>","The moment Yuan's physique evolved, the black flames ceased their relentless assault on his body. Instead of burning him, the flames began to restore his body, even strengthening it.","Once his body was fully restored, the flames began filling his Chaotic Heart with Chaotic Essence, causing his cultivation to soar once again.","<You have absorbed Chaotic Essence>","<You have absorbed enough Chaotic Essence for a breakthrough!>","<You have reached Intermediate Chaotic Master>","<You have reached Advanced Chaotic Master>","<You have reached Perfect Chaotic Master>","His cultivation halted at Perfect Chaotic Master, rivaling someone at the peak of Divine Master.","Yuan inspected his body, marveling at the transformation. The black flames, which had once pushed him to the brink of collapse with unbearable pain, now felt soothing and comforting, as if he were basking in the perfect sunlight.","'Am I completely impervious to fire now?' Yuan wondered inwardly.","He turned his gaze toward the eighth level, where beautiful white flames raged with an ethereal intensity. Strangely, despite their brilliance and power, he couldn't sense any threat from them. It was as though the flames no longer held the capacity to harm him. \"W-what just happened?! His body was on the verge of destruction just seconds ago! Now it seems as if the flames don't even affect him!\" Feng Liqiu exclaimed, her voice filled with shock and disbelief.","\"Not only is he unaffected by it, he's absorbing the flames and turning them into his own strength...\" The Primordial Phoenix muttered, her eyes narrowing as she observed Yuan with a thoughtful expression."]},{"number":1649,"title":"Chapter 1649 Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique","paragraphs":["\"Turning the flames into his own strength... that is a realm above Fire Harmony...\" Feng Liqiu muttered in a dazed voice.","While the phoenixes remained stunned by Yuan's remarkable achievements, he decided to push the boundaries of his newfound power. Without hesitation, he leaped straight into the eighth level, where the brilliant white flames roared fiercely.","'Sure enough, I don't feel any difference... no... this is even more comfortable than the black flames!' Yuan thought, closing his eyes as the white flames enveloped him.","\"This is... outrageous...\" Feng Liqiu muttered, her body trembling as she stared at Yuan's figure. The white flames, powerful enough to seriously injure even her—despite having pushed her Fire Harmony to its limits—seemed to have no effect on him. Just days ago, he had struggled on the second level, yet now, this mere human was enduring the flames of the eighth level with ease. The sight left her speechless and shaken.","\"I don't get it.\" The Primordial Phoenix suddenly muttered out loud.","\"Even if he has the ability to absorb my flames, there should be a limit to how much he could absorb without blowing up. His cultivation isn't increasing, and I refuse to believe that his single Chaotic Heart could contain so much Chaotic Essence! Where are all of the Chaotic Essence going?\"","The Primordial Phoenix's question was a valid one. Just like a cup, no vessel—no matter how powerful—could hold an infinite amount. If one kept pouring water into a cup, it would eventually overflow. Similarly, there had to be a limit to how much power Yuan could absorb before reaching a breaking point. Yet, this breaking point was nowhere to be seen with Yuan.","Sure enough, Yuan's Chaotic Heart could not contain an infinite amount of Chaotic Essence, and once it was completely filled to the brim, the Chaotic Essence was sent elsewhere.","<Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has activated>","<You have learned 'Primordial Fire'>","[Primordial Fire]","[Rank: Celestial]","[Mastery Level: 1]","[Description: The highest level of fire mastery, attainable only by a few bloodlines. Primordial Fire transcends all other flames, bypassing even the strongest fire resistance and immunity. It is the ultimate expression of fire, a flame unrivaled in destructive capability and feared by even phoenixes.]","'So I can turn the flames I absorbed into my own power...' Yuan swallowed nervously at the implications.","'If I can merge my physique with the fire immunity, I should be able to do the same with other immunities. Perhaps that's how I complete my new physique...'","Sometime later, Yuan turned his gaze to the ninth and final level of the Nine Levels of Hell. Unlike the previous eight levels, there were no visible flames in the ninth. However, despite the absence of fire, Yuan could clearly sense something powerful and ominous lingering within.","'It looks like I am not completely impervious to all fire yet...' Yuan sighed inwardly. Though he had endured the eighth level without any issues, he could instinctively sense that the ninth level was different—deadly, even for him. 'I guess it's about time I leave this place.'","In just a few days, he'd completed his Chaotic Heart, gained fire immunity, evolved his physique, and even acquired a Celestial-rank skill.","Feeling satisfied by the results, Yuan left the Nine Levels of Hell.","The moment Yuan emerged from the volcano, he instinctively sensed something hurtling toward him. Turning around, his eyes widened as he spotted a massive ball of black flames flying directly at him.","Yuan instinctively raised his arm, opening his palm to block the incoming flames with his bare hand. The moment the massive ball of flames made contact with his palm, it was absorbed instantly. The flames, which were strong enough to kill even immortals, vanished into his hand, leaving Yuan unscathed. \"What was that about?\" Yuan looked at the Primordial Phoenix, who was responsible for the surprise attack.","\"I wanted to confirm your abilities.\"","\"What if that had killed me?\"","\"But it didn't.\"","\"Unbelievable...\"","\"Why are you complaining? You should be thanking me for letting you use the Nine Levels of Hell.\"","\"I would've if you didn't send me here because of your pettiness.\" Yuan shrugged.","\"I have no clue what you're talking about.\" The Primordial Phoenix shook her head.","\"Whatever. I'm going to head to the Divine Dragon Sanctuary now that I have completed my Chaotic Heart.\" \"W-wait a minute!\" Feng Liqiu suddenly spoke up.","\"Hm? Who are you?\" Yuan asked.","\"I'm Feng Liqiu, the second eldest in the family.\"","\"Oh, hello. Do you need something from me?\"","\"Can you tell me how you are absorbing the flames?\"","\"It's mostly thanks to my unique physique, that's all.\"","\"Were you born with that physique?\"","\"Yes.\"","Feng Liqiu suddenly became silent with a ponderous expression on her face.","\"If there's nothing else—\"","\"Wait, I have one more thing—a request.\"","\"What kind?\"","Feng Liqiu narrowed her eyes and spoke, \"Give me some of your blood and Chaotic Essence.\"","\"What?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow, unable to comprehend her request at first.","However, Feng Yao and the Primordial Phoenix reacted with shock, their eyes wide in disbelief. The request clearly struck them, while the Primal Monarch, observing the scene, wore a slight smile, as if amused.","\"Hm? Wait a second...\" Yuan suddenly had a sense of Deja Vu.","Then, he recalled a certain conversation he had with Lan Yingying.","He swallowed nervously before asking, \"That request... you want to conceive with my energy?\" She nodded without hesitation.","\"What the hell are you thinking?\" The Primordial Phoenix suddenly interjected.","\"I have been wanting a child for a while now, and I think this is the perfect time.\"","\"But with a human...? I have never heard of anything like that before! Is that even possible?\"","\"I guess we'll find out soon enough!\" Feng Liqiu smiled.","\"Ahem.\" Yuan cleared his throat and said, \"It's definitely possible for beasts to conceive with humans since it's been done before in my world, but I have no intention of doing something like that with someone I don't know.\"","\"But I already told you who I am.\" Feng Liqiu said.","\"You know what I mean...\" Yuan shook his head."]},{"number":1650,"title":"Chapter 1650 Divine Dragon Sanctuary","paragraphs":["\"Honestly, I don't really understand.\" Feng Liqiu shook her head, and she continued, \"Most would be delighted, even honored, if I requested for their Chaotic Essence to conceive my child. Excluding dragons, I cannot imagine anyone refusing.\"","Feng Liqiu's status as the daughter of the Primordial Phoenix alone granted her immense prestige in the Primal Expanse. Her lineage was revered, making her among the most respected in the realm, with many viewing her as nearly untouchable.","Moreover, she was a powerhouse in her own right, standing as one of the strongest Predators in the Primal Expanse. In the entire Eternal Phoenix Domain, her strength was second only to her mother, the Primordial Phoenix. Countless powerful beings had willingly offered their Chaotic Essence to Feng Liqiu over the years without her even needing to ask them, but not a single one of them managed to receive her approval.","Just as human men court women out of love, in the Primal Expanse, beings offer their Chaotic Essence to those they admire to express their desire for a deeper bond and in hopes of conceiving a child with them.","\"If I'm going to conceive a child with someone, I'd at least want to get to know them first,\" Yuan said.","\"Is that a human thing?\" Feng Liqiu asked.","\"I guess.\"","Hearing this, she no longer continued the topic, but she didn't appear to have given up yet.","\"Can you bring me to the Divine Dragon Sanctuary?\" Yuan looked at the Primal Monarch.","\"Do you have a plan to acquire the treasure from them yet?\" The Primordial Phoenix suddenly asked.","He shook his head, \"No, I don't. I'll figure it out as things progress.\"","The Primal Monarch didn't ask any questions and created a rift that directly led to the Divine Dragon Sanctuary for him.","\"The rift will bring you to a place two days away from the Divine Dragon Sanctuary.\"","\"Okay.\" Yuan looked at Yingzi and asked, \"Want to come along?\"","She immediately nodded. With the Primordial Phoenix and the Primal Monarch's presence there, the atmosphere was a little too suffocating for someone like her.","\"Then I'll see you again once I acquire the treasure.\" Yuan entered the rift the next moment, followed by Yingzi.","The Primal Monarch left shortly after Yuan left, disappearing into thin air.","\"Sister, were you serious just now?\" Feng Yao looked at Feng Liqiu and asked.","\"Of course.\"","\"But why...?\"","\"I am curious,\" she said with a smile. \"What kind of child would be born from a phoenix and a human like him? I want to find out.\"","\"What do you think, Mother?\" Feng Liqiu looked at the Primordial Phoenix to get her opinion on the matter.","\"I think that's a ridiculous reason to conceive your first child with a human.\" The Primordial Phoenix shook her head, but she didn't reject the idea for some reason.","Feng Liqiu noticed this and chuckled, \"So you're also curious, huh? Now I wonder what would happen if a Primordial Phoenix like Mother conceived with a human.\"","Hearing this, the Primordial Phoenix smacked Feng Liqiu in the back of the head and sneered, \"Don't get ahead of yourself.\"","After emerging from the rift, Yingzi guided Yuan toward the Divine Dragon Sanctuary. Even before they began their journey, Yuan's eyes were drawn to a towering, pillar-like structure in the distance. The massive tower seemed to stretch endlessly into the heavens, dominating the horizon with its grandeur and presence.","\"That must be the Dragon Ascending Mountain. I wanted to visit this place before, but it was too far away.\" Yuan recalled his experience as Tian Yi.","Starting from the Eternal Phoenix Domain, the Divine Dragon Sanctuary was located on the far opposite side of the Primal Expanse. Without special treasures, the journey would take an unfathomable amount of time. Even with such treasures, it would have taken Tian Yi over a hundred years to reach the Divine Dragon Sanctuary on his own, which was why he had chosen to ignore it in the past.","\"Do you know anything about the Divine Dragon Sanctuary?\" Yuan asked Yingzi as they traveled.","\"I have never been to this part of the Primal Expanse, but the Divine Dragon Sanctuary is one of the most famous territories in this world.\"","\"Although it has 'Dragon' in its name and many dragons gather there, other races are also allowed to stay in the Divine Dragon Sanctuary,\" Yingzi continued. \"It's quite populated and diverse, unlike the Eternal Phoenix Domain, which is more exclusive.\"","\"Is that so...\"","Over the next two days, Yuan pondered how he should go about acquiring the Sacred Chalice of Purification. Unfortunately, with so little information on the Divine Dragon Sanctuary, formulating any reliable plans was pretty much impossible.","In the end, Yuan decided to join the Divine Dragon Sanctuary to learn more about them first before planinng anything.","Two days later, Yuan and Yingzi arrived at the Divine Dragon Sanctuary. Unlike the Eternal Phoenix Domain, where entry was closely guarded, no one approached or attempted to stop them from entering the territory. In fact, Yuan noticed a constant flow of other presences arriving at the territory at the same time, giving the place a more open and welcoming atmosphere. However, Yuan didn't know where to start.","In order to become affiliated with a territory, one typically required the approval of the territory's master. However, the Divine Dragon Sanctuary, being one of the largest and most powerful territories in the Primal Expanse, operated differently. It was impractical for one of the strongest beings in the world to handle such insignificant matters, so a dedicated group of individuals was appointed specifically for this purpose.","\"Yingzi, can you sense any dragons nearby?\" Yuan asked her.","\"I sense a few, but none of them have the scent of a true dragon. They probably belong to an inferior bloodline.\"","\"Can you bring us to the one who seems to be the most reliable?\"","\"How can I tell if they're reliable?\"","\"Uhh... forget it. Just bring us to the closest one.\"","\"Okay.\"","Sometime later, Yuan and Yingzi approached a tall man with striking blue hair. The moment he sensed Yuan's scent and powerful aura, the man's eyes widened in surprise and awe.","\"W-who are you?\""]},{"number":1651,"title":"Chapter 1651 Dragon God Festival","paragraphs":["\"I am Yuan, and I traveled half the world just to come to the Divine Dragon Sanctuary.\" Yuan introduced himself.","The blue-haired man swallowed nervously. He could tell just from Yuan's scent alone that he was in the presence of a true dragon with a powerful bloodline.","\"I cannot imagine the effort and time it took you to come here, but I would like to welcome you on behalf of the Divine Dragon Council.\" The man said.","\"It wasn't too bad.\" Yuan smiled. \"Anyway, I came here because—\"","Before Yuan could finish his sentence, the man interrupted, \"The Dragon God Festival, correct?\" \"The what?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow after hearing this unfamiliar name.","\"The Dragon God Festival,\" he repeated before asking, \"You didn't come here for the festival? Pretty much every single visitor these days are here for the festival.\"","\"Sorry, but I came here to visit the Divine Dragon Sanctuary because of its widespread fame,\" Yuan shook his head.","\"Please, there's no need for you to apologize. I should be the one apologizing for making such assumptions in the first place. If you have any questions, don't hesitate to ask me.\"","\"In that case, can you tell me more about this Dragon God Festival?\"","The man nodded.","\"The Dragon God Festival is a tradition in the Divine Dragon Sanctuary that happens only once every twenty-five million years. During the festival, the participants compete against each other for the title of Dragon God Successor. Naturally, since this is related to the dragon race, only dragons are allowed to participate. However, there's some leniency. Even those with inferior or incomplete dragon blood are permitted to join.\"","\"Every 25 million years...?\" Yuan wore a dumbfounded expression on his face after hearing this information.","He then asked, \"What kind of competitions occur during the festival?\"","\"I'm sorry, but I don't know,\" the blue-haired man replied, shaking his head. \"The trials are decided by the Dragon God, and they change with every festival. We only learn the details of the trials when the festival is about to begin.\" \"When does the festival begin?\"","\"Exactly two years from now, so very soon.\"","\"...\" Yuan was speechless.","'Since the festival takes place every 25 million years, I guess two years is nothing in their eyes...' he sighed inwardly.","\"Is there anything to be gained from this festival?\" Yuan asked a moment later.","\"Of course! Not only will you become the Dragon God's Successor if you win the festival, but the Dragon God will even grant you any one wish!\" The man replied, his voice filled with excitement.","\"Any wish...?\" Yuan repeated as he mused to himself.","The man nodded, \"That's right. The Dragon God is one of the most powerful beings in the Primal Expanse. He can fulfill almost any wish.\"","'I must be fated to participate in this festival...' Yuan sighed inwardly.","If he won the festival, he could wish for the Sacred Chalice of Purification.","\"Can I participate in the festival?\" he asked a moment later.","\"Of course. As long as you are related to the dragon race, you can sign up for the festival.\"","\"Are there any other requirements? For example, do I have to be affiliated with the Divine Dragon Sanctuary?\"","\"No, the festival is open to everyone as long as they meet the requirements.\"","\"That's great. Where do I sign up?\"","The man pointed to the Dragon Ascending Mountain and said, \"Do you see that tower? You can sign up there.\" \"Thank you very much.\" Yuan and Yingzi made their way to the tower shortly after.","'Now that I've decided to participate in the festival, I have to wait two years for it to begin...'","Yuan pondered what he should do in the meantime while they approached the Dragon Ascending Mountain.","Sometime later, Yuan and Yingzi reached Dragon Ascending Mountain, but by the time they got there, tens of thousands of beings were already lined up.","Once they joined the queue, Yuan took a moment to inspect the towering structure ahead. The Dragon Ascending Mountain was, in reality, just an incredibly tall pillar stretching into the sky. There was an entrance at the base of the tower, but Yuan couldn't quite imagine what lay inside or what purpose it served. He tried looking inside using his divine sense, but an invisible force prevented him from peeking inside.","\"Hey.\" Amid his thoughts, Yuan suddenly felt someone tugging at his clothes.","\"Hm?\"","He turned to look at Yingzi, who was staring at him.","\"I want to eat the rest of my meat skewers,\" she said.","\"Alright.\"","Yuan pulled out a handful of meat skewers and handed them to Yingzi. The rich, savory scent of the skewers immediately filled the air, catching the attention of everyone in line and even those nearby. Heads turned, and whispers spread as the aroma quickly became the center of attention.","\"What is that smell? My mouth became watery after a single whiff!\" \"It's coming from the back of the queue!\"","\"Look at those meat on sticks in that little girl's hands! What kind of meat is that?! I've never smelled anything so delicious before!\" someone exclaimed, their voice filled with astonishment.","The crowd murmured in agreement, their eyes fixed on the food in Yingzi's grasp.","\"Hey! What the fuck are you trying to pull here?!\"","An irritated voice suddenly roared, cutting through the chatter. Yuan shifted his gaze to the man standing directly in front of them in the queue. The man's expression was tense, clearly agitated by something, and his eyes flicked toward Yuan and Yingzi with clear frustration.","\"What do you mean?\" Yuan calmly inquired.","\"You know what I mean! Why would you pull out something like that without considering your place and situation?! Or are you trying to start something on purpose?!\"","\"It's just food,\" Yuan said with a seemingly innocent expression on his face.","\"Well, it's causing a commotion! Unless you share it with the rest of us, get it out of our faces!\"","\"What kind of logic is that? I don't see why we need to share it with you.\" Yuan shook his head and said, \"You're the one causing a commotion here. Anyway, if it bothers you that much, feel free to take the meat skewers away from her. I won't stop you.\""]},{"number":1652,"title":"Chapter 1652 Dragon Princess Meihui","paragraphs":["The man glanced at Yingzi, only to be met with a fierce, piercing glare that sent chills through his entire body. Instinctively, he knew that if he dared to make a move for the meat skewers in her hands, it would lead to a swift and terrible demise. 'Her lack of presence... is she a Shadow Dweller?' The onlookers pondered Yingzi's identity.","After chewing and swallowing the meat in her mouth, Yingzi spoke out loud, \"I'm willing to exchange my food.\"","\"Really?\" The man was pleasantly surprised, and his opinions of Shadow Dwellers slightly improved.","However, Yingzi continued, \"In exchange for one skewer, I will have your life.\"","\"...\"","Not just the man before her but even Yuan and the other onlookers reacted with bafflement.","\"Y-you crazy little bitch! I'm gonna fucking kill you!\" The man roared with an enraged face, and his aura surged with bloodlust. However, right as the man raised his hand, another voice boomed.","\"What is going on here?! Who dares to cause a commotion right before the Dragon God Festival?! I'll disqualify you on the spot!\"","Everyone there turned to look at the approaching figure. She was a tall beauty with a strict face and an authoritative air around her.","\"Dragon Princess Meihui!\"","The people there lowered their heads when they recognized her identity.","Yuan looked at her with interest.","'In terms of prowess, she seems to be on par with Feng Liqiu.'","\"So, what is the problem here?\" Dragon Princess Meihui glared at Yuan and the man who exuded bloodlust with a deep frown on her face.","However, if one looked closely, one would see her eyes glancing at the meat skewers in Yingzi's grasp every few seconds.","Dragon Princess Meihui would never admit it, but she couldn't care less about their insignificant drama. What prompted her to show up in the first place was in Yingzi's grasp.","\"Dragon Princess, we were quietly waiting in line when this unreasonable fellow in front of us suddenly became aggressive.\" Yuan was the first to speak up, and he directly placed all blame on the man.","\"D-don't give me that bullshit! You were the ones who provoked us with your food!\" The man hastily refuted.","Yuan shook his head and said, \"How did we provoke you with our food? I don't recall dangling them in front of your nose and provoking you. Or were you so enticed by the scent that you became offended?\"","\"Either way, my friend was minding her business when you started yapping about sharing our food without providing any logical reason, and then you got angry when she refused.\"","Yuan turned to look at the Dragon Princess with an apologetic smile, \"Although it wasn't our intention, it is true that our food was the main cause for the commotion. I hope you can forgive us.\"","Before the Dragon Princess could even open her mouth to respond, Yuan retrieved a handful of meat skewers and shoved them toward her.","\"Please accept our apology.\"","Silence filled the atmosphere while the onlookers were shocked by the implications behind Yuan's actions.","'That bastard has the audacity to bribe the Dragon Princess so openly?!'","The Dragon Princess stared at the meat skewers with a somewhat dazed face.","When she snapped out of it a moment later, she cleared her throat and spoke, \"Is that so? Don't worry about it. Since eating here is not a crime, you are not responsible for what happened.\"","She turned to look at the man with narrowed eyes and continued, \"I will only give you a warning. If you continue to make a scene, I will disqualify you from the festival.\"","\"I understand! I will not disappoint the Princess a second time!\" The man didn't dare to argue back and responded with his head lowered.","\"Then I will take my leave.\"","Just as the Dragon Princess turned to leave, Yuan spoke again, his tone calm but firm. \"You haven't accepted my apology yet, Princess.\"","He was referring to the meat skewers that were still in his grasp.","The Dragon Princess instantly halted her movements, but her eyebrows were twitching.","\"If you really don't want it, I'll take them back—\"","As Yuan began pulling his arms back, she turned back to Yuan and swiftly accepted the meat skewers.","\"If you insist, I will accept it,\" she said in a somewhat bashful voice.","After accepting the skewers, the Dragon Princess wasted no time and immediately took a bite. The moment the flavors hit her tongue, her eyes widened in surprise and delight, clearly caught off guard by how delicious the food was.","\"Oh my, this is so delicious! What kind of meat is this?\" The Dragon Princess inquired after swallowing.","\"Chicken.\"","\"What is that?\"","The Dragon Princess raised an eyebrow in puzzlement as she moved on to the next skewer.","\"It's a kind of bird.\"","\"Like phoenixes?\"","\"No, but I guess they're pretty similar.\"","\"I have eaten phoenixes before, but they don't taste anything like this.\" The Dragon Princess shook her head.","Before she realized it, the Dragon Princess had finished all the meat skewers, and a wave of disappointment washed over her. She hadn't expected to enjoy them so much, and now that they were gone, she found herself wishing for more. Her expression softened slightly, though she tried to maintain her composure.","She turned to look at Yingzi, who was slowly enjoying the skewers, and sighed inwardly, 'I should've slowly savored every bite, but alas...'","Then she shifted her gaze to Yuan's handsome face.","After a moment of silence, she cleared her throat and said, \"Thank you for the food. It was amazing. Can I get your name?\"","\"I am Yuan.\"","\"Then, Yuan, I'll give you this as a thank you.\"","She suddenly gestured toward the people working at the front of the line. Noticing her signal, one of them quickly rushed over, holding a small token in his hands.","\"This token verifies that you are a participant in the Dragon God Festival,\" Dragon Princess Meihui grabbed the token and handed it to Yuan, \"With this, you won't need to wait in line anymore.\"","Yuan gladly accepted the token.","\"Thank you!\""]},{"number":1653,"title":"Chapter 1653 Divine Dragon Council","paragraphs":["\"Then I'll be on my way now.\"","After Yuan had been given the token, Dragon Princess Meihui quickly left the scene.","There were two major reasons why Dragon Princess Meihui gave Yuan the token, allowing him to skip the assessment entirely. The first reason was simple: she could tell by Yuan's dragon scent that he was more than qualified to participate, making the assessment process unnecessary and a waste of time.","The second reason was because of the meat skewers. If the others in line were forced to endure the enticing aroma for too long, it would likely lead to another commotion. By allowing Yuan to leave early, they would avoid any further disruptions caused by the irresistible scent of the skewers.","With the token in his grasp, Yuan and Yingzi left the scene, disappearing into the distance.","\"I guess I don't need to worry about being affiliated with the Divine Dragon Sanctuary for now.\" Yuan tossed the token into his spatial ring.","\"What are you going to do for the next two years?\" Yingzi asked him.","\"Hmm...\"","Yuan pondered for several minutes before responding, \"If the Divine Dragon Sanctuary is as powerful as the Eternal Phoenix Domain, they should have training areas like the Nine Levels of Hell, right? I should take this time to strengthen myself further and prepare for the festival.\"","\"But will they allow someone who isn't affiliated with their territory to use these training spots?\" Yingzi mused.","\"Let's go ask that blue-haired dragon.\"","Yingzi and Yuan made their way back to the blue-haired dragon, who'd barely moved from his spot since they left.","\"Hm? You're back already? Did something happen?\" The blue-haired man asked them with a puzzled face since it'd been less than two hours since they left.","Yuan shook his head and explained, \"No, I have the participation token in my possession. I returned because I have some more questions.\"","\"Already? That place is usually crowded, and it normally takes several weeks to acquire a token unless you skipped the queue,\" the man remarked, his expression filled with surprise.","\"One thing led to another, and I somehow managed to skip the line.\" Yuan smiled.","\"So something did happen...\"","\"By the way, why are you still here?\"","\"Oh, I am something like a guide. It's my job to assist visitors like you. There are many first-time visitors because of the Dragon God Festival, after all.\"","\"I see...\"","\"Anyway, you have some questions, right? I'll try my best to answer them.\"","\"I'm looking for something to do while I wait for the Dragon God Festival. Are there any training areas available in the Divine Dragon Sanctuary?\" Yuan asked.","\"Training grounds, huh? There are several, but they are only accessible by those affiliated with the Divine Dragon Sanctuary.\"","\"How does one become affiliated?\"","\"You must visit the Divine Dragon Council and pass several assessments. Once you become an affiliate, you will essentially become part of the Divine Dragon Sanctuary's prowess. For example, if our territory is ever threatened, you are obligated to aid us.\"","\"Can I ask about the assessments? What do they ask for?\"","\"The Divine Dragon Council will ask about your background to determine whether you are qualified to become an affiliate.\"","\"So there's a chance I won't qualify, huh?\"","\"Yes, but I have no reason to believe why you wouldn't qualify. In fact, you're pretty much guaranteed to qualify because you belong to the dragon race.\"","\"I see. Where is the Divine Dragon Council?\" In response to Yuan's question, the blue-haired man retrieved a white stone and said, \"This will bring you directly to the Divine Dragon Council.\"","\"This...?\" Yuan accepted the white stone and inspected it with interest.","\"You've never seen a teleport stone before?\" The man inquired, sounding somewhat surprised.","\"Uhh, no. They don't exist where I am from.\"","\"I guess that's not too surprising since they're unique within the Divine Dragon Sancutary. These teleport stones are created by the Void Dragon, who has the ability to teleport. If you shatter that stone, you will create a rift that will directly bring you to the Divine Dragon Council.\"","Sometime later, Yuan shattered the teleport stone, releasing the energy stored within. The energy surged out, swirling in the air before forming a rift in front of him.","\"The rift will disappear after ten seconds.\" The man quickly warned him.","\"Thanks for your help again.\" Yuan said to him before jumping into the rift, followed by Yingzi.","Upon emerging from the rift, Yuan found himself standing before a majestic pagoda, its intricate design far surpassing the one he had seen at Phoenix Ascendancy Plateau. The towering structure was adorned with elaborate carvings and shimmering details, exuding an air of ancient power and significance. Its grandeur made it clear that this was a place of great importance.","Just like the Dragon Ascending Mountain, there was a huge line waiting to go inside the pagoda.","'Fortunately, the line isn't as long... Moreover, it's moving much faster,' Yuan thought to himself as he entered the back of the line.","As they waited in line, Yuan listened to the conversations around them. \"Hopefully I qualify as a Divine Dragon Warrior. That would make life much easier in the Divine Dragon Sanctuary.\"","\"Unless you are a dragon or have a Master-level bloodline, it's near impossible to become a Divine Dragon Warrior.\"","\"I'll be satisfied with just being affiliated with the Divine Dragon Sanctuary since having a higher rank also means having more responsibility.\"","\"So what if I have more responsibility? Only Divine Dragon Warriors are allowed to use their training grounds, and that is my sole reason for coming here!\"","After overhearing the nearby conversation, Yuan began to wonder if being affiliated with the Divine Dragon Sanctuary was similar to joining a faction in the Nine Heavens since there appeared to be ranks amongst those affiliated.","'I need to become at least a Divine Dragon Warrior to use their training grounds, huh?' Yuan mused inwardly.","Sometime later, he looked at Yingzi and asked, \"Are you also going to become an affiliate?\""]},{"number":1654,"title":"Chapter 1654 Divine Dragon Council(2)","paragraphs":["\"I don't really have a reason to join the Divine Dragon Sanctuary.\" Yingzi shook her head.","Most people join the Divine Dragon Sanctuary for one of two reasons. Some sought access to the powerful training grounds available within the territory, hoping to grow stronger. Others join to use the Divine Dragon Sanctuary's prestigious name as a shield, gaining protection and influence under its banner. \"I do not care about their training grounds, and I don't need their protection, so I don't really benefit from joining them. However, if you were to remain in the Primal Expanse forever, I wouldn't mind joining them with you.\"","Yuan smiled at her words and said, \"Unfortunately, I must return to my home soon.\"","\"I know. That's why I won't join them. Also, I am what most consider free-spirited. I don't wish to be constrained by their rules. It won't matter to you who will be leaving soon, but it's a big deal for those living in the Primal Expanse.\"","\"I see...\"","After a moment of silence, Yuan spoke again, \"This just crossed my mind, but do Shadow Dwellers also have their own territory?\"","She nodded, \"We do. It's a small and remote territory somewhere in the Hollowed Expanse, where sunlight doesn't exist.\"","Yuan's eyes widened at this information, and he said, \"I know of the Hollowed Expanse! But I never got the chance to see it for myself for the same reasons I didn't visit the Divine Dragon Sanctuary.\"","The Primal Expanse was composed of many smaller regions, each with its own distinct environment, power structures, and unique inhabitants. These regions varied greatly, from fiery domains to shadowy realms,","One such region was the Hollowed Expanse, a world shrouded in eternal darkness, where no sunlight ever touched the land. The creatures and powers that thrived there were adapted to the shadows, such as the Shadow Dwellers.","Since Shadow Dwellers are born from shadows, most of them originated from the Hollowed Expanse. In this realm of eternal darkness, the lack of sunlight and the pervasive gloom created the perfect conditions for these beings to come into existence. \"What kind of place is the Hallowed Expanse?\" Yuan asked a moment later.","Yingzi recalled her memories of the Hollowed Expanse and said, \"It's a gloomy place, with hardly any living trees and plants. The land is mostly sand and dirt, and not many Primals venture there. If we want food, we have to leave the region.\" Based on Yingzi's description, Yuan imagined the Hollowed Expanse as a vast desert, barren and desolate, where it was always nighttime.","\"That's why I left the Hallowed Expanse in the first place, even if it means weakening myself,\" Yingzi continued.","Since shadow and darkness were the sources of Shadow Dwellers' power, they preferred to stay in the darkest places, where their abilities were at their peak. For Yingzi, leaving the Hollowed Expanse, the darkest place in the Primal Expanse, significantly weakened her. The line moved quickly as they chatted, and before Yuan realized it, they had reached the front, now standing directly in front of the towering pagoda. Whenever someone exited the pagoda, it was immediately clear whether they had succeeded or not. Those who had a badge pinned to their chest wore expressions of pride or relief, while those without a badge left empty-handed, often looking disappointed or frustrated. Eventually, it was Yuan's turn.","Noticing the woman standing by the entrance beckoning toward him, Yuan stepped forward and approached the pagoda.","\"You can wait for me out here,\" Yuan said to Yingzi as he left.","Sometime later, Yuan entered the first floor of the pagoda. The interior was modestly decorated, with minimal furnishings. At the far end of the room, a young man sat behind a desk, his posture relaxed.","When the young man noticed Yuan's scent, he raised an eyebrow and asked in a surprised tone, \"What dragon bloodline do you have?\"","'My dragon bloodline...?' Yuan swallowed nervously. Fortunately, he'd prepared for this question.","\"I'm an Azure Dragon.\"","When Yuan considered his identity as a dragon, his first thought was to claim he hailed from the Xi Family's heritage. However, he quickly realized that he had never actually learned the name of their bloodline. In the end, he used the Azure Dragon's name. \"An Azure Dragon? That can't be right,\" the young man replied, his brow furrowing in doubt. \"I can tell by your scent alone that you come from a much more prestigious bloodline. Are you trying to hide your identity? Why? If you want to become affiliated with our Divine Dragon Sanctuary, you must tell us the truth. We don't accept those with ulterior motives.\"","'I didn't think he would see through me so easily...' Yuan sighed inwardly.","He responded a moment later, \"Actually, I don't know my race. I was abandoned when I was young, and the ones who accepted and raised me were Azure Dragons.\"","The young man narrowed his gaze at Yuan.","\"Where are you from?\"","\"I'm from a remote and insignificant territory located on the other side of the Primal Expanse,\" Yuan revealed, his tone calm and sincere.","\"What is your reason for wanting to join our Divine Dragon Sanctuary?\"","\"My parents have always spoken highly of the Divine Dragon Sanctuary even though they've never been here,\" Yuan swiftly responded. \"They also recommended that I come here once they are no longer in this world.\"","'What a load of bullshit...' the young man sneered inwardly at Yuan's excuses.","However, even though he knew that Yuan wasn't being truthful, he couldn't ignore Yuan's powerful bloodline.","'I don't know what he's planning, but we can figure out his true identity through the assessment.'","Sometime later, the young man smiled at Yuan and said, \"Alright, you pass. Moreover, I believe you have the potential to become someone greater than a Divine Dragon Warrior, so I'm going to give you a chance.\"","\"Head to the second floor and take the assessment there. If you pass, you'll become a Divine Dragon Commander instead of a mere Divine Dragon Warrior. Be proud. You're only the fourth to be sent to the second floor in the last thousand years.\"","Join Privilege for VIP Chaps!"]},{"number":1655,"title":"Chapter 1655 Divine Dragon Council(3)","paragraphs":["'Huh? That's it?' Yuan thought, surprised by how easy the process had been. He had expected the assessment to be much more difficult and strict, but in reality, it had turned out to be far simpler than he had anticipated.","\"Then I'll head to the second floor now.\" Yuan gave the young man a slight bow before approaching the spiraling staircase by the wall.","Several moments later, Yuan stepped onto the second floor. The layout and decorations were almost identical to those on the first floor. At the other end of the room, a middle-aged man was slumped over a desk, seemingly asleep. His posture was relaxed, and his soft, rhythmic breathing filled the otherwise quiet room.","Yuan didn't say anything and approached the desk.","Suddenly, without opening his eyes, the middle-aged man spoke, \"It's been two hundred years since someone was sent up here.\"","A moment later, the man slowly opened his eyes and sat up, his calm gaze immediately locking onto Yuan. \"Hmm. I see why you were sent up here. You have a strong bloodline.\"","\"Thank you.\"","The middle-aged man then spoke, \"In order to qualify as a Divine Dragon Commander, you must demonstrate a certain level of prowess, and your bloodline must be at least Commander quality.\" In the Primal Expanse, bloodlines are ranked in the following order: Primal, Master, Commander, Emperor, and Monarch. Each rank signifies a major increase in potential and influence. Monarch-quality bloodlines sit at the very pinnacle, and only supreme beings like the Dragon God, Primordial Phoenix, and Primal Monarch possess such powerful bloodlines. The middle-aged man retrieved a finger-sized needle and tossed it to Yuan.","\"Feed it your blood,\" he instructed.","Yuan didn't act right away. Instead, he stared at the needle in silence for a moment, as there was a good chance this would expose his identity.","The next moment, Yuan pricked his finger with the needle, and it immediately absorbed his blood.","09:54","\"What are you thinking so deeply about?\" The middle-aged man suddenly inquired when he noticed Yuan's hesitancy.","\"Nothing important. It's just that I've never seen anything like this before and was wondering what it does.\" Yuan said with an innocent smile.","\"Where did you come from to have never seen that before? It tests the quality of your bloodline.\" The middle-aged man briefly explained.","\"I see...\"","The next moment, Yuan pricked his finger with the needle, and it immediately absorbed his blood.","Once the needle had consumed enough of Yuan's blood, it began to glow faintly with a green light. In a matter of moments, the color shifted rapidly from green to blue, then to red, before finally settling into a glistening silver. The middle-aged man's eyes widened with shock.","\"Q-quickly! Let me see it!\" He hastily urged.","Yuan nodded and gave the needle to him, who inspected it with a serious expression on his face.","\"My eyes are not deceiving me! You actually have an Emperor-quality bloodline!?\" The middle-aged man stood up and shifted his gaze from the needle to Yuan, his eyes burning with excitement.","\"What sort of bloodline do you have?!\"","Yuan was inwardly relieved that the needle only revealed the quality of his bloodline and nothing more.","\"Uhh... I don't know,\" he responded a moment later.","\"What do you mean by that?\" \"I grew up without my parents.\"","\"Is that so?\" the middle-aged man muttered, his tone laced with skepticism as he eyed the glowing needle. While he clearly doubted Yuan's background, he didn't outright deny it either. After all, given how chaotic the Primal Expanse was, Yuan's claim was entirely possible—even common. In a realm where powerful bloodlines often mingled and mysterious origins were not unheard of, the idea of someone like Yuan emerging from obscurity wasn't out of the question.","\"Alright, you pass this assessment. Congratulations, you're the second to pass the second floor in the last thousand years.\"","\"What about assessing my prowess?\" Yuan asked.","\"You'll be doing that on the next floor. Although your cultivation is lacking, I don't doubt you have immense potential as someone with an Emperor-quality bloodline, so there's a very good chance you'll qualify as a Divine Dragon Commander even if you fail the next assessment.\" \"Alright. Then I'll head to the next floor now.\" Shortly after Yuan left the second floor, the middle-aged man noticed the needle was still glowing.","\"That's strange. Why is it still active?\"","Right as he muttered these words, the needle abruptly changed colors again.","\"T-this is—?!\" he gasped, his face pale with shock. He dropped the needle and stumbled backward, falling onto his buttocks.","The silver needle was now glowing a brilliant golden color.","\"A golden glow...\" he whispered in disbelief, fully aware of the significance of such a sight.","\"No... this can't be possible!\"","The middle-aged man shook his head in disbelief before staring at the golden needle for a moment longer. Then, he pulled out something that worked like a communication jade slip and started speaking into it.","Meanwhile, Yuan had just reached the third floor, only to find it completely empty except for two words painted on the wall that read, \"Be patient.\"","After seeing the words, Yuan patiently waited for the interviewer to show up.","'There's a formation in the center of the room.' Yu Ning suddenly notified him.","She continued after examining it, 'It appears to be a teleport formation.'","Yuan smiled as he sat on the floor and patiently waited for the interviewer to show up. Unbeknownst to Yuan, the Divine Dragon Sanctuary was in a commotion, stirred by a piece of specific information that spread like wildfire amongst the upper ranks.","\"What? A new descendant of the Dragon God showed up?\"","\"How is that even possible? The Dragon God should only have three descendants!\"","\"Perhaps he conceived another one in secret.\"","\"That's highly unlikely.\"","\"Where's this supposed fourth descendant?\"","\"According to Councillor Luo, he's currently on the third floor of the Divine Dragon Hall.\"","\"How long has it been since someone made it to the third floor?\"","\"Who's going to do the assessment?\"","\"I heard the interviewer has already been decided.\"","About fifteen minutes had passed since Yuan began waiting for his interviewer to show up when the teleportation formation suddenly flickered to life, and a handsome young man with a dignified and commanding presence emerged from it."]},{"number":1656,"title":"Chapter 1656 Long Yejun","paragraphs":["After appearing on the third floor, the handsome young man approached Yuan with a calm smile, \"Hello. I hope you didn't wait too long.\"","Yuan quickly stood up and said, \"No, I didn't.\"","The young man then introduced himself, \"I am Long Yejun, and I will be your interviewer. Before we begin, can you tell me about yourself?\"","\"I'm Yuan, and I traveled here from the other side of the Primal Expanse. I grew up in a small territory with two Azure Dragons, who I consider my parents. Unfortunately, I don't know my real parents.\"","\"I see...\" Long Yejun mumbled with a ponderous face.","Sometime later, he looked at Yuan with a serious expression and said, \"To be honest, based on the assessment from the second floor, we believe you may have a connection to the Dragon God.\"","\"What?\" Yuan's eyes widened with surprise after hearing this unexpected news.","\"When you say Dragon God, do you mean the master of the Divine Dragon Sanctuary—that Dragon God?\"","Long Yejun nodded, \"Indeed.\"","Yuan wore a dazed look on his face as he pondered how such a thing was possible inwardly.","'I may be related to the Dragon God? That's ridiculous. I don't recall ever meeting him even as Tian Yi, so how is it possible that we're related?'","Long Yejun stared intently at Yuan's face, carefully analyzing every detail as if searching for something hidden beneath the surface.","'He's genuinely surprised by the information. Maybe he really has no idea that he has the Dragon God's blood within him, and it was pure coincidence that he came to the Divine Dragon Sanctuary...' he wondered inwardly.","After a brief moment of silence, Yuan's expression shifted, as though a sudden realization had dawned on him.","'The Blood Cleansing Ceremony!'","He gained the ability to transform after the Blood Cleansing Ceremony at the Ancient Dragon City, and the Xi Family claimed they were unaware of the origin of the blood he absorbed. However, the system had confirmed that the blood belonged to the Dragon God.","\"That expression... did you remember something?\" Long Yejun inquired with a slight smile on his face.","Before Yuan could respond, he continued, \"Anyway, I am not here to question your bloodline. We can do that after the assessment.\"","\"For this assessment, I will be evaluating your combat prowess. The most effective way to do that is through a sparring match with you.\"","Long Yejun suddenly suppressed his cultivation to Perfect Chaotic Master, matching Yuan's cultivation.","\"You will pass this assessment if you can injure me even slightly,\" he said afterward.","\"Are you sure?\" Yuan asked. \"Yes. And take as much time as you need to prepare.\"","\"...\"","Yuan didn't say anything else and became silent.","'How should I go about this?' he wondered inwardly.","He could easily injure this confident interviewer with Number One Under Heaven, but he was pretending to be a dragon, and very few beings in the Primal Expanse used weapons. Moreover, he wanted to test out something.","Sometime later, Yuan said, \"Alright, I am ready.\"","Long Yejun beckoned with a provocative gesture, saying, \"Show me what you've got.\"","In the next instant, Yuan sprang from the ground, hurtling toward Long Yejun with incredible speed.","[Relentless Dragon Overwhelms the Nine Heavens!]","As Yuan activated his fist technique, he channeled his Chaotic Essence into it, amplifying its power several times over.","Long Yejun's eyes widened as Yuan's aura suddenly erupted with overwhelming force. Instinctively, he leaped back, attempting to dodge the oncoming strike.","However, Yuan suddenly activated Dragon's Gaze, catching Long Yejun completely off guard. The technique paralyzed him for a split second, leaving him vulnerable.","\"F—\"","Long Yejun couldn't even utter a word before Yuan's fist, engulfed in a black aura that resembled flames, slammed into his gut, launching him across the room. His body crashed into the wall with such force that the entire building trembled. If not for the defensive formations reinforcing the structure, his impact would have shattered through the wall entirely.","Despite the brutal blow, Long Yejun somehow managed to land on his feet, his expression grim but composed as he steadied himself.","He took a deep breath, then forcefully blew his nose, expelling a fair amount of blood.","Long Yejun stared at his own blood on the ground, then chuckled with excitement. \"When was the last time I saw my own blood...? Hahaha!\" he laughed, a wild glint in his eyes.","\"Does this mean I pass the assessment?\" Yuan asked.","Long Yejun stopped laughing to look at him with a solemn gaze.","\"No,\" he responded.","\"But you—\"","\"That wasn't enough to injure me.\"","Yuan didn't say anything and merely looked at the blood on the floor.","\"Ahem!\" Long Yejun awkwardly cleared his throat and explained, \"I was training before I came here, and that blood was accumulated then.\"","Yuan shook his head inwardly and responded with a bittersweet smile, \"I understand. Let's continue, then.\"","A satisfied smile appeared on Long Yejun's face as he settled into a combative stance, his eyes gleaming with anticipation.","After a brief moment of stillness, Long Yejun made the first move, using a movement technique to instantly get in front of Yuan.","Yuan reacted swiftly, but as he raised his arms to defend, Long Yejun's eyes gleamed with a golden light.","'Dragon's Gaze?!'","Yuan was caught off guard by Long Yejun's Dragon's Gaze and became momentarily stunned.","\"Payback time!\" Long Yejun laughed as he drove his fist into Yuan's stomach, precisely where he had been struck moments earlier.","Yuan was instantly sent flying, crashing into the wall with even greater force than when he had struck Long Yejun. The impact reverberated through the room, shaking the entire building.","Yet, it was Long Yejun who bore the brunt of the damage from the exchange. His hand was bruised and slightly bleeding, while Yuan emerged seemingly unscathed. \"Fuck! What is your body made of?!\" Long Yejun cried out, shaking his hand in an attempt to dispel the pain, disbelief written across his face."]},{"number":1657,"title":"Chapter 1657 Endless Arena","paragraphs":["Although Yuan appeared unscathed on the outside, he hadn't emerged from the exchange completely uninjured. Beneath his calm exterior, the impact had taken a slight toll on his body, but his regenerative ability swiftly healed the damage, allowing him to recover almost instantly.","'I cannot underestimate this man. Not only did he penetrate my defenses with his bare fists, but he's even restricted his cultivation to my level.' Yuan stared at Long Yejun with a sharp gaze.","Unbeknownst to him, an excited smile crept onto his face, giving him a fierce and almost vicious appearance.","When Long Yejun saw Yuan's expression, he also grinned excitedly, \"I see! So you're just like me! This is going to be fun! Hahaha!\"","\"However, this place is too small and restrictive for us to really go all out.\"","Long Yejun tossed a teleport stone to Yuan and said, \"Let's change our location to somewhere more suitable.\"","Before Yuan could even respond, Long Yejun crushed his own teleport stone and disappeared from the room.","Yuan didn't think too much about it and also crushed the teleport stone the next moment.","After being teleported, Yuan found himself in a vast land that seemed to have been artificially flattened. The ground was smooth and level, resembling the surface of a grand arena prepared for battle, and it stretched endlessly toward the horizon, its sheer size almost overwhelming.","\"Welcome to the Endless Arena,\" Long Yejun said, gesturing to the vast expanse around them. \"This is the largest arena in the Divine Dragon Sanctuary, spanning over 100,000 miles. We won't have to worry about slamming into walls and whatnot here.\"","\"Whenever you're ready.\" Long Yejun gestured to Yuan a moment later.","After a moment of stillness, Yuan made the first move. However, this time, Long Yejun had no intention of letting Yuan land a hit so easily and swiftly countered with a move of his own.","When they clashed, a powerful ripple surged through the arena, as if two colossal mountains had collided, sending shockwaves across the vast expanse and shaking the ground beneath them.","Each of their punches was so powerful that it generated a fierce gust of wind, while every kick unleashed small windstorms, the sheer force of their battle reshaping the air around them.","In addition to their fists and legs, they also unleashed Dragon's Gaze on each other whenever possible. However, now that they were both fully aware of each other's capabilities, neither of them was caught off guard, skillfully countering the other's Dragon's Gaze with their own.","'How is he canceling out my Dragon's Authority?!' Long Yejun thought in disbelief. 'Even though I've suppressed my cultivation, my soul strength should still be vastly superior!'","Meanwhile, Yuan was focusing all his efforts on breaking through Long Yejun's mental defenses, but no matter how hard he tried, he found himself unable to penetrate them.","'We're pretty evenly matched at this moment, but neither of us is truly going all out...'","Since it was rare for Yuan to encounter an opponent equal in strength, he took this moment to savor the fight. In fact, he had already forgotten about the assessment entirely, lost in the thrill of the battle.","Long Yejun felt the same way. Even if he suppressed his cultivation to match his opponent, only a handful of people in the Divine Dragon Sanctuary could even land a hit on him, let alone rival him in strength.","\"What was your name again?\" Long Yejun suddenly asked.","\"Yuan.\"","\"Allow me to introduce myself again! I am Long Yejun, a descendant of the Dragon God! Since you also have the Dragon God's blood in you, that makes you my younger brother!\"","\"How many children does the Dragon God have?\" Yuan asked as they continued fighting.","\"We always thought there were only three of us, but with your sudden appearance, there are now four of us. I am the second eldest.\"","\"The second eldest, huh? No wonder why you're so strong!\" Yuan laughed out loud.","\"If I am strong, when what are you, the youngest? Your cultivation may be low, but your prowess does not match your cultivation in the slightest, being several realms stronger! Just to fight with you on an equal footing, I had to increase my cultivation to Intermediate Chaotic Commander!\" Long Yejun admitted that he'd increased his cultivation just to match Yuan's prowess.","As Yuan and Long Yejun continued their intense battle, nearby beings began to take notice. Given the vast size of the Endless Arena, it was common for multiple individuals to use it simultaneously, typically without paying attention to others. However, the sheer ferocity of Yuan and Long Yejun's fight was impossible to ignore, compelling onlookers to steal glances and witness the spectacle unfolding before them.","\"Huh? Isn't that Prince Yejun? Who is his opponent? I don't recognize him.\"","\"I don't recognize him, but he's fighting with Prince Yejun on equal footing while having a lower cultivation! What in Dragon God's name is going on?!\" One of the onlookers exclaimed in disbelief, unable to comprehend how someone could rival Long Yejun, a descendant of the Dragon God.","\"Wait a second. I heard rumors about a fourth descendant showing up very recently. Is that him?\"","\"The Dragon God's fourth descendant looks extremely promising! He might even rival the eldest—that tyrant!\"","\"Impossible. Nobody can rival that tyrant, who is the closest to reaching the Dragon God's prowess.\"","\"Anyway, Prince Yejun is obviously holding back. If he became serious, the Fourth won't be able to fight back.\"","\"I wouldn't be so sure about that... It seems to me the Fourth is also holding back.\"","\"Time will tell.\"","More and more people began showing up at the Endless Arena to watch Yuan and Long Yejun's fight once word of it spread.","As the fight progressed, both Yuan and Long Yejun grew more serious, gradually revealing more of their true strength. \"That should be enough for a warm-up. Let's get serious now.\" Long Yejun suddenly stopped fighting and said. \"Fine by me.\" Yuan nodded, agreeing with him."]},{"number":1658,"title":"Chapter 1658 Dragon God’s Descendant","paragraphs":["Yuan and Long Yejun silently stared at each other, seeming waiting for the other to act first.","\"If you're not going to move first, then allow me to!\" Long Yejun suddenly began transforming. His aura erupted like a volcano, and scales began appearing all over his body.","Furthermore, a golden mask that was shaped like a dragon's face materialized on Long Yejun's face, giving him a fearsome presence.","Seeing this, Yuan used God of War's Astral Arts, but he restricted the avatar's size to be only slightly larger than his own body.","\"What is that...?\" Long Yejun murmured, staring at the avatar with awe and intrigue, as he'd never seen a technique like that before.","It was not just Long Yejun. The onlookers were also baffled by God of War's Astral Arts, a unique technique unlike anything they've seen before.","\"Why are you just standing there? Let's go!\" Yuan made the first move a moment later when Long Yejun only stood there in silence.","Long Yejun quickly snapped out of his daze to block Yuan's strike before countering with his own.","Long Yejun's speed and power had significantly increased since his transformation. As for Yuan, not only did he become stronger, but he also grew another pair of arms, allowing him to attack more frequently.","After their power-up, each of their punches and kicks would create powerful windstorms and cause violent earthquakes.","\"What is going on here?\" A new onlooker showed up after being attracted by the commotion.","\"Princess Meihui!\" The others bowed to her after recognizing her.","\"The Dragon Prince is currently sparring with the fourth Dragon God Descendant.\" Someone filled her in on the situation.","\"Huh? My brother? And what do you mean fourth Dragon God Descendant?\" Dragon Princess Meihui raised her eyebrows in a puzzled manner. This was her first time hearing this news.","\"You haven't heard? This person managed to reach the second floor of the Divine Dragon Council, and when his bloodline was tested, it was revealed he had the Dragon God's blood within him. It's been spreading around like crazy.\"","\"This is my first time hearing about it.\" Princess Meihui shook her head.","She narrowed her focus at the figure fighting with her brother, Long Yejun. When she saw Yuan's face and recognized him, her eyes widened with shock.","\"He's the fourth Dragon God Descendant?! No way!\" she exclaimed.","\"What? You know him?\" \"We've met and even spoken very recently. However, I can't say that I know him. To think he'd have Dragon God's blood in him... what kind of coincidence is this?\" Princess Meihui sighed out loud.","\"It's just a rumor for now since they haven't confirmed if he is truly the Dragon God's fourth descendant.\"","Princess Meihui shook her head and said, \"It's likely true since I felt a strange connection with him when we first met. Although it was subtle, it was still there. I didn't think much of it back then and even ignored it.\"","\"No way... so he might really be the fourth Dragon God's Descendant?\" The others were speechless.","In the Divine Dragon Sanctuary, those who were affiliated followed a strict ranking structure. This hierarchy determined not only status but also privileges and responsibilities, with higher-ranked individuals holding greater authority and access to powerful resources, while the lower ranks strove to prove themselves worthy of advancement.","The majority of affiliates within the Divine Dragon Sanctuary do not possess a rank, making even the lowest rank a position of immense authority.","The lowest rank within the Divine Dragon Sanctuary was the Divine Dragon Warrior, entrusted with maintaining order within the territory. They also served as the first line of defense and enforcers of the territory's peace.","Above them were the Divine Dragon Commanders, responsible for leading and directing the Divine Dragon Warriors. They were akin to generals in the military. Only a hundred Divine Dragon Commanders existed in the Divine Dragon Sanctuary, while hundreds of thousands of Divine Dragon Warriors exist.","The next and highest attainable rank was the Divine Dragon Council. Comprised of fewer than a dozen individuals, the members of the council wielded the greatest authority within the Divine Dragon Sanctuary, second only to the Dragon God and his descendants. They were entrusted with making crucial decisions and overseeing the sanctuary's most important matters.","Although the Divine Dragon Council was the highest rank, there was a rank even higher than them, reserved only for the Dragon God's offspring—the Dragon God's Descendants.","\"Has the Dragon God commented on the situation?\" Princess Meihui asked the ones around her.","\"No, but the Dragon God should have been notified already.\"","Meihui looked toward the sky and mumbled, \"Father...\"","Yuan and Long Yejun continued their battle for two days straight without a moment of rest. Both had long forgotten about the assessment, fully absorbed in the thrill of the fight, pushing each other to their limits as they exchanged relentless blows. Neither seemed willing to back down, their stamina and determination seemingly boundless.","\"You're really something, Yuan! I haven't been entertained to this extent in a very long time! However, I can tell that you're still holding back! Show me everything you've got!\" \"Are you sure? Don't complain if you get hurt!\"","\"Hahaha! Of course! I won't complain even if you kill me by accident!\" Long Yejun laughed out loud.","\"Then allow me to show you my true strength!\"","Yuan's aura suddenly surged, transforming into something more refined and razor-sharp, resembling the cutting edge of a sword.","Long Yejun halted his movement and even subconsciously backed away from Yuan after sensing his Enhanced Sword Aura.","\"What is that power...?\" Long Yejun muttered in astonishment","Everyone watching was equally bewildered by Yuan's Sword Aura. The sharp, otherworldly energy left them in awe, unable to comprehend its origin or nature.","\"I am not done yet.\"","After releasing his Enhanced Sword Aura, Yuan imbued it with his Chaotic Essence.","BOOM!","The Sword Aura instantly intensified several times, almost reaching the realm of Supreme Sword Aura in terms of prowess."]},{"number":1659,"title":"Chapter 1659 Chaotic Sword Aura","paragraphs":["\"Oh, this is not bad—much better than I anticipated,\" Yuan nodded in satisfaction, impressed by the result of fusing his Chaotic Essence with his Enhanced Sword Aura.","\"What is that power?\" Long Yejun asked again.","Yuan pondered for a moment before responding, \"Chaotic Sword Aura.\"","He decided to give his Sword Aura a new name.","\"Chaotic Sword Aura... what a fearsome technique!\" Long Yejun swallowed nervously.","Despite the distance between them, it felt as though his body was being assaulted by countless invisible blades. Had his physique been any weaker, Yuan's aura alone would have been enough to kill him on the spot.","In fact, a sizeable 500-meter-long crater had formed around Yuan. His Chaotic Sword Aura was so sharp and overwhelming that his mere presence had obliterated everything around him.","\"Here I come,\" Yuan warned Long Yejun before he swung his arm in a chopping motion.","Sha!","A black-colored sword light was created from the motion and flew at Long Yejun.","\"?!\"","Long Yejun was barely able to react and narrowly dodged it—or so he thought.","After sensing what felt like a drop of water flowing down his face, Long Yejun awkwardly reached for his face.","\"This is...\"","When he looked at his fingers, they were stained by his own blood.","Long Yejun trembled at the sight of his own blood. It had been so long since someone had managed to penetrate his scales that he couldn't remember the last time it happened.","\"Ahh... this sensation... this thrill that I am feeling...\"","A crazed expression appeared on Long Yejun's face as he licked his blood-stained fingers.","\"HAHAHAHA!\"","Long Yejun's aura suddenly skyrocketed, piercing straight through the heavens.","\"Let me enjoy this some more, Yu—Brother Yuan!\"","Long Yejun charged at Yuan.","Yuan also wore a wide smile on his face as he faced Long Yejun head-on.","BOOM!","When they clashed, Yuan's Chaotic Sword Aura scattered in every direction, carving deep sword cuts into the surrounding area. Long Yejun, who stood directly in front of Yuan, bore the brunt of the scattered Sword Aura with his bare body.","Sword cuts appeared all over Long Yejun's body, quickly drenching him in blood. However, despite the severity of the sight, the wounds were superficial—no more than paper cuts. Within moments, his naturally strong body healed all the sword cuts.","\"My turn!\"","Long Yejun opened his mouth, and a bright orb of light suddenly began to form inside, glowing with intense energy as it rapidly grew in size and brilliance.","Yuan's instincts warned him of the impending danger, but he found himself unable to move when he tried to dodge as Long Yejun held tightly onto his wrists. Long Yejun had deliberately closed the distance between them, enduring Yuan's previous attack directly with his body, all in order to capture him and prevent his escape.","\"Dragon's Breath!\"","Once he gathered enough energy, Long Yejun unleashed it from his mouth, shooting a beam of light resembling Heaven Splitting Sword Strike, even rivaling its destructiveness.","Yuan's entire body was swallowed by the massive beam of light, his silhouette disappearing completely within its blinding brilliance.","Long Yejun kept his mouth open, continuously releasing the Dragon's Breath until every last ounce of energy had been expended.","It took several long seconds before Long Yejun finally closed his mouth. When the Dragon's Breath attack was complete, it left a path of utter devastation in its wake, and Yuan was nowhere to be seen.","\"S-shit... Did I accidentally kill him?\" Long Yejun muttered in a dazed manner after snapping out of his frenzied state.","A tsunami of worry and guilt washed over Long Yejun as he realized what he'd just done. He frantically scanned the devastated area, his heart pounding anxiously, dreading the worst outcome.","\"Wow, that was scary. I almost died there.\"","A familiar voice suddenly resounded, prompting Long Yejun to turn around.","Yuan was standing right behind him, seemingly unscathed. However, he was naked since all of his clothes and equipment were destroyed by the attack.","\"Thank the Dragon God you're alive!\" Long Yejun exclaimed, feeling a surge of relief wash over him when he saw Yuan had survived his brutal attack. He let out a shaky breath, realizing just how close he'd come to a tragic mistake. He wouldn't have known what to do if he had accidentally killed Yuan.","\"Do you still want to continue?\" Yuan asked, seemingly eager to continue fighting despite his near-death experience.","Long Yejun shook his head with a bittersweet smile and said, \"No, let's stop here.\"","He continued, \"It's embarrassing considering my status and experience, but I tend to lose control when I get too excited in a fight. Anyway, I'm glad you're safe. This is my loss.\" Yuan smiled and dismissively waved his hand, \"Don't worry about it. I know how you feel since it also happens to me.\"","\"But how did you survive? I am certain my Dragon's Breath landed on you since I could still feel the sensation of your wrist after I released it.\" Long Yejun suddenly asked.","\"It did hit me, and it even destroyed most of my body.\"","\"What...? But you look perfectly fine...\"","\"I'm quite confident in my regenerative abilities.\" Yuan smiled. Although Long Yejun was too preoccupied to see it, the onlookers had witnessed Yuan reconstructing his entire body from a single cell, which left them all astonished, even terrified.","Sometime later, Yuan retrieved the Golden Dragon Robe and wore it.","'Thank the heavens I didn't wear this during the battle, or it would've been destroyed...' Yuan sighed inwardly.","Unfortunately, the rest of Yuan's equipment had been utterly obliterated by Long Yejun's Dragon's Breath. Among the losses were the treasured armor and boots that had once belonged to the Evil God, which he had only recently acquired.","These two treasures had endured thousands of years of abuse and even survived one of the biggest wars in the Divine Heaven. Yet, they were somehow destroyed so soon after returning to Yuan's possession.","\"Stygian Vest and Stygian Boots... What a pity...\" Yuan muttered in a gloomy tone.","Realizing that he'd destroyed Yuan's treasures, Long Yejun said, \"Sorry, I also destroyed your valuables.\"","\"It's fine. At least they were destroyed in a battle. They were also quite old and worn out, anyway.\"","\"No, it's not fine. I will compensate you fully. I promise.\" Long Yejun said with a heartfelt face.","Yuan nodded, acknowledging his sincerity."]},{"number":1660,"title":"Chapter 1660 Ancient Azure Dragon","paragraphs":["Sometime after their fight ended, Long Yejun said to Yuan, \"Although you have passed the assessment, it never mattered since you're one of the Dragon God's descendants, so you will automatically be ranked above the Divine Dragon Council.\"","\"Oh...\"","Yuan wondered if he should follow the flow and pretend to be a Dragon God's Descendant.","'If the Dragon God is as powerful as the Primordial Phoenix, there's a good chance he will be able to see through me, so the longer I continue to impersonate his offspring, the worse things will get for me...'","'However, if I reveal myself now, who knows how Long Yejun and the others will react...'","After some serious pondering, Yuan decided to continue acting as one of the Dragon God's Descendants to take advantage of their training grounds for as long as possible.","Even if his identity were exposed later by the Dragon God, Yuan was confident that the Primal Monarch wouldn't allow any real harm to come to him.","\"Hey, we meet again.\"","A familiar voice suddenly resounded, prompting Yuan to turn his head.","\"Princess Meihui.\" Yuan acknowledged her with a nod.","\"There's no need for such formality between us siblings. Allow me to introduce myself again. I am Long Meihui, the youngest of the Dragon God's Descendant.\" Long Meihui said with a beautiful smile on her face.","\"I'm Yuan.\"","\"I'll call you Brother Yuan from now on, so you should call me Sister Meihui. Elder Sister is fine, too.\" Long Meihui chuckled blissfully.","Although she was the youngest, she was still billions of years old, so one could imagine her happiness in finally becoming an elder sister.","\"I am finally an Elder Sister! I am no longer the youngest! Ahaha! I thought this day would never come!\" Long Meihui laughed out loud. She was so happy that she began crying a moment later.","\"By the way,\" Yuan suddenly spoke, \"Can I still participate in the Dragon God Festival as the Dragon God's Descendant?\" \"Of course. We'll also be participating.\" Long Yejun nodded.","\"I see. That's great.\"","\"Are you participating because there's something you want to accomplish? Can you tell us? Maybe we can help you right now.\" Long Meihui suddenly said.","As one of the Dragon God's Descendant, there was very little they couldn't achieve in the Divine Dragon Sanctuary.","Yuan nodded and said, \"A close friend of mine is cursed, and I need the power of the Sacred Chalice of Purification to cure him.\"","\"The Sacred Chalice of Purification, huh? If you can bring your friend to the Divine Dragon Sanctuary, we can help him.\" Long Yejun said.","Yuan shook his head and sighed, \"Unfortunately, my friend cannot leave his territory, so I have to bring the treasure to him.\"","\"Hmm... that would be difficult to do since the Sacred Chalice of Purification hasn't left the Divine Dragon Sanctuary since it was brought here.\" Long Meihui said.","\"But if you win the Dragon God Festival, you can make that request to the Dragon God.\" Long Yejun continued.","\"That's what I plan on doing,\" Yuan said.","\"Good luck, Brother Yuan. Although we've participated in nearly every Dragon God Festival since its creation many billion years ago, we've only won a few times.\" Long Meihui said.","\"What kind of trials are in the festival?\" Yuan asked.","\"All kinds, from trials that test your talent to nonsensical ones like racing each other across the Primal Expanse.\" Long Yejun said.","\"Racing across the Primal Expanse...? How long did that take to finish?\" Yuan asked nervously.","\"A few hundred years.\"","\"Oh...\" Yuan immediately became worried after hearing that the festival may potentially last for hundreds of years.","\"What's the shortest time a festival has ever lasted?\" he asked a moment later.","\"The shortest festival happened 750 million years ago. I believe that one ended in just a few minutes.\" Long Yejun said after pondering for a few moments.","\"Ah, I remember that one. It was a ridiculous trial that required us to catch a Primal prepared by the Dragon God. The Eldest caught it in less than three minutes.\" Long Meihui sighed as she recalled the events of that day.","\"Anyway, Brother Yuan, are you free now? I want to compensate you for the valuables that I destroyed.\" Long Yejun suddenly said.","\"I am free now.\" Yuan nodded.","\"Great. Take this.\" Long Yejun tossed another teleport stone to him.","\"I'll see you later.\" Long Meihui said to him before flying away.","Sometime later, Yuan crushed the teleport stone and entered the rift, followed by Long Yejun.","When they emerged from the rift, Yuan found himself standing before a beautiful pavilion with a pond built around it.","\"Where are we?\" he asked.","Long Yejun smiled and said, \"The Silver Pavilion.\"","When Long Yejun approached the pavilion, another portal appeared.","\"This is just the entrance to my real home.\"","Once they entered the portal, Yuan found himself surrounded by an endless, shimmering sea that was completely motionless, like water in a still cup. He stood on a long silver bridge that stretched out toward a distant island, where a large house was situated.","\"What do you think of my world?\" Long Yejun asked for his impressions.","Yuan looked around for a moment before responding, \"I can see that you like water.\"","Long Yejun laughed at his response.","He then said, \"I'm actually a water dragon—an Ancient Azure Dragon.\"","\"A water dragon? I thought you were a land dragon with how well you fought on land.\" Yuan was surprised to learn this.","Long Yejun smiled and said, \"If we had fought near the ocean—even near a small pond, I wouldn't have lost to you.\"","Water dragons could only unleash their true potential when fighting near or within water, so Long Yejun had been severely handicapped during his battle with Yuan.","\"I wouldn't be so sure about that,\" Yuan said provocatively.","\"Do you want to find out?\" Long Yejun's aura suddenly surged, causing the still water around them to tremble with excitement.","However, before Yuan could even respond, Long Yejun retracted his aura and chuckled, \"I'm just joking with you. Follow me. I'll bring you to my living quarters.\"","Yuan silently nodded, maintaining a composed expression, though inwardly, he was startled by Long Yejun's aura just now, which was incomparably stronger than when they had fought. 'If we really fought here, I have only about a 20 percent chance of winning...' he sighed inwardly."]},{"number":1661,"title":"Chapter 1661 Long Yejun’s Treasures","paragraphs":["After walking for several minutes, they finally arrived at the island.","\"Welcome to my humble home.\" Long Yejun said to Yuan as he opened the door.","\"Though, this is just my secondary home that I only use when I am in my human form. My real home is the water outside.\"","The interior of the house was incredibly simple. There was only one large room with a couch, a square table, four chairs, and some wall decorations. \"What do you typically do here?\" Yuan asked out of curiosity.","\"This.\"","Long Yejun suddenly sprawled out on the couch, his entire body stretched across it with one foot casually hanging off the edge.","\"What am I looking at...?\" Yuan didn't want to make any assumptions and asked.","\"You can't tell? I am relaxing.\"","\"...\"","Yuan was speechless.","\"Although the human form is very restricting and weak, it has its advantages. The biggest one is their ease of movement and small size. I wouldn't be able to do this if I were in my true form.\" Long Yejun said.","\"I see...\"","\"Speaking of human form...\" Long Yejun sat up and stared at Yuan with a serious face.","\"Your appearance is top-notch. Did you acquire it from the Human Face Artisan?\"","\"Human Face Artisan?\" Yuan wore a puzzled look on his face.","\"You don't know the Human Face Artisan? He's one of the top appearance makers in this world. Although his products are extremely expensive, they're all top-quality. In fact, most of the top-quality appearances are created by him, mine included.\"","\"Is that so... Anyway, to answer your question, I didn't acquire my face from him. I made it myself.\" \"What?! You made such a high-quality appearance by yourself?! You should start a business with that talent! The Human Face Artisan will finally have some real competition!\"","\"I'll think about it,\" Yuan said with a stiff smile.","Sometime later, Long Yejun got off the couch and walked toward the steel door on the other end of the room. When he opened the door, a descending staircase was revealed.","\"Come with me.\" Yuan nodded and followed Long Yejun down the staircase.","The staircase led to a tunnel made of transparent materials, allowing them to see the surrounding water. It reminded Yuan of an aquarium, with the serene, vast expanse of water pressing in from all sides as they walked through the passage. However, there was no aquatic life, so there was nothing to see.","After walking for several minutes, they arrived at another room where numerous objects, each radiating a vast amount of Chaotic Essence, were displayed like a prized collection.","\"Welcome to my treasure room, where I store most of my valuables. Unfortunately, I don't have any valuables that could replace your destroyed clothes and shoes.\"","Since humans don't exist in the Primal Expanse and Predators only take human form as a hobby, armor-type treasures meant for human anatomy are extremely rare.","\"Since I destroyed two of your valuables, you can pick any two treasures from here.\" Long Yejun continued.","\"Huh? Any? Are you sure?\" Yuan was pleasantly surprised by his generosity.","\"Yes, I am sure.\"","\"Then I'll look around.\"","There were about a dozen treasures in the room, and Yuan approached the one that was closest to him.","However, when he inspected the item, he was shocked by the notifications.","<Item could not be analyzed>","[???]","[Grade: ???]","[Quality: ???]","[Description: ???]","'The system failed to analyze the treasure?'","This was the first time the system couldn't identify a treasure at all.","'Is it because the treasures were created in the Primal Expanse?' he wondered.","A few moments later, Yuan looked at Long Yejun and said, \"Do you mind giving me a brief description of these treasures so I know what they do?\"","\"Oh, of course.\"","Long Yejun walked beside him and continued, \"This treasure is called Dragon's Avarice. If you feed it enough Chaotic Essence, it will unleash a devastating attack that rivals even a Dragon's Breath.\"","\"Is that the technique you used on me?\" Yuan asked.","\"Yes.\"","\"Let's move on to the next one. I'll make a decision after I hear about every treasure.\"","\"Sure.\"","The next treasure was a large golden scale that was the size of a watermelon.","\"This is a scale directly from the Dragon God. It doesn't really have any particular uses, but it's extremely durable—near indestructible. I wouldn't be able to put a scratch on it even if I used my full power.\" Long Yejun said.","\"The Dragon God's scale? How did you acquire this? And why is it so small?\"","\"It was given to me by the Dragon God—our father. Our siblings also have one, so he'll probably give you one later. It's small because I made Father shrink it since its actual size is a pain in the ass the carry around. Its real size could cover the entire Endless Arena.\"","\"I see...\"","The next treasure was an elegant earring, crafted from gleaming silver and adorned with a brilliant sapphire gem. \"Oh, I crafted this one myself. It greatly increases the wearer's ability to control water. I chose this shape after meeting a human a few hundred million years ago, and he was wearing something like this on his ears.\" Long Yejun explained,.","\"What happened to that human?\" Yuan asked out of curiosity.","\"He took his own life when he realized that he couldn't return home and couldn't cultivate in this world. He was also my first and last human friend.\" A sorrowful expression appeared on Long Yejun's face as he recalled this tragic event.","\"Sorry if I made you uncomfortable...\" \"It's fine. It happened a long time ago.\"","The next treasure appeared to be nothing more than an ordinary sheet of black leather at first glance, but Yuan could sense an ominous aura emanating from it.","\"This is dragon skin that belongs to the Dragon of Destruction, who was said to be the Dragon God's strongest rival billions of years ago. After his defeat, he was skinned alive and eaten by the Dragon God. This is all that remains of the Dragon of Destruction today.\"","Yuan stared at the black leather with great interest.","'I can make new armor out of this...' he thought."]},{"number":1662,"title":"Chapter 1662 Two Treasures of His Choice","paragraphs":["Long Yejun noticed Yuan's intrigued expression and smiled, \"You seem interested. Do you want it?\"","He nodded, \"A little, but I will decide after looking at the other treasures.\"","\"Then let's move on to the next one.\"","The next treasure displayed was a beautiful golden marble resembling a dragon's eyes.","\"This is the Dragon's True Eye. If you consume it, you'll significantly strengthen all of your senses and even learn Dragon's Authority. Since you already know Dragon's Authority, this treasure won't benefit you too much, but for an ordinary dragon, it essentially turns them into royalty.\"","The next treasure appeared to be some kind of stone. It didn't have any distinctive shape, and its Chaotic Essence was also the weakest in the room.","\"This is a small piece of the Dragon God's claw. I acquired it from the first Dragon God's Descendant, who managed to chip it off the Dragon God during a spar.\"","\"If you know how to make your own treasures, this will definitely create a very powerful treasure.\"","\"Hmm...\"","Yuan stared at the Dragon God's claw with interest. Because he had recovered Tian Qiyuan's memories as the Exalted Blacksmith, these materials were more enticing than already completed treasures because he could easily customize the treasure to his own preferences.","'This material will be the most effective if used to create a weapon, but I already have enough weapons. Perhaps I can use it to upgrade the Abyssal Dagger.'","All sorts of ideas appeared inside Yuan's head.","Sometime later, Long Yejun continued introducing the treasures to him.","Since there were only a dozen treasures in the room, it didn't take long for the tour to be finished.","\"So, have you decided on which two treasures you want?\" Ling Yejun asked him afterward.","Yuan nodded and walked to the Dragon of Destruction's skin.","\"I want this for my first choice.\"","\"I had a feeling you would pick that. If needed, I can get someone to craft a treasure for you with that skin.\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"It's fine. I plan on doing it myself.\"","\"What? This material isn't your ordinary skin but the Dragon of Destruction's skin. You'll need to be a master of crafting to deal with it.\"","\"I know. I just need the proper equipment and place to craft the treasure.\" Yuan showed a confident smile.","\"Unbelievable... How many talents do you have?\" Long Yejun muttered with a dumbfounded face.","After snapping out of it, he continued, \"Alright, I'll arrange the perfect place for you to craft the treasure. It might take a few months, though.\"","\"As long as it can be done before the Dragon God Festival,\" Yuan said.","Long Yejun retrieved the Dragon of Destruction's skin from the display and handed it over to Yuan.","\"There's a lot more than I anticipated,\" Yuan mumbled after unfolding the skin to examine it properly.","At a glance, there didn't appear to be much skin when it was neatly folded inside its display, but unexpectedly, after it was unfolded, its full size was revealed to be large enough to use as a ship's sail.","'With this much material, I can create more than just a piece of armor!' Yuan smiled excitedly after realizing this.","After storing the skin inside his spatial ring, Yuan approached his second choice.","Long Yejun raised his eyebrows in a puzzled manner after seeing Yuan's second choice.","\"Why did you pick this treasure?\" he asked.","\"I'm not sure myself. It's a gut feeling, I guess.\" Yuan said with a genuine face.","\"Are you sure? I only placed it here because of its mysterious origins.\"","The treasure Yuan had picked for his second choice had an unknown origin and effects. Long Yejun had examined and tried to figure out its secrets since he acquired it but to no avail.","\"I am sure.\"","\"If you say so...\" Long Yejun didn't say anything else and handed the treasure to Yuan, who placed it inside his spatial ring without examining it.","Seeing how confidently Yuan handled the treasure, Long Yejun had a feeling that Yuan knew the origin of the treasure, but he decided not to inquire about it for now.","Once Yuan had his two treasures, they left the treasure room and returned to the main room.","\"What are you going to do until the Dragon God Festival in two years?\" Long Yejun asked.","\"I'm going to use the training grounds to strengthen myself.\"","\"Which one?\"","\"I'm not sure yet since this is my first time at the Divine Dragon Sanctuary.\" \"I see. Wait a moment.\"","Long Yejun suddenly tapped his forehead, retrieving an orb of light.","After extracting the orb of light, he made a flicking motion with his fingers, shooting the orb of light directly into Yuan's forehead.","Once he absorbed the light, information on the Divine Dragon Sanctuary began filling his head, from its training grounds to other miscellaneous places. He was essentially given a map of the entire Divine Dragon Sanctuary.","Sometime later, Long Yejun asked, \"Have you found a training ground yet?\"","Yuan nodded and said, \"The Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp.\" Long Yejun's eyes widened, and he hastily said, \"W-wait a second. That's one of the most dangerous training grounds available! Unless you're a poison dragon, it's essentially suicide to train there! Even I don't dare to go there.\"","\"I'll be fine. My poison resistance is quite strong.\" Yuan said.","\"I never asked, but what kind of dragon are you?\"","\"I'll keep it a secret for now. If you can guess it, I'll do you a favor.\"","\"Alright, I'll accept your challenge.\"","\"Before I head to the baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp, can you take me back to the Divine Dragon Hall? I came to the Divine Dragon Sanctuary with a friend.\"","\"Sure thing.\"","Long Yejun shattered a teleport stone to the Divine Dragon Hall a moment later.","\"Sorry for making you wait so long.\" Yuan approached Yingzi, who was waiting beside the entrance.","\"Hm? Where did you come from?\" Yingzi was puzzled since she hadn't noticed him leaving the Divine Dragon Hall even though she had been watching it without looking away the entire time.","Yuan immediately explained the situation to her."]},{"number":1663,"title":"Chapter 1663 Baneful Dragon’s Poisonous Swamp","paragraphs":["\"I see...?\" Despite Yuan explaining the situation to her, Yingzi only became more puzzled afterward. She couldn't fathom how Yuan, who was obviously human, became the Dragon God's Descendant. Moreover, he should have the Primal Monarch's bloodline. However, she quickly stopped thinking about it, realizing it was pointless to overthink something she wasn't meant to understand.","\"Your friend is a Shadow Dweller, huh? It's been over a million years since I last encountered their race.\" Long Yejun commented as he stared at Yingzi, as it was incredibly rare for a Shadow Dweller to be so far away from their natural habitat, the Hollowed Expanse.","\"Oh, let me introduce myself. I am the second Dragon God's Descendant, Long Yejun.\"","\"Yingzi.\"","\"Let's head to the Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp now, shall we?\" Yuan said a moment later.","\"Sure.\"","Since their destination was only three days away from the Divine Dragon Hall, they decided to fly there instead of wasting a teleport stone.","While they traveled, Long Yejun gave an introduction to the Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp.","\"Baneful Dragons are the strongest poison dragons and some of the most feared creatures in the Primal Expanse due to their dreadful poisons. Their poisons are so deadly that even entities with poison immunities could perish from them. They're also so incredibly annoying to deal with that even the Dragon God avoids fighting them as much as possible.\"","\"How are they annoying to deal with?\" Yuan asked curiously.","\"Their bodies are essentially made of poison, so they release poison from any wounds inflicted upon them. The only way to fight them is from a safe distance, and you must defeat them swiftly, or else their poison will spread. Unfortunately, that is easier said than done because Baneful Dragons are annoyingly durable.\"","\"There's a reason poison dragons are considered one of the most powerful and dangerous dragon bloodlines.\"","\"What bloodline does the Dragon God have?\" Yuan asked.","\"I would love to tell you, but unfortunately, even I do not have the answer.\"","\"What? Even though you're his offspring?\"","Long Yejun nodded and sighed, \"We've asked him many times, but he said he'd only tell us if we can defeat him, which is essentially impossible. Even the Eldest, who is recognized as the most talented dragon since the Dragon God—the Unrivaled Tyrant—hasn't defeated him after many billions of years.\"","\"I've heard about the first Dragon God's Descendant multiple times now, but I still don't have a clue what they're like.\" Yuan suddenly said.","\"There's only one thing you need to be aware of about the Eldest—\" Long Yejun paused to look around nervously.","Once he was sure nobody was eavesdropping on them, he continued speaking through divine sense, \"That bitch is fucking crazy! No matter what, don't speak with her! As a matter of fact, don't even approach her! If you ever see her, run the other direction!\" 'The Eldest is a woman, huh?' Yuan thought to himself.","\"What does she look like so I know it's her?\" Yuan then asked.","\"She has multiple appearances and changes quite often, so it's impossible to recognize her from appearance alone. However, you'll still recognize her at a glance.\"","\"I don't get it.\"","\"You'll understand when you meet her.\"","\"Not even a hint?\"","\"Nope.\" Long Yejun refused with a smile.","\"Forget it then.\"","Three days later, they arrived at the Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp.","Just as its name implied, the place was literally a swamp but with poisonous water and plants everywhere.","\"There are three different zones in the Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp: Outer, Inner, and Center. Every zone has many layers of poisonous water, each containing a unique poison. We're currently in the first zone on the very outskirts of the place.\" Long Yejun explained.","\"As you go deeper and approach the center of the swamp, the poison will become stronger. Do not underestimate this place, or you'll die. I have the antidote for all poisons up to the inner zone, so you don't have to worry about dying. However, once you enter the inner zone, I cannot save you, and only the Baneful Dragon could save you.\"","Yuan nodded, \"Thank you for the warning.\"","After taking a deep breath, Yuan entered the swamp.","'The swamp is much shallower than I anticipated...' Yuan thought to himself as the water in the swamp only reached his knees.","<You have been poisoned by 'Phantom Poison'>","<Ten Thousand Poison Immunity has nullified the effects of 'Phantom Poison'>","Once he confirmed that his poison immunity was working, Yuan began walking deeper.","Several steps later, he was poisoned by a different type of poison.","<You have been poisoned by 'Whispering Death'>","<Ten Thousand Poison Immunity has nullified the effects of 'Whispering Death'>","He continued walking deeper into the swamp.","<You have been poisoned by 'Blood Corruption Poison'>","<Ten Thousand Poison Immunity has nullified the effects of 'Blood Corruption Poison'>","<You have been poisoned by 'Death's Extract'>","<Ten Thousand Poison Immunity has nullified the effects of 'Death's Extract'>","After walking three hundred steps and being exposed to over 20 different types of deadly poison, Yuan had only managed to complete a little under 10 percent of the first zone, meaning he was still over two thousand steps away from reaching the second zone.","'My poison resistance isn't increasing. I guess I have to be poisoned by something that my Ten Thousand Poison Immunity cannot handle...'","With that in mind, Yuan continued walking to the next zone.","Sometime later, Yuan finished 90 percent of the first zone after experiencing over 200 different types of poison.","When he was poisoned for the 207th time, a change occurred in his notifications.","<You have been poisoned by 'Eternal Agony'>","<Ten Thousand Poison Immunity has failed to nullify 'Eternal Agony'>","Ding!","<Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has activated>","<Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has begun refining 'Eternal Agony'>","<Your poison resistance has increased>","<Your poison resistance has increased>","<Your poison resistance has increased>","Seeing that his physique had finally activated, Yuan sat in the poisonous water and began cultivating. Although his physique was refining the poison, it didn't mean he wasn't experiencing any pain. In fact, Yuan was currently experiencing excruciating pain from every inch of his body."]},{"number":1664,"title":"Chapter 1664 Hundred Thousand Poison Immunity","paragraphs":["\"Wow, he's doing much better than I expected...\" Long Yejun muttered with a surprised look after seeing how far Yuan had progressed in the Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp.","He turned to look at Yingzi, who was standing beside him, and asked, \"How long have you been traveling with him?\"","\"A little over two years.\"","\"So only recently, huh? How did you guys meet?\"","\"I was the one who approached him. He appeared out of nowhere and piqued my interest.\"","\"Is that so...\"","Sometime later, Yuan stood up after receiving a notification.","<Your poison resistance has stregnthened>","<Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has begun fusing with Ten Thousand Poison Immunity>","[Progress: 10%]","<Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has nullified Eternal Agony>","<You have been poisoned by 'Plague Poison'>","<Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has activated>","<Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has begun refining 'Plague Poison'>","<Your poison resistance has increased>","Yuan stopped to cultivate again.","A few minutes later, Yuan walked to the next layer. He continued this until he reached the last layer of the first zone.","<Your skill 'Ten Thousand Poison Immunity' has developed into 'Hundred Thousand Poison Immunity'>","[Progress: 25%]","It was only when his poison immunity advanced to the next realm that he noticed an increase in his progress. This realization led Yuan to believe that he would need to continue elevating his poison immunity to even higher levels in order to complete his progress.","Sometime later, Yuan walked forward, stepping into the second zone of the swamp.","Long Yejun swallowed nervously when he saw this. The second zone was incomparably more challenging than the first, and even poison dragons had trouble adapting to the poison there.","\"He's only been here for a few hours, and he's already entering the second zone...\" Long Yejun sighed out loud as he recalled taking several hundred million years to reach that point.","\"His insane speed of adapting to poison... he's definitely a poison dragon!\" Long Yejun was already convinced that Yuan was a poison dragon. Otherwise, it would make no sense.","\"Hm?\"","Long Yejun suddenly noticed a powerful presence behind him, prompting him to turn around.","A tall and handsome man with purple, blue, and green hair was walking toward them with a slight smile on his face.","\"It's been a while since I've seen you at my playground, Prince Yejun.\" This man greeted Long Yejun with respect.","\"Baneful Dragon. Are you here to watch my little brother, too?\"","Sure enough, this newcomer was the Baneful Dragon—the creator of the Poisonous Swamp.","\"Your little brother?\" The Baneful Dragon looked at Yuan and smiled, \"So that's the rumored fourth Dragon God's Descendant. And I came here because I noticed something odd was happening at my playground.\"","\"Something odd?\" Long Yejun raised his eyebrows in a questioning manner.","\"My Poisonous Swamp started losing its strength rapidly a few hours ago, almost as if someone was purposefully detoxifying the poison.\"","The Baneful Dragon narrowed his gaze at Yuan and continued, \"Turns out he has been absorbing my poison and using it to enhance his own body—and at an incredible rate at that.\"","\"What? Isn't that something only someone who has attained Poison Harmony could achieve?\" Long Yejun's eyes widened with shock. \"Although Brother Yuan has poison immunity, he definitely hasn't reached the level of Poison Harmony yet!\"","Yingzi looked at Yuan with a weird expression on her face.","'Isn't this exactly what happened at the Eternal Phoenix Domain? So he can do more than just absorb fire, huh?' Yingzi, who had witnessed Yuan's feats at the Nine Levels of Hell, immediately realized what was happening.","However, she said nothing to Long Yejun and the Baneful Dragon since it would reveal Yuan's true identity, leaving them to figure everything out themselves.","When Yuan entered the second zone and was poisoned, his Hundred Thousand Poison Immunity immediately nullified the poison effects, so he continued walking deeper until he could no longer continue at the 20% mark.","\"If he's stopping there, then his poison immunity should've only reached the level of Hundred Thousand Poison Immunity.\" The Baneful Dragon remarked.","\"That's where I am now, and that took me hundreds of millions of years to achieve...\" Long Yejun sighed.","The Baneful Dragon looked at him and sneered, \"You make it sound like you've been training for hundreds of millions of years straight when, in reality, you've only really trained for a few thousand years.\"","It took Yuan a little longer to adapt to the poison in the second zone and a little over a week to advance his poison immunity to the next stage.","<Your skill 'Hundred Thousand Poison Immunity' has developed into 'Myriad Poison Immunity'>","[Progress: 75%]","[Myriad Poison Immunity]","[Description: Grants the user immunity to over a million poisons, including Immortal-grade poisons.]","When Yuan attained Myriad of Poison Immunity, he'd just traversed a little over 75 percent of the second zone. However, even with his improved poison immunity, he was only able to continue all the way up to 90 percent before needing to halt again.","\"I have never seen anyone adapt to poison so quickly...\" The Baneful Dragon spoke with a shocked expression on his face.","\"That's my little brother for you! Hahaha!\" Long Yejun laughed with prideful expression, as if he was the one who was being praised.","\"By the way, can you tell what kind of poison dragon he is?\"","The Baneful Dragon shook his head and said, \"Everything about him tells me that he's a poison dragon, but for some reason, I cannot see him being a poison dragon. My gut tells me he isn't one.\" \"What? He isn't a poison dragon? How is that possible? There's no way anything other than a poison dragon could adapt to poison so quickly!\"","\"I am well aware of that. If I have to be honest, even I cannot compare to him in that category.\"","\"No way! You have the strongest bloodline and highest poison affinity as a poison dragon! How could you lose to someone who isn't even a poison dragon? That doesn't make any sense!\" Long Yejun exclaimed.","The Baneful Dragon remained silent, almost as if he had no response to such remarks."]},{"number":1665,"title":"Chapter 1665 Heaven’s Bane","paragraphs":["Another two weeks have passed since Yuan attained Myriad Poison Immunity.","<Your skill 'Myriad Poison Immunity' has developed into 'True Poison Immunity'>","[True Poison Immunity]","[Description: Grants the user immunity to most poisons.]","[Progress: 90%]","'Looks like I will have to advance my poison immunity by one more stage if I want to complete the fusion...' Yuan thought to himself as he took his first step into the third zone, where the poisons are strong enough to kill even immortals within seconds.","\"I would've stopped him from advancing further if you weren't here, Baneful Dragon.\" Long Yejun said.","However, the Baneful Dragon shook his head and said, \"Even with me here, there's nothing I can do to save him in the third zone because the poison there are strong enough to kill him before I can even attempt to save him.\"","\"My Poisonous Swamp isn't the most dangerous training ground in the Divine Dragon Sanctuary without reason. It has the most casualties, and even other Baneful Dragons have perished here because they underestimated my poison.\"","\"What? Then I need to stop him immediately! Before it's too late!\" Long Yejun hastily said.","\"He'll be fine.\" Yingzi suddenly spoke for the first time since the Baneful Dragon's appearance.","\"Where is your confidence coming from?\" The Baneful Dragon inquired, his gaze filled with intrigue.","\"From experience, I guess. I have seen what he's capable of.\"","\"But you've only been with him for around two years!\" Long Yejun exclaimed.","\"And in those two years, I have witnessed enough to be confident of him.\" Yingzi shrugged.","Long Yejun shifted his focus to Yuan again and swallowed nervously.","\"Even that Unrivaled Tyrant hasn't stepped foot inside the third zone...\" he mumbled in a dazed voice.","The third zone of the Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp was much smaller than the previous two, requiring only a hundred steps to reach its very center. However, each step introduced a new, more potent layer of poison. These toxins were so deadly that even those at the God Ascension would succumb to them within minutes.","Even with True Poison Immunity, Yuan couldn't take more than ten steps before he had to sit down to cultivate.","The pain he experienced was excruciating, and if it weren't for his regeneration ability that constantly created healthy blood cells and restored his organs, the poison would've melted his body within seconds.","\"Oh god... what is his body made of?\" The Baneful Dragon was shocked by what he was witnessing, and he even began to doubt the effectiveness of his poison, something he had been immensely proud of for countless years.","\"That regenerative ability... if he's not a poison dragon, he's a dragon with extremely high recovery rates...\" Long Yejun immediately started thinking of the possibilities.","\"Only an Undying Dragon would be able to rival that recovery speed of his... but they are especially weak to poison, so that can't be right...\"","\"The Dragon God's blood within him might have something to do with that.\"","\"No... the Dragon God's blood only enhances our existing abilities to extreme lengths. None of the Dragon God's Descendants have abilities beyond what they're capable of—not even the Unrivaled Tyrant.\"","For example, Long Yejun's ability to control water reached levels other Ancient Azure Dragons could never hope to achieve because of the Dragon God's blood within him. However, he would not suddenly acquire the ability to control the void or fire.","Four hours later, Yuan stood up and took another step before sitting back down again to cultivate. He would continue to spend four hours for each step until he reached the 69th step.","Ding!","<Your skill 'True Poison Immunity' has developed into 'Perfect Poison Immunity'!>","[Progress: 100%]","<Congratulation, your Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has successfully merged with Perfect Poison Immunity>","<Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique(Incomplete) has improved>","<You have acquired the title 'Harmonious Poison Body'>","The Baneful Dragon narrowed his eyes, sensing a drastic change in Yuan's body and aura as his physique merged properly.","\"What a ridiculous monster. Even the Unrivaled Tyrant is nothing in front of his poison affinity!\" The Baneful Dragon praised loudly. \"Don't let her hear that, or she'll kill you.\" Long Yejun said as he nervously looked around to make sure nobody there heard it.","\"Relax. This place is usually empty.\" The Baneful Dragon laughed.","\"I wonder why.\" Long Yejun shook his head.","Meanwhile, Yuan continued his march toward the very center of the poisonous swamp. Unlike before, when each step took him hours to complete, this time he moved forward without pause, not stopping for even a second.","In the blink of an eye, he reached the very center of the Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp.","<Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has activated>","<You have learned 'Heaven's Bane'>","[Heaven's Bane]","[Rank: Celestial]","[Mastery Level: 1]","[Description: The strongest poison—the bane of all existence. A single drop of Heaven's Bane could poison even Heaven itself.]","Despite the powerful new technique he'd just acquired, Yuan was paying attention to something else—something inside the Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp.","He crouched down and reached into the water, carefully retrieving a purple crystal as large as his entire head. The crystal gleamed with an otherworldly glow and exuded a deadly presence.","[???]","\"What is this?\" he muttered.","\"Congratulations, fourth Dragon God's Descendant!\" The Baneful Dragon suddenly appeared before Yuan with a wide smile on his face.","\"Huh? Who are you?\"","\"I am the Baneful Dragon—the owner and creator of this wonder playground! And you've just become the first entity to defeat all of my poison by reaching the very center of the swamp!\"","\"That object in your hand is a Baneful Crystal—a treasure I have been nurturing for over a billion years in this playground. It can be used to create poison or as a material to craft another treasure. I'll give it to you to celebrate this occasion.\" \"Thank you, Baneful Dragon. I will put this treasure into good use,\" Yuan said, already thinking about how he should use it.","Join Privilege for VIP Chaps!"]},{"number":1666,"title":"Chapter 1666 The Next Training Ground","paragraphs":["\"I can't believe you have managed to conquer the Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp in such a short time, and it's even your first visit to this place.\" Long Yejun praised Yuan when he returned.","He said, \"Are you a Baneful Dragon, too? Only a Baneful Dragon with Dragon God's blood could possibly achieve this feat.\"","Yuan shook his head with a smile and said, \"Sorry, you're wrong. I am not a Baneful Dragon.\"","\"I want to believe you, but alas...\"","\"Anyway, let's head to the next training ground.\" Yuan then said, leaving them speechless.","\"Already?\"","\"There's less than two years until the Dragon God Festival, so I am short on time. I am going to experience most of the training ground in the Divine Dragon Sanctuary by then.\"","\"Hahaha! You're really something, little brother! Good! I'll also stay with you until then!\" Long Yejun declared, as he had a feeling that he might be witnessing history being made.","\"What about the location where I can craft my treasure?\" Yuan then asked.","\"Don't worry, I've already notified my contact about it. I'll let you know when it's available.\"","\"Thank you.\" Yuan nodded.","\"Where are you going next?\" The Baneful Dragon suddenly inquired.","Yuan took a moment to look at the map inside his head before responding, \"The nearest training ground from here is the Sky Splitting Dragon's Tribulation, so I'll train there next.\"","\"The Sky Splitting Dragon's Tribulation, huh?\" Long Yejum mumbled.","\"It's been a while since I went there, so I'm going to tag along. I also want to see how far you'll go in a different environment.\" The Baneful Dragon said.","Long Yejun shattered a teleport stone that brought them near their destination shortly after.","'If I can become immune to lightning, I'll no longer have to worry about Heavenly Tribulations back in the Nine Heavens...' Yuan thought to himself as they entered the rift.","In the Nine Heavens, when an individual attains immunity to a particular element, their unique physique is given a specific name. For instance, those immune to poison are known to possess the 'Perfect Poison Body,' while those immune to fire are referred to as 'One With the Flames.'","For those who achieve immunity to lightning, they possess what is known as a 'Heavenly Physique,' a physique that directly defies Heavenly Tribulations. This unique trait grants them the power to withstand the wrath of the heavens itself, making it one of the most coveted and sought-after physiques for cultivators.","Most cultivators perish during Heavenly Tribulations when attempting to ascend to the next major realm. Thus, one can only imagine the immense value of the Heavenly Physique that enables its bearer to completely ignore these tribulations and ascend unchallenged.","A few days later, Yuan and his group arrived at the Sky Splitting Dragon's Tribulation. The training ground stretched across a vast, barren landscape, where lightning strikes continuously poured down like raindrops in a storm, illuminating the area with their relentless fury.","With countless lightning strikes crashing down incessantly, the training ground was filled with a deafening noise. The clamor was so overwhelming that it was impossible to stay there without sealing one's hearing.","Long Yejun snapped his fingers, covering their group in a soundproof barrier.","\"What a chaotic place and scenery, but it's also oddly beautiful...\" Yuan muttered.","Unlike the Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp, which was devoid of any presence, the Sky Splitting Dragon's Tribulation was bustling with beings.","\"Hey, look over there! Two of the seven Dragon Monarchs are together!\" It didn't take long for the beings there to notice Yuan's group.","\"Wow! The Water Dragon Monarch and the Poison Dragon Monarch? What a rare sight!\"","In the Divine Dragon Sanctuary, there exists a prestigious title separate from the regular rankings, bestowed only upon the strongest dragons of their respective elements. Both the Baneful Dragon and Long Yejun held this revered title as the Poison Dragon Monarch and the Water Dragon Monarch.","The Spy Splitting Dragon was also one of the seven Dragon Monarchs as the Lightning Dragon Monarch.","\"What are they doing together at this training ground? And who are those two unfamiliar faces with them?\"","\"I recognize the young man! He's the fourth Dragon God's Descendant!\"","\"So he's the one...\"","While the onlookers chatted, Long Yejun explained the training ground to Yuan.","\"There are nine levels of difficulty in this training ground,\" Long Yejun explained. \"You basically temper your body at the level you can endure until you're ready to move on to the next. Quite simple, right?\"","\"For reference, my limit is level 3,\" Long Yejun continued.","\"Only level 3?\" Yuan remarked with raised eyebrows, surprised that the limit seemed relatively low for someone of Long Yejun's stature.","\"As a water dragon, I am especially weak to lightning, so it's much harder for me to train here than others.\"","\"By the way, my limit is level 5.\" The Baneful Dragon said.","\"What about the Unrivaled Tyrant?\" Yuan asked out of curiosity.","\"She's conquered all nine levels a few million years ago.\" Long Yejun said. \"But it took her 300 million years of straight training.\"","\"300 million years...?\" Yuan swallowed hard at the sheer enormity of that number, unable to hide his awe and disbelief.","'Hopefully, it won't take me anywhere as long...'","After taking a moment to prepare himself, Yuan entered the training ground.","\"Then I'll see you later.\"","\"Good luck.\" They said to him.","\"Look! The fourth Dragon God's Descendant has entered the training ground!\" The onlookers started shifting their attention to him.","After entering the training ground, Yuan was immediately bombarded with lightning strikes that could easily kill even a Divine Grandmaster. However, it merely tickled him, who had attained the Golden Immortal Physique. Yet, he didn't continue to the second level and sat down to cultivate in the first level.","'Unlike the poisonous swamp, where I had some poison immunity since the beginning, I don't have any resistance to lightning, so I must build it up from scratch,' he thought inwardly.","Join Privilege for VIP Chaps!"]},{"number":1667,"title":"Chapter 1667 Sky Splitting Dragon’s Tribulation","paragraphs":["<Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has activated>","<Your lightning resistance has increased slightly>","<Your lightning resistance has increased slightly>","<Your lightning resistance has increased slightly>","An entire day had passed since Yuan began his training at the Sky Splitting Dragon's Tribulation, yet he had still not managed to develop any resistance to lightning.","Lightning resistance was not only one of the most sought-after immunities but also one of the most difficult to train. Among all the immunities, the Heavenly Physique was one of the rarest, even though it had the greatest number of pursuers. Seeing that he was only progressing slightly, Yuan was tempted to enter the second level directly.","After some contemplation, Yuan moved to the border between the first and second levels. In the second level, the lightning strikes crackled with a vivid purple hue, a stark contrast to the blue lightning of the first level.","A few moments later, Yuan entered the second level with just one of his arm to test the waters.","DONG!","As if his arm had become a lightning rod, the purple lightning strikes that had been raining down aimlessly suddenly converged, targeting him with unerring precision.","\"Whoa!\"","Yuan cried out loud when the lightning strikes completely obliterated his arm in the blink of an eye, and he hastily took several steps back afterward.","\"The difficulty between each level is no joke...\" he swallowed nervously.","Unfortunately, there was nothing he could do but continue training in the first level until he gained some resistance to lightning.","\"Is he bold or reckless? I have never seen anyone try to advance to the next level so quickly.\" The onlookers laughed after witnessing Yuan's blunder.","\"He was probably influenced by his success in my playground and underestimated this place.\" The Baneful Dragon smiled. \"Fortunately, he was smart enough to only stick an arm in there, or that would've been the end of him.\"","Unbeknownst to Yuan, the lightning strikes in the second level were several times more powerful than the Heavenly Tribulation Feng Yuxiang had faced and nearly lost her life to.","A few days later, Yuan finally acquired some lightning resistance.","<You have gained Weak Lightning Resistance>","After gaining Weak Lightning Resistance, Yuan immediately attempted to enter the second level once more.","Yet, nothing had changed; his arm was still instantly obliterated by the purple lightning.","\"...\"","However, not all hope was lost, as he was able to strengthen his lightning resistance this time, while his previous attempt did not give him any experience.","<Your lightning resistance has increased moderately>","<Your lightning resistance has increased slightly>","<Your lightning resistance has increased moderately>","Thus, Yuan began cultivating with only half of his body exposed to the second level, straddling the border and experiencing the effects of both levels simultaneously. This way, he could push his limits while still maintaining some degree of safety.","\"What the hell am I looking at?\"","The onlookers were in disbelief after seeing Yuan's ridiculous training method that took advantage of his insane regenerative ability.","\"Does that really work?\"","\"Only if you have his speed of recovery...\"","Meanwhile, Long Yejun was laughing.","\"Hahaha! What a brutal yet efficient method of training! Only someone like him could possibly do something like this!\" \"He did that with the poison at my playground, too...\" The Baneful Dragon shook his head with a defeated smile.","Word of Yuan's training at the Sky Splitting Dragon's Tribulation spread like wildfire, drawing an increasing number of onlookers. Some were captivated by the rumors of the fourth Dragon God's Descendant, eager to glimpse his identity, while others came to witness his potential firsthand.","Two weeks later, Yuan advanced his lightning resistance to the next level.","<Your skill 'Weak Lightning Resistance' has developed into 'Powerful Lightning Resistance'>","After attaining Powerful Lightning Resistance, the purple lightning in the second level no longer obliterated his arm. Instead, it merely tickled him, while the lightning from the first level had become so weak he could no longer feel it at all.","Seeing this, Yuan confidently strolled into the second level. However, he didn't stop and continued moving until he was right before the third level.","Then, just like before, he tested the water with his arm.","BOOM!","The red lightning strikes in the third level instantly obliterated his arm, and his lightning resistance didn't increase even slightly.","Meanwhile, the purple lightning no longer increased his resistance moderately. Now, it only increased his resistance slightly.","<Your lightning resistance has increased slightly>","After seeing the results, Yuan no longer bothered with the third level and focused on cultivating in the second level.","\"My god, he's managed to progress from the first level to the second level in just three weeks! What monstrous speed!\" The onlookers exclaimed with shock.","\"Even the Unrivaled Tyrant took several years! Does this mean the fourth Dragon's God Descendant is potentially even more talented than the Unrivaled Tyrant?\"","\"No, this just means he's more talented than her in this one aspect. The Unrivaled Tyrant has conquered most of the training grounds in the Divine Dragon Sanctuary, after all.\" \"Also, it is still too early to say anything. Even if his progress is faster than others, that won't mean anything if he reaches his limit too quickly.\" A month later.","<Your skill 'Powerful Lightning Resistance' has developed into 'Super Lightning Resistance'>","After advancing his resistance, Yuan repeated what he had done at the first level and cultivated in the third level with only half of his body.","<Your lightning resistance has increased moderately>","<Your lightning resistance has increased moderately>","During this time, news of Yuan's intense training session continued to spread across the territory, drawing in a steady stream of new onlookers. Curiosity and excitement filled the air as more people gathered, eager to witness his remarkable progress.","\"Elder Brother, I knew you'd be here.\" Long Meihui approached Long Yejun after noticing him at the training ground. \"Oh, you're also here, Baneful Dragon.\"","\"It's been a while, Princess Meihui.\" The Baneful Dragon greeted her with a handsome smile.","\"How long have you been watching?\" Long Yejun asked her.","\"I just arrived,\" she said, turning to gaze at Yuan with a look of awe in her eyes."]},{"number":1668,"title":"Chapter 1668 Courting Death","paragraphs":["\"How long has he been training here?\" Long Meihui asked.","\"It'll be two months tomorrow.\" Long Yejun said.","\"Did he start from level two?\" \"No, he started from level one.\"","\"What?! He went from level one to level three in two months?! That's impossible!\" Long Meihui exclaimed, her face filled with disbelief.","The Baneful Dragon smiled and said, \"Then you'll definitely not believe this, but he came here right after conquering my Poisonous Swamp in just a month.\"","\"WHAT?!\"","Long Meihui snapped her head to look at the Baneful Dragon with eyes as wide as saucers.","\"That's literally impossible! Even Elder Sister hasn't conquered the Poisonous Swamp! And you're telling me he's managed to do just that in a month?!\"","Long Yejun chuckled at her reaction, \"It's true. I was there from the beginning.\"","\"That's...\" Long Meihui fell silent with a dazed expression on her face.","In the blink of an eye, two more months passed. <Your skill 'Super Lightning Resistance' has developed into 'Supreme Lightning Resistance'>","After advancing his lightning resistance, Yuan entered the third level with his entire body and walked straight to the border of level three and level four.","However, when he tried sticking an arm in level four, Yuan was pleasantly surprised to see his lightning resistance increase, and his arm hadn't been obliterated, only burnt.","<Your lightning resistance has increased significantly>","Of course, it was unfathomably painful. Even though it was only his arm getting struck, he felt the pain throughout his entire body.","'No pain, no gain!'","After mentally preparing himself, Yuan walked into the fourth level, shocking the onlookers.","\"He's going straight into level four this time!\"","\"How bold!\"","\"No matter how many times I see it, his regenerative ability still shocks me... Is he an Undying Dragon?\"","\"Most likely.\"","Time continued to swiftly pass, and another three months have passed. <Your skill 'Supreme Lightning Resistance' has developed into 'Incomplete Heavenly Physique'>","By now, Yuan has spent seven months in the Sky Splitting Dragon's Tribulation. If the cultivators in the Nine Heavens knew that he'd managed to start creating his Heavenly Physique in such little time, not even the heavens could predict their reaction.","Even the most talented cultivators required centuries, if not millenniums, of rigorous training to attain the Incomplete Heavenly Physique, but Yuan had managed to achieve it in a little over half a year.","However, the Incomplete Heavenly Physique was just the beginning, as he still had to advance it a few more times to achieve the completed Heavenly Physique.","<Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has begun fusing with Incomplete Heavenly Physique>","[Progress: 25%]","Yuan went to stick an arm into the fifth level shortly after.","<Your lightning resistance has increased significantly>","When he confirmed that he was able to survive the lightning strikes, he entered the fifth level with his entire body.","\"Level five in seven months! I don't think anyone is going to beat this record!\" The onlookers could feel their bodies trembling in excitement.","\"If he continues at this pace, he'll reach level nine before the Dragon God Festival!\"","However, to the onlooker's shock, Yuan increased his pace, and just a month later, he began walking toward the sixth level.","<Your skill 'Incomplete Heavenly Physique' has developed into 'Imperfect Heavenly Physique'>","[Progress: 50%]","When he entered the sixth level and was bombarded with silver-colored lightning strikes, Yuan was pleasantly surprised to find out that he was enduring the lightning strikes with relative ease.","Thus, he made a bold move and went into the seventh level after testing the waters with an arm.","\"He's already at level seven?!\"","The seventh level unleashed torrents of black-colored lightning strikes, each bolt as thick as a tree trunk, crashing down with immense power and fury.","<Your lightning resistance has increased significantly>","<Your lightning resistance has increased significantly>","<Your lightning resistance has increased significantly>","Although he was able to endure the seventh level, each lightning strike was powerful enough to almost completely erase his existence.","Ding!","<You have acquired the title 'Courting Death'>","[Courting Death]","[Description: The holder of this title has faced the brink of death countless times. All sources of healing will be 1,000% more effective.]","After receiving his new title, Yuan's regeneration became even more powerful.","\"Is it just me, or is he regenerating even faster now?\"","\"You noticed it, too?\"","The onlookers did not miss this detail.","By now, the entire Sky Splitting Dragon's Tribulation was filled to the brim with onlookers, all of them watching with anticipation for the moment Yuan conquers the training ground.","In fact, even the Sky Splitting Dragon himself was present to witness history being made.","\"Took you long enough to show up, Lightning Dragon Monarch.\" Long Yejun said as he looked at the handsome, bulky man approaching their group.","\"I had to confirm the rumors—that someone had reached the seventh level from the first level in under a year. Is it true?\"","\"It is very much true.\" Long Meihui said.","The Sky Splitting Dragon looked around and asked, \"Where's the Unrivaled Tyrant? I thought she'd be here as well.\"","\"I haven't seen her since she entered the Void Vortex two million years ago.\" Long Yejun said.","\"But she should be returning soon for the Dragon God Festival.\" Long Meihui continued.","The Baneful Dragon shuddered at the thought and sighed, \"If only she never returned...\"","Time continued to pass, and it has been ten months since Yuan entered the Sky Splitting Dragon's Tribulation.","<Your skill 'Imperfect Heavenly Physique' has developed into 'Heavenly Physique'>","Ding!","<You have acquired the title 'Heavenly Physique'>","Yuan had finally acquired the Heavenly Physique after ten gruesome months of training. However, even after acquiring the highly coveted Heavenly Physique, his progress only went up to 90 percent.","[Progress: 90%]","'I guess there's one more stage beyond the Heavenly Physique...'","With that thought in mind, Yuan began approaching the eighth level, where golden-colored lightning strikes poured heavier than rain in a storm.","\"He's heading for level eight!\" The onlookers swallowed nervously as they watched Yuan step into the eighth level after making sure he could endure it."]},{"number":1669,"title":"Chapter 1669 Heavenly Physique","paragraphs":["<Your lightning resistance has increased significantly>","After reaching the eighth level, Yuan didn't pause and continued toward the ninth level. However, just as he was about to extend his arm into the ninth level, he suddenly stopped. His instincts had kicked in, warning him that he wouldn't escape with just a destroyed arm if he underestimated the ninth level.","'Let's ignore the ninth level for now...'","Yuan took several steps back and sat down to cultivate in the eighth level.","\"I guess he's not just bold and reckless.\" Long Yejun laughed out loud after seeing Yuan's actions.","\"He has good instincts.\" The Sky Splitting Dragon smiled.","\"You guys want to play a game? Let's bet on how long he'll take to reach the ninth level and conquer the training ground.\" The Baneful Dragon suddenly suggested. \"I'll start with five months.\"","\"Sounds fun. I'll bet a year.\" The Sky Splitting Dragon confidently said.","\"Then I'll go with six months.\" Long Meihui said.","Long Yejun pondered for a moment before speaking, \"I'll bet he'll conquer this place within three months.\"","\"What are we betting, anyway?\" Yingzi asked.","\"Good question. How about something we consider valuable? Even if it's only slightly.\"","\"Sure.\"","\"Then I'll bet a hundred meat skewers he'll finish in a month,\" Yingzi said.","\"Meat skewers? What are those?\" They looked at her with raised eyebrows.","The only person who knew what the meat skewers were, aside from Yingzi, was Long Meihui, who had experienced their deliciousness before.","\"It's food,\" she calmly said.","\"Food...? How's that valuable?\" The Baneful Dragon asked.","Long Meihui responded in Yingzi's stead, \"I can vouch for their value. They're unlike anything you've ever seen or tasted before. I can still clearly taste them even though it's been a year since I had them.\"","\"Now I'm interested.\" Long Yejun said with an intrigued smile.","\"But I thought they belonged to Brother Yuan.\" Long Meihui then inquired while looking at Yingzi.","\"They do, but some of them belong to me,\" she said.","\"I see...\"","A month and twenty days later.","<Your skill 'Heavenly Physique' has developed into 'Flawless Heavenly Physique'>","[Progress: 100%]","<Congratulation, your Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has successfully merged with Flawless Heavenly Physique>","\"Finally...\" Yuan stood up and immediately began walking towards the ninth level.","This time, his instincts told him that he had no problem withstanding the rainbow-colored lightning strikes in the ninth level. \"No way... is he already ready to conquer the training ground?\" The Sky Splitting Dragon exclaimed in a shocked voice after seeing Yuan's actions.","\"Slightly under two months... If he manages to conquer this place, it'll be the Shadow Dweller's win since she has the closest guess.\" Long Yejun said.","After taking a deep breath, Yuan stepped into the ninth level. As the lightning strikes rained down on him, they rapidly changed colors, giving an odd scenery.","<Harmonious Heaven Refining Immortal Physique has activated>","<You have learned 'Heaven's Final Judgement'>","[Heaven's Final Judgement]","[Rank: Celestial]","[Description: The pinnacle of lightning mastery, a level no human has ever attained. A single strike shall split the heavens and obliterate stars!]","\"He's done it! The fourth Dragon God's Descendant has actually managed to conquer the Sky Splitting Dragon's Tribulation in less than a year!\"","The onlookers cheered loudly after witnessing history being made, causing the place to tremble.","\"Unbelievable...\" Long Meihui muttered in a dazed voice.","\"Here.\" The Baneful Dragon handed a treasure he deemed valuable to Yingzi after losing the bet.","The Sky Splitting Dragon and the others followed.","\"Thank you.\"","Yingzi tossed the treasures into her shadow without even inspecting them.","Sometime later, Yuan reunited with Long Yejun and the others. \"Congratulations, Brother Yuan! I can't believe you actually conquered this training ground in just a year!\" Long Meihui congratulated him.","\"Huh?\" However, Yuan did not react in the manner they expected.","\"H-how long have I been training...?\" he asked in a shaky voice, his face pale with a look of terror as he sought confirmation.","\"Well, it hasn't been a full year, but it's close.\" The Baneful Dragon said.","\"11 months and 20 days, to be exact.\" Long Yejun confirmed.","\"Fuck! I had been training for that long?!\"","Yuan cried out in surprise, suddenly realizing that he had completely lost track of time.","\"I'll be right back!\"","Without explaining further, Yuan suddenly disappeared into thin air, dumbfounding everyone there.","\"What the? Where did he go?\" The Sky Splitting Dragon muttered with a dazed expression.","\"I don't know, but he'll be back soon,\" Yingzi said.","Meanwhile, in the Nine Heavens, Xi Meili approached Meixiu and asked with a worried face, \"Still no news from Yuan?\"","Meixiu shook her head in a dispirited manner.","\"It's been a whole year since he stopped all communication... What if something happened to him?\" Xi Meili sighed out loud.","Yuan had been so absorbed in his training that he'd forgotten to log off, missing his monthly update to the others for an entire year.","\"Don't worry, I'm sure he's fine,\" Meixiu reassured Xi Meili. \"The last time we spoke a year ago, he mentioned that he would stay in the Primal Expanse for at least another two years to revive Feng Feng. He's probably just lost track of time while training. This isn't the first time it's happened, though it is definitely one of his longest absences.\"","\"I really hope that's the case...\"","At that very moment, Chu Liuxiang appeared before them like a ghost, a wide smile spreading across her face as she announced, \"Yuan's back!\"","\"What?! Really?!\" Xi Meili's eyes flickered with excitement and relief after receiving this news.","\"Yes,\" she reassured.","\"What happened to him?\" Meixiu inquired.","Chu Liuxiang chuckled and said, \"He said he was training and lost track of time. He also wanted to say he's sorry for making us worry.\"","\"As long as he's safe...\" Xi Meili said.","Chu Liuxiang continued, \"Anyway, he returned to Cultivation Online immediately after telling me that. However, he said he'll return as soon as possible to update us once he's done with his business in the Primal Expanse.\""]},{"number":1670,"title":"Chapter 1670 Something Fun","paragraphs":["\"Where did you go just now?\" Long Yejun asked Yuan after he returned to the Primal Expanse a few minutes later.","\"That's a secret,\" Yuan said with a smile.","It was common for powerful beings in the Primal Expanse to disappear and appear suddenly, so the others weren't too baffled by Yuan's sudden disappearance.","Of course, they were curious, but seeing how Yuan didn't want to talk about it, they didn't question it.","\"Are you going to the next training ground now?\" The Baneful Dragon suddenly inquired.","Yuan shook his head and said, \"I am going to take a short break. Is there any place where I can have some privacy for a few days?\"","\"You can stay at my abode.\" Long Yejun said.","\"Thanks.\" Yuan nodded.","\"W-wait! Before you go, can I shamelessly ask for a few more of those skewers?\" Long Meihui suddenly said.","Yuan smiled, \"Sure.\"","He retrieved ten meat skewers and handed them to her the next moment.","Long Yejun and the others stared at meat skewers as they were being handed to her, their eyes wide with surprise.","\"What a unique aroma! Do you think I can get some, too?\" Long Yejun asked with a watery mouth.","\"Of course.\" After giving a handful of skewers to Long Yejun, Yuan turned to look at the others and asked, \"Do you also want some?\"","\"Please!\" The Baneful Dragon and the Sky Splitting Dragon eagerly nodded.","\"Thanks!\"","\"By the way, I am the creator of this place, the Sky Splitting Dragon.\" The Sky Splitting Dragon introduced himself after receiving the skewers.","\"Oh, it's nice to meet you. This is a great training ground.\" Yuan said.","\"You have no idea how much it hurts my pride when you conquer it so quickly.\" \"Let us know when you head to the next training ground. I want to be there when you conquer another one.\" Long Meihui said a moment later.","\"Sure.\" Yuan nodded.","Sometime later, Long Yejun shattered a teleport stone, teleporting Yuan and Yingzi to his living quarters.","\"You can go without me. I received the notification that your crafting room was prepared a month ago. I'll go verify it myself first. Don't worry, there's no rush. You can take your time.\" Long Yejun said to them.","\"Thanks for everything so far.\"","\"No, thank you for entertaining me.\" Long Yejun laughed before disappearing.","Once they were inside Long Yejun's home, Yuan handed Yingzi the rest of her meat skewers and said, \"I'll be gone for about a week or two.\" \"Okay.\"","Yuan logged off shortly after.","When he returned to his real body, Chu Liuxiang and Meixiu were already awake and waiting for him.","\"Welcome back,\" Meixiu said.","\"I'm so sorry!\"","Yuan wasted no time lowering his head and apologizing to her.","\"I was caught up in training and lost track of the time!\"","\"I know. Lulu already told me.\"","\"Still, I wanted to apologize to you myself.\"","\"It's fine. Honestly, it didn't feel that long. I guess the higher our cultivation, the more we're prone to losing track of time.\" Meixiu chuckled.","\"Right? I have also been a victim of this.\" Chu Liuxiang said.","Yuan then inquired about the Lord, \"Anyway, how's the Lord doing? I haven't replenished his energy in a year, after all.\"","\"He's doing fine for now. I visited him last week.\" Chu Liuxiang said.","\"That's good. I'll go replenish his energy right now.\"","Yuan left from their balcony and flew straight to the peak of the mountain.","The Lord emerged from his cave after sensing Yuan's presence approaching his place.","\"It's been a while.\"","\"Sorry, I lost track of time during my training. I hope you're doing okay.\"","\"I have endured many centuries without any help. A single year won't kill me.\" The Lord laughed out loud. \"Still... Anyway, I'll call Ji Ran now.\"","Yuan summoned the Starry Abyss shortly after.","However, after being summoned, Ji Ran said, \"Sorry, but I barely recovered any spiritual energy because the Primal Expanse lacks spiritual energy, so I won't be able to help.\"","\"Now that you mention it...\" Yuan rubbed his eyes after realizing this blunder.","\"I'm sorry, but you'll have to use my spiritual energy until I leave the Primal Expanse,\" he then said.","\"I don't mind waiting until you leave the Primal Expanse. After all, even if you give me all your spiritual energy, it will only give me relief for a brief moment.\" The Lord said. He continued, \"Moreover, the amount of spiritual energy I have received so far is enough to last another decade.\"","\"Alright. Then, I will return once I leave the Primal Expanse. It shouldn't take too long. Probably another year or two at most.\"","Yuan returned to his living quarters afterward.","\"How's training with the Eternal Lotuses lately? It must've been rough without my spiritual bath.\" Yuan asked.","\"Yes, it was definitely rough on the trainees at first since they suddenly stopped recovering overnight, but they've adapted. Moreover, every single member of their faction is training with us now.\" Meixiu said.","\"That's good to hear.\"","\"The Eternal Lotuses have also advanced their rank back to the top 10.\" Chu Liuxiang then said.","\"What about us? Have you guys participated in any Faction War since the last one?\"","\"Unfortunately, they're still afraid to challenge us. And since we've been inactive for a whole year, we're back to being unranked.\" Chu Liuxiang sighed.","\"The ranking doesn't have any meaning to us, anyway.\" Yuan shrugged nonchalantly.","He then asked, \"Any news on the government or the Ten Great Families?\"","\"Well, we know they're watching us from outside the Dragon Spiral Mountain, but that's about it,\" Meixiu said.","\"That's good.\"","\"By the way, when are you going to return to Cultivation Online?\" Chu Liuxiang suddenly asked.","\"I intend to stay here for a week or two before I return.\"","\"Do you have something to do on Earth?\"","He shook his head and said, \"No, I just want to spend some time with you guys since I've been away for a whole year.\"","\"Hmm... then do you want to go out and have some fun? It's been a while since we've done anything fun together.\" Chu Liuxiang suggested.","Yuan nodded, \"Let's do that.\""]},{"number":1671,"title":"Chapter 1671 Ready or Not","paragraphs":["\"Do you have any suggestions?\" Chu Liuxiang asked.","Yuan pondered for a good moment before responding, \"There is this place that I have always wanted to go to as a child but never got the chance to for obvious reasons. Nine Flags Amusement Park.\"","\"An amusement park, huh? I have also never been to one before. Let's go!\" Chu Liuxiang immediately agreed, even appearing quite excited about it.","\"What about the others?\" Meixiu asked.","\"We can invite everyone. I'll let Yu Rou know later.\" Yuan said.","Sometime later, Chu Liuxiang logged into Cultivation Online to invite the Demon Sealing Faction.","Meanwhile, Yuan and Meixiu went to visit the Eternal Lotuses.","\"Brother! You're finally back!\" Yu Rou was nearly brought to tears after seeing Yuan's face for the first time in over a year.","\"Sorry...\" Yuan apologized and explained the situation to her.","\"I thought we would see each other more often after becoming your neighbor... how wrong I was...\" she sighed.","Yuan smiled and said, \"This is the nature of the cultivation world. Anyway, you've grown taller and even more pretty since I last saw you.\"","\"Trying to change the subject? Well, I'll forgive you this time...\" Yu Rou showed a bashful smile after hearing his praises.","\"Then, changing the subject again, I'm here to give you an invitation. We've decided to visit the Nine Flags Amusement Park. Want to tag along?\"","\"I want to go!\" Yu Rou responded immediately and without any hesitation.","She continued, \"Oh, but can I invite Sister Jingyi and Sister Lianhua?\"","\"Of course.\"","\"Great! I'll go let her know now!\"","While Yu Rou went to speak with Xia Jingyi, Yuan visited Bai Lianhua.","\"Hm? Who is it?\" Bai Lianhua stopped her paperwork after hearing her door being knocked on.","\"It's me, Yuan.\"","\"Yuan?!\"","Surprised by his voice, Bai Lianhua swiftly stood up and rushed to open the door.","\"It's really you! Are you okay?\"","Yuan nodded and explained the situation.","\"Thank god it's only that. I was worried that something bad might've happened to you. I'm glad that wasn't the case.\" Bai Lianhua sighed in relief after learning of the truth.","\"Sorry for making you worry.\"","\"It's fine.\"","\"Anyway, did you need something from me?\"","\"Yes, I'd like to invite you to the amusement park.\"","\"A-amusement park?!\" Bai Lianhua took a step back with a bewildered expression on her face.","'Is he asking me out on a date?!' she cried inwardly as her heart began racing like a sports car.","\"If you're too busy, I understand,\" Yuan said as his gaze shifted to the piles of paperwork on her desk.","\"I'll come!\" Bai Lianhua hastily responded. \"I need a breath of fresh air once in a while.\"","\"Great. I'll let you know when once I receive the other's answers.\" \"Huh? The others?\" Bai Lianhua wore a dumbfounded look on her face.","\"Yes, I also invited the rest of the Demon Sealing Faction. Yu Rou and her friend will be coming, as well.\"","\"Is that so... I cannot wait.\"","Bai Lianhua's face flushed with redness after she realized her blunder.","'Why did I think we'd be alone?!' she cried inwardly.","Later that day, Yuan confirmed that everyone would be going to the amusement park.","\"When do you want to go? I'll schedule it for everyone.\" Meifeng asked him during dinner.","\"Since this is quite sudden, how does the day after tomorrow sound?\" Yuan asked the others, as everyone invited was present at the dining table.","Once everyone agreed to go in two days, Meifeng went to schedule the event.","\"An amusement park, huh? The closest thing we have to one at the Jaded Garden would be the playgrounds...\" Wang Ming mused.","\"I cannot wait!\" Wang Bingbing said.","After dinner, Li Jinxi approached Yuan to make an appointment.","\"Let's have a spar tomorrow morning. I want to see how much stronger you've gotten in a year.\"","\"Sure. I'll meet you at the training ground tomorrow.\"","That night, Yuan went to the spare room with Meixiu, and the two of them embraced each other for the entire night.","\"How's your training with Kelan?\" Yuan asked as they took a bath together.","\"Even though we've trained with him for a year, his training sessions don't get any easier. No matter how much we improve, he always has something even more difficult prepared for us. Because of that, we're unable to relax. However, as a result, we improve consistently at a tremendous rate.\"","\"What about you? What kind of training made you lose track of time?\"","Yuan gave her a detailed description of the training grounds in the Divine Dragon Sanctuary and the training he'd done so far.","\"Your training is at an entirely different level... but why am I not surprised? Meanwhile, we're still learning our basics and strengthening our foundations.\" Meixiu sighed.","\"The basics are just as important as whatever I am doing. Remember, I have experience from my past lives, so it's only natural for me to be significantly ahead. My starting line is different from everyone else, so there's no need to compare yourself to me.\"","\"I know, but it's human nature to compare ourselves with others.\"","After coming out of the bathroom, Yuan headed straight to the training ground, where Li Jinxi stood, the Golden Empress already firmly in her grasp.","Although it had been a year since they last sparred, and it was natural for people to change in that much time, Yuan could sense that there was something fundamentally different about the Li Jinxi standing before him now.","\"Did something happen?\" Yuan inquired with a curious gaze.","\"Why would you ask me that?\" Li Jinxi asked.","\"Just felt like it, I guess.\"","\"I'll tell you if you can beat me.\"","Yuan smiled and said, \"You should only utter such words if you've never lost to your opponent before.\"","\"Well, 'I' haven't lost to the current you yet,'\" Li Jinxi said in a weird tone.","\"What?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","Li Jinxi couldn't wait any longer and got into her fighting position.","\"That stance...\" Yuan's eyes widened.","\"Ready or not, here I come, Yuan! Or should I call you Tian Xin!?\"","A wide smile spread across Li Jinxi's face as she flew at Yuan, who looked stunned and was completely caught off guard by the way she addressed him.","\"Jin Xi?!\" he exclaimed."]},{"number":1672,"title":"Chapter 1672 Amusement Park","paragraphs":["Yuan hastily retrieved his Abyssal Dagger to block Li Jinxi's attack.","\"So you finally remembered your past life?\" Yuan inquired as they clashed.","\"I won't say anything until you beat me!\" Li Jinxi repeated.","\"But you've already said a lot...\" Yuan smiled.","However, instead of going all out to defeat her quickly, Yuan was curious to see how strong Li Jinxi had become after a year of training with Kelan and regaining Jin Xi's memories.","Their clashes were so intense that, if not for the formation surrounding the training ground, each strike would have caused the entire mountain to tremble violently.","\"I know this is not all you've got!\" Li Jinxi said to him a few minutes later when neither of them were gaining an advantage.","\"I can say the same to you. You seem weaker compared to our last spar a year ago.\" Yuan smiled.","\"Hmph. If I truly went all out, this mountain would perish in the blink of an eye!\"","\"Only the mountain? This world would perish if I went all out.\" Yuan shrugged.","\"You will be returning to the Nine Heavens soon, right? Let's postpone our match until then. We can only go all out in the Nine Heavens, anyway,\" she suggested.","\"I can't give an exact date of my return, but it won't be too long. I also agree that we won't be able to fight seriously unless it's within the Nine Heavens, so I don't mind postponing our match until I return.\"","After a slight pause, Yuan continued with a provocative smile, \"It'll give you more time to mentally prepare for your inevitable defeat, too.\"","\"Then it's settled.\" Li Jinxi said as she stowed away her weapon.","\"Are you really not going to say anything until then?\" Yuan then asked.","\"That's what I said, no?\"","Without saying anything else, Li Jinxi left the training ground, leaving Yuan standing there with a dumbfounded face.","After leaving, Li Jinxi returned to her room and stood before a mirror with a perplexed expression on her face.","\"So it's real...\" she muttered in a dazed voice.","Early in the morning the following day, everyone from the Demon Sealing Faction and three individuals from Eternal Lotuses gathered at the gates of the Dragon Spiral Mountain, where a long limousine picked them up and drove them to the Dragon Spiral Mountain's private airport.","\"It's Yuan and the rest of the Demon Sealing Faction! They're finally leaving the Dragon Spiral Mountain!\" The people hired by the government to watch over the Dragon Spiral Mountain were shocked to see Yuan and the others leave the mountain, and they quickly notified their superiors.","\"When did you buy a private jet?\" Yuan asked Meifeng when they arrived at the airport to see a luxurious private jet with the name of their faction printed on its body.","\"A few months ago,\" she said. \"We have plenty of money, so you don't have to worry about our finances.\"","\"I am not worried at all. I was just curious.\" Yuan said with a smile. Even if they were completely out of money, he could easily sell some treasures and gain a fortune.","With the amount of treasures in his possession, as well as what he could acquire, it wouldn't be an exaggeration to say the Demon Sealing Faction was one of the wealthiest in the entire world.","Once they boarded the jet, Meifeng drove it herself. The flight was only an hour long.","When they landed, the group entered another transport vehicle that brought them directly to the amusement park.","\"Huh? Why is it so empty? Is the amusement park closed?\" Yu Rou muttered out loud after seeing the empty parking lot.","Yuan used his divine sense to peer inside the amusement park and spotted several workers going about their tasks. However, not a single customer was present within the park's grounds.","Meifeng then spoke, \"Oh, that's because I reserved the whole amusement park for today, so we're the only ones here.\"","\"Seriously...?\" Yu Rou stared at her with wide eyes.","\"The experience will be different if we're alone...\" Chu Liuxiang sighed.","Meifeng shrugged and explained herself, \"In case you forgot, you're all celebrities. If I hadn't done this, we would've been swarmed by people.\"","Yuan then said, \"Although the experience will be different than what I had anticipated, I understand why it was done. I don't really mind it, either. Also, this means we don't need to wait in line for the rides.\"","\"I actually prefer that we're alone since we don't need to deal with anyone,\" Wang Bingbing said.","Sometime later, they entered the amusement park.","\"What should we do first?\" Yu Rou asked.","\"We have plenty of time to try everything, so why don't we explore the park clockwise?\" Yuan suggested.","\"Sounds like a plan.\"","Thus, the group began exploring the park, experiencing every attraction one at a time.","However, several attractions later, Wang Ming sighed out loud, \"This is more boring than I'd anticipated. Is it because this park was built for mortals? I don't feel any excitement from the rollercoasters.\"","As cultivators, their senses had been significantly enhanced, and things like rollercoasters felt like they were moving at a snail's pace. As for the height, it wasn't even worth mentioning.","\"It's a little disappointing, but there's nothing we can do about it. After all, this place wasn't made for cultivators.\" Yuan said.","They continued to explore the amusement park until they experienced all of the attractions.","\"Wow, that turned out to be a chore.\" Shi Lang laughed out loud as they left the amusement park.","\"Although there wasn't any blood-pumping and heartstopping excitement, I still had fun. It's like a walk in the park—one that is more elaborate, I guess.\" Yu Rou said.","\"I agree. It wasn't that bad.\" Chu Liuxiang said.","After leaving the amusement park, they returned to the Dragon Spiral Mountain to have a feast. Since Meifeng's cooking was better than most restaurants out there, they decided to save a trip and dine at home.","\"Brother, do you have anything else planned?\" Yu Rou asked Yuan as they feasted. Yuan shook his head and said, \"Not really, but if there's anything you want to do, don't hesitate to let me know.\"","\"Okay. Let me think about it.\" she nodded."]},{"number":1673,"title":"Chapter 1673 Returning to the Primal Expanse","paragraphs":["At the end of the feast, Yu Rou said, \"Brother, if you don't have anything to do, why don't you give us a concert? It's been a while since I have listened to your music.\"","Yuan nodded, \"Sure. How does tomorrow noon sound? I can do it in our training ground.\"","\"Then it's decided! I'll let the rest of my faction know, so make sure you have enough seats!\" she eagerly said.","\"Okay.\"","Later that night, Yuan cuddled with Meixiu. He'd cuddled with Chu Liuxiang yesterday after his short spar with Li Jinxi ended, and the two of them didn't leave the room until the very next day until it was time for them to head to the amusement park.","The following day, after embracing Meixiu for an entire night and morning, Yuan held a private concert in his training ground with the Demon Sealing Faction and Eternal Lotuses as his audience.","During the concert, Yuan played all sorts of instruments, from the zither to the piano to obscure instruments most of them had never seen before.","Meanwhile, government agencies around the world were in the midst of a meeting. The subject of the matter was, of course, about Yuan.","\"Yesterday at 0600, Yuan and the entire Demon Sealing Faction left the Dragon Spiral Mountain for the first time in over a year.\"","\"His sister, Yu Rou, her close friend, Xia Jingyi, and the leader of the Eternal Lotuses, Bai Lianhua, was also with them.\"","\"They flew from the Dragon Spiral Mountain's private airport to Jade City's airport, and from there, they went to the Nine Flags Amusement Park.\"","\"The Demon Sealing Faction's manager, Meifeng, who used to work for the Yu Family, had reserved the entire amusement park for the whole day. They spent six hours and thirty-two minutes in the amusement park and returned straight to the Dragon Spiral Mountain.\"","Every detail of the Demon Sealing Faction's movement was reported to the people in the meeting.","\"He went radio silent and holed up inside the Dragon Spiral Mountain for over a year, then came out just to visit the amusement park? What do you guys think of this?\"","\"Bastard doesn't even put us in his eyes. How dare he have fun at an amusement park after threatening us? He's acting like we don't even exist!\"","\"Honestly, I'd rather he ignore us than pay attention to us.\"","\"That's what a coward would say! How can you let a single man who'd just reached adulthood scare you with some threat?!\"","\"You say that, but I know you're also scared of him! This man has the power to destroy the world! We should ensure he doesn't see us as a threat rather than make an enemy out of him!\" \"Let's change the topic for a moment. Did we manage to find anyone close to him who's willing to spy on him for us?\"","\"We're still working on it, but we're making progress. We're currently in contact with several members of Eternal Lotuses trying to make a deal.\"","\"Increase the rewards if they're still hesitant—enough to blow their hesitancy away in an instant!\"","In the end, they decided to continue monitoring Yuan from a distance—at least until they found a way to deal with him.","Meanwhile, Yuan ended the concert after four hours. Then, for the rest of the day, Yuan sparred with the members of Eternal Lotuses to see their growth.","\"Since it's been a while, let's end today with a spiritual water bath,\" Yuan said, and the members cheered with excitement.","After the bath, everyone returned home.","For the next week, Yuan devoted all his time to Meixiu and Chu Liuxiang, making up for the past year he had been away, with most of that time spent making love.","\"I'll be returning to the Primal Expanse today,\" Yuan announced after spending 13 days on Earth.","\"Try not to disappear on us for too long again, okay?\" Chu Liuxiang teased.","Yuan nodded with a bittersweet smile.","After saying his goodbyes, Yuan returned to the Primal Expanse.","\"Welcome back.\" Yingzi was there to greet him upon his return, and all of the skewers she had before he left were gone.","\"Did Long Yejun come by while I was gone?\" he asked her.","\"Yes, he came by two days ago and left this behind.\"","Yingzi handed him a teleport stone before continuing to speak. \"He said everything's been prepared, and you can use this teleport stone whenever you're ready.\"","\"Alright.\"","After leaving Long Yejun's home and returning to the Divine Dragon Sanctuary, Yuan shattered the teleport stone and entered the rift with Yingzi.","When he emerged from the rift, Yuan found himself on a remote island that had an active volcano that was larger than any mountain he'd seen before.","\"Where is this?\" Yuan muttered out loud, as this place wasn't part of the Divine Dragon Sanctuary.","Suddenly, a powerful presence filled the entire island.","\"Are you the one Prince Yejun said will be coming?\" A stern voice rippled.","\"Yes, I am Yuan.\"","A half-naked, tall, bulky man with a bald head appeared before them a moment later.","\"Let's make this clear. I only agreed to lend you my precious workshop because I owe Prince Yejun a favor. I don't care if you're the fourth Dragon God's Descendant. If you make a mess of my workshop, I will kill you.\"","Yuan nodded with a confident smile and said, \"Don't worry, I'll be out of your hair—your sight before you even know it.\"","\"By the way, is Long Yejun not here?\"","\"No, but he said he'll be back soon.\"","\"Do you mind if I wait until he returns?\"","\"I don't care, but I only agreed to lend you my workshop for ten years—not even a second more. Oh, one more thing. The timer started when I notified you a month ago.\"","Yuan silently nodded.","'It's been a while since I created something, so I will be a little rusty, but it shouldn't take more than a few months to finish my treasures.' He thought to himself."]},{"number":1674,"title":"Chapter 1674 Metal Dragon Monarch","paragraphs":["\"Can you show me the workshop for now?\" Yuan asked the bald man. \"By the way, how should I address you?\"","The man lifted his head in a prideful manner and introduced himself, \"I am the Metal Dragon Monarch, Refined Obsidian Dragon! I am also one of the few beings in the Primal Expanse capable of creating treasures! As a matter of fact, nobody dares to claim they are number one as long as I am still alive!\"","Creating treasures was unheard of in the Primal Expanse until a human skilled in treasure crafting appeared hundreds of millions of years ago. Since then, they have acquired the ability and knowledge to craft treasures.","However, despite its potential, crafting treasures remained a niche practice in the Primal Expanse, as the knowledge and techniques were originally designed solely for humans.","While some, like the Refined Obsidian Dragon, have refined and further developed their techniques to new heights that allowed them to craft treasures for Primals and Predators, most lacked the talent to achieve such mastery and remained mediocre in their abilities.","The lack of treasures for Primals and Predators also contributed to why the beings of this world preferred using human appearances, as that allowed them to wield treasures. That said, only the truly powerful are capable of acquiring treasures, which is why only the top beings in the Primal Expanse take the form of humans.","Sometime later, the Refined Obsidian Dragon led Yuan to a massive cave located at the base of the volcano.","The workshop was so massive that Yuan couldn't help but think it had been built for giants. He glanced at the Refined Obsidian Dragon, whose human form was also significantly larger than normal, resembling that of a miniature giant.","All sorts of tools hung on the wall, but the most eye-catching was the elegant black hammer that hung prominently above the furnace, its surface gleaming with a mysterious aura.","Yingzi also looked around with interest. This was her first time being in this kind of environment, and it piqued her interest.","The Refined Obsidian Dragon took a seat near the entrance, his gaze fixed on Yuan and Yingzi. It was as if he were a vigilant guard, ensuring they wouldn't cause any trouble in his workshop.","Yuan also sat down and closed his eyes to cultivate.","Two days later, Yuan opened his eyes when he sensed a familiar presence appearing on the remote island.","Long Yejun showed up at the workshop shortly after.","\"Were you waiting for me?\" he asked Yuan.","\"Yes. I figured you wanted to watch.\"","\"I sure do! Also, this is for you.\" Long Yejun retrieved a fist-sized crystal that crackled with electric energy, tiny arcs of lightning dancing across its surface.","\"What is this?\" Yuan asked.","\"The Sky Splitting Dragon wanted me to give you this as your reward for conquering his training ground in record time.\"","Yuan accepted the crystal and inspected it with interest.","\"T-that is!\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon's eyes widened with shock after seeing the crystal.","He hastily rushed over to get a closer view of it.","\"What a wonderful material! I could craft something even better than my previous masterpiece if I had this!\" He glanced at Yuan and frowned, \"I doubt you have the ability to handle this material yourself. Even if you can somehow handle it, you'll definitely waste its potential! Instead of wasting such a precious material, you should give it to me. In fact, I am probably the only one in this world who is qualified enough to use it!\"","\"Refined Obsidian Dragon, even if Brother Yuan is willing to give you the material, the Sky Splitting Dragon won't approve of it since you didn't earn it.\" Long Yejun shook his head.","Yuan smiled and said, \"Sorry, but I have no intention of giving it to you.\"","\"You ignorant bastard! Do you even know what you're holding?! Do you even know how to use it?!\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon exclaimed angrily.","\"I have never seen this material before, but I will understand it once I spend some time with it. Also, who said that I wouldn't be able to use it properly? I certainly didn't say anything like that.\" Yuan shrugged.","The Refined Obsidian Dragon then spoke, \"You seem confident in your abilities. In that case, let's put you to the test. If you can craft something that satisfies me and prove you can handle this material, I'll no longer attempt to take it from you.\"","\"However,\" he continued, his eyes narrowing, \"if you prove incapable of handling this type of material, you'll have to hand it over to me. No, I'll take it from you!\"","Yuan frowned and said, \"I don't mind you wanting to test me, but why is there no benefit for me, regardless of the outcome? If I prove my abilities, nothing changes, but if I fail, you'll take my material. Does that sound fair to you?\"","\"As the one suggesting this test, you should, at the very least, put something on the line! How else will you atone for belittling me?\"","The Refined Obsidian Dragon gritted his teeth, struggling to suppress his irritation. Yet, he couldn't find any flaw in Yuan's logic. After all, even he had to admit that he was the aggressor in this situation.","\"Very well. If you can prove yourself, I will give you the most valuable material in my possession as an apology!\"","Yuan nodded with a smile, \"That's more like it.\"","\"Give me a few hours to prepare the materials for your test.\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon said before leaving the workshop.","\"I'm sorry about this, Brother Yuan,\" Long Yejun said, his tone apologetic. \"The Refined Obsidian Dragon may come off as an asshole, but it's only because he's incredibly passionate about his craft.\"","\"In fact, even if you were the Dragon God himself, he would still try to take the material from you if he deemed you unqualified.\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"You don't need to tell me. I understand where he's coming from, nor do I blame him.\"","\"Thank you.\" Long Yejun smiled."]},{"number":1675,"title":"Chapter 1675 Crafting His First Treasure","paragraphs":["The Refined Obsidian Dragon returned to the workshop several hours later with a leather pouch filled with materials.","He tossed the bag before Yuan and said, \"If you can craft a treasure while using half of the materials in there, I'll consider you worthy.\"","Yuan grabbed the bag and poured all of the materials out. There were twenty-one materials in total, and he didn't recognize any of them.","However, instead of panicking, Yuan smiled and muttered, \"Interesting. This will be fun.\"","He suddenly sat before the materials, grabbed one of them, and started inspecting it in silence.","\"...\"","The Refined Obsidian Dragon's eyebrows twitched at Yuan's actions, and he sneered inwardly, 'At least he isn't completely incompetent.'","After spending several hours examining every single material there in great detail, Yuan closed his eyes and began doing mental simulations. \"What's he doing?\" Long Yejun asked the Refined Obsidian Dragon. Despite being a blacksmith himself, he didn't understand Yuan's actions.","The Refined Obsidian Dragon narrowed his gaze at Yuan and pondered for a moment before responding, \"I believe he's doing mental stimulations. He's basically crafting the treasure inside his head right now.\"","\"What? You can do something like that? I have never even heard of this until today.\" Long Yejun couldn't fathom crafting treasures inside his mind.","\"It's possible, but it's extremely difficult to achieve since you need to know the materials perfectly, and you also need to be incredibly knowledgeable and experienced in blacksmithing.\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon clenched his fists in frustration as he spoke.","'Mental simulations? Hahaha! Even I cannot do mental simulations! There's no way he's doing it properly! This is just a waste of time!' he mocked inwardly.","A few hours later, Yuan stood up and said, \"Okay, I am ready to craft the treasure. Do you have a hammer I can borrow?\"","The Refined Obsidian Dragon grabbed an old hammer and tossed it to him.","Yuan looked at the worn hammer with a slight smile and said, \"It'll only make you look worse if I pass the test with this half-broken tool.\"","\"Here, you can use mine.\" Long Yejun retrieved his personal hammer and offered it to Yuan.","However, he shook his head, refusing to accept it.","\"Thanks, but I don't need it.\"","He walked to the anvil and controlled the materials from afar with his Qi Manipulation, throwing all of them into the furnace. \"What the...?\" Long Yejun's eyes widened at his bizarre actions.","\"Hahaha! What the fuck is he doing?! How can he throw all of the materials in her at once?!\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon burst out laughing.","They were taught to deal with one material at a time, so Yuan's actions made him look like a complete fool who knew nothing about smithing.","\"I can't believe I actually thought he was competent even for a second! He had me fooled in the beginning!\"","Yuan completely ignored the Refined Obsidian Dragon's loud mockery and focused on the materials inside the furnace.","A few days later, Yuan retrieved a single piece of material from the furnace. This material had no impurities and was perfectly refined.","When the Refined Obsidian Dragon saw this, his eyes nearly popped out of their sockets.","\"What the fuck?! That's impossible!\" he cried out loud.","\"He actually managed to refine that many materials at once, even though each one needed to be handled differently and required a different refining time?\" Long Yejun muttered in disbelief, struggling to comprehend the feat.","The Refined Obsidian Dragon felt an intense urge to rush over and inspect the refined material up close, but he held back. It wasn't out of respect for Yuan but rather because of an unspoken rule among blacksmiths to never interrupt one once they have begun their work.","After inspecting the refined material and being satisfied with it, Yuan placed it on top of the black anvil before him and started hammering away with the damaged tool.","The Refined Obsidian Dragon felt his heart skip a beat with every strike Yuan delivered to the material, his ears captivated by the mythical sound that resonated each time the hammer made contact.","\"What is this sound? How is he creating such a beautiful melody with that tool?\" Long Yejun muttered, his eyes wide with awe.","Even Yingzi, who knew nothing about smithing, could sense that something extraordinary was unfolding before her. She found herself completely absorbed by the performance, unable to look away.","\"The refined material... his hammering techniques... the sound it produces... it's beyond even my understanding...\"","The Refined Obsidian Dragon fell to his knees as the crushing reality of the vast difference in skill between himself and Yuan set in. It was an unfathomable gap, leaving him overwhelmed and humbled.","\"It turns out I was the ignorant one all along...\"","Tears flowed from his eyes.","After striking the anvil for several hours without pause, Yuan finally completed the treasure, which took the form of a sword. It radiated a powerful aura that would easily be graded as a peak-quality Empyrean-grade treasure in the Nine Heavens.","<Congratulations! You have crafted your first treasure!>","<Congratulations! You are the first player to ever craft an Empyrean-grade treasure!>","<You have acquired the title 'Divine Blacksmith'!>","Yuan walked to the Refined Obsidian Dragon, who was still on his knees and placed the treasure before him.","\"I'm done. Please examine it.\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","\"You're done...? Already?\"","The Refined Obsidian Dragon muttered in a dazed voice.","\"It's a bit slower than usual, but it can't be helped since I am still rusty, so thank you for giving me this chance to warm up.\"","The Refined Obsidian Dragon slowly reached for the sword before him, but he stopped himself centimeters away and withdrew his hand.","\"I don't deserve to touch it, let alone examine it. I am also not qualified to test you. I apologize for my ignorance and disrespectful behavior earlier. I hope you'll forgive me, Master Yuan.\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon apologized in a sincere tone as he kowtowed respectfully before Yuan.","Long Yejun stared at the scene, his face filled with bewilderment. He could never have imagined witnessing the Refined Obsidian Dragon behave in such a manner.","\"He's showing Brother Yuan more respect than he does to the Dragon God...\" he sighed with a bittersweet smile."]},{"number":1676,"title":"Chapter 1676 The Refined Obsidian Dragon’s Sincerity","paragraphs":["\"I don't mind forgiving you for your unruly behavior, but I will need you to prove your sincerity first,\" Yuan said to the Refined Obsidian Dragon.","\"How can I show my sincerity? I will do anything!\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon shouted.","\"Although I can make do with the materials I possess currently, it would be great if I had more. Do you understand what I mean?\" Yuan spoke with a calm expression on his face.","It took a second, but the Refined Obsidian Dragon responded with great enthusiasm, \"Of course, I understand! It would be an honor if Master Yuan used my materials for his creations! Please wait here while I gather my finest materials!\"","The Refined Obsidian Dragon rushed out of the workshop the very next moment.","\"Brother Yuan... how many more surprises are under your wings? Where in god's name did you learn how to craft treasures like that?!\" Long Yejun asked him with shining eyes.","\"I am mostly self-taught,\" Yuan said with a calm smile.","\"Self-taught?! Surely, you are teasing me.\" Long Yejun didn't believe him even for a second.","\"I am serious.\"","\"...\"","\"How long did it take for you to achieve that level of mastery? It must've taken billions of years. I am beginning to wonder if you're actually older than me...\" Long Yejun continued to inquire.","\"I am definitely nowhere as old as you, and it took me several thousand years to achieve my current level.\"","\"...\"","Long Yejun was speechless.","'It only took him several thousand years to achieve his level of mastery?! My nap lasts longer than that!' he exclaimed inwardly.","However, after thinking about it, Yuan had managed to conquer the Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp and the Sky Splitting Dragon's Tribulation in a little over a year.","'If I see it in that manner, I guess a few thousand years is actually a very long time...'","\"By the way...\" Yuan suddenly grabbed the sword he'd just created off the ground and offered it to Long Yejun, \"You can have this.\"","\"What? Are you sure?\" Long Yejun stared at him with wide eyes.","He nodded, \"Take it. You've been extremely helpful to me without expecting anything in return, so consider this my way of thanking you.\"","Long Yejun nodded and accepted the sword. When he held the treasure in his grasp, and its aura seeped into his skin, his entire body trembled.","\"What a masterpiece! The treasure I crafted is trash in comparison!\"","\"Don't undersell your own creation. That earring is also a piece of art.\" Yuan smiled.","\"I am only speaking the truth, Brother Yuan. I don't know how to explain this, but I have never held a treasure like this before. Compared to the other treasures, there's just something fundamentally different about this treasure.\" Sometime later, the Refined Obsidian Dragon returned to the workshop. This time, he brought back with him an even larger sack.","\"Here you go, Master Yuan! You can use these materials as you please!\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon poured the materials on the ground, forming a small mountain.","Yuan's eyebrows twitched as he took in the sheer quantity of treasures laid out before him. In his past life, he had encountered all sorts of treasures, including some of the most valuable and powerful materials. Yet, every single material before him now was entirely unknown.","'If I brought these treasures back to the Nine Heavens, they'd be priceless as one-of-a-kind treasures!' Yuan thought to himself.","However, the Refined Obsidian Dragon was not finished and continued, \"Of course, I didn't forget about the other thing.\"","He retrieved a black rock and offered it to Yuan.","\"This is my most valuable material—the Infinite Obsidian. I found this rock floating in the Infinite Expanse six hundred million years ago, and I have been trying to refine it since then. Unfortunately, I lack the skills and experience to refine it, much less turn it into a treasure. However, I believe you, Master Yuan, will be able to achieve what I could not.\"","Yuan accepted the rock and inspected it with immense interest. His eyes flickered as he examined every little detail.","'What a mythical material...'","Although he didn't know what kind of treasure it was, Yuan could tell it was as valuable as the materials he used as the core of Number One Under Heaven.","'No, this thing might be even more powerful... If I use this to enhance Number One Under Heaven, who knows what will happen!' Just the mere thought of enhancing his masterpiece sent chills through Yuan's entire being. He had always believed that Number One Under Heaven was already a perfect treasure, beyond any further improvement. Yet, the appearance of this unknown material had turned his understanding on its head, igniting a surge of excitement within him.","'Unfortunately... my cultivation is lacking. I will need to improve my cultivation before I can even attempt to refine this material.'","\"Thank you. I will put this treasure to good use. You have also proved your sincerity, so I'll forgive you and let bygones be bygones,\" he said to the Refined Obsidian Dragon after putting the Infinite Obsidian inside his spatial ring.","\"Your words mean more than you can fathom, Master Yuan!\"","He nodded and said, \"I am going to start crafting my treasure now.\"","Hearing this, the Refined Obsidian Dragon made a swift grasping motion toward the massive hammer hanging on the wall. As it flew through the air, the hammer began to shrink, transforming until it was small enough to be held comfortably, even by an ordinary human.","\"Please use this hammer, Master Yuan!\"","Yuan accepted the hammer and smiled, \"It's a nice hammer.\"","\"Thank you very much!\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon looked as if he was about to cry.","'This guy has gone crazy...' Long Yejun looked at the Refined Obsidian Dragon while shaking his head inwardly.","\"Master Yuan, do you mind if I watch you craft? I swear I won't disturb you.\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon then asked with begging eyes.","Yuan nodded, \"Sure.\"","\"Thank you very much!!!\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon actually shed tears this time."]},{"number":1677,"title":"Chapter 1677 Robes of Destruction","paragraphs":["Yuan sat before the mountain of materials and proceeded to inspect each one for several days.","After completing his inspection a week later, Yuan closed his eyes and began doing simulations inside his head.","Several more days later, he stood up, picked the needed materials from the pile, and tossed them directly into the furnace.","\"It's finally time!\" the Refined Obsidian Dragon exclaimed with excitement, his eyes gleaming like a child about to enter his favorite ride in an amusement park after waiting in line for hours.","While the materials were being refined, Yuan retrieved the Dragon of Destruction's skin and Number One Under Heaven, using it to cut the tough skin.","\"What is that treasure?!?!?!\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon's eyes popped out of their sockets after seeing Number One Under Heaven.","Long Yejun swallowed nervously and mumbled in a dazed voice, \"No wonder why he didn't even bat an eyelid when giving me that sword... That's a true masterpiece...\"","By the time Yuan finished cutting up the skin, the materials inside the furnace just finished their refinement.","After retrieving the materials, he immediately began combining the Dragon of Destruction's skin and the refined materials.","Clang! Clang! Clang!","Beautiful sounds filled the workshop.","\"His movement and techniques are even better than before!\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon's jaw dropped.","\"So he wasn't joking when he said he was rusty...\" Long Yejun swallowed nervously.","\"It's too vast...\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon suddenly mumbled in a dazed voice.","\"What is?\" Long Yejun asked.","\"Our difference. I knew he was much better than me, but I could've never imagined it was to such an extent. I am no different than a baby in his eyes.\"","\"Don't punch yourself down too much... You're still one of the best blacksmiths in the Primal Expanse.\" Long Yejun sighed.","\"Pei!\" Refined Obsidian Dragon suddenly spat on the ground. \"One of the best? Don't you ever say that to me again! I feel nothing but shame when I recall how prideful I was before Master Yuan opened my eyes! I was just a frog in a well, unaware of how truly vast the sky is!\"","A few days later.","<Congratulations! You are the first player to ever craft a Celestial-grade treasure!>","<You have acquired the title 'True Divine Blacksmith'>","[True Divine Blacksmith]","[Description: All of your creations below Celestial-grade will always result in peak quality!]","Yuan looked at the result of his work with a satisfied smile.","[Robes of Destruction]","[Grade: Celestial]","[Quality: Peak]","[Description: A piece of art crafted by Player Yuan. It exudes a menacing aura. When worn, the wearer will be able to use the technique 'Dragon of Destruction's Ultimate Chaos' once every 72 hours. Increases the wearer's Physical Defense by 100,000%. 'Dragon of Destruction's Scales' will automatically activate when the wearer's life is threatened, negating all damage for 10 seconds(30 days cooldown). This treasure is indestructible.] [Dragon of Destruction's Ultimate Chaos]","[Description: Absorbs a portion of all damage taken, which can then be released with up to 1,000% increased power.]","Yuan immediately wore the Robes of Destruction, a black and red outer garment that appeared simple yet elegant.","\"I am speechless, Master Yuan! I thought I couldn't respect you any more than I already was, but you've proven me wrong!\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon fell to his knees and started kowtowing to Yuan. \"You're exaggerating.\" Yuan smiled.","\"Please! Can this humble dragon take a closer look at the completed treasure?!\" he begged.","\"Sure.\"","\"I will forever be in your debt!\"","The Refined Obsidian Dragon jumped to his feet and rushed over to inspect the Robes of Destruction.","\"Does it have a name yet?\" he asked.","Yuan nodded, \"Robes of Destruction.\"","\"A powerful name, befitting of someone of your exalted stature!\" Refined Obsidian Dragon nodded.","\"...\"","Yuan could've never expected the Refined Obsidian Dragon to be so good at kissing ass.","\"Are you going to make more treasures?\" Long Yejun suddenly asked him.","\"Yes, but not from scratch. I am going to upgrade an existing treasure next,\" he revealed.","\"Upgrading an existing treasure? You can do something like that?!\" Refined Obsidian Dragon exclaimed in shock. He always thought that once a treasure was completed, it could no longer be altered.","\"I'll show you how it's done in a moment,\" Yuan said.","Refined Obsidian Dragon nodded and swiftly backed away, returning to his original location.","Yuan retrieved the Starry Abyss and the Baneful Crystal—the treasure he'd acquired at the center of Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp.","\"That dagger gives off a similar aura to his sword,\" The Refined Obsidian Dragon noticed this detail and mused out loud, unaware they were both Soul Weapons, something that did not exist within the Primal Expanse due to a lack of usage of weapons.","\"And that material... it gives me the shivers. What is it?\"","\"That treasure belonged to the Poison Dragon Monarch, Baneful Dragon.\" Long Yejun said.","\"I see... But will he be okay handling such a poisonous material? While his smithing abilities are second to none, his cultivation, on the other hand...\"","\"Oh, he'll be fine. He acquired it from the very center of the Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp, after all.\"","\"Seriously? Just how talented is he?\"","\"You have no idea...\" Long Yejun chuckled.","Their conversation stopped at that point when Yuan started working.","'Ji Ran, it will be a little chaotic for a bit. Please bear with it.' Yuan warned him before tossing both the Starry Abyss and the Baneful Crystal inside the furnace.","When he retrieved them from the furnace a few hours later, only the Starry Abyss remained, glowing purple and blue.","\"He fused the completed treasure with the material while they were inside the furnace... I have tried doing that before, but it would always completely mess up the treasure, so I figured it was impossible.\" Refined Obsidian Dragon sighed.","Sometime later.","<Congratulations! Starry Abyss has evolved and gained new abilities!>","Yuan gazed at the Starry Abyss with a satisfied smile. The once fully black dagger now shimmered with shades of purple and blue, resembling a vibrant nebula."]},{"number":1678,"title":"Chapter 1678 Starry Abyss Upgrade","paragraphs":["<Starry Abyss has evolved into Baneful Abyss>","<Baneful Abyss has learned the ability 'Mark of the Baneful'>","[Mark of the Baneful]","[Description: When this weapon inflicts damage, the victim will be inflicted with the Mark of the Baneful. Those affected by Mark of the Baneful will be severely poisoned and take continuous damage until their life is completely extinguished. The poison damage will increase over time. Mark of the Baneful can only be dispelled by the Baneful Abyss.]","<Baneful Abyss has learned the ability 'Revenge of the Baneful'>","[Revenge of the Baneful]","[Description: Whenever someone inflicted with Mark of the Baneful dies, their body will explode, automatically releasing a poison mist in a 100-meter radius. Those caught in the poison mist will also be inflicted with Mark of the Baneful.]","<Baneful Abyss has learned the ability 'Poison Acceleration'>","[Poison Acceleration]","[Description: The Baneful Abyss will accelerate the effects of all poison in its vicinity.]","<Baneful Abyss has learned the ability 'Poison Absorption'>","[Poison Absoption]","[Description: The Baneful Abyss has the ability to absorb all poison to enhance its own strength.]","Even without needing to test its abilities, Yuan could tell that the poison within the Baneful Abyss rivaled even Heaven's Bane.","'Revenge of the Baneful... this will allow me to kill a crowds of enemies with extreme ease.' Yuan thought to himself after reading its second ability.","After its upgrade, the Baneful Abyss has transformed into a terrifying weapon that, if misused, could turn the heavens upside down.","\"What an ominous aura that weapon now exudes. Even I don't dare to approach it.\" Refined Obsidian Dragon swallowed nervously after sensing the Baneful Abyss' sinister aura, even taking a few steps back.","\"It gives off the same dangerous aura as the Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp.\" Long Yejun commented.","Yuan looked at Refined Obsidian Dragon and showed a teasing smile, \"You don't want to inspect this? I'll even let you touch it.\"","Refined Obsidian Dragon began sweating as he started making excuses, \"I don't dare touch it... It's too much for a humble blacksmith such as myself. I would only dirty your beautiful creation...\"","\"It's fine. Come, give it a touch. But don't touch the blade. You might die.\" Yuan beckoned.","Refined Obsidian Dragon cried inwardly as he reluctantly approached Yuan. However, once he got closer and saw just how beautiful the dagger was, his passion overwhelmed his fear.","\"Wow! What a truly unique treasure! I can even feel a soul residing inside!\"","\"You can tell? This is what's called a Soul Weapon. They're different from ordinary treasures, as they give birth to their own consciousness.\"","\"Such a miraculous treasure exists?!\" Long Yejun also approached them to take a closer look.","\"A Soul Weapon... how do you make something like this?\" he then asked.","\"Some treasures have the potential to become a Soul Weapon if you use it long enough,\" Yuan explained.","\"Does that mean I can turn the sword you gave me into a Soul Weapon?\" Long Yejun asked.","\"It's possible.\" He acknowledged.","\"I guess I should start learning to wield the sword now...\" Long Yejun mumbled.","\"By the way, Refined Obsidian Dragon, this hammer of yours has already begun forming its consciousness. If you continue to use it, it should become a Soul Weapon in the future.\"","\"Really?!\" Refined Obsidian Dragon was immensely delighted to hear this information.","\"Anyway, I'm going to continue crafting some more treasures. I still have plenty of Dragon of Destruction's skin left.\" Yuan suddenly said.","\"I also have the Sky Splitting Dragon's material, too.\"","Yuan resumed his mental simulations shortly after.","A few hours later, he tossed the Sky Splitting Dragon's treasure into the furnace before he began cutting up the Dragon of Destruction's skin.","\"Looks like he's going to make a new pair of shoes to replace the ones I destroyed next.\" Long Yejun muttered.","Sure enough, Yuan wanted to replace the Stygian Boots next.","Sometime later.","<Congratulations! You have successfully crafted a Celestial-grade treasure!>","[Boots of Swift Destruction]","[Grade: Celestial]","[Quality: Peak]","[Description: A treasure crafted by Player Yuan. When worn, the wearer will be able to use the technique 'Sky Sundering Steps' and 'Lightning Strides'. Grants the wearer immunity to most movement restrictions. This equipment can be charged with Lightning Qi to increase the wearer's speed by up to 1,000%]","[Sky Sundering Steps]","[Description: A movement technique that allows the wearer to turn into lightning and travel at the speed of light.]","[Lightning Strides]","[Description: Traverse the Heavens at unimaginable speed. Instantly move up to 100,000 meters in any direction in the blink of an eye.]","Yuan slipped on the Boots of Swift Destruction, their sleek black design accented with bold red soles, perfectly complementing his Robes of Destruction.","\"How much longer before the Dragon God Festival begins?\" Yuan asked Long Yejun.","\"We still have about ten months. Do you plan on training some more?\"","He nodded.","\"But first, I'd like to test out some of my newly learned techniques.\"","\"Then we can go back to the Endless Arena.\"","\"You're leaving already?\" Refined Obsidian Dragon asked, seemingly reluctant to see him go.","\"Yes. I want to prepare myself as much as possible for the Dragon God Festival.\"","\"Then, if you ever need to craft something in the future, my workshop will always be available for you. As for the remaining materials... you can take them with you.\"","\"Are you sure?\" Yuan asked.","He'd only intended to use some of them.","\"I'm sure. Although it was short, I have learned a lot about blacksmithing from watching you, and I don't want to feel like I'd stolen your techniques.\"","\"I allowed you to watch because I wanted you to learn from it, but if you're willing to give me all of these wonderful materials, I won't refuse.\"","With a wave of his sleeve, Yuan gathered all of the materials and tossed them inside his spatial ring.","\"Thanks again.\" Long Yejun brought Yuan and Yingzi to the Endless Arena shortly later with a teleport stone."]},{"number":1679,"title":"Chapter 1679 Boots of Swift Destruction","paragraphs":["After returning to the Endless Arena, Yuan immediately started testing his new equipment and techniques.","'First up, let's try out my new equipment.'","Yuan looked at Long Yejun and said, \"Throw some attacks my way.\"","\"How many?\"","\"As many as you want.\"","Long Yejun nodded and started attacking Yuan with techniques weaker than his Dragon's Breath.","Since these attacks weren't threatening enough, Yuan just allowed them to land on his body.","The Robes of Destruction increased his Physical Defense by 100,000%, and what would've severely damaged him before barely hurt him now.","\"I'm going to attack now,\" Yuan suddenly warned.","Once Yuan had accumulated enough damage, he activated Dragon of Destruction's Ultimate Chaos, unleashing a ball of concentrated power at Long Yejun.","Long Yejun's eyes widened slightly when a ball of mass destruction that was ten times more powerful than all of his attacks combined flew at him.","Of course, even if the Dragon of Destruction's Ultimate Chaos could strengthen the attacks a thousand times, it would not be enough to harm a hair on Long Yejun, who only attacked Yuan with Divine Lord-level attacks while being as powerful as a God Ascension cultivator.","\"Was that your robes ability?\" Long Yejun asked afterward. \"That attack resembled one of the Dragon of Destruction's techniques.\"","Yuan nodded, confirming his suspicions.","\"So you can draw out the power of the Dragon of Destruction in such a manner... how interesting...\" Long Yejun muttered as he learned something new.","\"Okay, now attack me with the intent to kill me.\" Yuan suddenly said. \"Do that Dragon's Breath attack on me, but make it stronger than last time.\"","\"Are you serious?\" Long Yejun's eyes widened with surprise.","\"Don't worry, I won't die.\"","\"If you say so. Don't blame me if anything happens!\"","Long Yejun immediately began preparing for a Dragon's Breath.","A few moments later, he released it.","A Dragon's Breath that was twice as powerful as the last one flew at Yuan, who merely stood there with a calm smile on his face.","<Robes of Destruction has detected a life-threatening attack>","<Dragon of Destruction's Scale has activated>","A black barrier enveloped Yuan's entire body. When the Dragon's Breath connected with the barrier, it was immediately absorbed by the barrier, like a black hole.","Seeing this, Long Yejun continued to release Dragon's Breath.","Long Yejun closed his mouth after seven full seconds.","\"Wow... you really escaped that unscathed. Is that also the robe's ability?\"","Yuan nodded. \"But I can only use it once a month.\"","\"That's amazing. You basically have an extra life every month!\" Yuan tested the Boots of Swift Destruction next.","He tested Sky Sundering Steps first. When he activated the technique, Yuan transformed into a streak of golden lightning as he traversed around the arena at the speed of light. However, his spiritual energy was also being drained at lightning speed.","Even with how rapidly he could restore his spiritual energy, Yuan could only maintain Sky Sundering Steps for a full minute before he was completely exhausted.","'Even if it's only for a minute for now, I can travel an immense distance in that minute, and if I use it wisely, I can maintain it for much longer.'","After recovering enough spiritual energy, Yuan began testing Lightning Strides.","Every time he activated Lightning Strides, he would instantly travel tens of thousands of meters, up to 100,000 meters.","'It's basically short-distance teleporting, and it doesn't consume that much spiritual energy either.'","He looked at Long Yejun and asked, \"Do you have any technique that restricts movement?\"","\"I do. Want me to use it on you?\"","He nodded.","\"Alright.\"","Long Yejun made a grasping motion at Yuan the next moment.","\"Water Prison.\"","A barrier of water enveloped Yuan. It didn't directly restrict his movements, so the movement immunity from the Boots of Swift Destruction didn't activate, but it did trap him inside.","Once he was fully imprisoned, Yuan activated Lightning Strikes again.","Sha!","He turned into a streak of lightning that bypassed the water barrier, appearing outside it without any issues.","\"It's not completely teleportation, but it's close.\" Long Yejun muttered after seeing this.","Sometime later, Yuan said to Long Yejun, \"Alright, I'm going to attack you with a lightning attack next.\"","\"Do your worst.\" Long Yejun replied with a confident pose and smile.","Yuan pointed at him with two fingers and activated—","[Heaven's Final Judgement!]","The sky above Long Yejun suddenly darkened before swiftly releasing a thick lightning bolt, striking him.","At the same time, Yuan felt all of his spiritual energy deplete almost instantly.","Meanwhile, Long Yejun casually swatted the lightning bolt away.","\"It's definitely powerful—even more powerful than your robe's ability, but it didn't completely activate.\" Long Yejun commented as his gaze landed on Yuan. \"Because you lack the cultivation to activate it.\"","Yuan nodded and said, \"Yes, my cultivation is not enough to use it, but I want to try again.\"","He sat down and cultivated until he fully restored his cultivation.","\"I'm going to do it again now.\"","Once he was prepared, Yuan activated the technique again. However, instead of just using his spiritual energy, he also used the chaotic essence within his Chaotic Heart.","The sky above Long Yejun darkened again, but it was much more ominous this time.","Yuan could feel his spiritual energy and chaotic essence deplete instantly, but miraculously, he managed to retain a sliver of chaotic essence.","[Heaven's Final Judgement!]","BANG!","A massive streak of golden lightning emerged from the black clouds, striking Long Yejun.","Long Yejun tried to flick it away like last time, but when the lightning struck his arm, it immediately exploded, releasing countless smaller lightning energy.","Once the explosion subdued, Long Yejun looked at his arm. It wasn't bleeding, but he wasn't completely unscathed either, as there was a slight burnt spot where the lightning struck.","\"For you to damage me without my cultivation suppressed, even if it's only to this degree... As impressive as ever, Brother Yuan!\" Long Yejun laughed out loud."]},{"number":1680,"title":"Chapter 1680 Infinite Spiraling Abyss","paragraphs":["\"With that said, it is clear that you still lack the cultivation to truly utilize its true power.\" Long Yejun said as the wound on his arm quickly healed.","\"Yes, that feels like a fraction of its true potential. Unfortunately, that was the best I can do with my cultivation.\"","Yuan sighed, but he wasn't discouraged. If anything, he was excited for the future when his cultivation was sufficient enough to call down the true Heaven's Final Judgement.","'I guess the technique isn't Celetial-grade for no reason.' He smiled inwardly.","Yuan wanted to test Heaven's Bane and the Baneful Abyss, but he felt that it was too dangerous. While his techniques may not affect Long Yejun, poison was a different story, especially when it's one of the strongest poison in the world.","'There is a good chance that the poison won't affect him, but there's no reason to risk it just to satisfy my curiosity. I can test it later on people who really deserve it. As for Primordial Fire... let's not reveal too much just in case.'","With that decided, Yuan ended his testing there.","\"Alright, I am done here,\" he said a moment later.","\"So, which training ground will you attempt to conquer next?\"","Yuan began pondering.","He'd already conquered the three biggest and most useful elements out there: fire, lightning, and poison.","His lightning immunity made him unaffected by even heavenly tribulations. His poison immunity made it impossible to assassinate or poison him. As for his fire immunity, the fire element was one of the most widely used elements in the cultivation world.","After pondering for some time, Yuan smiled and said, \"I want to try my hands at the Infinite Spiraling Abyss.\"","Long Yejun's eyes widened as he hastily exclaimed, \"No, you don't!\"","\"The Infinite Spiraling Abyss is arguably the most dangerous training ground in the Divine Dragon—in the entire Primal Expanse!\"","Yuan was surprised by his reaction and asked, \"For you to react like this... Is this place really that dangerous?\"","\"You have no idea! Only those who have a good understanding of the power of the void should think of training there. Even if you're an expert, a single mistake and you'll instantly be consumed by the Infinite Spiraling Abyss and never return!\"","The power of the void, simply put, was the power to control space itself. If one could master this ability, one would have the freedom to traverse anywhere in the world.","This power was incredibly potent and filled with infinite possibilities, but it was also the most difficult and dangerous to cultivate, with countless casualties just trying to understand the surface of it. Hence, only a handful of cultivators dare to pursue it, and most of them do so after becoming powerful Immortals. However, even to this day, not a single cultivator has ever mastered the power of the void.","'I am well aware of how dangerous the power of the void is...' Yuan sighed inwardly. 'After all, not a single of my previous incarnations had any understanding of it despite being peak figures in their era—at least as far as I am aware.'","However, to be fair, none of them had tried to understand the power of the void, as the very concept itself was nearly nonexistent, and they were busy pursuing other paths.","\"Don't worry, I understand how dangerous the power of the void is, and I am not going to directly challenge the Infinite Spiraling Abyss. I am going to study it from the outside and try to understand it first.\"","\"I see... if you're only going to study it from the outside, I guess it'll be fine.\" Long Yejun mumbled.","A few days later, they arrived at the Infinite Spiraling Abyss, located inside a massive crack in the ground, its depths disappearing into darkness.","Unlike the Sky Splitting Dragon's Tribulation, this place was completely empty.","\"So this is the Infinite Spiraling Abyss...\" Despite being miles away, Yuan could feel a vacuuming force emanating from the crack, as if it were trying to pull him into its endless depths.","\"Be careful, or you'll get sucked inside.\" Long Yejun warned him.","\"I'll be right back.\"","Before Yuan started his training, he logged off and wrote a note to the others in case he lost track of the time again.","Since the Eternal Lotuses no longer needed his help with the spiritual bath, Yuan could spend more time in Cultivation Online without logging off.","Once he returned to the Primal Expanse, Yuan immediately began trying to understand the power of the void.","As Yuan became focused, Long Yejun looked at him and wondered, 'Will he actually understand the power of the void like this?'","He didn't mention it to Yuan because he wanted to see what Yuan was capable of, but there was another training ground in the Divine Dragon Sanctuary for those who wanted to understand the power of the void, and it was a much easier place specifically for beginners like Yuan.","The Infinite Spiraling Abyss was meant for experts—those who already have a good understanding of the power of the void.","'The others told me to contact them if Brother Yuan visits another training ground, but this place is dangerous, and the fewer distractions there are, the better.'","Trying to understand the power of the void was no joke, even for powerful beings like dragons.","In the entire Primal Expanse, the number of beings who had fully grasped the understanding of the power of the void was fewer than ten—and this referred solely to the comprehension of its nature, not the ability to wield the power itself.","'Besides the Primal Monarch, Dragon God, and Primordial Phoenix, I cannot imagine another being capable of wielding the power of the void. Not even the Abyssal Dragon, who is known as the Void Dragon Monarch, could wield such power to its full potential...'","As Yuan stared into the Infinite Spiraling Abyss, he gradually fell into a trance, much like the state he experienced when he first comprehended Dragon's Gaze."]},{"number":1681,"title":"Chapter 1681 Gathering of the Seven Dragon Monarchs","paragraphs":["'Power of the void... what a profound and mysterious concept...' Yuan pondered as he gazed into the Infinite Spiraling Abyss. 'It's like a branch that endlessly spreads out, extending into countless possibilities...'","The more Yuan tried to comprehend the power of the void, the more overwhelming it felt, almost as if he'd been tossed inside the void itself.","Long Yejun and Yingzi silently watched him from a distance while ensuring that he didn't accidentally fall into the Infinite Spiraling Abyss.","'What is that profound and mysterious feeling that surrounds him? I have never felt anything like that before.' Long Yejun wondered to himself as Yuan's aura gradually began to change.","After a few days, Yuan began showing signs of entering enlightenment. However, the concept of enlightenment did not exist within the Primal Expanse. As a matter of fact, beings in the Primal Expanse are incapable of entering enlightenment. The reason remains unknown because nobody knew of its existence in the first place.","\"What a mysterious aura...\" Yingzi was immediately drawn to the aura Yuan was emitting due to his enlightenment, and she subconsciously approached him.","However, Long Yejun snapped her out of it and said, \"You can't disturb him now. I don't know why, but I am getting this feeling that it'd be dangerous to disturb him now.\"","Yingzi nodded and moved further away from Yuan so she couldn't disturb him.","As time passed, the profound aura surrounding Yuan grew stronger and stronger until it reached the point where even other beings from far away could vaguely sense it.","When Long Yejun noticed several presences approaching their direction, he immediately set up a barrier around Yuan and the Infinite Spiraling Abyss.","Then, using sound transmission, he commanded the approaching presence to leave.","\"As the second Dragon God's Descendant, I, Long Yejun, command you to leave and stay away from this place for the rest of the year!\"","When those approaching heard Long Yejun's voice and command, they instantly halted, silently bowed in their direction, and turned around, swiftly leaving.","However, Yuan's aura of enlightenment continued to grow stronger—much stronger than ever.","'My concealment barrier isn't able to stop his aura from spreading even though it could completely hide our presence? What an extraordinary aura!' Long Yejun was inwardly shocked, but he didn't have much time to think about such things.","'I will be busy asking people to leave,' he smiled inwardly.","'Now that I think about it, I've done things for Brother Yuan I wouldn't bother for my other two siblings. What's so different about him?' Long Yejun realized that he had been helping Yuan to the best of his abilities without expecting anything in return, something quite unlike his usual self. Yet, despite this change, it felt as natural as breathing for him to help Yuan.","'He's humble and pleasant to have around, unlike the other two, who are always trying to get on my nerves. This... is this what it feels like to have a younger brother?' <Your understanding of the Power of the Void has improved slightly>","<Your understanding of the Power of the Void has improved moderately>","<Your understanding of the Power of the Void has improved significantly>","As Yuan's enlightenment deepened, so did his progress in comprehending the power of the void.","A few days later, Yuan's aura of enlightenment grew so intense that it spread throughout the entire Divine Dragon Sanctuary. Fortunately, word of Long Yejun's order forbidding anyone from approaching had also circulated, so few dared to get too close. Most onlookers observed from a distance, respecting the boundary set around Yuan.","Of course, a few individuals still approached—mainly the Dragon Monarches and the third Dragon God's Descendant, Long Meihui.","\"You're so mean, Elder Brother! You said you'd contact us the moment Junior Brother Yuan visits another training ground!\" Long Meihui stared at him with her cheeks puffed angrily.","\"I didn't say anything because I didn't want any distractions near Brother Yuan. I hope you understand,\" he explained.","\"The Infinite Spiraling Abyss... Even I could've never imagined he'd come here after conquering my playground...\" The Sky Splitting Dragon said.","\"Hahaha! I'd expect nothing less from the monster who conquered my poison swamp!\" Baneful Dragon laughed out loud.","\"You've changed, Prince Yejun. I never thought you'd be this caring toward another being.\" A new face said, his body naturally exuding intense heat.","\"What do you know, Hellfire Dragon?\" Long Yejun sneered.","The Hellfire Dragon, also known as the Fire Dragon Monarch, was a beautiful woman with long black hair and fiery eyes.","\"As expected of Master Yuan, he's as brilliant as ever.\" Refined Obsidian Dragon sighed out loud, his gaze filled with admiration.","\"The fourth Dragon God's Descendant... he's just a beginninger. Why did you allow him to cultivate here?\" Another new face said. He was a middle-aged man with long, wavy black hair and pitch-black eyes.","\"You're here too, Abyssal Dragon?\"","The Abyssal Dragon was the Void Dragon Monarch.","\"Who wouldn't want to investigate that weird aura? I came here as soon as I sensed it,\" said another new face, the last of the Seven Dragon Monarchs, the Ice Dragon Monarch, Eternal Frost Dragon. She was a young lady with short white and light blue hair and silver eyes.","\"Well, Elder Sister isn't here.\" Long Meihui said.","\"How odd. There's no way she wouldn't make an appearance during such a commotion. In fact, I'd expected her to be the first one to show up, too.\" Abyssal Dragon said.","\"She's probably too busy training to notice.\" Eternal Frost Dragon shrugged.","\"No way. Even if she's deep asleep, this weird aura would've instantly woken her up.\" Long Yejun shook his head.","Meanwhile, the onlookers were abuzz with excitement as they witnessed all seven of the Seven Dragon Monarchs gathered in one place, a sight so rare that it left everyone in awe.","\"Maybe the Unrivaled Tyrant died without anyone knowing?\" The Baneful Dragon suddenly suggested.","\"Hahaha! Great joke! Even if everyone were to suddenly die in the Primal Expanse, she'd still be alive and kicking!\" Sky Splitting Dragon laughed out loud.","\"Yeah, no way she'd die. What could possibly kill her when even the Dragon God failed to do so?\" Hellfire Dragon shook her head."]},{"number":1682,"title":"Chapter 1682 Basic Void Understanding","paragraphs":["One month... two months...","Three months passed in the blink of an eye. During this time, Yuan remained fixated on the Infinite Spiraling Abyss, his eyes staring into the darkness in a dazed manner.","<Your understanding of Power of the Void has increased significantly>","Ding!","<Congratulations! You have comprehended the basics of Power of the Void!>","<Due to your understanding of Power of the Void, you have acquired a new title!>","<You have acquired the title 'Basic Void Understanding'>","[Basic Void Understanding]","[Description: You grasp the fundamentals of the Power of the Void, allowing you to manipulate the void to a minor extent.]","<You have learned the technique 'Void Manipulation'>","[Void Manipulation]","[Grade: Mythic]","[Mastery Level: 1]","[Description: Allows you to manipulate the void to a certain extent.]","After acquiring the most basic understanding of the void, the Infinite Spiraling Abyss looked entirely different in Yuan's eyes. It no longer seemed out of reach and incomprehensible.","Once Yuan was familiar with the power of the void within the Infinite Spiraling Abyss, his progress skyrocketed, and his aura of enlightenment became even stronger.","However, despite Yuan's ever-growing understanding, he couldn't shake the feeling that he wasn't getting any closer to the next level. It was as if he had encountered an invisible bottleneck, and this feeling lingered for an entire month.","Suddenly, as if possessed by a ghost, Yuan suddenly began flying toward the Infinite Spiraling Abyss, shocking everyone there.","\"Brother Yuan! What are you doing?!\" Long Yejun exclaimed with a bewildered expression.","However, Yuan had moved with such speed that by the time Long Yejun processed the situation, he'd already flown into the Infinite Spiraling Abyss.","\"My god! Why did he do that?!\" Long Meihui cried out loud.","The Abyssal Dragon shook his head and sighed, \"How foolish. He'd only just reached a basic understanding, yet he dared to challenge the Infinite Spiraling Abyss meant for those who have fully comprehended the power of the void. I had high hopes for him, too.\" \"Right? How boring. I also had high hopes for him after hearing of his previous feats. I guess he'd only conquered the last two training grounds with luck.\" Hellfire Dragon casually shrugged.","\"Master Yuan isn't someone who'd take on something he cannot handle!\" Refined Obsidian Dragon roared.","\"Since when did you become the type to have faith in others, Metal Dragon Monarch?\" The Eternal Frost Dragon asked him.","\"Hmph! If you knew Master Yuan's true capabilities, you'd also be revering him!\"","\"Will he be okay?\" Yingzi asked Long Yejun with a worried look on her face. Since their first meeting, this was the only time she didn't have any confidence in Yuan's actions.","Long Yejun clenched his fists, and he responded with a deep frown on his face, \"Unfortunately, even if it's Brother Yuan, I don't think he can escape the Infinite Spiraling Abyss. If anyone can save him, it's the Dragon God and possibly my Elder Sister if he hadn't gone too deep into the void.\"","\"You only mentioned that he wouldn't be able to escape, but what about his chance of survival?\" Yingzi asked after noticing this detail.","He sighed, \"While the Infinite Spiraling Abyss is indeed very destructive, I believe Brother Yuan can survive it with his current level of regeneration. However, as he descends deeper into the void, the destructiveness will continue to intensify until it eventually surpasses his regenerative abilities.\"","\"How about the Dragon God? You said he could probably save Yuan. Can we ask for his help?.\" Yingzi said.","\"Hah! Good luck with that!\" Hellfire Dragon sneered. \"The Dragon God will only show himself during the Dragon God Festival or when he needs something. Since we're so close to the Dragon God Festival, he probably won't appear until the very last second, right before the festival begins.\"","\"I can try looking for him, but it'll take so long that it's better just to wait for him to show up during the Dragon God Festival.\" Long Yejun sighed.","\"No way...\" Yingzi wore a sorrowful look on her face.","\"What about Elder Sister?\" Long Meihui asked.","\"She's even harder to find than the Dragon God. Unless you're fated to meet her, you'll never find her.\" Long Yejun sighed.","He continued, \"We can only hope Brother Yuan survives long enough for the Dragon God to show up.","Meanwhile, somewhere in the Infinite Expanse, two individuals had been quietly observing the events unfolding at the Infinite Spiraling Abyss since the very beginning, their expressions calm yet alert.","A handsome man with long, beautiful golden hair glanced at the young child hovering beside him and spoke, \"Are you sure you don't want to save him? He's your son, isn't he?\" \"Weren't you prepared to kill him for faking his identity as your descendant just some time ago? Why are you suddenly worried about his wellbeing?\" The Primal Monarch inquired with a nonchalant expression on his face.","The handsome man, who was known as the Dragon God, smiled, \"I was—until he showed the qualifications to become a genuine descendant of mine. I can save him right now, but then I'll take him off your hands.\"","\"What kind of nonsense is that?\" Primal Monarch shook his head and continued, \"Also, even if you want him, does he want to be your son? You're just a slightly stronger dragon than the rest.\"","\"Hahaha!\" The Dragon God suddenly burst out laughing, his laughter powerful enough to shake the void around them.","He stopped a moment later and said, \"Did I just receive your permission to save him? Whether he wants to become my son or not... we can deal with that afterward!\"","The Primal Monarch sighed, \"Do you really think he needs your help?\"","\"...\"","The Dragon God stared at the Infinite Spiraling Abyss and sneered, \"Whatever.\"","Meanwhile, after entering the Infinite Spiraling Abyss, Yuan found himself in a pitch-black world that seemed to spiral endlessly around him as he continued to fall deeper into the void. His body was also constantly being damaged; while it wasn't enough to threaten his life, he could feel the intensity of the damage gradually increasing, becoming stronger with every passing moment."]},{"number":1683,"title":"Chapter 1683 Leaving the Infinite Spiraling Abyss","paragraphs":["Although Yuan's consciousness was awake, he was not fully aware or in control, akin to a state of sleep paralysis, where he was conscious of his surroundings but unable to move or react.","As the void continuously damaged him, his body felt like it was slowly being chipped away by countless ants. It wasn't too painful, but the gnarly sensation would drive most people mad if they had to endure it for an extended time.","Time felt incredibly slow inside the Infinite Spiraling Abyss—almost as if it were frozen. However, what felt like minutes to Yuan was actually days outside the void, and two full months had passed since he entered the Infinite Spiraling Abyss.","During this time, Yuan's comprehension of the power of the void continued to progress. Despite the constant pain throughout his body that grew more intensive as time passed, it wasn't able to disturb Yuan from his enlightenment. If anything, it sped up his cultivation, as every time the void inflicted damage on his body, he would absorb some of that damage, refining it into his own power.","It has been six months since Yuan started training at the Infinite Spiraling Abyss. As the Dragon God Festival drew near, more and more guests showed up at the Divine Dragon Sanctuary to participate or cheer on the participants.","However, these new guests were puzzled to find the Divine Dragon Sanctuary nearly empty. Typically, the sanctuary would be bustling with activity, filled with countless beings, but this time it was eerily quiet.","\"Apparently, everyone went to the Infinite Spiraling Abyss.\"","\"What is going on there?\"","\"No idea.\"","\"I heard the Seven Dragon Monarchs are also there.\"","\"Seriously?! Let's check it out!\"","At the Infinite Spiraling Abyss, Long Yejun sighed, \"There's less than half a year before the Dragon God Festival begins... Hang in there, Brother Yuan...\"","Another two months have passed since Yuan entered the Infinite Spiraling Abyss. Inside, Yuan was still half concious, and the void's strength has become so much that his regeneration could no longer keep up with it. However, it was just slightly below the rate his body was being destroyed, so his body was slowly being chipped away.","As of this moment, Yuan's body was a mess. His limbs were missing, and only his head and upper body remained.","Yu Ning tried to wake him up, but no matter how much she called for him, there was no response.","After another month, only Yuan's head remained.","'How long has it been? Am I going to die here? If I die here and return to the Nine Heavens, what about Feng Feng? Would I be leaving her behind?'","<Your understanding of the Power of the Void has increased signfiicantly>","<Your understanding of the Power of the Void has reached the next realm>","<You have acquired the title 'Moderate Void Understanding'>","Unfortunately, even after his Void Understanding had reached the next level, Yuan's condition remained unchanged, as he'd fallen too deep inside the void.","However, Yuan suddenly sensed another presence nearby. 'What a powerful, almost tyrannical presence... Is that old booger finally here to save me?' Yuan wondered as the presence approached him.","\"My, my, what do we have here? A human inside the Infinite Spiraling Abyss?\"","A small silhouette stopped before Yuan, her gaze staring at Yuan's handsome face with interest.","Yuan's transformation had been undone shortly after he entered the void, so he was in his human form at this moment.","\"You've only just achieved Moderate Void Understanding, yet you dare to enter the Infinite Spiraling Abyss. I have never seen a being as reckless as you. But what is this weird aura you're emitting?\"","However, Yuan couldn't respond.","\"...\"","Seeing Yuan was unresponsive, the silhouette tapped his forehead with a finger.","The next moment, the void ceased to attack him, and his body instantly regenerated fully.","His connection with the void had been severed, blocked by the barrier the silhouette had cast around him, and his enlightenment also ended shortly after.","Once he'd regained control over his body, Yuan looked at the silhouette and said, \"Thank you for saving me. You must be the first Dragon God's Descendant, the Unrivaled Tyrant.\"","\"Oh? You recognize me?\"","Yuan nodded, \"Long Yejun spoke of you before. He said I'd instantly recognize you the moment I saw you. Truly, your presence is something else.\"","The Unrivaled Tyrant's presence was unfathomably profound and chaotic, so much so that even the void around them was being affected by it.","Yuan examined the Unrivaled Tyrant's appearance. She had a petite figure and a somewhat skinny body, with short black hair that ended at her shoulders, a refined face, and sharp eyebrows that gave her a naturally fierce expression. At a glance, she looked like an ordinary, pretty little girl, but once her dark red eyes locked onto you, it felt like you were being preyed on by a bloodthirsty monster.","\"Um... My name is Yuan.\" Yuan introduced himself.","\"I'm Long Wu Qing, eldest of the Dragon God's Descendants. How long have you been living in the Primal Expanse?\"","\"Not long. I've only been here for about three years.\"","Long Wu Qing narrowed her eyes and said, \"Are you lying to me?\"","\"Why would I do that?\" Yuan quickly refuted.","\"You've just arrived in the Primal Expanse, yet you already have a completed Chaotic Heart? How do you explain that? Also, I didn't know humans were capable of having Chaotic Hearts.\"","\"I guess you can say I'm a special case. My father is the Primal Monarch, after all.\"","Long Wi Qing's eyes widened after hearing his words.","\"The Primal Monarch is your father...?\"","\"Well, he's not my real father. I was adopted by him.\"","\"I see... In any case, I have a lot to ask you, but we can continue our chat later. The Dragon God Festival is about to begin, so I will take my leave now. Do you wish to come with me or continue training here?\"","\"Honestly, I'm trapped in here, so I'd appreciate it if you can take me with you.\"","Long Wu Qing nodded and brought him along as she traversed the void.","'She's a pretty nice person. I wonder why Long Yejun made her seem like some unreasonable monster.' Yuan thought to himself.","\"Ah. I cannot wait to get back and have a feast. I have been training here for the last hundred million years.\" Long Wu Qing suddenly muttered out loud.","Yuan looked at her and said, \"I happen to have some food with me. Do you want some?\"","\"I am a very picky eater,\" she said.","Yuan didn't say another word and directly retrieved several meat skewers for her.","Long Wu Qing's body trembled the moment she noticed their savory aroma.","\"Let me see those!\" She hastily said in a demanding tone.","Yuan handed them to her.","Once the skewers were in her hand, Long Wu Qing examined them for several minutes before putting them in her mouth.","\"Mmm... I have traversed nearly the entirety of Primal Expanse and savored all kinds of beings, but nothing comes close to this!\"","After her fist bite, Long Wu Qing wouldn't stop until all of the meat skewers were gone—the skewers included.","\"Did you bring that food from the human world?\" She asked afterward.","\"That's right.\"","\"Do you have any more?\"","\"Of course.\" Yuan didn't hesitate to grab another handful of meat skewers for her.","'She did save my life, after all.' He smiled inwardly.","\"Do you have more?\" Long Wu Qing asked again a few minutes later.","\"Here you go.\" Yuan continued taking out meat skewers for her.","\"You're very different from the other humans I have met,\" she suddenly said. \"They would all cower in fear and soil themselves the moment they see me. Even my siblings are no different.\"","\"Have you met a lot of humans?\" He asked.","\"A few hundred of them, I suppose.\"","\"Wow, that's a lot.\" Yuan was surprised by the number.","\"I have lived a long time, after all. However, humans have stopped coming to our world for some time now. Do you know why?\"","\"Because they're afraid. After all, none of those who have come to this world have ever returned, so people just stopped coming.\"","\"That makes sense. What about you? Are you sad that you can no longer return to the human world?\"","\"Not at all. I can return whenever I want with the Primal Monarch's help, but I am staying here for reasons.\"","\"Once I win the Dragon God Festival, I will return.\"","\"Hahaha!\" Long Wu Qing suddenly burst out laughing.","\"You actually dare to claim you'll win the Dragon God Festival right before me? How bold! So, you think you can defeat me?\" She looked at him with an excited face, but her aura was oozing with bloodlust.","Despite her threatening aura, Yuan faced her and spoke calmly, \"Depending on the conditions, yes, I can.\"","Long Wi Qing stared at him in silence for a moment before turning away, but she didn't say anything.","A few more minutes of awkward silence later, they emerged from the Infinite Spiraling Abyss, shocking everyone there.","\"Brother Yuan! He's actually managed to escape!\" Long Yejun exclaimed in an excited voice.","Then he noticed Yuan had emerged with a different appearance, and even his scent had changed.","However, before he could even think about it, his entire body trembled as Long Wu Qing's tyrannical aura permeated throughout the entire place.","\"The Unrivaled Tyrant?!\" The Dragon Monarchs and onlookers exclaimed with shocked faces after noticing her presence, their very souls trembling in immense fear."]},{"number":1684,"title":"Chapter 1684 Unrivaled Tyrant","paragraphs":["\"My, what's going on here? I have never had such a massive crowd to welcome me back before.\" Long Wu Qing spoke with a slight smile on her face when she noticed the Seven Dragon Monarchs and the onlookers outside the Infinite Spiraling Abyss.","\"I-it's the Unrivaled Tyrant! Run for your lives!\" The onlookers began scrambling in fear, resembling a group of startled cats, their escape messy and swift.","The only ones who didn't attempt to escape were the Seven Dragon Monarchs, primarily because fleeing would make them appear weak, a vulnerability that would only invite further bullying and challenges to their authority.","\"What is this weird scent coming from the fourth Dragon God's Descendant?\" Eternal Frost Dragon suddenly mused out loud.","Since he was in his human form, Yuan's human scent swiftly permeated the area. It was so intense that it even halted some of the onlookers running away. However, once they realized the scent was coming from the Unrivaled Tyrant's direction, they began running again.","\"This scent... is the scent of a human!\" Long Yejun's eyes widened as he stared at Yuan, who now had black hair.","\"No way... why does Brother Yuan have the scent of a human on him? What happened inside the Infinite Spiraling Abyss?\" He didn't immediately entertain the possibility that Yuan had been human all along; instead, he assumed that something within the Infinite Spiraling Abyss had triggered this puzzling transformation. After all, there was simply no way a human could have the Dragon God's blood.","Yingzi wore a nervous look on her face after realizing that Yuan's identity had been exposed, but there was nothing she could do there. Even if she wanted to take Yuan and escape from the Divine Dragon Sanctuary, she knew it was impossible to escape with the Seven Dragon Monarchs so close.","Moreover, with Long Wu Qing beside Yuan, she would kill Yingzi before she could even reach him.","'The only thing I can do now is hope for the Primal Monarch to help us,' she sighed inwardly.","\"Thank you for your help, Senior Long,\" Yuan said to Long Wu Qing after coming out of the Infinite Spiraling Abyss.","\"You can just call me Wu Qing. I permit you to do so,\" she casually said. \"Anyway, I need to stretch myself. I'll talk to you again afterward.\"","When the Seven Dragon Monarchs heard her words, their faces darkened, and they simultaneously released their cultivation, shocking Yuan.","\"What are they—?\"","Before he could even finish his sentence, Long Wu Qing turned to look at them with a murderous smile on her face.","\"Let me see how much you've all grown!\" she laughed as she flew at them.","\"This crazy bitch! The Dragon God Festival is right around the corner, and she wants to fight now?!\" Hellfire Dragon exclaimed.","\"Elder Sister! Please wait a moment!\" Long Yejun shouted with a begging expression.","\"Damn it! Why is she always like this?!\" Sky Splitting Dragon cried out loud.","\"I shouldn't have come here!\" Refined Obsidian Dragon sighed.","\"Have mercy on me...\" Long Meihui shed a tear. She wasn't one of the Seven Dragon Monarchs, but she was still a target.","The Seven Dragon Monarchs attacked the incoming Long Wu Qing with the intent to kill her.","BOOM!","A powerful ripple swept the Divine Dragon Sanctuary when Long Wu Qing collided with the Seven Dragon Monarchs.","Yingzi had instinctively escaped the moment Long Wu Qing looked in her direction, and she barely made it in time, or she would've been caught up in their confrontation.","Yuan was swept away like a pebble during a storm at first, but he quickly stabilized himself.","A massive cloud of smoke hovered in the air, concealing the figures of the Seven Dragon Monarchs and Long Wu Qing within its dense, swirling mist.","Moments later, several silhouettes could be seen coming out of the smoke. To be more precise, they appeared to have been tossed out, and their appearance was a mess with blood all over their bodies.","Amongst these silhouettes were the Refined Obsidian Dragon, Eternal Frost Dragon, Long Meihui, and the Baneful Dragon.","After a few more moments, the cloud of smoke was forcefully removed when another powerful blast occurred, revealing Long Yejun, the Abyssal Dragon, Sky Splitting Dragon, and Hellfire Dragon's figure. However, they were all beaten up and dripping with blood, looking as if they had been run through by several trucks.","Long Wu Qing was also there, but she didn't have a single scratch on her body.","As Long Wu Qing hovered in the air, exuding an aura of confidence and superiority, she sighed and remarked, \"What have you lot been doing for the last hundred million years? Lying on your backs all day?\"","She looked at Long Yejun and continued, \"I am especially disappointed in you, little brother. I thought you would be able to last a little longer this time, but alas, you've barely improved since we last fought.\"","\"T-that's nonsense! I have improved a lot! You're just a damn monster who outpaces all of us significantly, so no matter how much we train, you'll always be several steps ahead of us!\" Long Yejun refuted, his voice full of frustration.","\"Huh? What did you just call me?\" Long Wu Qing's eyebrows twitched.","Long Yejun's body shivered, realizing that he'd misspoke.","Long Wu Qing moved again, but she only targetted Long Yejun this time, beating him left and right.","Long Yejun tried to fight back, but their disparity was simply too vast.","\"Wu Qing, can you stop beating him?\" A voice suddenly spoke, halting her movements.","Long Wu Qing turned to look at Yuan, who continued speaking, \"He's been nothing but a good friend to me ever since I arrived, and I cannot bear to see him in such a state. If you want to stretch, how about doing it with me? Ah, I would appreciate it if you can suppress your cultivation to match mine, or I'll die from a single punch from you.\""]},{"number":1685,"title":"Chapter 1685 Sworn Brothers","paragraphs":["A deafening silence filled the area for a good moment after Yuan spoke, with the Seven Dragon Monarchs staring at him with wide eyes filled with disbelief.","\"I like your enthusiasm, Yuan, but I don't want to injure you before the Dragon God Festival. After all, I don't want to hear any excuses when you lose to me,\" said Long Wu Qing.","Her words shocked the others more than Yuan's words.","'That crazy bitch is declining a fight?! I didn't know she was even capable of that!' Hellfire Dragon cried inwardly.","\"But I can't bear to watch you beat my friend any longer.\" Yuan sighed.","Long Wu Qing glanced at Long Yejun for a brief moment before releasing him.","\"Consider yourself lucky, little brother.\"","She approached Yuan and continued, \"Don't think we won't fight. We'll do it the moment the Dragon God Festival is over.\"","\"I am looking forward to it.\"","Long Wu Qing left the scene shortly after.","\"I didn't want to show you such a pathetic sight, Brother Yuan.\" Long Yejun approached him a moment later.","Despite his resilient body, the wounds caused by Long Wu Qing didn't recover normally, as if there was something preventing him from healing.","The same could be said for the others, too.","\"Don't say that.\" Yuan shook his head.","\"I can't believe you came out of the Infinite Spiraling Abyss with her. My heart stopped for a second back there.\"","\"She saved my life.\" \"How unexpected...\" Long Yejun mumbled.","\"By the way, what happened to you inside the Infinite Spiraling Abyss? Why do you smell like a human now?\"","\"Oh...\"","It was at this moment that Yuan realized he forgot to transform back to his dragon form. However, considering that his true identity has been revealed to Long Wu Qing, it would only be a matter of time before it was revealed to everyone else. \"Actually, I am human.\" Yuan decided to reveal his true identity.","\"What...?\" Long Yejun's eyes widened with immense shock.","\"I apologize for deceiving you until now, but I am not one of Dragon God's descendants.\"","\"W-why would you...?\"","\"I have my reasons...\" he sighed.","Long Yejun lowered his head and fell silent, seemingly in deep thoughts.","\"I see... so you were human from the start...\"","When Long Yejun lifted his head and showed his expression again, it was filled with excitement and admiration.","\"I can't believe a human has conquered the Baneful Dragon's Poisonous Swamp, the Sky Splitting Dragon's Tribulation, and even survived the Infinite Spiraling Abyss! Hahaha!\" He laughed so hard tears began forming in his eyes.","\"Hey, although we're not real brothers, can I still call you Brother? I've grown accustomed to it, and it wouldn't feel right if I changed it now.\"","Yuan nodded, \"Of course.\"","The realization that Yuan was a human began to set in for the others, their faces filled with shock, some with disdain.","\"Master Yuan is a human...? That explains his godlike smithing techniques! The art of smithing was originally humans to begin with!\" Refined Obsidian Dragon muttered to himself.","\"A human? A human conquered my playground?\" The Baneful Dragon wore a look of disbelief on his face.","The Sky Splitting Dragon had a similar reaction.","Long Meihui's eyes were sparkling with admiration.","The Hellfire Dragon and Eternal Frost Dragon glared at Yuan with disdain in their eyes.","The Abyssal Dragon remained silent.","\"Though, I must admit that I am disappointed.\" Long Yejun suddenly continued with a weak smile, \"You have taught and given me the experience of what it's like to have a little brother. Now I have to face the reality that I might never have a little brother.\"","\"Although I cannot be your real brother, we can still be brothers. In the human world, we have the concept known as sworn brothers. While they are not real brothers, they treat each other as one.\"","\"What a wonderful concept! Let's be sworn brothers!\" Yuan nodded with a smile.","However, a voice filled with power and authority abruptly resounded, \"Who said you can't be real brothers?\"","Yuan suddenly sensed a powerful presence behind one, one that surpassed even Long Wu Qing. However, it wasn't tyrannical and oppressive as hers.","Yuan turned around to see a handsome man with long golden hair and golden eyes hovering behind him.","\"Dragon God!\" Long Yejun hastily lowered his head after recognizing the man.","The others followed suit.","\"Dragon God?\" Yuan muttered.","\"Indeed. I am your father—or so you claimed.\" The Dragon God spoke with a smile that appeared threatening to Yuan for some reason.","Perhaps it was because of his guilt for taking on the identity as one of the Dragon God's descendants.","\"F-father! Please wait! There's a good reason that Brother Yuan—\" Long Yejun hastily tried to come up with an excuse, but the Dragon God sealed his lips with a single glance.","\"Brother Yuan, huh? It sure has a nice ring to it.\" The Dragon God chuckled.","\"Relax, I am not cruel enough to punish you for pretending to be my descendant,\" he continued.","\"Oh, really?\"","Suddenly, another figure appeared beside the Dragon God.","None of those present, except for Yuan and Yingzi, recognized him. However, they were bewildered that this young man could stand beside the Dragon God as an equal.","'No, he is standing even above the Dragon God!' Long Yejun noticed this.","\"You're not going to tell him that if I hadn't stopped you, you would've killed him?\"","\"You dwell too much on the insignificant details, Primal Monarch.\" The Dragon God shook his head.","\"The Primal Monarch?!\"","Long Yejun and the others exclaimed in shock.","\"W-we greet the Primal Monarch!\" They hastily greeted him in a messy fashion.","\"You've finally decided to show yourself, you old booger.\"","Long Yejun and the others stared at Yuan with terrified expressions.","\"B-Brother Yuan! T-that's...\" Long Yejun tried to warn him, but Yuan interrupted with a smile, \"Don't worry, he's my old man—my father.\"","\"Y-your father?\" Long Yejun looked speechless.","\"Yes.\" Yuan confirmed."]},{"number":1686,"title":"Chapter 1686 A Feast Before the Festival","paragraphs":["\"Did you want me to save you sooner? I knew there was someone inside that was capable of saving you, so why would I waste my energy?\" The Primal Monarch shrugged with a smile on his face after hearing Yuan's words.","\"What if she didn't save me?\" he asked.","\"But that didn't happen, so why dwell on it?\" Yuan sighed and no longer tried to argue with him.","\"Ahem.\" The Dragon God cleared his throat. \"As I was saying. If you want to become my descendant, I will make it possible.\"","\"You were serious?\" Yuan looked at him with wide eyes.","\"Of course. Do you want me to show you how serious I am?\"","\"Hey, why are you trying to poach him when you didn't even save him?\" Primal Monarch suddenly asked.","\"My daughter saved him, which is the same thing.\" Dragon God shrugged.","\"I can't believe such shameless words are coming out of that mouth. Did you hit your head too hard recently?\"","Long Yejun and the others were bewildered by the Dragon God and Primal Monarch's childish bickering, as they had never seen such behavior from these godlike existences.","'Since when were they on such good terms with each other?' Long Yejun wondered inwardly.","Once it seemed like their conversation had ended, Yuan spoke, \"I don't know how you'll make me a descendant, and I appreciate the offer, but I will have to decline. After all, I already have a father here.\"","Primal Monarch snickered after hearing this. The Dragon God's expression didn't change much, and he appeared calm, but he was definitely disappointed inwardly.","\"What a pity. With your talents, you definitely qualify to be my descendant. But if you don't want it, I can't force you.\"","\"The Dragon God Festival will begin soon, so I will take my leave now. Until then.\" The Dragon God disappeared into thin air the very next moment.","\"I'll also take my leave for now.\" The Primal Monarch left before Yuan could say anything to him.","The place remained dead silent even many moments later.","Eventually, Long Yejun broke the silence and spoke in a trembling voice, \"I can't believe you're the Primal Monarch's descendant! That's actually even more impressive than being the Dragon God's descendant!\"","\"Well, I am not really his blood-related descendant. I was adopted by him, and he gave his Blood Essence to me.\" Yuan explained.","\"The Primal Monarch's Blood Essence?! That's even more impressive!\" Long Yejun cried out loud.","He continued, \"Anyway, what are you going to do now? Since we still have a little time left before the Dragon God Festival, want to have a feast?\"","Yuan nodded and said, \"Sure, but I will be away for a little.\"","\"No worries. We need a few days to prepare the feast, anyway.\" Long Yejun nodded.","Yuan looked at Yingzi and said to her, \"I'll be gone for a bit again.\"","\"Okay.\"","Yuan logged off at that moment.","\"Huh? Where did he go?\" The Baneful Dragon muttered in a dazed voice.","\"I can't sense his presence anymore, almost as if he ceased to exist. Was that the power of the void?\" Long Meihui inquired out loud, her face filled with wonder.","\"The Primal Monarch probably took him somewhere,\" Eternal Frost Dragon deducted.","Meanwhile, Yuan returned to Earth again.","He looked at the two sleeping beauties beside him and sighed, \"I'd just promised them that I'd not lose track of time, but alas, it's almost been a year since my last return...\"","Although he didn't technically lose track of time but was trapped inside the Infinite Spiraling Abyss, it was basically the same thing.","Yuan waited for either Meixiu or Chu Liuxiang to wake up.","The following day, Meixiu was the first to wake up. She and Chu Liuxiang had been taking turns logging off every other day to see if Yuan had returned.","\"Hm? You're back?\" Meixiu looked at him with a pleasantly surprised face.","\"Yes...\"","Upon seeing his apologetic smile, Meixiu instantly knew he was about to apologize for his absence again, so she swiftly placed a finger on his lips and said, \"You don't need to apologize. We were prepared for it when you left a note this time.\"","Yuan nodded and said, \"Alright, I won't apologize, but I want to tell you what happened this time.\"","\"Of course.\"","Yuan proceeded to explain about being trapped inside the Infinite Spiraling Abyss and how time flowed differently inside.","\"It felt like I had only been there for several minutes, but by the time I came out, several months had passed,\" he said.","\"Anyway, the Dragon God Festival is right around the corner. Once I finish it and hopefully win it, I'll immediately return to the Nine Heavens.\"","\"What will happen if you don't win?\" Meixiu entertained this possibility and inquired.","\"Then I'll have to ask the Primal Monarch for help. If he can't help Feng Feng, I'll just have to postpone her revival and return to the Nine Heavens. Though, I doubt the Primordial Phoenix will accept that outcome.\"","\"She said that she'd wage war with the Divine Dragon Sanctuary for the treasure if I failed, and I cannot allow that to happen no matter what. I don't know how serious she was being when she said it, but I have a feeling she was being dead serious,\" Yuan sighed.","\"If I have no other option, I will see if the Dragon God would be willing to lend me the treasure, and in exchange, I will become his descendant.\"","\"His descendant?\" Meixiu wore a puzzled look on her face.","\"Apparently, the Dragon God wants me to be his descendant. I don't know what went through his mind that led him to such a decision, though.\"","After chatting for some time, Yuan and Meixiu spent the rest of the day together. He did the same thing with Chu Liuxiang the following day. Then, he visited Yu Rou and the Eternal Lotuses.","Once he caught up with everyone, Yuan returned to the Primal Expanse for the feast."]},{"number":1687,"title":"Chapter 1687 Seasoning","paragraphs":["When Yuan returned to the Primal Expanse, Yingzi was there to greet him with a teleport stone given to her by Long Yejun.","Without uttering a word, Yingzi handed the teleport stone to him.","After attaining Moderate Void Understanding, Yuan could see the more intricate details within the teleport stone, even able to tell the direction it would take him. He shattered the teleport stone the next moment and entered the rift created by it.","When they emerged from the rift, Yuan and Yingzi appeared at the Endless Arena, but it had a vastly different atmosphere and was no longer as empty as their previous visits. The once-empty platform is now filled with human figures and beasts, with mountains of food in every direction.","Since Yuan was still in his human form, his scent quickly spread, attracting the attention of those around him.","They stared at him in silence for a few moments before someone shouted, \"It's the Primal Monarch's descendant!\" News of Yuan's true identity had long spread throughout the Divine Dragon Sanctuary. Some were upset, even angry, that they had been deceived by a human, but the majority of them didn't mind it and became more impressed by his feats in the past two years.","The beings near Yuan respectfully greeted him, regardless of their feelings toward him, as he was the Primal Monarch's descendant, which ranked even above the Dragon God's descendants.","\"Oh, you've arrived.\" Long Yejun appeared shortly after their arrival.","\"Follow me. I'll bring you to our spot.\"","Yuan and Yingzi followed him to another area where the other Dragon Monarchs were present. However, not all seven of the Dragon Monarchs were present.","Besides the Hellfire Dragon and Eternal Frost Dragon, the rest were there.","\"Hello, everyone. Sorry to make you wait.\"","\"It's fine. We just finished setting up the place.\" Long Yejun said.","\"There's still two weeks left before the Dragon God Festival. Enjoy yourself until then!\" Long Yejun's voice rippled throughout the Endless Arena. Everyone started stuffing their mouths with food the very next moment.","Yuan also started eating the food that had been prepared using beings that only existed in the Primal Expanse.","Although the food had natural flavors, it lacked any seasoning, so it was very lackluster compared to the food in the human world.","Realizing this, Yuan said to them, \"You guys like the meat skewers, right? How about I prepare this food in the same way?\"","\"What? You can do that?\" Long Yejun's eyes widened.","\"Please do!\" Long Meihui exclaimed, her eyes flickering with excitement.","Yuan nodded and retrieved several bottles of seasoning. \"One of the most significant contributors to the excellence of human food is how we apply our seasoning—how we season our food.\"","He showed them the bottles and continued, \"We call this seasoning. If we apply it to the food, it will give the food a specific taste. If we mix them together, it will create a unique flavor, and different mixtures have different results.\"","Yuan sprinkled some salt on his food and handed it to Long Yejun.","\"This is one of the most commonly used seasonings. Salt.\"","When Long Yejun bit into the meat, his eyes widened with surprise. \"What the! This food is now several times tastier!\" \"L-let me try!\" Long Meihui and the others shouted.","Yuan sprinkled some salt onto their food.","\"Wow!\"","\"I can't believe those tiny sand-like things could enhance the flavors so much!\"","\"This one is called black pepper, another commonly used seasoning.\" Yuan handed them more food.","\"What a stark difference!\"","\"And this is what happens when I mix them together.\"","Yuan added salt, black pepper, and garlic powder to the next sample.","Long Yejun and the others trembled with satisfaction when they ate the food.","\"I used to underestimate humans, but the fact is, they possess knowledge we could never fathom...\" The Baneful Dragon muttered.","\"I've known that since I learned how to blacksmith from one.\" Refined Obsidian Dragon commented.","Yuan then said, \"By the way, we typically season our food before cooking it.\"","\"Speaking of cooking, we also learned that from humans. Before, we would consume our food raw.\" Long Yejun said.","Yingzi gently tugged on Yuan's robes and asked, \"How about the flavor of meat skewers? What kind of seasoning do you put on them?\"","\"Many people have their own special mix, but the majority of them contain cumin, salt, and chili.\" Yuan tried to replicate the seasoning of the meat skewers in his possession and handed them to Yingzi.","\"It's missing some flavors, but it's very close,\" she said after tasting it.","\"There are hundreds of different seasonings out there, but I only have some of them,\" Yuan said.","Yuan took out all of the seasoning in his possession to let the others use them as they pleased.","Long Yejun and the others had a blast testing out every combination, but their peace lasted only for a few minutes.","Suddenly, a rift appeared right next to Yuan, and even before the figure emerged, their tyrannical presence poured through the rift, saturating the surroundings with an overwhelming and oppressive force.","\"My, my. How can you have a feast without me?\" Long Wu Qing spoke as she walked out of the rift. However, she looked a little different from before. While most of her features remained the same, she was much taller and more mature-looking, resembling that of a peerless woman.","\"Because we knew you'd show up regardless.\" Long Yejun spoke with a nervous smile.","Long Wu Qing looked at the bottle of salt in his hand and inquired, \"What is that white stuff in your hand?\"","\"Seasoning. Humans use them to enhance the flavor of their food.\" Yuan gave her a brief explanation.","\"Interesting,\" she showed a thrilled smile. \"Show me how to use it.\"","\"Ummm... I don't mind, but can you do something about your presence? It's terrifying everyone.\" Yuan said.","Everyone at the Endless Arena had instinctively halted their movements since Long Wu Qing's appearance and hadn't moved a muscle since then. Some even tried running away, but their bodies were stiff from fear."]},{"number":1688,"title":"Chapter 1688 Dragon God Festival Details","paragraphs":["Long Yejun and the others looked at Long Wu Qing with nervous gazes, seemingly waiting for her reaction. Nobody has ever dared to ask her to suppress her presence since she killed the last one who did.","In the Primal Expanse, displaying one's presence was a way of flaunting their status and prowess. The more powerful the presence, the better. To be told to stop, even if it was a reasonable request, could be interpreted as disrespect. It was akin to telling a wealthy man to stop showing off their jewelry in public because they were reflecting the sunlight and bothering those around him.","\"...\"","After a long moment of silence, Long Wu Qing's tyrannical presence unexpectedly began to weaken until it was barely noticeable. Her oddly obedient behavior greatly shocked everyone there, with some even wondering if she was truly the feared Unrivaled Tyrant.","\"There. You happy now, little human?\" Long Wu Qing glared at Yuan.","He nodded and said, \"That's perfect. Let me show you how to use the seasoning.\"","After teaching her the basics, Long Wu Qing began testing other combinations on her own. Sometime later, she'd managed to somewhat replicate the meat skewers' flavor.","\"Hey, do you have any more seasoning? This isn't enough to recreate the taste of those skewers you gave me,\" she said.","\"Sorry, but that's all I have right now.\"","\"When can you get more?\" she inquired.","\"When I return to the human world, but once I do that... I won't be returning.\"","\"...\"","Long Wu Qing fell silent again.","\"What a pity,\" she muttered a moment later and continued to eat in silence.","'I can't believe it! That tyrant is actually have a peaceful meal with everyone!' Long Yejun swallowed nervously, feeling like he was living a dream.","When he pinched himself and sensed pain, Long Yejun nearly cried tears of joy.","'As expected of Brother Yuan... If anyone can tame that monster, it's him!' he glared at Yuan with a profound gaze.","Yuan's spine shivered at Long Yejun's gaze.","'What is this ominous feeling?' he wondered inwardly.","For the next few days, Yuan and the others continued to feast until all of the food was devoured, leaving not even the bones. Of course, it was the beasts who consumed all of the bones. As big as his appetite was, Yuan wouldn't eat bones.","10:46","For the next few days, Yuan and the others continued to feast until all of the food was devoured, leaving not even the bones. Of course, it was the beasts who consumed all of the bones. As big as his appetite was, Yuan wouldn't eat bones.","Shortly after they finished eating, a powerful presence suddenly appeared in the Endless Arena, alerting everyone there.","\"We greet the almighty Dragon God!\" The beings there respectfully greeted upon noticing him.","The Dragon God remained silent.","A few moments later, he opened his mouth and spoke, his voice resounding throughout the entire Divine Dragon Sanctuary.","\"Heed my words. I will be announcing the details for this year's Dragon God Festival.\"","The entire Divine Sanctuary became dead silent without a single entity making a sound.","\"This year's Dragon God Festival will consist of three separate trials, each requiring the completion of the previous to participate.\"","\"The first trial shall be a one-on-one deathmatch. In order to make things as fair as possible, your cultivation must be suppressed to Perfect Chaotic Commander. Those of you with a lower cultivation will have to deal with the difference if your opponent has a higher cultivation. Once you participate, you will not be able to forfeit. In other words, half of the participants will die!\"","The first trial left everyone speechless. While death was not uncommon during the Dragon God Festival, with many perishing in each event, this trial had been the deadliest to date—and it was only the first of three trials. The sheer brutality of it shocked even the most seasoned participants.","'Why did the Dragon God make such a trial?' Long Yejun wondered, his gaze subconsciously shifting toward Yuan.","Yuan was only a Perfect Chaotic Master. If he were unlucky with his opponent, he'd need to fight a Perfect Chaotic Commander in a worst-case scenario.","Although the atmosphere remained quiet, a significant portion of the participants had already made the decision to skip this year's Dragon God Festival. Whether it was due to insufficient cultivation or simply an unwillingness to risk their lives, many chose to withdraw rather than face the deadly trial ahead.","The Dragon God continued to speak after giving the listeners a moment to think about the first trial.","\"Those of you who survived the deathmatch will be qualified to participate in the second trial. In the second trial, you will be given a Blood Reservoir containing my blood. If you are able to absorb and refine more than 90 percent of my blood within 30 days, you will pass the second trial.\"","\"The Dragon God's blood?!\" Countless beings exclaimed in a shocked voice after hearing the details of the second trial.","Even if it wasn't his Blood Essence, the Dragon God's blood was an invaluable treasure, capable of strengthening bloodlines and even transforming a mere snake into a true dragon. Most beings present would willingly start a war over such a precious resource, let alone risk everything in a one-on-one deathmatch.","'We only need to pass the first trial to absorb the Dragon God's blood in the second? Even if we only manage to absorb a drop of his blood in the second trial, it's completely worth it!'","Those who had already decided to skip this year's Dragon God Festival immediately had a change of heart. They have decided to participate even if they had to risk their lives, including those with a lower cultivation.","'Why is the Dragon God being so generous for this year's Dragon God Festival...? No... this is a little too generous. I doubt he'd really let so many people absorb his blood with so little risks.' Long Yejun and the Seven Dragon Monarchs stared at the Dragon God with suspicious faces.","The Dragon God suddenly laughed, \"You lot sure seem eager to absorb my blood. However, did you think it would be so simple?\"","'I knew it!' Long Yejun cried inwardly after the Dragon God proved his worries to be correct so quickly."]},{"number":1689,"title":"Chapter 1689 Dragon God Festival Details(2)","paragraphs":["The Dragon God continued to speak, \"The Blood Reservoir contains exactly ten drops of my blood, so you will need to absorb and refine at least nine drops to pass the trial.\"","\"However, with that said, the blood you'll be absorbing is no ordinary blood. Every single drop has been enhanced, and if you're unable to absorb it, you'll immediately die a violent and explosive death.\"","\"For example, let's say I only have the potential to absorb three drops of blood. If I try to absorb even a single drop more, it will spell the end for me. You may think it'll be fine as long as you stop at your limit, and while that is true, only some of you will have the capability to tell your own limit. The majority of you will not know your limit and will essentially be walking on a thin rope in the void.\"","\"I will give you a warning. Whether you heed it or not is none of my problem. Many—and I mean many of you here will not even be able to absorb a single drop of my enhanced blood!\" The Dragon God's voice was grim but also felt oddly provocative, as if he was daring them to participate.","The second trial was arguably even more dangerous and deadly than the first. While half of the participants would perish in the first trial, there was a good chance that most of the participants would perish in the second trial.","As the reality set in for those present, they began to wonder why this year's Dragon God Festival was so dangerous and different from the rest. It was as though the festival had been tailored and fine-tuned for a particular individual.","Unbeknownst to those present, the Dragon God had changed the Dragon God Festival at the very last minute. While some speculated that was the case, they had no solid proof, and they were not going to question the Dragon God.","Yuan silently stared at the Dragon God. Although the Dragon God wasn't looking at him, he had a weird feeling the Dragon God was somehow paying attention to him.","\"Let's move on to the last trial.\" The Dragon God continued a few moments later.","\"If you manage to absorb and refine nine drops of my blood and pass the second trial, you'll be able to participate in the third and final trial, where you will get the opportunity to refine my Blood Essence!\"","\"WHAT?!\"","Almost everyone there exclaimed in shock, Long Wu Qing included. Long Yejun's eyes were so wide that his eyeballs were on the verge of falling out of their sockets.","\"You did not hear me incorrectly. For the third trial, you'll need to refine my Blood Essence to become this year's champion.\"","Yuan was speechless. He could've never expected the Dragon God to use his own Blood Essence for a mere festival. However, he wasn't exactly delighted, either.","While he'd managed to refine the Primal Monarch's Blood Essence, it was mainly because he already had the Immortal Monarch's Bloodline. The Dragon God's Blood Essence was an entirely different story and could outright kill him if he attempted to do so.","'I still don't dare to consume the Dragon Ancestor's Blood Essence in my current state, and the Dragon God is most likely even stronger than the Dragon Ancestor. How could I possibly refine his Blood Essence? It sounds like an impossible task...'","The only one there who even had a chance to refine the Dragon God's Blood Essence would be Long Wu Qing. However, when Yuan looked at her to see her reaction, her face was full of doubt and worry.","'So even she's not confident, huh?' Yuan shook his head inwardly.","\"That is all. Due to the unnatural nature of this year's Dragon God Festival, I will give you all an extra month to think about it. Until then.\"","The Dragon God disappeared into thin air afterward. Right before the Dragon God left, Yuan noticed the Dragon God giving him a quick glance.","The entire Divine Dragon Sanctuary remained silent for a few more moments before commotions erupted in every direction.","\"Holy fuck! This year's Dragon God Festival is fucking batshit insane!\"","\"It's as dangerous as it is rewarding! Who is going to participate?\"","\"I was... until his warning for the second trial...\"","Nearly everyone was having a conversation about the Dragon God Festival at this moment.","\"Brother Yuan, what do you think? Are you still going to participate?\" Long Yejun turned to ask him.","\"The festival turned out to be much more dangerous than I could have ever anticipated. You probably don't want to hear this, but I don't want you to participate. It's too dangerous. This has nothing to do with your talents. Humans are simply unable to absorb the Dragon God's blood, much less the enhanced version.\"","Yuan nodded, \"I am aware of its danger. We still have a month to decide, but as of this moment, I haven't given up yet.\"","\"It'd be quite bad if one of us gets paired with each other during the first trial...\" Sky Splitting Dragon suddenly commented.","\"Yes. It's incredibly risky, and it'll only become riskier with fewer participants.\" Baneful Dragon responded.","\"As enticing as the trial seems, I won't be participating.\" Refined Obsidian Dragon had already made up his mind. He was already one of the Seven Dragon Monarchs, and his passion was smithing. He almost has no reason to risk his life at this festival.","\"What about you two, the Dragon God's descendants?\" Abyssal Dragon looked at Long Yejun and Long Meihui. He didn't even bother asking Long Wu Qing because he already knew her answer.","In response, Long Meihui looked at Long Yejun and Long Wu Qing with a worried frown.","\"I'm worried that I might need to fight with my own siblings. Will the Dragon God—our father really be fine with us killing each other for this festival?\" she wondered out loud.","Long Meihui wasn't worried that she had to kill her siblings. If she really fought with Long Yejun or Long Wu Qing, Long Meihui had no chance of surviving. She was worried for her own life. It was as simple as that."]},{"number":1690,"title":"Chapter 1690 Yingzi","paragraphs":["\"I...I don't think I'll participate in this year's Dragon God Festival.\" Long Yejun spoke after Long Meihui, surprising the others.","\"I can't lie that the rewards aren't enticing, but as mentioned, there's a chance I might fight with my siblings or Brother Yuan. I don't think I'll be able to kill them if I matched against them.\"","Long Yejun could not bear fighting his sworn brother for real, much less kill him. However, since it was a rule in the Dragon God Festival, there was no way to avoid it if he really fought against Yuan.","The Dragon God Festival was more than just a festival. It was a sacred ritual, one that even the Primal Monarch could not interfere with ease.","If Long Yejun and Yuan matched against each other, one of them would need to die, and the Dragon God himself would make sure of it even if it were the last thing he did.","\"Hah!\" A scornful laugh suddenly resounded.","Everyone there turned to look at Long Wu Qing, who'd just laughed.","She was staring at Long Yujun and said, \"Just say you're afraid of being killed by me. This is your only chance to become truly powerful, but you're shying away because of some emotional bullshit.\"","\"Or do you believe the Dragon God will give us another opportunity like this ever again? I don't think so.\"","Long Yejun clenched his teeth, but he couldn't refute her claims. The chances of a similar Dragon God Festival occurring in the future were extremely slim to none. If he were to let go of this opportunity, he would never close the gap between him and Long Wu Qing.","\"If you're worried about killing me, don't.\" Yuan suddenly chimed in. \"If we really matched against each other, I wouldn't hesitate to kill you. Of course, I will also have no qualms if you kill me.\"","\"Brother Yuan...?\" Long Yejun looked at him with wide eyes.","Yuan smiled and said, \"I told you. I need to get my hands on the Sacred Chalice of Purification no matter what. Being sworn brothers doesn't mean we cannot kill each other. As long as we both agree to it, nothing is off the table.\"","\"Brother Yejun. I don't mind if you kill me.\" Yuan confirmed with a serious expression on his face.","After a moment of silence, Long Yejun smiled and said, \"I also don't mind if you kill me. Even if I die, it's not like I will be gone forever. Due to my bloodline, I'll eventually be reincarnated. However, if I let go of this opportunity, I will never have a chance like this again.\"","\"Then it's settled.\" Yuan nodded with a smile.","Long Yejun turned to look at Long Wu Qing and continued, \"Don't think you've won already. We'll both have our cultivation suppressed, so even if we fought, it's not like I don't have any chance at all to defeat you.\"","Long Wu Qing laughed out loud, as if she just heard something unbelievable. \"What a ridiculous joke. Even if I suppressed my cultivation to Perfect Chaotic Master, you will never defeat me.\"","Long Wu Qing shifted her attention to Yuan and said, \"You better not run away, little human. You claimed you'd win the Dragon God Festival. If you dare run away, I'll kill you right here and now.\"","Yuan smiled and said, \"Don't worry, I don't have any plans on running.\"","Although he was worried about the second and third trials, he still had to do it for Feng Yuxiang's sake.","'No... this is no longer just about Feng Feng. If I lose here, there will be countless casualties from both the Divine Dragon Sanctuary and the Eternal Phoenix Domain,' he sighed inwardly.","If he fails to acquire the Sacred Chalice of Purification, the Primordial Phoenix will lead the Eternal Phoenix Domain and raid the Divine Dragon Sanctuary, resulting in countless deaths.","\"Good, because you seemed hesitant moments ago.\" Long Wu Qing smiled.","\"I could say the same for you, Wu Qing.\"","\"Hmph. As if. You were just seeing things. Then I'll see you next month.\"","Long Wu Qing flew away shortly after.","\"I'll probably still skip this year's Dragon God Festival.\" Long Meihui sighed a moment later. \"But I'll wait to see how many will be participating. We have a month, after all.\"","After saying that, Long Meihui also left.","\"I'll also leave now.\" The others left one after another until it was just Long Yejun, Yuan, and Yingzi.","\"What about you, Yingzi? You going to participate?\" Yuan asked her.","She immediately shook her head.","\"I have no interest in this sort of thing,\" she said.","\"I see.\"","\"I'm going to go home and take this time to prepare myself.\" Long Yejun said a moment later. \"You're welcome to join me.\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"It's fine. There's nothing I can do to prepare for the upcoming trials.\"","\"Then I'll see you here in a month.\"","Long Yejun disappeared afterward.","Now that it was just Yuan and Yingzi, he said to her, \"I'm going to leave for a month.\"","\"Hey, can I come with you?\" Yingzi suddenly asked.","\"Come with me...? I don't think that's possible, unfortunately.\"","\"You know this isn't my real body, just a fragment of my soul, right?\"","She nodded.","\"I am returning to my real body now, and I don't think there's a way for you to come with me. Sorry.\"","\"It's okay,\" Yingzi said.","A split second before Yuan logged off, Yingzi's figure suddenly flickered and disappeared into thin air.","When Yuan returned to Earth, he removed his helmet and got off the bed to stretch.","\"Since there's nothing I can do to prepare, I might as well use this time to relax,\" Yuan mumbled.","\"Let's take a shower first.\"","Just as Yuan turned around to face the bathroom, he was shocked to see a petite figure standing right behind him, her face filled with wonder and excitement.","\"Y-Yingzi...?\" Yuan muttered in a dazed voice, his eyes wide with disbelief.","\"Yes?\" she calmly responded, confirming that she wasn't his imagination.","\"H-how in the world...?\""]},{"number":1691,"title":"Chapter 1691 Yingzi(2)","paragraphs":["\"Yingzi, how did you follow me?\" Yuan asked her with a dumbfounded expression on his face.","\"I followed your shadow,\" she calmly responded.","\"My shadow...?\"","\"How much do you know about shadows?\" she asked him next.","\"Honestly, not much.\"","Yingzi proceeded to explain, \"Most believe that shadows are universal for everyone. While that is somewhat true, it's different for us, Shadow Dwellers.\"","\"Just like how everyone has a different soul, their shadow is also unique to them. However, only those born in the shadows like us Shadow Dwellers can see the difference.\"","\"That means as long as I enter your shadow, I'll be able to emerge from your shadow, no matter where that may be.\"","\"With that said, I wasn't certain I would be able to follow you, and I acted on a whim. But I'm glad it worked. This world may be small, but it has a lot of delicious scents.\"","\"...\"","Yuan stared at Yingzi with a worried gaze. While he was confident that Yingzi wouldn't cause any trouble for him or Earth, this incident exposed a loophole—a risk that he wasn't even aware of before.","If Yinzgi was able to follow him from the Primal Expanse through her own abilities, there was a chance the same could happen again. This meant that Earth wasn't completely safe from unexpected invasions.","'I will need to be more wary of who I log out around. I should let the others know this too.' Yuan thought inwardly.","It'd be disastrous if someone dangerous were to follow him back to Earth, after all.","He looked at Yingzi and spoke a moment later, \"Um, Yingzi. I trust you, and I don't mind your presence here, but you'll need to be extra careful in this world. As you know, this world is very small and fragile. If someone like you were to use your abilities, it would fall apart.\"","She nodded, \"I am aware. I won't do anything to your territory.\"","\"Thank you. By the way, are you feeling okay? This world doesn't have any Chaotic Essence.\"","He figured that if humans were unable to cultivate in the Primal Expanse, those from the Primal Expanse would have the same issue if the roles were reversed.","\"I guess it does feel a little uncomfortable since I have never been this deprived of chaotic essence, and I won't be able to replenish my chaotic essense if I use them, but it doesn't have any detrimental effects on me.\"","\"That's good. Anyway, since you're here, is there anything you want to do? I'll show you around.\"","Without hesitation, Yingzi replied, \"Food.\"","\"I figured.\" Yuan smiled.","\"Alright, give me a few minutes to shower first.\"","\"What is a shower?\" she asked.","\"It's when we clean ourselves with water.\"","\"Why? You don't look dirty.\"","\"We can shower even if we're not dirty.\"","\"Is it common for humans to shower?\"","\"Very. Pretty much everyone showers.\"","\"Okay. I will shower with you,\" Yingzi declared.","\"If you want.\"","Yingzi followed Yuan into the bathroom a moment later.","Once inside, Yuan began taking off his clothes. Yingzi followed.","A certain object on Yuan's body quickly attracted Yingzi's attention.","\"Hey,\" she spoke. \"What is that weird thing between your legs?\"","When the beings of Primal Expanse first took on the appearance of humans, most got rid of what they deemed useless, such as the object between a man's legs. In their eyes, it was nothing but a hindrance since they don't require sexual intercourse to reproduce. Hearing Yingzi's odd question, Yuan subconsciously looked at the area between her legs. However, what was supposed to be there wasn't. It was a smooth area without the slit.","\"I see,\" He muttered as if he understood something.","\"Looks like beings in the Primal Expanse only care about the face and overall appearance, so they forgot the most integral part of humans—their private part.\"","This made Yuan wonder about their internal organs.","\"Anyway, unlike you, we humans reproduce through sexual intercourse, which is done by connecting a woman and man's private part.\"","Even though Yingzi had the appearance of a little girl, her real age could potentially rival even the Lord, so Yuan had no issue teaching her. Most importantly, she wasn't even human, hence why Yuan could take a shower with her without batting an eye.","\"Anyway, let me show you how to shower.\"","Yuan quickly changed the subject and pointed to the shower area, which was large enough to fit two or even three people with ease.","\"You operate it with this handle.\"","Water began pouring from the shower head.","\"You can adjust the water's temperature like this. Turn it this way if you want cold water and the opposite way if you want hot water. Keep it in the middle if you want warm water.\"","\"Ooooh.\" Yingzi stared at the pouring water with interest. \"It's like rain.\"","Yuan stepped into the shower once the water temperature was to his liking.","\"Once your body is wet, you use body wash to cleanse your body like this. You can also wash your hair with shampoo and finish it with conditioner.\"","\"Then, you rinse yourself again with water.\"","Yuan stepped out a few minutes later and wiped himself with a towel.","\"That's the gist of it. Pretty simple, right?\"","Yingzi entered the shower next, and she played around with the water temperature while standing below the shower head.","In the end, she settled with hot water that was raised to the maximum, quickly steaming the place.","Once she was satisfied, she stepped out of the water and started washing her body with body wash and hair with shampoo just like Yuan did.","Afterward, she rinsed herself and stepped out, feeling refreshed.","\"We also take baths after showers if you want to relax. It's when you submerge yourself in water. Since we're already here, want to try it out?\" Yuan asked.","Yingzi immediately nodded.","Yuan quickly prepared the bath.","They entered the large bathtub sometime later and spent the next several minutes in silence.","\"I have been meaning to ask, but who are the two female humans outside sleeping next to each other?\" Yingzi suddenly asked."]},{"number":1692,"title":"Chapter 1692 Yingzi(3)","paragraphs":["\"Ah, those two? They're my partners, Meixiu and Chu Liuxiang.\" Yuan explained.","\"Partner... so you're breeding them?\" she spoke calmly. The weird phrasing and her calm tone sent shivers down Yuan's spine.","He cleared his throat and explained, \"While some humans enter a relationship with the determination and intent of having children, not everyone wants children. We became partners because we love each other.\"","\"What is love?\"","\"It's an emotion we feel towards someone we want to be with forever—someone you really like. For example, you like to eat food, right? Love is basically several times more intense than that.\"","\"Hm. I still don't understand.\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before asking her, \"How do you feel about me? What emotions do I invoke from you?\"","Yingzi stared at his handsome face in silence.","\"You pique my interest. You're always full of surprises. Also, when I look at you, I don't feel the desire to rip you apart, unlike others,\" she said a moment later.","\"You've followed me for over two years now. Why?\"","\"At first, I wanted to learn more about humans. But before I realized it, I found myself wanting to learn more about you.\"","\"Then how do you feel about following me for the rest of your life? Would you be able to do it?\"","\"I'm not sure what to feel, but I can't imagine following you for the rest of my life,\" she responded with a calm expression.","Yuan smiled and said, \"If you can imagine yourself following me—or anyone for that matter—for the rest of your life, you'll get closer to understanding the feeling of love. With that said, love is a very complex emotion, even for us humans, and there are many different types of love. Of course, it's also fine if you don't understand it for the rest of your life. It's just an emotion, after all. Just like how some people never feel fear, it's possible some will never experience love.\"","\"By the way, why do you want to understand humans?\" Yuan suddenly asked.","\"I don't really have a reason. I think I am inherently interested in them,\" she responded. \"Is there a problem with that?\"","\"No, that's fine. We humans often do things for no reason, too.\"","\"I—\"","Just as Yingzi opened her mouth, another voice interrupted.","\"Welcome back, Yuan! Are you taking a bath? Let me join you!\" A cheerful voice came from outside the bathroom.","The very next moment, a naked Chu Liuxiang could be seen strolling into the bathroom with a bright smile on her face.","However, her smile froze when she noticed an unfamiliar little girl resting in the same bathtub as Yuan.","\"Eh? Huh? Wait...\" Chu Liuxiang's brain nearly overheated from trying to comprehend the situation.","Chu Liuxiang had no qualms if Yuan found more partners, having already come to terms with and accepted the idea. However, the girl with Yuan appeared so young that it would instantly raise many eyebrows wherever they went, and even someone as accepting as Chu Liuxiang couldn't help but feel a sense of concern.","Seeing Chu Liuxiang's panicked and perplexed expression, Yuan said, \"Calm down, it's not what you're thinking.\"","He proceeded to explain the situation in a calm but hasty manner.","\"First of all, she's not as young as she looks. She's actually from the Primal Expanse, and she somehow followed me back to Earth when I logged out.\"","\"...\"","After taking a long moment to process this information, Chu Liuxiang asked, \"But why are you taking a bath together?\"","\"I am teaching her about humans and our culture. Ah, she's also not human.\"","\"So she's not the 'third'?\" she asked for clarification.","Yuan calmly shook his head.","Chu Liuxiang heaved a deep sigh of relief once her worries were eliminated.","\"Oh, I was worried for a second there.\"","Chu Liuxiang went to take a quick shower before entering the bath with them.","\"Hello, I'm Chu Liuxiang,\" she introduced herself to Yingzi.","\"I'm Yingzi. We were just talking about you,\" Yingzi said.","\"Really? About what?\" Chu Liuxiang's eyes flickered with curiosity.","Yuan gave her a brief description of the subject.","Chu Liuxiang chuckled after hearing it.","\"Is that so? But Yuan, if you ever want a child, don't hesitate to ask me.\"","Yuan silently nodded with a somewhat stiff smile.","\"By the way, how did she follow you from the Primal Expanse?\" Chu Liuxiang asked a moment later.","\"Her race has the power to control and enter shadows. She entered my shadow right before I logged off and managed to come out through my real body.\"","\"Such a thing is possible...? That's ridiculous... and has some serious implications...\" Chu Liuxiang muttered in disbelief. \"I know what you're thinking, but if Yingzi is able to come to Earth through her own powers, we cannot dismiss the possibility that others could accomplish the same,\" Yuan sighed.","\"Isn't that really dangerous for us?\" she asked.","\"It is. However, I doubt there are many beings out there who have such capabilities. Still, we need to be careful where and who we log off around from now on in case we do meet someone similar to Yingzi.\"","Chu Liuxiang nodded with a serious face.","Sometime later, the three of them left the bathroom.","\"By the way, the Dragon God Festival was postponed for a month, and I'll be staying here for the whole duration. However, I cannot leave Yingzi unattended, so I'll be accompanying her for a bit.\" Yuan said.","Chu Liuxiang nodded, \"Alright. Then I won't bother you for the time being.\"","\"Can you let the others know the situation for me?\"","\"Of course.\"","After giving Yuan a passionate kiss on the lips, Chu Liuxiang returned to Cultivation Online.","Meanwhile, Yuan went to find Meifeng. However, she was also inside Cultivation Online.","'I guess Yingzi can experience her food later.'","Yuan brought Yingzi outside.","\"I don't know where to bring you, so let's just wander until you find something you want to eat,\" Yuan proposed with a casual smile.","\"Okay!\" she nodded eagerly."]},{"number":1693,"title":"Chapter 1693 Yingzi(4)","paragraphs":["After leaving the Dragon Spiral Mountain, Yuan brought Yingzi to the nearest city for their first destination.","Before leaving, Yuan consumed an appearance-altering pill to change his face so they don't attract unwanted attention.","\"We're moving too slow. I'll bring you with me like usual.\" Yingzi complained halfway there.","Yuan nodded and said, \"Do you see the city in that direction? That's our destination.\"","Yingzi swiftly wrapped her chaotic essence around Yuan and, as if they'd teleported, arrived at the city instantly.","Earth was simply too small for someone like Yingzi. With her cultivation, she could easily circle the world a dozen times before someone could even finish blinking their eyes.","'Either her cultivation is too high for formation to work on her, or it has no effect on those with a Chaotic Heart...' Yuan thought inwardly after realizing the cultivation restricting formation had no effect on Yingzi.","After arriving at the city, Yingzi took a moment to savor the unique scenery of tall buildings, cars, and bustling humans.","Although she'd already seen this view through her divine sense, looking at it with her own eyes and being there in person invoked a special feeling that couldn't be achieved through divine sense.","A look of awe appeared on Yingzi's face as she realized the complexity of human technology.","\"Just how did humans achieve this...?\" she mused in a low voice.","\"This is what happens when society focuses on technology rather than cultivation. You may find this hard to believe, but the majority of this world learned about cultivation only a few years ago,\" Yuan said with a slight smile.","\"Is that why everyone's cultivation is so weak—barely noticeable? Even the weakest beings in the Primal Expanse would be a bigshot here.\" \"Unfortunately.\"","Once she had enough of the scenery, Yingzi walked to the nearest restaurant and pointed at it from outside.","\"I want to eat whatever is inside,\" she said.","Yuan nodded and approached the waiter by the entrance. \"Table for two. Ah, can I also have your biggest table? We'll be ordering one of everything.\"","The waiter looked at Yuan with wide eyes, seemingly in disbelief.","\"One of everything? We have 200 different dishes, you know?\"","Yuan silently nodded.","\"O-okay. Please follow me.\"","The waiter led them to one of the biggest tables available and asked again once they were seated, \"Just to confirm, one of everything?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Umm... can you pay in advance first?\"","Yuan retrieved a black card and placed it on the table.","\"T-thank you very much, esteemed guest!\" The waiter's eyes flickered with excitement after seeing the card.","Once the payment was confirmed, the waiter placed their order.","\"Why is it taking so long?\" Yingzi complained not even five minutes later, her disappointed gaze focused on the empty table before her.","\"Besides fast food, they only start cooking once an order is placed. This guarantees the food will come out fresh and hot.\"","After waiting another ten minutes, their first dish finally arrived, with more dishes coming out nearly every minute.","The workers were initially worried they'd need several tables to accommodate all the food, but Yingzi quickly relieved them of their concerns. She devoured each meal within seconds, effortlessly keeping pace with the speed at which dishes were coming out of the kitchen.","Yuan didn't touch any of the meals and allowed Yingzi to hoard all of the food. Yingzi's unfathomable ability to consume so much food with her small body left the others shocked. They took out their cellphones and began recording her.","\"Heavens! Is she a professional eater?\"","\"That already exceeds the level of pros!\"","\"Where does she keep the food? Is there a black hole in her stomach?\"","The other customers muttered to each other.","Once Yingzi finished all of the dishes, she stood up and said to Yuan, \"Let's head to the next place immediately.\"","Yuan nodded with a smile.","As they walked to their next destination, which was right next door, Yuan asked her, \"How does it compare to the meat skewers you've been eating?\"","With an excited expression on her face, she responded, \"The flavors are much more complex, and the textures vary greatly between dishes. While some tasted better than meat skewers, others were less enjoyable. However, overall, even the least impressive dish is far superior to anything I've experienced in the Primal Expanse.\"","Once they arrived at the restaurant next door, Yuan showed the waiter his black card and said, \"I want to order one of everything on the menu. You can charge me in advance.\"","The waiter silently stared at him, as it took some time to comprehend his words.","\"R-right away!\"","When the customers from the previous restaurant realized Yingzi planned on eating more, they followed her to the next restaurant with their phones out, acting like a group of paparazzi.","\"My god! They ordered one of everything again!\"","\"How much does she plan on eating?!\"","An hour later, Yingzi finished every dish with ease, and they made their way to the next food establishment, repeating the same thing.","News of a monstrous little eater began spreading across the internet, quickly gaining traction. Videos of Yingzi eating gained millions of views in just a few hours, and every single one of these viewers was shocked by her infinite appetite. With her newfound fame, Yingzi earned the nickname Little Fairy of Gluttony.","However, many were skeptical of her eating ability and claimed it was all fake. Once Yingzi became popular enough, people began traveling to her location just to watch her eat with their own eyes, with some traveling even halfway across the world just to confirm her existence.","\"She's still eating?! This is her 27th food establishment, and she'd been eating almost nonstop for the last ten hours!\" The onlookers couldn't comprehend how Yingzi could eat so much.","When some onlookers attempted to approach her, their advances were immediately halted by Yuan, who was concerned they might annoy Yingzi. He knew that irritating her could potentially lead to disastrous consequences, and he wasn't willing to take that risk.","A few stubborn individuals tried to force their way past Yuan, only to be sent flying.","'I knew she'd attract attention, but this is too much...' he sighed inwardly."]},{"number":1694,"title":"Chapter 1694 Yingzi(5)","paragraphs":["\"Bastard, who the hell do you think you are?! We are just trying to speak with the Little Fairy of Gluttony!\" One of the individuals who tried to force his way through and was sent flying returned shortly after to shout at Yuan.","\"Little Fairy of Gluttony?\" Yuan couldn't help but crack a chuckle after hearing her nickname.","\"Anyway, she's a friend of mine, and we don't need any distractions. I don't mind if you watch from a distance, but stay away from my friend unless you want to die.\"","Of course, Yuan had no intention of killing anyone, but Yingzi was a different story. He didn't know much about her or the limits of her patience, and the last thing he wanted was for things to escalate due to her unpredictable nature.","\"Unless you want to die.\" The man repeated Yuan's words in a mocking tone. \"Get a load of this bastard!\"","Suddenly, another figure stepped forward. He was a skinny young man with depraved facial features, looking like a ghoul.","\"Step aside before you get hurt.\" The skinny man warned Yuan as he showed off his Spirit Grandmaster cultivation base.","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, a low sigh resounded.","\"Should I just get rid of all of them?\" Yingzi stopped eating to ask.","Yuan looked at her and said, \"Just focus on your food. I can deal with them myself.\"","\"Alright.\" Yingzi no longer paid them any attention and returned to eating her food.","Yuan released a defeated sigh the next moment. He looked at the skinny man and muttered, \"Since we've already attracted this much attention, there's no point in hiding myself any longer.\"","Yuan removed his disguise, revealing his true identity to everyone there.","\"P-Player Yuan?!\" Someone from the crowd instantly recognized him and shouted.","\"What?! The same Player Yuan who disappeared after stomping the Fiery Garden of Hell?! He hasn't shown himself for over three years now!\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes at the skinny Spirit Grandmaster and those around him. \"I am having trouble breathing with so many people around me. Do you mind giving me some space?\"","The skinny man snapped out of his daze and hurriedly left without uttering another word. The others swiftly followed.","Yuan shook his head and returned to his seat. Now that he'd made an appearance for the first time in over three years, the attention on Yingzi skyrocketed to unprecedented levels.","\"Player Yuan returns after three years! Unexpectedly, he's friends with the Little Fairy of Gluttony!\"","\"What's Player Yuan's relationship with Little Fairy of Gluttony?!\"","\"Player Yuan disguised himself to be with Little Fairy of Gluttony! A secret relationship exposed?!\"","Such leadlines swiftly filled the internet.","Despite the growing attention and the increasing size of the crowd around them, nobody dared to approach Yuan or Yingzi. The spectators kept their distance, content to watch from afar, clearly still fearful of Yuan.","Although three years had passed, the majority of people still vividly remembered Yuan's fight with the Fiery Garden of Hell. The sheer intensity of that battle left an everlasting impression, keeping his reputation fresh in their minds.","After spending a few days visiting literally every single food establishment in the city, Yingzi traveled to the next city and repeated the same thing.","Her seemingly infinite appetite made people wonder if she had a unique physique that refines food into her own energy. Unbeknownst to them, Yingzi truly had an infinite appetite. Shadow Dwellers are made entirely of shadows, so no matter how much Yingzi ate, she would never feel full. However, she doesn't feel hungry, either.","While unnecessary, Yingzi still enjoyed eating, just like how powerful cultivators could survive without food but still indulge in it once in a while.","In the blink of an eye, two weeks had passed since Yingzi's visit to Earth. During that time, she had experienced a wide variety of foods and cuisines. However, there was only so much truly unique food to try. Eventually, she began encountering similar dishes, with only minor differences in flavor and quality.","Although she still enjoyed them, Yuan could tell that she was slowly getting bored of them.","\"Food can vary greatly depending on our location, with some food only available in specific parts of the world. If you want to experience newer food, we should travel further.\" Yuan suggested.","Yingzi nodded and said, \"Okay. I'll let you choose the place next.\" After finishing her current meal, Yuan brought Yingzi to the other side of the world to experience their cuisine.","They spent one week eating as much food as they could. Then, for the last week, Yuan bought seasoning for her to use in the Primal Expanse. He bought so much that they had to visit several supermarkets because he emptied all of their stock.","\"This month I have spent in this world has been the best of my entire life. I will remember it forever. Thank you,\" Yingzi said to Yuan with sincerity as they returned to the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","Yuan nodded with a smile, \"You've done a lot for me in the Primal Expanse. This is the least I could do for you.\"","\"Before we return to the Primal Expanse, I would like you to have one last meal.\"","\"Okay.\"","Yuan brought her to the dining room, where a feast prepared by Meifeng was waiting. The Demon Sealing Faction members were also present.","\"So that's the famous Little Fairy of Gluttony, huh?\" Wang Ming chuckled after seeing her.","\"She resembles Xiao Hua...\" Meixiu mumbled after noticing their similarity. After all, Yingzi borrowed most of her features from Xiao Hua.","\"Although you've eaten a lot of food in the past month, you ate mostly alone. Some say food will taste better when you're eating with others.\" Yuan said to her.","Once the introductions were done, they began feasting.","When Yingzi took her first bite, her eyes widened with surprise.","'He's right... there is something different about this food...' she mused inwardly.","\"Hey, Yuan, the Dragon God Festival is tomorrow, right? How confident do you feel about it?\" Shi Lang suddenly asked.","A stiff smile appeared on Yuan's face as he responded, \"Honestly? I don't feel confident at all.\"","\"Seriously?\" Everyone there turned to look at him while looking surprised."]},{"number":1695,"title":"Chapter 1695 The Dragon God Festival Begins!","paragraphs":["Seeing their surprised faces, Yuan explained the details of the Dragon God Festival and why he didn't feel confident with them.","\"The Dragon God is a godlike entity with strength that rivals a Cultivation God. I cannot fathom someone at my level would be able to absorb it, much less refine it.\"","While he had a heaven-defying physique that allowed him to refine things one typically could not, even extending the limit of what those around his cultivation could absorb, it did not allow him to refine anything without limit. The training grounds were prime examples. It wasn't as if he could walk straight into the highest difficulty without any preparation. His body could still be destroyed if its limit was exceeded.","\"There's also one thing I am worried about.\"","Yuan wore a serious expression as he spoke, \"There is a chance I might not respawn if I die in the Primal Expanse.\"","\"What? Why not?\" Wang Ming inquired.","\"Because we don't know everything about the system. What if the revival system only works within the Nine Heavens? What if I am too far away for it to work? The heavens have no influence in the Primal Expanse, after all.\"","After a moment of silence, Yuan asked, \"Were there any announcements recently? About me, specifically.\"","\"No, announcements are quite rare nowadays, and anything related to you would instantly rile up the internet,\" Meifeng said.","\"In that case, I'm certain there are limitations to the system. Unless someone has learned Celestial-grade techniques before me, there should've been an announcement about it. I even received the notification that I was the first. However, since I was in the Primal Expanse when it happened, something probably prevented the announcement from being made.\"","\"What if it's like a cell phone and reception?\" Wang Xiuying suddenly said. When the others looked at her, she explained, \"You know how cell phones cannot receive messages without reception? What if the Nine Heavens is like a cell phone, and the reason it didn't make any announcement was because it couldn't receive Yuan's data in the Primal Expanse?\"","\"That does make sense and definitely a possibility...\" Yuan nodded with a pondering face.","\"In that case, the announcements may show up once you return to the Nine Heavens.\"","\"I guess we'll find out when he returns.\"","\"In any case, the chances of my worries coming true have increased now.\" Yuan sighed.","\"Having said that, I have no plans on backing down now. I am going to tackle this Dragon God Festival, regardless of the risks,\" he swiftly continued with a resolute face.","Although he was concerned, he wasn't losing his mind over it. After all, he was pretty confident the Primal Monarch wouldn't let him die needlessly.","After the feast, Yuan and Yingzi prepared to return to the Primal Expanse.","\"I have learned a lot about humans this past month,\" Yingzi said as she sat on his balcony.","\"After seeing so many humans, I think I'll be able to craft a unique appearance for myself.\"","She closed her eyes and began visualizing her ideal appearance.","In the next moment, Yingzi's appearance began to transform. Her hair grew longer, its color deepening into a much darker shade of black, resembling the void itself. At the same time, her skin became even paler, almost ghostly white, creating a striking contrast against her dark hair.","Her height increased, and her face matured slightly. In just a few moments, Yingzi had transformed from a cute, innocent little girl to a strikingly beautiful girl with a naturally aloof expression, and she even wore a black dress that complimented her appearance.","From behind, she appeared completely human in every aspect. However, once her front was revealed, she left an unforgettable impression, her appearance teetering between human and something ethereal, almost ghostly. It was an otherworldly sight that would linger in one's mind.","\"What do you think?\" she asked him afterward.","Yuan smiled, \"I think it suits you perfectly.\"","Yingzi smiled back and said, \"Now the only thing left for me to experience is sexual intercourse. Hey, let's have sex before we return to the Primal Expanse.\"","Her bazaar words instantly shattered whatever atmosphere they just had. However, Yingzi spoke with such clarity that it didn't sound like a joke at all.","\"That is something you should only experience with the one you love, especially if it's your first time,\" Yuan responded with a stiff smile.","\"Is that how it works?\"","\"Normally.\"","Yingzi wore a disappointed look on her face.","\"Fine.\"","Without saying another word, her figure disappeared into Yuan's shadow.","Yuan returned to the Primal Expanse shortly after.","The moment he returned, something in the sky caught his attention.","There were millions of gold tokens hovering in the sky, and beings could be seen grabbing one from time to time.","As Yuan wondered about their purpose, a familiar presence approached him.","\"You're back.\" Long Yejun spoke with a smile.","\"Yes. What are those tokens in the sky?\" Yuan asked him. \"Grab one if you wish to participate in the Dragon God Festival,\" he briefly explained, showing the token in his grasp.","Yuan looked around and noticed that nearly everyone around him had a token, and there were tens of thousands of beings in his area alone.","He went to grab one for himself a moment later.","\"I'll leave just in case the Dragon God matches us in groups.\" Long Yejun suddenly said.","He wanted to lower his chance of being matched against Yuan as much as possible.","\"Then I'll see you after the first trial. Good luck, Brother Yejun.\"","\"Best of luck to you too.\" Long Yejun disappeared into the distance shortly after.","The very next day, Dragon God's voice rippled throughout the Divine Dragon Sanctuary.","\"This is your last chance to grab a token and participate in the festival.\"","\"In thirty seconds, everyone with a participation token will be teleported to a secluded arena with their opponent, and you will not be able to leave until one of you dies. If both fighters are still alive after a month passes, the space will collapse and kill both of you.\"","The participants were shocked by the last part, which wasn't mentioned until the last second, causing some of the participants to change their minds by tossing their tokens away.","Once thirty seconds had passed, everyone holding a token disappeared into thin air without any warning.","The Dragon God Festival has begun!"]},{"number":1696,"title":"Chapter 1696 Yuan’s Opponent","paragraphs":["After being teleported, Yuan found himself surrounded by darkness, almost as if he'd returned inside the Infinite Spiraling Abyss.","However, oddly enough, he was able to see his opponent clearly.","\"Hahaha! What luck!\" His opponent, a red-headed man, laughed hysterically.","Yuan stared at his opponent with a calm gaze. This wasn't their first meeting.","\"I can't believe I actually got matched with the Primal Monarch's son! How lucky!\"","\"Hellfire Dragon...\" Yuan muttered with a slight smile on his face.","Hellfire Dragon was one of the Seven Dragon Monarchs as the Fire Dragon Monarch. He was someone nobody wanted as an opponent, especially for a deathmatch.","However, despite being matched with one of the strongest beings in Divine Dragon Sanctuary, Yuan wasn't even the least concerned. After all, his opponent specialized in fire.","'Fortunately, I visited the Eternal Phoenix Domain and acquired fire immunity before coming here.'","\"Why are you staying silent? Are you despairing because you realized that you're doomed?\" Hellfire Dragon taunted, appearing very confident.","\"On the other hand, you talk too much. They say when one realizes they are screwed, they often become more chatty than usual to cope with their anxiety,\" Yuan sneered, wiping the smile off Hellfire Dragon's now enraged face.","\"As I thought, I really don't like you, human.\"","The Hellfire Dragon wasted no time transforming into his true dragon form. Shedding his human appearance, he became a massive red dragon, his scales glowing like molten lava. His aura radiated such intense heat that the air around him twisted and shimmered from the scorching energy.","The Hellfire Dragon's aura was so powerful that it would have been enough to kill an ordinary Chaotic Commander. However, to Yuan, it was nothing more than a comfortable, lukewarm sensation, barely worth noticing.","\"So what if you have godly talents? That shit will amount to nothing if you die an early death.\" Hellfire Dragon remarked. \"You got greedy, human. If you hadn't participated in the Dragon God Festival, you would've become a powerful figure.\"","Yuan's face remained calm as he responded to his provocation, \"Where is your confidence coming from?\"","\"Where?\" Hellfire Dragon sneered.","\"Right here!\" He abruptly opened his mouth and spat a massive fireball at Yuan.","Despite seeing the ball of fire hurling at him, Yuan didn't move a muscle and silently stared at it. Once the fireball was close enough to touch him, Yuan extended a finger to poke at it. The moment his finger came into contact with the fireball, its heat and energy were absorbed.","\"W-what?\" Hellfire Dragon's eyes widened with shock after witnessing his fire being absorbed.","\"Why do you look so flabbergasted? Did you think I only had two types of immunities? Unfortunately for you, I am also immune to fire.\"","\"Since when?!\" Hellfire Dragon roared.","\"Since before I came to the Divine Dragon Sanctuary, obviously.\" Hellfire Dragon clenched his jaws tightly, his gaze so intense it could engulf an entire world in flames.","\"So what if you're immune to fire? You're still just a human! I don't need my fire to kill someone like you!\" The Hellfire Dragon started laughing.","\"I heard that you almost died to Long Yejun even when he suppressed his cultivation. I am on the same level as Long Yejun if not a little stronger. There's nothing you can do to defeat me.\"","Yuan chuckled and said, \"Brother Yejun is indeed very powerful. However, if I wanted to kill him during our spar, it wouldn't have been too difficult.\"","\"You're bluffing!\" Hellfire Dragon did not believe Yuan's claims for a second.","Not only was Yuan a mere Chaotic Master, but he was also human, who were inherently weaker than beasts. \"Don't think you can rely on the Primal Monarch's power for everything! It won't work on someone like me!\"","\"I never intended on using the Primal Monarch's power, anyway.\"","Yuan suddenly retrieved a sword—a majestic sword that emitted an otherworldly aura.","\"A sword?\" Hellfire Dragon raised his eyebrows, looking surprised. However, it was not because he was worried.","\"That tiny thing won't even scratch my scales, much less—\"","In the midst of Hellfire Dragon's speech, Yuan's arm suddenly flickered, shooting a powerful sword light made of pure Enhanced Sword Qi at him.","Sha!","The sword light went right through Hellfire Dragon's right wing, cutting through his scales as if they were tofu.","A moment later, the Hellfire Dragon released a deafening roar, not out of pain, but from the overwhelming shame he felt after realizing one of his wings had been severed. The humiliation of such a blow stung more than any physical injury could.","\"I will make you suffer a fate worse than death for this humiliation!\" Hellfire Dragon released one last roar before charging at Yuan in his human form.","Meanwhile, their fight was being spectated by the onlookers who didn't participate in the Dragon God Festival. However, it wasn't just Yuan's fight that was being broadcasted. Every single fight was displayed for everyone to see.","Although Yuan's fight attracted some attention at first, they all went to watch another broadcast, one that had nearly the attention of every single onlooker at the moment.","This specific broadcast displayed Long Wu Qing's dominating performance as she brutally toyed with her opponent, which wasn't too surprising considering her unrivaled status.","However, what truly surprised the onlookers and initially captured their attention wasn't just Long Wu Qing's presence, but her opponent.","\"What's wrong? Are you already giving up? It hasn't even been half a day since we started.\" Long Wu Qing provoked her opponent with a cold grin on her face.","\"Shut up!\" her opponent roared, their voice filled with fury. Their entire body was drenched in blood, open wounds covering nearly every inch of their skin. Meanwhile, Long Wu Qing appeared unscathed in comparison.","\"What a pitiful sight.\" Long Wu Qing shook her head at the fully transformed dragon before her.","\"Well, it's not like you ever had a chance in the first place—just as I said. Right, little brother?\" Long Wu Qing remarked, her voice cold and condescending as she stared at Long Yejun with an eerily calm expression, unfazed by his bloodied state."]},{"number":1697,"title":"Chapter 1697 The Sibling’s Deathmatch","paragraphs":["After being teleported, Long Yejun found himself inside a secluded dimension that was created solely for the Dragon God Festival. He didn't waste any time looking at the void and searched for his opponent.","However, he instinctively knew who he had been matched against after sensing her tyrannical presence.","\"Elder sister.\" Long Yejun muttered in a calm voice after confirming that his opponent was Long Wu Qing.","He had already mentally prepared himself to fight Long Wu Qing, so he didn't act surprised. As a matter of fact, he had spent the past month preparing to fight Long Wu Qing.","\"Why am I not surprised, little brother?\" Long Wu Qing suddenly spoke. \"Is this fate, or is this father's desire?\"","There was a chance the Dragon God had purposefully matched them together. However, they had no proof.","\"Either way, it doesn't matter. I have been prepared to fight you since I decided to participate in the Dragon God Festival,\" said Long Yejun.","\"Really? It doesn't look that way.\" A cold smile crept on Long Wu Qing's face as her fierce eyes glared at Long Yejun's left arm, which had been trembling nonstop for some time now.","\"!!!\" Long Yejun was surprised when he looked at his arm. He wasn't aware that he had been trembling until Long Wu Qing mentioned it.","He hastily grabbed his left arm with his right, forcing it to stop trembling.","\"Hahaha!\" Long Wu Qing couldn't help but laugh at his reaction.","In response, Long Yejun released a deafening roar as he transformed into a blue and white dragon.","\"What's the rush, little brother? I have a whole month to kill you, so there's plenty of time to play. However, if you wish a swift death, I can also make that happen.\"","\"Screw you!\" Long Yejun cursed before launching a quick Dragon's Breath at her.","However, Long Wu Qing casually flung it away with a swatting motion. \"At least you've become bolder than before. Or maybe it's because you know you are going to die soon?\" Long Wu Qing treated Long Yejun as a joke.","As infuriated as Long Yejun was, he knew that Long Wu Qing had the power to back up her arrogance.","\"Here, I'll lower my cultivation a little more for you.\" Long Wu Qing's cultivation base suddenly dropped from the peak of Chaotic Command to the peak of Chaotic Master, dropping an entire realm.","Her actions were incredibly arrogant and the ultimate mockery to her opponent. However, Long Yejun wasn't offended. If anything, he saw this as his chance.","'I knew you'd do something like this! Your arrogance will be your downfall!' Long Yejun smiled inwardly as he prepared to launch a full-scale attack on her.","After throwing a few more weak attacks at her, Long Yejun unleashed his most powerful technique, utilizing all of his chaotic essence.","When facing a monster like Long Wu Qing, a prolonged fight would inevitably end in defeat. There was only one way to stand a chance against someone like her—a swift and sudden attack that exploited her weakness: her arrogance. Her tendency to underestimate her opponents could be her downfall if timed correctly.","Unfortunately, Long Yejun miscalculated one thing—the true extent of Long Wu Qing's overwhelming power.","Even without transforming, Long Wu Qing easily defended against the strongest attack Long Yejun could muster with his suppressed cultivation.","\"Did you think I was underestimating you?\" Long Wu Qing spoke after seeing the look of disbelief on his face.","\"It's the opposite, little brother. I lowered my cultivation because I know exactly what you're capable of—that you'd still not be able to defeat me.\"","\"You fucking monster...\" Long Yejun muttered.","Long Wu QIng's eyebrows twitched, and she scolded, \"Just because you're about to die doesn't mean I'll let you say whatever you want.\"","For the next few hours, Long Wu Qing would launch an endless assault on Long Yejun, beating him left and right.","Despite Long Yejun's attempt to fight back, Long Wu Qing was too overpowering for him to do anything.","'Damn it! If only our cultivation wasn't restricted this much... No... even if the limit was higher, the results would have remained the same...' Long Yejun sighed inwardly, accepting the results—his defeat.","\"Giving up already? This is why I always mess with you.\" Long Wu Qing looked at him with a disdainful gaze after seeing his state, and she increased the intensity of her attacks.","\"You give up too quickly. You never push yourself past your limit, and you have a habit of running away from your problems. You're a disgrace to the Dragon God's bloodline.\"","Long Wu Qing's words ignited a fire in Long Yejun's heart, and he released a vicious roar.","\"I know I can't defeat you, but I will survive for a month, and then the both of us will perish together!\"","Long Wu Qing merely laughed at his plan, showing no signs of concern. She knew that she could defeat him whenever she wanted, after all.","A few hours later, Long Wu Qing sighed, \"Seeing you struggling like this isn't fun at all. I'd rather go watch that human's performance than beat a corpse like you any longer. Any last words?\"","\"...\"","Long Yejun didn't respond. His body hovered in the void like a lifeless corpse, but he wasn't dead just yet.","\"Is that so? I hope you said your goodbyes to your human friend, at the very least.\"","\"He's... not a... friend...\" Long Yejun suddenly muttered. \"He's my... brother.\"","\"I'll consider those your final words.\" Without saying another word, Long Wu Qing unleashed a devastating attack at Long Yejun, far more powerful than anything she had displayed so far. \"This is your last chance to intervene, father.\" Long Wu Qing muttered in a low voice as the attack enveloped Long Yejun's figure.","However, the Dragon God did not respond, and Long Yejun's body was obliterated, disintegrating completely under the overwhelming power of Long Wu Qing's attack.","Long Wu Qing found herself back in the Divine Dragon Sanctuary shortly after."]},{"number":1698,"title":"Chapter 1698 Hellfire Dragon","paragraphs":["After returning to the Divine Dragon Sanctuary, Long Wu Qing ignored the nearby stares being tossed her way and looked for Yuan's fight.","Once she found it, she disappeared into thin air, appearing at the location it was being broadcasted a moment later.","Her sudden appearance terrified those nearby, causing them to flee as if their lives depended on it.","\"I see... so that's how he fights...\" Long Wu Qing muttered with a slight smile on her face as she analyzed Yuan's fight.","If someone were to look at her right now, they'd never imagine she had killed her own little brother just moments ago based on her calm and nonchalant demeanor.","\"Oh, I remember now.\" Yuan suddenly spoke as he dodged the Hellfire Dragon's attack.","\"We've fought before,\" he continued.","\"What the fuck are you talking about?\" Hellfire Dragon halted his movements to ask. He was certain they had never fought before.","\"Well, you didn't fight the current me, but Tian Yi,\" Yuan explained.","\"I recall fighting you near the end of my journey. It happened quite long ago, so I don't blame you if you don't remember. You had the appearance of a female human at that time, too.\"","Although the Hellfire Dragon had the appearance of a human man at this moment, he also had female appearances in his collection. When he first encountered Yuan, he was in his female appearance. The reason Yuan recognized him despite his new appearance was simply because of his unique presence.","Just like how one could identify Long Wu Qing through her tyrannical presence, one could also identify the Hellfire Dragon through his fiery presence.","While beings in the Primal Expanse also had genders, such as male and female, some of them tended to adopt whatever appearance they preferred. The distinction between a female human and a male human was mostly cosmetic in their eyes.","The Hellfire Dragon was a male dragon, but he preferred a female human's appearance. Hell, even his male appearance was very feminine and could easily be mistaken as a female from afar.","The Hellfire Dragon became silent to ponder Yuan's words.","'The last time I fought a human was—'","His eyes widened after realizing the meaning behind Yuan's words.","\"Y-you! You were that bastard human from back then?!\" Hellfire Dragon cried out loud as he recalled some bitter memories.","\"N-now that I take a good look at your face, you definitely resemble that human! But how is that possible?! You only have a single Chaotic Heart, not to mention your cultivation!\"","Yuan merely smiled at his confusion, refusing to explain further.","After learning that Yuan was Tian Yi, the Hellfire Dragon's eyes flickered with fear. He had been badly beaten in the past by Tian Yi, hence his hatred toward humans. \"Are you remembering that day?\" Yuan suddenly inquired. \"You should've just left me alone. If you hadn't provoked me, I wouldn't have done that to you.\"","Hellfire Dragon's entire being trembled after Yuan mentioned a certain event.","A few hundred million years ago, the Hellfire Dragon encountered Tian Yi and provoked him, threatening to make him a human pet. Tian Yi became so enraged that he plucked every single one of Hellfire Dragon's scales, turning him into a scaleless dragon for millions of years until his scales eventually grew back.","That incident had humiliated the Hellfire Dragon to such an extent that it drove him to the brink of insanity. Consumed by the desire for revenge, he trained like a madman until he became a powerhouse. It could be said that Tian Yi was the catalyst who shaped the Hellfire Dragon into who he is today—one of the formidable Seven Dragon Monarchs.","However, Tian Yi left the Primal Expanse shortly after that incident and never appeared again. After hundreds of millions of years, Hellfire Dragon started to forget about that incident.","\"After so long, I have finally found you...\" Hellfire Dragon muttered in a shivering tone, his voice filled with excitement.","\"I have trained myself to the brink of destruction countless times for this moment!\"","The Hellfire Dragon resumed his assault, pouncing at Yuan with a ferocity unlike anything he had shown before. It was as if his power was being fueled by the immense rage he had contained within him for the past several hundred million years.","Yuan remained composed. Despite the Hellfire Dragon's brief boost in power, it was not enough for him to defeat Yuan, who was immune to his fire attacks, and any physical damage dealt would also heal in the blink of an eye.","The Hellfire Dragon had no real means of defeating Yuan, and as the fight dragged on, it became clear he was merely wasting his energy. Each of his attacks, though fierce, lacked the effectiveness needed to overcome Yuan's defenses.","On the other hand, every time Yuan struck with Enhanced Sword Aura, Hellfire Dragon needed to expend energy to recover from the damage.","It was a fight the Hellfire Dragon was destined to lose, and he realized it. However, instead of accepting it calmly like Long Yejun, he became more and more frenzied—desperate.","Eventually, Yuan had enough and decided to end the fight with Heaven Splitting Sword Strike.","He unleashed a massive beam of light that closely resembled a Dragon's Breath. In fact, many onlookers mistook Heaven Splitting Sword Strike as Dragon's Breath.","Hellfire Dragon's figure was completely engulfed by the light. Once the attack ended, he was nowhere to be seen.","A few moments later, Yuan was transported back to the Divine Dragon Sanctuary.","\"Congratulations on your victory, Yuan.\" Long Wu Qing approached him shortly after his return.","\"Thank—\"","\"However, if that's the full extent of your capabilities, I'm afraid you won't qualify to be my opponent,\" she continued.","\"...\"","Yuan didn't respond, but it wasn't due to a lack of words. Instead, his attention was drawn to a certain energy lingering around Long Wu Qing.","\"Where's Brother Yejun?\" Yuan suddenly inquired with a serious expression.","\"...\"","Long Wu Qing refused to respond, merely staring at him in a deafening silence.","\"Did you...?\" Yuan's eyes narrowed. He looked at her as if he already knew the answer.","\"Yes, I killed him,\" Long Wu Qing eventually responded, her voice as calm as it could be."]},{"number":1699,"title":"Chapter 1699 End of the First Trial","paragraphs":["After hearing Ling Wu Qing's confirmation that Long Yejun had matched up against her and lost, Yuan tightly clenched his fists.","Long Wu Qing paid attention to every little detail and asked, \"Are you angry at me for killing him?\"","Yuan closed his eyes for a moment and took a deep breath before responding calmly, \"No, I am not.\"","\"Oh?\" Long Wu Qing looked genuinely surprised by his answer.","She knew humans were emotional beings who are often led astray by their emotions, causing them to do unreasonable things.","\"My, my. You're surprisingly calm. Totally not what I expected.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow and responded, \"Were you expecting me to lash out at you for doing something I would've done myself if I had been matched with him?\"","He had prepared to kill Long Yejun if they fought, after all. It would be unreasonable for him to be angry at Long Wu Qing for doing what she has to do.","Everyone who participated in the Dragon God Festival accepted and agreed to such a risk before they grabbed the token so they couldn't complain about being killed.","\"I like you even more now. But that doesn't mean I will go easy on you later,\" Long Wu Qing said with a smile.","Yuan smiled back and said, \"I may not blame you, but I am still going to vent my anger on you, so I apologize in advance.\"","\"I thought you weren't angry?\" she raised an eyebrow.","\"Not at you, specifically. Just in general,\" he clarified.","\"But you're going to take it out on me?\" Long Wu Qing chuckled.","\"If anyone could deal with my anger, it'd be you.\"","\"I guess that's fine since it'll make things more entertaining,\" she nodded with an understanding expression.","After a few more days, Long Meihui defeated her opponent and returned to the Divine Dragon Sanctuary. When she first heard the news of Long Yejun's death, she didn't believe it. However, after she found Long Wu Qing and confirmed Long Yejun's death, Long Meihui broke down in tears.","\"Waaaaah! This is why I didn't want to participate! Why would the Dragon God do this—let his own descendants die?!\" she cried out loud.","\"Stop exaggerating. It's not like he's gone forever.\" Long Wu Qing shook her head.","\"As a matter of fact, this isn't his first time dying,\" she suddenly revealed.","\"I know that, but it could potentially be millions of years before I see him again!\"","\"What's a few million years to beings like us?\" Long Wu Qing sighed.","\"That's not the point!\" Long Meihui screamed.","\"Huh? Who the hell do you think you are raising your voice at?\" Long Wu Qing glared at her with narrowed eyes.","\"S-sorry...\" Long Meihui immediately shrunk her body, looking like a timid rabbit.","\"Hmph.\" Long Wu Qing sneered.","Long Meihui withdrew to Yuan's side and asked him, \"Are you okay?\"","\"I am upset about Brother Yejun's death, but this is the result if you lose.\"","Long Meihui sighed, \"I hope he reincarnates soon. I don't think I can handle being alone with my older sister. She's too scary.\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before asking, \"How long does it usually take for one to reincarnate?\"","\"It depends on factors I am unfamiliar with. He could immediately reincarnate, or it could take hundreds of millions of years,\" she answered.","\"I see. I hope he reincarnates sooner than later.\"","After a brief moment of silence, Yuan spoke again, \"One more thing. Will he remember memories of his past life?\"","\"I can't say for sure. There's a chance he might reincarnate without his memories, but I'm sure they will still be deep within his consciousness and eventually resurface.\"","\"Thank you.\"","They proceeded to spectate the other ongoing fights for the remainder of the month.","Long Wu Qing approached Yuan again a few days later.","\"Hey, do you have any more of those skewers?\" she asked him without any shame or hesitation in her voice.","\"You still have an appetite after everything that happened?\" Yuan looked at her with a look of disbelief.","\"Why not?\" she responded in an unfazed manner.","Yuan couldn't help but admire her carefree nature. It was as if nothing in this world could truly bother her.","\"So, do you have any or not? Or are you going to refuse because I killed Long Yejun? Don't be so petty,\" she continued.","He sighed, \"I do have some, but I am running low on supply, so I cannot give them out so casually.\"","\"Sounds like an excuse to me,\" she muttered with a displeased look.","However, Yuan wasn't lying because he was being petty. He was really running low on meat skewers.","He had a chance to replenish his supply when he returned to Earth, but he couldn't bring them back through the system and had to rely on Yingzi, who was capable of bypassing the system and bringing whatever she wanted back with her.","That said, Yingzi had managed to acquire a tremendous amount of meat skewers. During her food tour, she bought out the entire stock of every single stall she encountered. Of course, it was done using Yuan's money.","'Yingzi has plenty of meat skewers, but I doubt she'd be willing to share them.' Yuan smiled inwardly. He also had no authority to make her share them, even if it was purchased with his money.","\"If you give me some, I'll share Long Yejun's final words with you,\" Long Wu Qing suddenly bargained.","Yuan raised an eyebrow at her words.","\"His final words...?\" he muttered.","\"Alright.\"","Yuan retrieved a handful of meat skewers and handed them to Long Wu Qing, who immediately repeated Long Yejun's final words to him. Word for word.","\"I see...\" A warm smile appeared on Yuan's face after hearing it.","As the end of the first trial approached, more and more participants returned to the Divine Dragon Sanctuary. However, there were still plenty of matches that seemed far from being concluded.","Once the time limit had been reached, all of the secluded dimensions were forcefully closed, crushing anyone who remained inside them without any warning."]},{"number":1700,"title":"Chapter 1700 Refining the Dragon God’s Blood","paragraphs":["\"Congratulations to those of you who have survived the first trial.\" The Dragon God's voice rippled throughout the Divine Dragon Sanctuary.","\"You may choose to continue to the second trial or give up now. Those of you who will continue, keep the token in your grasp. Otherwise, crush it. You have an hour to decide.\"","Once the Dragon God's voice faded, everyone began mumbling to each other.","\"He said that most of us won't even be able to refine a single drop of blood, correct? Do you think he's serious, or is he trying to scare us into forfeiting?\"","\"Knowing the Dragon God, it could go both ways. It's extremely risky, no doubt. However, the benefit of this trial is worth the risk, so I am going to risk it.\"","\"Many of us have risked our lives for much less. This is a no-brainer for me.\"","Most of the participants shared similar sentiments.","Only a few remained hesitant. However, after thinking about it, they realized if they gave up now, they would have fought to the death for nothing in the previous trial. In the end, everyone who survived the first trial decided to participate in the second trial.","An hour later, the golden token suddenly emitted a golden light, and a small bottle materialized before the participants. Every participant had a single bottle containing ten drops of the Dragon God's blood.","\"You will need to refine at least nine drops of blood to pass the second trial within three months. If you manage to refine all ten drops of blood, I will give you a special reward at the end.\" The Dragon God's voice returned.","\"What kind of reward?\" The participants mused to themselves.","However, the Dragon God did not respond to their curiosity and disappeared after saying, \"The second trial begins now.\"","Yuan inspected the bottle of blood in his grasp. He had a quarter of a year to refine nine drops of blood, which seemed plenty of time at a glance.","However, after inspecting the Dragon God's blood, each drop contained an immense amount of chaotic essence that could take months if not years to refine, but they're only given three months to refine nine drops, which seemed impossible.","The first participant to act and consume a drop of the Dragon God's blood was Long Wu Qing. She retrieved a drop and swallowed it without hesitation. She then closed her eyes and began to cultivate in silence.","Many participants followed and consumed their first drop.","\"Agh!\"","Suddenly, a painful shout pierced the air, drawing everyone's attention. As heads turned toward the source of the scream, the individual who had cried out exploded into a gruesome, bloody mess before anyone could fully process what had happened.","However, that was just the beginning, and the situation quickly grew more chaotic as more and more participants exploded after failing to refine the Dragon God's blood.","The gruesome scene terrified the others, but they couldn't forfeit now and forcefully consumed their first drop of blood.","In half an hour, nearly 70 percent of the participants had perished from just the first drop of blood. There were tens of millions of participants who had passed the first trial, so one could imagine the carnage that occurred within these thirty minutes.","Yuan was one of the last participants to consume the Dragon God's blood. As soon as the first drop entered his body, a powerful surge of energy began coursing through his veins, filling him with a strength unlike anything he had felt before.","However, that sensation was short-lived. Shortly after his body began surging with energy, something within his body activated and started consuming the energy at a tremendous rate.","<Nine Dragon Symbols have activated!>","<Nine Dragon Symbols has absorbed the Dragon God's blood!>","The energy from the Dragon God's blood disappeared within minutes, causing Yuan to raise an eyebrow.","When nothing else happened after waiting for several minutes, Yuan looked at the bottle of blood in his grasp. After some consideration, he retrieved the second drop of blood and consumed it.","His actions greatly bewildered the onlookers.","\"Didn't he just consume a drop of blood a few minutes ago?\"","\"You're saying he's already on the second drop? Impossible! Even the Unrivaled Tyrant is still on her first drop of blood! You definitely saw it wrong, and he'd just consumed his first drop.\"","The onlookers quickly dismissed the possibility that Yuan had already refined the first drop of blood, let alone started on the second—everyone, that is, except for Yingzi. Having been watching Yuan closely from the very beginning, she was certain that he had already refined the first drop of the Dragon God's blood.","\"There's no way he'd just refined a drop of my enhanced blood in just a few minutes. Did you do something to him?\" The Dragon God questioned the Primal Monarch after witnessing this.","The Primal Monarch calmly shook his head and refuted, \"No, I have nothing to do with this.\"","<Nine Dragon Symbols have activated!>","<Nine Dragon Symbols is resonating with the Dragon God's blood!>","<Nine Dragon Symbols has absorbed the Dragon God's blood!>","Yuan absorbed the second drop of blood just as fast as the first... No, it was slightly faster.","\"No, no, no. There's just no way!\" The Dragon God exclaimed as he watched Yuan consume the third drop of blood, his voice filled with disbelief.","\"You must've done something to help him! I refuse to believe a human has the capability to refine my blood this quickly!\"","The Primal Monarch glared at him and sneered, \"Why would I lie to you? If I said I have nothing to do with it, then I didn't.\" His tone was cold, leaving no room for doubt or further questioning.","The Dragon God clenched his fists as he returned to focusing on Yuan, who was already preparing to consume the fourth drop of blood.","A few moments later.","<Nine Dragon Symbols have reached level four!>"]}]);
